#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"'Tis but a scratch?'  Bandage and disinfect it anyway to speed up healing."
msgstr "「かすり傷だ」？包帯や消毒をすれば早く治りますよ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A door is not the only way in or out of most places."
msgstr "ドアだけが出入口ではありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"A full stomach will not solve your starvation.  Give it time and eat "
"regularly."
msgstr "一度満腹になってもまた飢餓は訪れます。定期的に食事を摂りましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A pillow or stuffed animal will make it easier to fall asleep."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "A survivor saved is a friend earned.  Most of the time…"
msgstr "生存者を守ってあげると友情が芽生えます。そうならないことも稀にありますが..."

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Adhesive bandages are much quicker to use, but not as effective.  Perfect "
"for minor wounds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Afraid of wildlife?  Yell until it goes away.  But beware of what comes "
"instead."
msgstr "野生動物が怖い？叫んで追い払ってみましょう。代わりに他の何かがやってくるかもしれませんが。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"An armored enemy?  Don't give up, maybe it has some weaknesses that can be "
"exploited."
msgstr "装甲の厚い敵が現れた？諦めずに攻撃すれば、急所に命中するかもしれません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Animals and zombies are not friends.  You can take advantage of that."
msgstr "動物とゾンビは友達同士ではありません。上手く利用しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Arterial bleeding from a gunshot?  A tourniquet can save you from death."
msgstr "銃で撃たれて動脈から出血してる？止血帯があれば死なずに済みます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Athletics skill helps with swimming, climbing, and max stamina.  Don't "
"neglect it!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Auto-pickup settings can save you time when you need it.  It's fully "
"customizable too."
msgstr "自動拾得を設定すれば、時間の節約になります。設定は細かくカスタマイズできます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Balance armor versus encumbrance, and try not to wear bags in combat"
msgstr "防御力と動作制限の双方を考慮しましょう。バックパックを脱ぎ捨てるだけで、近接戦闘が楽になります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Bare ground is hard to sleep on and will make you much colder.  Try "
"gathering a pile of leaves."
msgstr "床で眠るのは辛いですか？枯れた植物を集めてみましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Be mindful of what, when, and how much you eat.  A balanced diet is crucial "
"in the long run."
msgstr "何を、いつ、どれだけ食べるかに気を付けましょう。長期的に見れば、バランスのとれた食生活はとても重要です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Being skilled does not mean being proficient.  Gain proficiency to become a "
"master in specific areas."
msgstr "スキルがある＝熟練している、ではありません。特定の分野の達人を目指すなら、熟練を取得しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Being wet makes the cold far worse.  Find some rainproof gear"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Binoculars make it easier to scout the terrain, gun scopes work too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Blinded creatures can still detect you in melee, and will remember where "
"they last saw you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Books carry knowledge and often recipes.  You need practical skills to "
"utilize them.  Practice."
msgstr "本に有用な知識やレシピが載っていることもありますが、それらを活用するには実践的なスキルが必要です。実践あるのみ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Broken limb?  Improvised splints are ok, but hospitals might have better "
"tech for it."
msgstr "手足を骨折した？即席の添え木を使うのもいいですが、病院ではもっと高度な治療を受けられるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Cameras can blind enemies with their flash in melee.  Say cheese and die!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Check what you can craft from time to time, even if you don't have "
"components right now."
msgstr "今は材料が足りなくても、製作レシピはこまめにチェックしておきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Cold food lasts longer.  Find a cool basement or make a root cellar."
msgstr "食べ物を冷やすと長持ちします。温度の低い地下室や自作の貯蔵穴を利用しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Crafting is faster if you have an actual place for it, preferably a workshop"
" bench."
msgstr "製作はまともな場所、できれば作業台などの付近で実行すれば、早く完了できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Crouching is quieter than walking and will let you hide behind some "
"furniture."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Crouching or going prone make you harder to hit in ranged combat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Did you *only* take everything not nailed down?  Go back for the nails!"
msgstr "本当に*すべて*の物資を拾いましたか？釘も大事な物資です！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Different characters, professions, hobbies, and scenarios can spice up your "
"game.  Roleplay!"
msgstr "様々なキャラクター、職業、趣味、シナリオでプレイすればゲームが更に楽しくなります。ロールプレイしましょう！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Different enemies require different weapons.  Diversify your loadout, and "
"always have a backup"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Dissecting bodies will help in gaining knowledge about the weaknesses of the"
" opponents."
msgstr "敵の死体を解剖すれば、急所に関する知識を得られます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't be too greedy.  Loot doesn't matter if you're dead."
msgstr "欲張り過ぎは止めましょう。死んでしまっては戦利品も役に立ちません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't fight against the odds.  There's no shame in running to survive."
msgstr "勝ち目のない戦いは避けましょう。生き延びるため逃げる事は恥ではありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't get surrounded!  Always have an exit plan."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Don't smoke in bed!"
msgstr "お構いなく。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Don't wait until it's too late!  Run away and live to fight another day."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Drugs are great for quick morale boosts and more, but be aware of addiction "
"and overdose."
msgstr "意欲などを今すぐ上げたいなら薬物が便利ですが、依存症や過剰摂取に注意しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Dying is part of the experience.  Try again with what you've learned."
msgstr "死もまた経験です。学んだことを生かしてもう一度挑戦しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Eat well or your health might suffer.  Fast food is only good in a pinch."
msgstr "健康的な食事をしないと体調は悪化します。ファーストフードを食べるのは最後の手段です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Enemies can see you peeking, but they won't get a chance to shoot you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Every sensei was once a student.  NPCs can teach you and vice versa."
msgstr "偉大な先生もかつては生徒でした。NPCから教わることもあれば、その逆もあり得ます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Excessive item counts in proximity to your character can cause slowdown.  "
"Don't be a hoarder!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Exercising daily increases your cardio fitness and therefore your stamina "
"pool."
msgstr "頻繁に有酸素運動をし続けることで、スタミナ上限が上昇します。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Famous last words:  Let's poke this electric zombie with a metal pipe."
msgstr "有名な最期の言葉: この放電ゾンビを金属棒で突き刺してみようかな。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Feeling bad after waking up?  Exercise and clean living are key to a healthy"
" lifestyle."
msgstr "起床したとき調子が悪い？より健康的な食事を心がけましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Feeling unwell?  Allow yourself to rest, even for a few days as needed.  "
"Heal now, explore later."
msgstr "体調が悪い？必要に応じて、数時間でも数日でも休みましょう。冒険は一休み、今は治療に専念です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Fight on your conditions whenever you can.  Use terrain, traps, and fire to "
"your advantage."
msgstr "周囲の状況を利用して戦いましょう。地形や罠、射撃などを駆使し、有利に立ち回りましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Fight smarter, not harder.  Even simple traps can turn the tide in your "
"favor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Fires can spread easily, especially with an abundance of fuel."
msgstr "火は簡単に燃え広がります。特に、燃料が豊富な場所では。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Food from before the Cataclysm won't last forever.  Keep that in mind."
msgstr "大変動以前からあった食料はいつか必ず不足します。心に留めておきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"For free in the construction menu: a crafting spot, a firewood source, and a"
" practice target."
msgstr "製作場所、焚物置き場、練習標的は、道具や材料なしで建設メニューから設置できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Foraging isn't easy.  It takes survival skill, perception, and a lot of "
"luck."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Frozen food doesn't rot, but may be inedible if not defrosted."
msgstr "冷凍した食べ物は腐敗しませんが、解凍しないと食べられない物もあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Frozen food?  Put it by a fire or heat it up by activating a pan."
msgstr "食べ物が凍っている？火の傍に置くか鍋で温めてみましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Going prone can make it harder for shrapnel to hit you."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Grabbed enemies can't dodge. If something won't sit still, try making it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Grenades create very fine shrapnel which isn't great against armor.  "
"Pipebombs on the other hand…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Handguns are powerful and easy to use even when you're badly wounded.  "
"Always keep one handy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Holsters, quivers, sheaths, and ammo pouches can be much faster than using a"
" backpack."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Hope for the best but prepare for the worst.  A backup stash of necessities "
"can save the day."
msgstr "最善を尽くし、最悪に備えましょう。必需品の予備を用意しておくことで、危機を脱することもあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If a wound gets dirty, find some antiseptic quick!  Infections can be "
"deadly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If it's too dark to see, you'll suffer penalties to dodge, melee, and "
"aiming."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If the weather's too bad, you might just want to stay home."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If you like archery but lack the strength, consider a crossbow."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "If you're breaking in, be sure you also know how to get back out."
msgstr "侵入する前に脱出経路を確認しておきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"If you're stuck inside with a broken leg, read some books to pass the time."
msgstr "足が骨折して家に籠っている時は、本を読んで時間をつぶしましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Insecticide is really good at killing bugs, even the big ones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"It can take days or even weeks to put on weight after you've lost too much."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"It's a good idea to keep books around the house.  You never know when you'll"
" be laid up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Just because a place is dangerous doesn't mean it's worth looting."
msgstr "危険な場所だからと言って、素敵な戦利品があるわけではありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Just because they're all monsters doesn't mean they're friends.  Take "
"advantage of infighting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Keep a few spare weapons and pieces of armor around your base.  Switching is"
" easier than repairing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Keep essentials in your clothing pockets in case you have to ditch your "
"backpack."
msgstr "衣類のポケットに必需品を収納すれば、万が一バックパックを捨てることになっても安心です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Knowledge can't replace practical skill and experience, but it will help you"
" get them faster."
msgstr "知識は実践的なスキルや経験の代わりにはなりませんが、それらをより早くものにする足掛かりになります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Large targets are easier to hit."
msgstr "照準訓練キット"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Learn to use zone sorting to sort your loot in one go.  Y to set up zones, O"
" to sort items."
msgstr "アイテムを一度に整理する区域管理の使い方。Yで区域を設定し、Oで自動分類を開始します。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Learning how to play?  Visit the keybindings menu and learn your ropes."
msgstr "操作方法を学びたい？キー割当メニューを開いて操作を身に付けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Length matters… at least when it comes to shoving a shovel in your backpack."
msgstr "長さは重要な問題です...少なくとも、シャベルをバックパックに詰めこみたい時は。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Light itself doesn't draw zombies, it's the sight, noise, or smell of the "
"living."
msgstr "光源自体はゾンビを引き寄せません。視界や音、臭いに気を付けましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Like to gamble?  Use mutagen!  Be a winner today!"
msgstr "ギャンブルが好き？変異原を使いましょう！今日こそ勝ってやる！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Long trip ahead?  Auto travel and auto drive to your desired destination."
msgstr "長旅ですか？自動移動、自動運転モードで目的地を目指しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Major blood loss?  Drink plenty, supplement iron, and rest to regenerate "
"your red blood cells."
msgstr "大出血した？水分をたっぷり取って、鉄分を補給して、休養して、赤血球を増やしましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Makeshift weapons can break easily, but they are weapons, and can be made "
"again."
msgstr "簡易武器は簡単に破損しますが、簡単に作り直せる事が最大の利点です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Many items have contextual uses.  Use the item action menu to find out what "
"you can do with them."
msgstr "大抵のアイテムは、状況に応じた使い道があります。使用メニューを開き、各アイテムで何ができるか見ておきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Many items have special actions.  Try to find out what they do."
msgstr "特殊な用途をもつアイテムはたくさんあります。何ができるか試してみましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mark the items you carry as favorites so you can easily identify new items "
"and drop them in bulk."
msgstr "普段持ち歩くアイテムをお気に入りに設定しておくと、新たに拾った物資の確認や、アイテムをまとめて置く際に便利です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Moose may not be your friend."
msgstr "ヘラジカはあなたの友達ではありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most adults are too heavy to climb drainpipes, so go find or make a "
"stepladder!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most medicine doesn't work instantly, so don't swallow a whole bottle of "
"pills."
msgstr "大抵の薬品は飲んでもすぐには効きません。一気飲みは止めましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Most zombies go through cars, not around them.  Remember that when running "
"away."
msgstr "大抵のゾンビは車両にまっすぐ突っ込み、避けようとしません。逃げるときは有効活用しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Murky water is unsafe to drink, water might be safe, clean water is always "
"safe."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mutagen can dramatically improve your stats.  Bionics can help a little, "
"too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Mutant meat is toxic, but surely a little bit would be OK."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Mutant meat isn't good for you, but if you're hungry, surely you can eat "
"just a little…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"NSAIDs are all the same type of drug and their effects don't stack, but they"
" do with acetaminophen."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Need experience with crafting and such?  Use the training recipes to master "
"the ins and outs."
msgstr "製作などの経験を積みたい？訓練用の製作レシピを使って、コツを掴みましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"No bandages nearby?  Empty your hands and let the time pass to apply "
"pressure to the wound."
msgstr "包帯を持ってない？何も装備していない状態で、しばらく傷口を押さえましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Nobody told the vending machines that the world ended.  Save those cash "
"cards!"
msgstr "自動販売機は世界が崩壊したことに気付いていないようです。キャッシュカードは残しておきましょう！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Not much survives a hit from a very fast car."
msgstr "時速200kmで走る車に勝てる敵は滅多にいません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Out of resources?  Breaking or disassembling stuff can yield interesting "
"components."
msgstr "資源が足りない？物を破壊・分解すると様々な素材が得られます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Over the counter pain medication is weak, but it's not habit forming. It may"
" keep you in the fight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Overconfidence is a treacherous killer.  Leave yourself some leeway for "
"unforeseen circumstances."
msgstr "自信過剰は危険な罠です。不測の事態に備え、ある程度の余裕をもって行動しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pain can drastically slow you down and reduces your stats.  Check your speed"
" in the character menu."
msgstr "苦痛は動きを鈍らせ、能力値を低下させます。キャラクターメニューで速度を確認しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pain medication doesn't reduce pain, it is a buffer against it for the "
"entirety of its duration."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Pick your fights and don't let them pick you.  Don't bite what you can't "
"chew."
msgstr "喧嘩の相手は選びましょう。歯が立たない相手には目を付けられないように動きましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Poison, radiation, and blood loss will negatively impact your lifestyle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Power move.  You can take control and play as your NPC follower."
msgstr "これがプレイヤーの力です。操作キャラクターを仲間NPCに切り替えて、自由に動かすことができます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Priorities for survival: shelter, water, food, then everything else."
msgstr "生存するための優先順位: 1.安全な場所 2.水 3.食料 4.その他あらゆる物"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Prolonged physical exhaustion results in weariness.  Overworking causes loss"
" of productivity."
msgstr "長時間の肉体的疲労は倦怠感を招きます。過労は生産性の低下を招きます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Put a funnel over a jug or barrel to collect rainwater over time."
msgstr "瓶や樽などの上に漏斗を設置すれば、時間経過と共に雨水が溜まります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Rain ponchos are lightweight, easy to store, and can keep you dry in a "
"storm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Remember that the sidebar is customizable and widgets can be added and "
"removed from it."
msgstr "サイドバーは、項目の追加や削除などのカスタマイズが可能です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Routine kills.  Stay alert!  Don't let your guard down."
msgstr "そろそろ殺しに慣れてきた、そんな時こそ気を付けて！警戒を緩めてはいけません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Save time.  Instead of using a recipe, place water in a container on a fire "
"to boil it."
msgstr "時間を節約しましょう。製作レシピを使わなくても、容器に入れた水を火にかけるだけで煮沸できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Scared of melee?  Throw some things at enemies and use reach weapons like "
"spears."
msgstr "近接戦闘が怖い？敵に物を投擲する、スピアなどの遠隔武器を使う、といった方法があります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Skillful management of your stamina is crucial for your survival.  Conserve "
"it when you can."
msgstr "生き残るには、上手なスタミナ管理が大切です。使わずに済むなら温存しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some animals can be tamed, especially when young.  Try finding some pet "
"food."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some foods can be eaten frozen.  Some foods become mushy after defrosting."
msgstr "乾燥している食べ物には凍ったまま食べられる物もあります。解凍すると不味くなる食べ物もあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Some mutations allow you to leap.  This makes it easy to get out of melee, "
"or up onto a roof."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Some negative traits have their upsides."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Sometimes you just can't run.  Always try to keep a handgun on you for "
"emergencies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Spraypaint can be used to blind enemies, and is especially effective against"
" robots."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Stun guns will cause even zombies to release their grabs, but effectiveness "
"falls off with size."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Switching to a sidearm is often faster than reloading."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Tear gas stuns anything that breathes.  It blinds anything with eyes, except"
" robots and arthropods."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Terrain that slows you down will also slow down your enemies."
msgstr "通り抜け辛い地形では、敵の移動速度も遅くなります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The Archer's Form proficiency lowers the strength requirement on bows by up "
"to 6."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The action menu can help you determine what you can do.  There are also some"
" rare actions there."
msgstr "使用メニューを見れば、アイテムの使用法が分かります。今まで知らなかった使い方が判明することもありますよ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "The best gun in the world is useless without ammo."
msgstr "世界一の銃も弾薬が無ければ役に立ちません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The number of zombies in a city is large but finite.  You can (eventually) "
"kill them all."
msgstr "都市部に大量発生したゾンビも、数は有限です。(時間はかかりますが)皆殺しも可能です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The worse you're hurt, the slower you'll heal. Try not to push yourself too "
"far."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"The zone activity manager can make your life easier.  Do more in one go."
msgstr "区域管理システムを使って一度にたくさんの作業をこなせば、生活がもっと快適になります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "There are a million ways to use a garbage bag."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are billions of them and one of you, but only you have a working "
"brain."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are fungi you want to eat, and those you want to burn.  You'll know "
"the difference."
msgstr "食べられるキノコと燃やすべきキノコがあります。違いを知りましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There are some unbound keybindings that might prove useful for your needs.  "
"Check them out."
msgstr "初期状態でキーが割り当てられていない便利機能もあります。一度チェックしてみましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There's got to be some cool stuff in those top-secret underground labs, "
"right?"
msgstr "最高機密の地下研究所で素晴らしい物が見つかる気がしませんか？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"There's usually more than one way to do things.  Think outside the box."
msgstr "目標を達成する方法は様々です。既成概念にとらわれず考えましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Thirsty on a long winter journey?  Take a thermos with you."
msgstr "冬の長旅で喉が渇いた？魔法瓶を持っていきましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Too cold to sleep well at night?  A pile of clothes will make it better."
msgstr "夜は寒くてよく眠れない？寝る場所に服を山盛り置けば安心です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Trouble with sticky or slippery floors?  Try using them against your "
"enemies."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Turnout gear protects from fire but not from overheating."
msgstr "消防士の装備は火災から身を守りますが、熱によるダメージは防げません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Twohanded weapons are hard to use when things are grabbing you.  Keep "
"something smaller on hand too!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Underground spaces like basements or caves stay cool year-round."
msgstr "地下洞窟や地下室は年中涼しく過ごせます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Use the fire, sludge, and acid some enemies spread to your advantage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Use your map wisely.  Prioritize looting places that will get you what you "
"need."
msgstr "マップを上手に使いましょう。必要なものがありそうな場所を優先して狙いましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Verticality is a thing.  If you can get to a roof somehow, it may save your "
"life."
msgstr "垂直方向に目を向けましょう。何とかして屋根の上に昇れば、命が助かることもあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Want less micro-management?  The zone manager can change your game."
msgstr "細々した作業はうんざり？区域管理システムを使えばゲームが快適になります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Want to protect your gear from acid?  Try wearing a raincoat over it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Weariness can be debilitating.  Don't go into combat if you're tired!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Wet and angry?  A dry towel will bring your smile back."
msgstr "身体が濡れて不愉快？乾いたタオルで笑顔を取り戻しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"When looking around, use T to move to a destination or item automatically."
msgstr "周囲確認中にTキーを押すと、指定した地点やアイテムのある位置に自動で移動します。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#. ~ Snippet in category "hint"
#: data/core/tips.json data/json/npcs/hints.json
msgid ""
"When the whole town is one big supermarket, a shopping cart becomes your "
"best friend."
msgstr "街全体が大きなスーパーマーケットだと考えれば、ショッピングカートは大いに活躍します。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "When you are prone, you use the bipod of a rifle for better accuracy."
msgstr "伏せてライフルを撃つなら、二脚を使って命中精度を高めましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Where applicable, use blacklists, whitelists, and filters for a better "
"quality of life."
msgstr "必要に応じてブラックリストやホワイトリスト、フィルターを使い、質の高い暮らしを目指しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Where did my lighter go again?  Manage your containers to store specific "
"items in them."
msgstr "ライターはどこに入れたっけ？収納を管理して、特定の所にアイテムを収納しましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Why walk when you can use a car?  Or a bike?  Or rollerblades?"
msgstr "徒歩ではなく車で移動してみては？それとも自転車？ローラーブレードはどうでしょう？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Winners don't do drugs.  They're too valuable.  Winners trade drugs for more"
" bullets."
msgstr "勝者は注意深く慎重であり、ドラッグに手を出しません。勝者はドラッグを売って弾薬をたっぷり手に入れます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "Wounds heal over time.  Bandages and antiseptic speed that up."
msgstr "傷は時間経過とともに治癒します。包帯や消毒薬を使えば治りが早まります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can automate repetitive tasks such as foraging, mining, or mopping for "
"your convenience."
msgstr "採取、採掘、モップ掛けなどの反復作業は、自動化して楽にこなしましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can crouch or go prone to hide behind objects and reduce the sound you "
"make when you move."
msgstr "屈んだり伏せて物陰に隠れたりすれば、移動時に発生する音を軽減できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can make unusual things from usual stuff.  Go full MacGyver style if "
"needed."
msgstr "どこにでもあるアイテムからでも貴重な物を作れます。冒険野郎マクガイバーになりきりましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can make your own safe mode rules in the pause menu."
msgstr "Escキーのメニューから独自のセーフモード規則を作成できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can throw things while peeking around corners."
msgstr "曲がり角を覗きながら物を投擲できます。この方法はタレットを撃墜するのに最適です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can use markers to rename items, making it easier to stay organized."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can use your mouse in your inventory and few other menus."
msgstr "所持品メニューなど一部の画面では、マウス操作が可能です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You can use your mouse to move to a destination by double-clicking it."
msgstr "行きたいタイルをマウスでダブルクリックすれば、その地点まで移動できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You can view local keybindings in most sub-menus by pressing the question "
"mark (?) key."
msgstr "?キーを押すと、その画面で使えるキー割り当てが表示されます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You don't have to sit right next to fire to use it."
msgstr "燃えている火は隣接しなくても利用できます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You don't need to grab every piece of loot you see.  There's always more to "
"find."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid "You don't win, you just do a little better each time."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You won't use mutated body parts like fangs and horns to attack if they're "
"covered up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"You're on fire?  Stop and wait to put it out.  Better yet, go prone first."
msgstr "身体が燃えてる？立ち止まって、鎮火を待ちましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tip"
#: data/core/tips.json
msgid ""
"Your enemy is often slower than you.  Walk to conserve stamina and run only "
"when you must."
msgstr "大抵の敵は自分より鈍いです。必要なときだけ走り、普段は歩いてスタミナを温存しましょう。"

