#. ~ Description of achievement "Edged Combat"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid ""
"Blades are one of man's most useful tools.  It was true then and it's even "
"more true now."
msgstr "刃物は、人間がもつ非常に便利な道具の一つです。かつてもそうでしたが、今はもっとそうです。"

#. ~ Description of achievement "Brawler"
#: data/json/achievements.json
msgid "Bottle in left hand, chair leg in right hand."
msgstr "左手にガラス瓶、右手に椅子の脚。"

