#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Flash"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes a flashbang at the target."
msgstr "標的のいる地点に閃光を発生させます。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Adrenaline"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes a surge of adrenaline to flow throughout your body."
msgstr "アドレナリンが急増し全身に行き渡ります。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Fireball"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes an explosion at the target."
msgstr "標的のいる地点に爆発を発生させます。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Blood"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes blood to leak from nearby terrain."
msgstr "付近の地形から血液が漏れ出します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Confused"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes nearby enemies to become confused."
msgstr "付近の敵を混乱させます。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Radiation"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes radiation."
msgstr "放射能汚染を引き起こします。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Vomit"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Causes the caster to vomit."
msgstr "詠唱者を嘔吐させます。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Dimensional Fatigue"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
msgid "Creates some dimensional fatigue at a random point within range."
msgstr "範囲内のランダムな地点に時空の歪みを生成します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Artifact Teleglow"
#: data/json/artifact/legacy_artifact_active.json
