#. ~ Description of profession "Lockpicking (Beginner)" for female
#: data/json/backgrounds.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Whether it was for fun, innocent utility, or criminal intent, you learned "
"the basics of how to silently pick locks.  Now, being able to get into "
"secured places just got a lot more useful."
msgstr ""
"単なる道楽か、あるいは仕事、もしくは犯罪のために、静かに錠をピッキングする基礎的な方法を学びました。この技術があれば、安全な場所により簡単に侵入できそうです。"

