msgstr "クモの巣を巻き取る奇妙な夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a strange dream."
msgstr "奇妙な夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have a vivid dream of being a medical anomaly, as your heartbeat syncs "
"with the steady drip of an IV line."
msgstr "静脈に流れ込む点滴と脈拍が完全に同期するという、鮮烈で医学的に異常な夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of hunting in the woods."
msgstr "森の中で狩猟を楽しむはっきりとした夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have a vivid dream of shedding your carapace.  It feels good."
msgstr "甲羅を脱皮する鮮烈な夢を見ました。良い気分です。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You have an upsetting dream about falling and being unable to get back up."
msgstr "転んで立ち上がれなくなり慌てる夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You have strange dreams of soaring through the sky."
msgstr "空に舞い上がる奇妙な夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You hear the sirens again, but this time you stay in your hole in the wall."
"  Nobody will think to look there!"
msgstr "夢の中でサイレンの音が聞こえましたが、あなたは壁の穴の中でじっとしています。ここなら誰にも見つかりません！"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You howl loud and long, ecstatic after securing a whole cache of supplies."
msgstr "食料を確保し、歓喜の遠吠えを上げる夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You leap from rooftop to rooftop, effortlessly avoiding your pursuers while "
"making your way to safety."
msgstr "屋上から屋上へ飛び渡り、追っ手を撒いて安全な場所へ逃げる夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You lie in a pile with your brothers and sisters.  Someone keeps moving "
"around, nearly waking you up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You pant, terrified at the thought of that FUNGUS destroying your home!"
msgstr "真菌の群れがあなたの家を破壊する夢から覚めました。動悸が激しく、恐怖で震えています。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You relax in your web; it's not vibrating, so dinner hasn't arrived yet."
msgstr "巣の中でくつろぐ夢を見ました。糸が振動していないので、夕飯はもうすこし先になりそうです。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You scream in fear while you dream of being chased by a cat"
msgstr "夢の中でネコに追いかけられ、思わず悲鳴を上げました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You see yourself reflected in the beauty of the forest."
msgstr "美しい森の中に自分の姿を見出す夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You see yourself, five years from now, as the leader of a successful city."
msgstr "夢の中に、都市のリーダーとして大成した5年後の自分が登場しました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You sit at the bottom of the sea, staring without thought at all the world "
"passing by overhead."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You sneak into a house, only to discover a full, intact cupboard of cat "
"food!"
msgstr "民家に忍び込み、新品のツナ缶がたくさん入った食器棚を見つける夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You startle as the shadow of a bird passes over your web, but it's only a "
"dream."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You stir, saddened that your beautiful hatchlings were only a dream."
msgstr "素晴らしい孵化体験はただの夢だったようです。悲しくなり、心がかき乱される気分です。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You swim with fish.  You fly with birds.  You run with the beasts of the "
"land.  You change with the changing of seasons.  You are everything."
msgstr "魚と共に泳ぎ、鳥と共に飛び、獣と共に走る夢を見ました。季節毎に姿を変え、何にでもなれるような気がします。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIROPTERAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You taste iron all night long, like you've bitten your tongue."
msgstr "夢の中で鉄の味を感じました。舌でも噛んだのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You taste the blood of another, and know that it will be yours."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You terrifyingly dream of being led to a slaughterhouse by a farmer."
msgstr "農家によって屠殺場へ連れていかれる恐ろしい夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of living in a web and consuming insects."
msgstr "クモの巣で生活し、昆虫を食べる鮮明な夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of living in the sewers."
msgstr "下水道で生き生きと活動する夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of running with your pack, hunting a wild animal."
msgstr "群れで野生動物を狩っている、鮮明な夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You vividly dream of sharing a kill with your pack."
msgstr "群れで協力して狩りをする鮮明な夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wake up with your legs pumping as you hop along in your sleep."
msgstr "睡眠中に脚が勝手に屈伸して、思わず目が覚めました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MOUSE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You weave between the zombies' legs, too small for them to catch.  The gas "
"station isn't far now, with all its soda and chips and- UGH, dream…"
msgstr ""
"ゾンビの股の下を潜り抜けました。小柄なので誰にも捕まりません。ガソリンスタンドはもうすぐそこです。あそこにはソーダとポテチと...わっ、夢か..."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You were once many cells living as one, now you are one living as many."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wish others could understand, and join your struggle…"
msgstr "他人に理解してほしい、共に戦ってもらいたいと強く感じています..."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"You wonder if you could find one of those 'salmon runs', or if they were "
"just a legend…"
msgstr "夢の中で見た「サケの遡上」を実際に見られそうだと思いました。ただの夢かもしれませんが..."

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You wonder if your nest will be good enough."
msgstr "夢から覚めて、巣の備蓄は十分だろうかと気になりました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "You've never felt so lithe and powerful."
msgstr "夢を見ました。これほどのしなやかさと力強さを感じたのは生まれて初めてです。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your body flows slightly faster than you expected… oh, just a dream."
msgstr "身体が思ったよりも軽いような...あれっ、ただの夢でした。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your disturbingly lifelike dream has you pollinating plants."
msgstr "植物に受粉する、現実感のある不安な夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream is filled with creatures, and yet all seem like you."
msgstr "自分そっくりの生物に囲まれる夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream of living in the dark for years is almost real."
msgstr "一年中暗闇の中で暮らす、現実感のある夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dream of raiding a giant beehive has you licking your… muzzle in "
"anticipation."
msgstr "巨大なハチの巣を襲う夢を見て...起きた時には期待に胸を膨らませながら鼻面を舐めていました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-reflection is rather bearish."
msgstr "どうもクマのように乱暴な夢を見たような気がします。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-self looks competent and in control."
msgstr "強い力を完璧に使いこなす夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dream-self's muzzle looks… wait, muzzle?"
msgstr "夢の中で自分の鼻面を...えっ、鼻面？"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dreams are simple.  Movement among the leaves, your heart pounding as "
"you leap through the air, satisfaction when your claws find purchase."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams contain a croaking concerto."
msgstr "喉を膨らませて協奏曲を奏でる夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "URSINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a rough furry feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、皮膚に剛毛の毛皮があるような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FELINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a sleek furry feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、皮膚に滑らかな毛皮があるような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange chitinous feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、皮膚がキチン質で覆われたような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CATTLE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange content, furry feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、皮膚に毛皮があるような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BIRD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange feathered feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、身体に羽が生えたような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RABBIT"
#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BEAST"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange furry feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、皮膚に毛皮があるような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange fuzzy feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、皮膚に微毛が生えているような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "PLANT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange plantlike feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、まるで植物になってしまったような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "TROGLOBITE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange reclusive feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で奇妙な孤独感を味わいました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LIZARD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange scaly feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、皮膚に鱗があるような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange shelled feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、殻に包まれているような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange slimy feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、身体が粘液になってしまったような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange webbed feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、クモの巣に包まれているような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange wet feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、身体が湿り気を帯びるような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "FISH"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a strange wet, scaly feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、皮膚に湿った鱗があるような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you a thick furry feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、皮膚に厚い毛皮があるような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "MEDICAL"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams give you an oddly medicated feeling."
msgstr "夢の中で、身体に投薬されたような奇妙な感覚をおぼえました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams leave you feeling like something is stuck to you."
msgstr "何かにへばりつく夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams of fully turning into a spider frighten you."
msgstr "完全にクモになってしまう恐ろしい夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CEPHALOPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your dreams of living on the ocean floor seem more lifelike than reality."
msgstr "海底に住む夢を見ました。現実よりもリアルだった気がします。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CHIMERA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your dreams… are complex and multifaceted."
msgstr "なんというか...複雑で多面的な良く分からない感じの夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SPIDER"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your fangs sink into your prey, which struggles as your many legs embrace "
"it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ELFA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your heart is moved to breaking at the thought of all the lives lost, and "
"the struggle yet to come."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your lifelike dreams have you scavenging food with a pack of rats."
msgstr "群れと共に食料を漁る鮮明な夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "BATRACHIAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your mouth grows wider and wider, there's nothing you can't devour…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "LUPINE"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your mouth waters as you dream of eating dog food."
msgstr "森の中で狩猟を楽しむはっきりとした夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAPTOR"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your prey stares you down, unaware that your mate has already flanked it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "GASTROPOD"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your skin tastes the slime of another, and you follow the trail."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "INSECT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your sleep is utterly dreamless for a time."
msgstr "睡眠時間は、人間として標準的なものです。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "ALPHA"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your success in restoring civilization was only a dream.  For now."
msgstr "文明社会の復興を成し遂げた、と思ったら夢でした。今のところ。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "CRUSTACEAN"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your vivid dream of living as a crustacean frightens you."
msgstr "甲殻類として生きる鮮烈な恐ろしい夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid "Your vivid dream of living as a slime blob frightens you."
msgstr "どろどろのブロブとして生きる鮮烈な恐ろしい夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "SLIME"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your vivid dream of your pseudopods calcifying into rigid structures "
"terrifies you."
msgstr "仮足が石灰のように固まってしまう鮮明で恐ろしい夢を見ました。"

#. ~ Dream of mutation category "RAT"
#: data/json/dreams.json
msgid ""
"Your warren is wiped out, your family lost.  It'll be OK, as long as you "
"survive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Minor Bleeding"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "'Tis but a scratch."
msgstr "かすり傷でしょうか。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "mech_recon_vision"
#. ~ Description of spell "Spawn Raptor EOC"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "End The Nightmare"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that cabin"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that desolate barn"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Check out that collapsed house"
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/effects.json data/json/monster_special_attacks/spells.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/godco_missions.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "."
msgstr "。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "glowy_led"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "A bionic LED is glowing softly beneath your skin."
msgstr "埋め込んだLEDが皮膚の下でほのかに光っています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Disabled"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "A body part has been critically injured!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Opioid Withdrawal, Moderate Opioid
#. Withdrawal, Severe Opioid Withdrawal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "A chill runs through your body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Smoke Inhalation, Smoke Inhalation,
#. Major Smoke Inhalation, Severe Smoke Inhalation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "A dense cloud of smoke enters your lungs."
msgstr "濃い煙を吸い込みました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Distracting Wound, Painful Wound, Searing
#. Wound"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "A dull pain starts spreading from the wound!"
msgstr "傷口がズキズキと痛みます！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"A lack of iron in your diet has hampered the efficiency and regeneration of "
"your red blood cells."
msgstr "食事中の鉄分が不足していると、赤血球の輸送効率と再生力が低下します。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"A lack of vitamin C in your diet will result in progressively worse symptoms"
" of scurvy."
msgstr "食事内のビタミンCが不足すると、壊血病が次第に悪化します。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Laser-targeted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "A laser sight is targeting you!"
msgstr "レーザーサイトがこちらに狙いを定めています！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Skunk Spray Neutralized"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "A solution that neutralizes skunk odors."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Counting Down"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag for monster's counting down.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "モンスターが秒読み状態に入った時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dragging"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when a monster is dragging you behind it.  This is a bug if you "
"have it."
msgstr "モンスターがキャラクターを牽引している時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Operating"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when a monster is operating on you.  This is a bug if you have "
"it."
msgstr "モンスターがキャラクターを手術している時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Well Fed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when critter has had enough to eat.  This is a bug if you have "
"it."
msgstr "十分な食事を摂取した時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Underfed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when critter has not had enough to eat.  This is a bug if you "
"have it."
msgstr "十分な食事を摂取できていない時のAIタグです。AIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Harnessed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when critter is being harnessed by a vehicle.  This is a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "車両に繋がれているモンスターのAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Ridden"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when critter is being ridden.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "騎乗されているモンスターのAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hit-and-run Running"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when hit-and-run monsters run away.  This is a bug if you have "
"it."
msgstr "ヒット&アウェイ戦法を駆使するモンスターが逃げている時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Controlled Monster"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when monsters are being controlled by another.  This is a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "何かによってモンスターが支配されている時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hit By Player"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag for when monsters are hit by player.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "モンスターがプレイヤーに攻撃された時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Docile Monster"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag for when monsters are tamed.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "モンスターを飼い慣らした時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cornered Fighter Recently Spooked"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag to allow CORNERED_FIGHTER monsters to turn and fight.  This is a bug "
"if you have it."
msgstr "CORNERED_FIGHTERのモンスターが戦いに転じる時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cornered Fighter Spooked"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag to let CORNERED_FIGHTER monsters try to flee.  This is a bug if you "
"have it."
msgstr "CORNERED_FIGHTERのモンスターが逃げ出す時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Being Led by Leash"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag used for critters forced to follow using a leash.  This is a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "リードによってキャラクターに追従している生物用のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Has Bag"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag used for critters holding your bags.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "あなたの荷物を背負った生物用のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Has Leash"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag used for critters wearing a leash.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "リードを身に着けている生物用のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Has Saddle"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag used for critters wearing a saddle.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "モンスターが鞍を装着している時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Has Armor"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag used for critters wearing armor.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "装甲を身に着けている生物用のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Pushed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag used for monsters pushing each other.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "モンスターが周囲のモンスターを押し退ける時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Heard Sound"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag used for monsters responding to sound.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Pacified"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag used for pacified critters.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "平静な生物用のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Paid"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag used for paid critters.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "料金を支払われた生物用のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Pet"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag used for pet critters.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "ペット用のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mechanical Fluid Dripping"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"AI tag used for robot monsters losing mechanical fluid.  This is a bug if "
"you have it."
msgstr "ロボットのモンスターが液漏れを起こしている時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Worked On"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "AI tag used for robots being disabled.  This is a bug if you have it."
msgstr "ロボット系モンスターが無効化されている時のAIタグです。操作キャラクターに付いている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Shrieking"
