#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are too high on amphetamines to realize how much of a twitchy degenerate"
" you've become."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Lacking Sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are too physically tired to function well."
msgstr "疲れ過ぎて身体が上手く動きません。"

