#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are under the effects of cannabis."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Beta blocker"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are under the influence of a beta blocker.  This controls your heart "
"rate, decreasing the influence of stressful events such as pain on it.  "
"However, it also lowers blood pressure and induces fatigue."
msgstr ""
"ベータ遮断薬の影響を受けており、心拍数が抑制されています。苦痛などのストレスが心拍数に与える影響を軽減しますが、血圧が低下し倦怠感を引き起こします。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Opioid Buzz"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are uplifted by a gentle, bubbly euphoria that soothes your every ache."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Contact Lenses"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are wearing contact lenses."
msgstr "コンタクトレンズを付けました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Wearing Earphones"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You are wearing earphones and can't hear much from outside world."
msgstr "イヤホンを装着している間は、周辺の音がほとんど聞こえなくなります。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Transition Contact Lenses (Plano)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are wearing non-prescription photochromic contact lenses that protect "
"you from the sunlight, but don't help with any sight issues."
msgstr "太陽光から目を守る度なし調光コンタクトレンズを着用しています。視力は補正されていません。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Transition Contact Lenses"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You are wearing photochromic contact lenses that additionally protect you "
"from the sunlight."
msgstr "太陽光から目を守る調光コンタクトレンズを着用しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Unidentified Illness"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You aren't sure what's wrong with you but you don't feel well."
msgstr "何が原因かよく分かりませんが、気分が悪いと感じています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency, Iron Deficiency,
#. Acute Iron Deficiency"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You begin feeling increasingly tired and listless."
msgstr "疲れがたまって辛い気分です。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Ringing Ears"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can barely hear anything and your ears hurt."
msgstr "ほとんど何も聴こえず、耳を痛めています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Wriggling Skin"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You can feel something wriggling beneath the skin…"
msgstr "皮膚の下で何かが蠢いている気がします。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Spore Dusted, Spore Covered, Spore Coated"
#: data/json/effects.json
