#. ~ Description of effect type "Gastropod Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You itch terribly, and your mouth feels salty and dry."
msgstr "ひどい痒みを感じます。口の中が塩辛く、ヒリヒリしています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Incorporeal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You lack substance, as if you aren't quite fully here."
msgstr "自分の存在が消えてしまったような気分になりました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Riding"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You mount your steed."
msgstr "動物に騎乗しました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sylvan Transformation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You must look after this world, if no one else will."
msgstr "ここが見捨てられた世界だと言うのなら、自ら面倒を見るしかありません。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You no longer feel anemic."
msgstr "貧血が治りました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Slightly Nauseated, Mildly Nauseated,
#. Nauseated, Very Nauseated, Extremely Nauseated"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You no longer feel nauseous."
msgstr "吐き気が治まりました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Canine Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You pant, unable to stop pacing and full of hunger."
msgstr "空腹感に喘ぎながらも、動くことを止められません。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Alcohol Withdrawal, Moderate Alcohol
#. Withdrawal, Severe Alcohol Withdrawal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You really need a drink!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Recently Trained"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You recently finished a training session and need a mental break before "
"teaching again."
msgstr "訓練を終えたばかりのため、再度訓練を指導するにはしばらく時間を空ける必要があります。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Seizure"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You regain control of your muscles!"
msgstr "筋肉の痙攣が治まりました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Strangulation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You see stars!"
msgstr "見えるだろ、あれは"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sylvan Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You see stars.  You see so many stars."
msgstr "星が見えます。満天の星空です。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weak Grasp"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You seem to have problems touching things."
msgstr "触覚が鈍っているように感じます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Otherworldly Vision"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You seem to see slightly different realities every time you blink."
msgstr "瞬きをする度に、周囲の光景が少しずつ変わって見えます。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Stimulant Overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You shake with the excess stimulation."
msgstr "過剰興奮で体が震えています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You start to develop symptoms of scurvy."
msgstr "壊血病の症状が現れはじめました。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You start to feel rejected by the world again."
msgstr "世界からの拒絶を再び感じ始めました。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Wandering Mind, Foreign Mind"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You suddenly think you shouldn't do that!"
msgstr "突然、こんなことをしてはいけないという考えが頭に浮かびました！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Asthma, Heavy Asthma"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You suffer from a respiratory disorder that makes breathing difficult.\n"
"An asthma attack can occur from time to time, so have your inhaler nearby."
msgstr ""
"呼吸器系疾患の症状に苦しんでいます。\n"
"時々喘息の発作が起きるので、手元に吸入器を用意しておきましょう。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moderate Opioid Withdrawal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You swing between fever and chills, and you can't stop thinking about "
"painkillers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Chiropteran Transformation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You taste iron, and you want more."
msgstr "鉄分を味わっています。もっと鉄分が欲しいと感じます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Antimutagenic Purgative"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You took a dose of purgative.  Any mutagens in your body are being purged."
msgstr "キレート剤を服用しました。体内の変異原物質が排出されました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Alprazolam"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You took a fast-acting sedative some time ago and you might still be under "
"its influence."
msgstr "摂取した即効性鎮静剤の影響がまだ残っているようです。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Fluoxetine"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You took an antidepressant some time ago and you might still be under its "
"influence."
msgstr "摂取した抗うつ剤の影響がまだ残っているようです。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Chlorpromazine"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You took an antipsychotic some time ago and you might still be under its "
"influence."
msgstr "摂取した抗精神病薬の影響がまだ残っているようです。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Took Anticonvulsant Drugs"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You took anticonvulsant drugs some time ago and you might still be under its influence.\n"
"Prescription note says its effect duration may vary, so your estimate may be inaccurate."
msgstr ""
"プロザックを摂取した影響を受けているようです。\n"
"処方箋によると効果の持続時間は変動するため、数値は不正確かもしれません。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Melatonin Supplements"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You took some melatonin supplements.  These will help with sleep "
"deprivation."
msgstr "メラトニンのサプリメントを摂取しました。睡眠不足の解消に効果があります。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Shakes"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You tremble."
msgstr "身体が震えています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Unstable Footing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You try to keep your balance."
msgstr "転ばないように必死で踏ん張っています。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "sleep"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You wake up."
msgstr "目が覚めました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Skunk Spray"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You were sprayed by a skunk!"
msgstr "%sによって攻撃されました！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Acid Drenched"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're bathed in acid!"
msgstr "放射線を浴びています！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Electrocuted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're being electrocuted!"
msgstr "感電しています！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Electrocuted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're being shocked with electricity to the point of serious harm!"
msgstr "重傷に至る程の電気ショックを受けています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Minor Bleeding, Bleeding, Bad Bleeding,
#. Heavy Bleeding, Heavy Arterial Bleeding"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're bleeding!"
msgstr "出血しています！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Blind"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're blinded!"
msgstr "何も見えません！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sap-coated"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sap-coated"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're coated in sap!"
msgstr "樹液まみれになっています！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Skunk Spray"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're covered in a foul smelling fluid!"
msgstr "発光する粘液まみれになっています！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Glowing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're covered in a glowing goo!"
msgstr "発光する粘液まみれになっています！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Acid Splattered, Acid Splashed, Acid
#. Showered, Acid Soaked, Acid Drenched"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're covered in acid!"
msgstr "酸まみれになっています！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Acid Soaked"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're covered in an alarming amount of acid!"
msgstr "発光する粘液まみれになっています！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Bile Splashed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're covered in bile!"
msgstr "胆汁まみれになっています！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Slimed"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Slimed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're covered in thick goo!"
msgstr "粘液まみれになっています！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Webbed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're covered in webs!"
msgstr "粘着質の糸まみれになっています！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Covered in Fetid Goop"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're disgusted by the goop."
msgstr "ヘドロに塗れて不快な気分です。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Coked Up"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're feeling chatty and energized, and probably way too confident."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Severe Opioid Withdrawal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're horribly sick.  Everything hurts, and not a moment goes by that you "
"aren't desperate to get your fix."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Downed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're knocked to the floor!"
msgstr "地面に打ち倒されました！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Downed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're knocked to the ground.  You have to get up before you can move."
msgstr ""
"地面に倒れています。\n"
"移動する前に立ち上がる必要があります。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're not dying from lack of blood, but you're not out of the woods yet."
msgstr "出血多量による死は回避しましたが、まだ峠は越えていません。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Inattentive"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're not even listening, are you?"
msgstr "周囲に注意を払えていませんよ？大丈夫ですか？"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "On Fire"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're on fire!  Wait in place to attempt to put out the fire."
msgstr "燃えています！その場に留まることで消火を試みます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Playing an Instrument"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're playing an instrument.\n"
"Focusing on playing music distracts you, slowing you down."
msgstr ""
"楽器を演奏しています。\n"
"楽器の演奏に集中している間は、他の事に気が回らず、行動も緩慢になります。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Heavy Opioid High"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're really out of it.  That's OK…"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Assisted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're receiving assistance to practice a surgery."
msgstr "手術の援助を受けています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Winded"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're short of breath.  Running and fighting will be difficult until you "
"recover."
msgstr "息切れしています。息切れが回復するまでは、駆足と戦闘は困難です。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Winded (Arms)"
#. ~ Description of effect type "Winded (Tentacles)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're short of breath.  Your arms have impaired function until you recover."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Winded (Foot)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're short of breath.  Your foot has impaired function until you recover."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Winded (Left Arm)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're short of breath.  Your left arm has impaired function until you "
"recover."
msgstr "息切れしており、回復するまで左腕の能力が損なわれています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Winded (Left Leg)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're short of breath.  Your left leg has impaired function until you "
"recover."
msgstr "息切れしており、回復するまで左脚の能力が損なわれています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Winded (Crab Leg)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're short of breath.  Your leg has impaired function until you recover."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Winded (Right Arm)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're short of breath.  Your right arm has impaired function until you "
"recover."
msgstr "息切れしており、回復するまで右腕の能力が損なわれています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Winded (Right Leg)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're short of breath.  Your right leg has impaired function until you "
"recover."
msgstr "息切れしており、回復するまで右脚の能力が損なわれています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Nodding Out"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're so high that it's difficult to keep your eyes open."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bile Splashed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're splattered with a greasy layer of liquified putrescence."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Staggered"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're staggered off-balance."
msgstr "バランスを崩してよろめきました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sludged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're standing in sludge!"
msgstr "ヘドロの中に立っています！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mild Alcohol Withdrawal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're starting to feel sick.  You know a drink would fix this."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stuck in a Pit"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're stuck in a pit.  Sight distance is limited and you have to climb out."
msgstr "穴に嵌って動けません。視界が阻まれており、這い上がる必要があります。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Stunned"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're stunned!"
msgstr "意識が朦朧としています！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Medical Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're tearing yourself apart.  Need to get fixed back up.  Should put some "
"stitches in you."
msgstr "肉体を自ら引き裂いています。元通りに治さないと。何針か縫えば大丈夫でしょうか。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Stoned, Baked, Blazed, Zooted"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're too stoned to keep up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Common Cold"
#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Influenza"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're too stuffed up to fight effectively."
msgstr "鼻が詰まって、効率的に戦えない状態です。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Dazed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You're visibly shaken up, and are having a hard time focusing on what's "
"going on around you."
msgstr "目に見えて動揺しています。周囲を見ようとしてもなかなか焦点を合わせられません。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Asthma, Heavy Asthma"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're winded."
msgstr "息切れしています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Zapped"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You're zapped!"
msgstr "電撃を浴びました！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bad High"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been exposed to fungal acid fumes!"
msgstr "菌類の幻覚成分の影響を受けています！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Tear Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been exposed to tear gas!"
msgstr "催涙ガスに晒されています！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Really Bad High"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been exposed to thick fungal acid fumes!"
msgstr "菌類の幻覚成分の影響を強く受けています！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and can no longer keep pushing.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"非常に活発な運動が長期間続きました。既に限界を超えています。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x10、高: x8、中: x6、低: x4、軽微: x2"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and can't take much more activity.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"非常に活発な運動をずっと続けています。これ以上の活動は難しそうです。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x10、高: x8、中: x6、低: x4、軽微: x2"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Very Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and need to slow down.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 5x, Active: 4x, Brisk: 3x, Moderate: 2x"
msgstr ""
"活発な運動が長く続きました。しばらくは身体を休ませる必要があります。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x5、高: x4、中: x3、低: x2"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while, and really need to get some rest.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"非常に活発な運動をずっと続けています。休憩を真剣に検討するべきです。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x10、高: x8、中: x6、低: x4、軽微: x2"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Extremely Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been extremely active for a while; it's time to stop.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 10x, Active: 8x, Brisk: 6x, Moderate: 4x, Light: 2x"
msgstr ""
"非常に活発な運動が長期間続きました。もう止めましょう。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x10、高: x8、中: x6、低: x4、軽微: x2"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Staggered"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been knocked off-balance by an attack."
msgstr "攻撃を受けてバランスを崩しました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Lightly Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been pretty active for a while; operating at the highest levels of activity will be impaired.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 1.25x"
msgstr ""
"活発な運動が少し続きました。最高の調子では動けません。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x1.25"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moderately Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been quite active for a while; operating at higher levels of activity will be impaired.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 1.67x, Active: 1.33x"
msgstr ""
"活発な運動がしばらく続きました。あまり調子良くは動けません。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x1.67、高: x1.33"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Discharge"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been recently affected by an electromagnetic pulse."
msgstr "EMPの影響を受けています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Supercharged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been struck by lightning, and feel… different."
msgstr "電撃に打たれ、何か...今までと違う気分になっています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weary"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've been very active for a while, and need to slow down for a bit.\n"
"The following move penalties are applied for the following activity levels:\n"
"Extreme: 2.5x, Active: 2x, Brisk: 1.5x"
msgstr ""
"活発な運動がかなりの間続きました。少し身体を休ませる必要があります。\n"
"以下の運動レベルの行動コストにペナルティを受けます。\n"
"最高: x2.5、高: x2、中: x1.5"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Zapped"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've been zapped with electricity and are barely able to move!"
msgstr "電撃を浴びました。移動が困難になります！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Acid Splattered"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've got a little bit of acid on you."
msgstr "敵を殴り倒すコツを掴みました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cocaine Buzz"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've got a mild cocaine buzz going.  Feels good, feels clean."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Acid Splashed"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've got a small amount of acid on you."
msgstr "契約成立だ。ロボットを探してこよう。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Caffeine Overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've had far too much caffeine.  You feel shaky and irritable."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Glowing Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've inhaled a lungful of glowing nether parasite spores.  Thankfully, "
"they don't seem adapted to the human physiology."
msgstr "光り輝く異界の寄生生物の胞子を肺一杯に吸い込みました。ありがたいことに、人間に寄生する特性はないようです。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moderate Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've lost a large amount of blood, and you're not feeling well."
msgstr "大量の血液を失い、気分が悪くなっています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Advanced Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've lost an awful lot of blood, and your condition is severe.  Seek "
"medical attention."
msgstr "非常に大量の血液を失い、容体は深刻です。医師の診察を受けた方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've lost some blood and look somewhat pale."
msgstr "血液を失い、顔が少し青ざめています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"You've lost tremendous amount of blood, and you're standing on death's door."
"  Transfusion might save you."
msgstr "途方もない量の血液を失い、死にかけています。輸血できれば助かるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Sludged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "You've stepped into some sludge!"
msgstr "ヘドロに足を踏み入れました！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Warm"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s feels warm."
msgstr "%sが熱気を帯びています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Blisters"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is blistering from the intense heat."
msgstr "酷い高温が原因で%sに水疱が発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Scorching"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is burning up!"
msgstr "%sが燃えるように暑く感じます！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Damp"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is covered in moisture."
msgstr "%sが少し湿っています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Freezing"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is dangerously cold!"
msgstr "%sが強烈な冷気に晒されています！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Chilly"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is exposed to the cold."
msgstr "%sが冷気に晒されています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Frostbite"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is frostbitten!  Its tissues are frozen from the cold!"
msgstr "%sが凍傷になりました！細胞組織が凍り始めています！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Frostnip"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is frostnipped and has gone numb."
msgstr "%sに霜焼けができ、痺れてきました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hot"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is hot."
msgstr "%sが暑く感じます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Soaked"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is soaked!"
msgstr "%sがずぶ濡れです！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Defrosting"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is starting to feel the damage cold has wrought."
msgstr "凍傷によって麻痺していた%sの痛みを感じるようになりました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Uncomfortable"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Your %s is uncomfortable.  Wearing something soft under your hard armor "
"would help."
msgstr "%sの着心地が悪く感じます。硬い防具の下に柔らかい防具を着用すると解消されます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cold"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is very exposed to the cold."
msgstr "%sが強い冷気に晒されています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Wet"
#: data/json/effects.json
#, c-format
msgid "Your %s is wet."
msgstr "%sが濡れています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Opioid Painkillers"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your aches and pains don't feel as bad."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Charged Acid Glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your acid glands are full and ready to burst.  Ew."
msgstr "酸嚢は満杯で、すぐにも破裂しそうです。うげっ。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Acid Glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your acid glands got all leaky."
msgstr "酸嚢が破れ、中身が漏れ出てしまいました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Adrenaline Comedown, Adrenaline Rush"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your adrenaline rush wears off.  You feel AWFUL!"
msgstr "アドレナリンの爆発が収まりました。酷い気分です！"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your anemia is nearly resolved."
msgstr "貧血がほぼ発生しなくなりました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Broken Arm"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your arms are broken.  Your imaginary monster arms, so this is probably a "
"bug."
msgstr "腕が骨折しています。モンスターに設定された疑似的な部位の設定であり、キャラクターに表示されている場合はバグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "EM Interference"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your artificial senses are overloaded."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Weak Grasp, Inexistent Grasp"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your attacks don't seem to touch your enemies!"
msgstr "攻撃が敵に効いていないようです！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Stinger"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your beautiful stinger is broken!  That must be a bug, right?"
msgstr "美しい針が折れてしまいました！恐らくこの表示はバグですね？"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Blisters"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your blisters distract you"
msgstr "水疱のせいで気が散っています。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Mild Hypovolemic Shock, Moderate
#. Hypovolemic Shock, Advanced Hypovolemic Shock, Severe Hypovolemic Shock"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your blood volume increases, and you feel better; but still, you look pale."
msgstr "血液量が回復して気分は良くなりましたが、まだ顔色は悪いままです。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Moderate Alcohol Withdrawal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your body aches and you have chills, like you've got the flu."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Chimera Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your body heaving and changing is a rough time, but what doesn't kill you "
"makes you stronger."
msgstr "肉体が波打ち、変化しました。酷い気分ですが、乗り越えれば強くなれる筈です。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Severe Opioid Overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your body is shutting down."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your body is strangely difficult to move, as if it weighted more."
msgstr "身体が重くなったような、妙な動きにくさを感じます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your body moves strangely easily, as if it weighted less."
msgstr "身体が妙に軽くなり、楽に動くような気がします。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Winded"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your breath gives out!"
msgstr "呼吸が乱れています！"

#. ~ Death message of effect type "Buzzed, Tipsy, Drunk, Wasted, Dead Drunk"
#. ~ Death message of effect type "Opioid Painkillers, Opioid Buzz, Opioid
#. High, Heavy Opioid High, Nodding Out, Opioid Overdose, Severe Opioid
#. Overdose"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your breathing grows weaker and weaker, and then you are gone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Legs"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your bugged legs are maimed beyond recognition.  How will you leap now?"
msgstr "バグにまみれた肢は、もう肢だと分からないほど傷ついています。どうやって飛び跳ねればいいのでしょう？"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Charged Capacitor"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your capacitors sizzle with bioelectricity."
msgstr "電気嚢に生体電気が溜まり、音を立てています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mild Smoke Inhalation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your chest and throat burn a little."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Molting"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your chitin plating itches against your body."
msgstr "キチン質の装甲と肉体が擦れて痒みを感じます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Claws"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your claws broke.  Like a broken nail, but somehow worse."
msgstr "鉤爪が損傷しました。爪が割れたようなものですが、影響はもっと甚大です。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Adrenaline Comedown, Adrenaline Rush"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your comedown throws you off."
msgstr "薬の効果が切れて、気分が落ち込んでいます。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Disabled"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your disabled body part has recovered enough for use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Nicotine Withdrawal"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your ears ring and your head is pounding."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Impaired Hearing, Ringing Ears, Deaf"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your ears ring!"
msgstr "耳鳴りがします！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Unnerving symptoms"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your extremities feel numb, with occasional painful tingling and "
"convulsions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Hay Fever"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes are itchy and you've got a runny nose."
msgstr "目が痒く、鼻水が出ています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Severe Eye Irritation"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Eye Irritation, Eye Irritation, Major
#. Eye Irritation, Severe Eye Irritation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes are so badly inflamed that you can hardly see."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Mild Eye Irritation, Eye Irritation, Major
#. Eye Irritation, Severe Eye Irritation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes are so irritated you can barely see."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Eye Irritation"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Eye Irritation, Eye Irritation, Major
#. Eye Irritation, Severe Eye Irritation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes are watering."
msgstr "目が潤んでいます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Mild Eye Irritation"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Eye Irritation, Eye Irritation, Major
#. Eye Irritation, Severe Eye Irritation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes burn a little."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Tear Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes burn from the tear gas."
msgstr "催涙ガスが目に入り、焼けるような痛みが走っています。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes open to a whole new world!"
msgstr "まったく新しい世界を見据えました！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Major Eye Irritation"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Mild Eye Irritation, Eye Irritation, Major
#. Eye Irritation, Severe Eye Irritation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your eyes sting badly and tears stream from them continuously."
msgstr "目が激しく痛み、涙が止まりません。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Anemia, Anemia, Acute Anemia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your feel stronger as your anemia starts to improve."
msgstr "貧血が改善し、前より強くなった気がします。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency, Iron Deficiency,
#. Acute Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your feel stronger as your iron deficiency starts to improve."
msgstr "鉄欠乏症が改善し始め、元気になった気がします。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Chimera Transformation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your flesh is the clay of the new world.  You'll overcome all challenges."
msgstr "この肉体は言わば新世界の粘土です。形を変えればどんな困難でも乗り越えられそうな気がします。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Unstable Footing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your footing is unstable.  It's more difficult to fight while standing here,"
" and you could easily stumble or fall."
msgstr "足場が不安定です。この場で戦うのは困難です。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "World's Acceptance, World's Embracement,
#. Dimensional Foothold, Dimensional Assimilation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your grip suddenly failed you."
msgstr "一瞬、何も分からなくなりました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Shakes"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your hands just won't stop shaking."
msgstr "手の震えが止まりません。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Impaired Hearing"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your hearing is impaired."
msgstr "聴覚が損なわれています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Murine Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your heart hammers away with a rapid, irregular beat."
msgstr "心臓が忙しなく不規則に拍動しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Murine Transformation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your heart pounds, knowing that predators could approach at any second!"
msgstr "今にも肉食獣に襲われるような気がして、動悸が治まりません！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your inertia itself is damaged, but hopefully it's not permanent yet."
msgstr "慣性に欠落が生じていますが、きっとそのうち元に戻るでしょう。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Weakened Inertia"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your inertia itself is damaged, but the outcome seems suspiciously "
"beneficial."
msgstr "慣性に欠落が生じており、妙に身体が軽くなったような気がします。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Deflated ink glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your ink glands are almost empty.  Given some time and hydration they will "
"recharge."
msgstr "墨袋がほとんど空になっています。水分を補給して少し待てば墨が生成されます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Bulged ink glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your ink glands are bulged and full.  No more ink is being created."
msgstr "墨袋がパンパンに膨らんでいます。墨はこれ以上生成されません。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Depleted ink"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your ink glands are empty.  Given some time and hydration they will "
"recharge."
msgstr "墨袋がほとんど空になっています。水分を補給して少し待てば墨が生成されます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Inky glands"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your ink glands have some ink inside.  Given some time and hydration, more "
"ink will be generated."
msgstr "墨袋の中に墨が入っています。水分を補給して少し待てば墨が更に生成されます。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Iron Deficiency, Iron Deficiency,
#. Acute Iron Deficiency"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your iron deficiency is nearly resolved."
msgstr "鉄分不足はほぼ解消されました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Conjunctivitis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your itchy eye leaks a filmy discharge."
msgstr "目元が痒く、目ヤニが出ています。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Muscle Vanishment, Muscle Disappearance"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your lack of strength stops you!"
msgstr "身体に力が入らず動けません！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Reptilian Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your limbs slump, almost ready to tear right out of their sockets."
msgstr "四肢が力を失い、今にももげてしまいそうに感じます。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Glowing Gas"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your lungs burn from the glowing gas."
msgstr "発光する粒子を吸い込み、肺がヒリヒリと痛みます。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Mild Smoke Inhalation, Smoke Inhalation,
#. Major Smoke Inhalation, Severe Smoke Inhalation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your lungs burn from the smoke."
msgstr "煙を吸い込み、肺がヒリヒリと痛みます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Mandibles"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your mandibles are unusable.  What, you don't have mandibles?  Then it must "
"be a bug if you have it."
msgstr "虫顎はもう使えません。えっ、虫顎なんて持っていない？では、この表示はバグのせいですね。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Hypervitaminosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your metabolism becomes more stable."
msgstr "代謝が安定しました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Hypervitaminosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your metabolism becomes unstable."
msgstr "代謝が不安定になりました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Stunned"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your movement is randomized."
msgstr "ランダムな方向に移動してしまいます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Muscle Cramps"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your muscles are binding up, you should probably find a sedative."
msgstr "筋肉が自由に動きません。鎮静剤を摂取しましょう。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Seizure"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your muscles have seized up, and you can't control them!"
msgstr "筋肉がつって上手く動かせません！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Muscle Cramps"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your muscles start convulsing!"
msgstr "筋肉が痙攣しています！"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Seizure"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your muscles won't cooperate!"
msgstr "筋肉が上手く動きません！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Crowded"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your nerves are frayed from all this socializing.  You need some alone time "
"to recharge."
msgstr "他者との交流のせいで神経がすり減っています。元気を取り戻すには一人の時間が必要です。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Night Vision Goggles (Green)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your night vision goggles give a green tint to the world."
msgstr "右手が寒さで小刻みに震えています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Plant Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your processes are slowing.  You would make great fertilizer."
msgstr "動作が鈍くなっているように感じます。効き目の強い肥料ですね。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Got a Check-up"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your received a complete check-up and are now aware of the state of your "
"health."
msgstr "詳細な健康診断を受け、自分の健康状態を認識しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Masked Scent"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your scent is masked by another one."
msgstr "他の匂いによって体臭がかき消されています。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your scurvy has resolved."
msgstr "壊血病が治りました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your scurvy lessens as your Vitamin C deficiency improves."
msgstr "ビタミンC不足が改善され、壊血病の症状は軽くなりました。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Touched Mind, Tainted Mind, Badly Tainted
#. Mind"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your sense of reality warps!"
msgstr "現実感が歪んでいます！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Poor Sight"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your sight distance is impaired."
msgstr "遠くのものが見えません。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Blind"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your sight returns!"
msgstr "視力が戻りました！"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Cephalopod Metamorphosis"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your skin crawls and your extremities twitch and jerk."
msgstr "肌がムズムズし、四肢がひくつきました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Reptilian Transformation"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your skin feels dry and too small.  You'll have to molt soon."
msgstr "この肌はカサついており、窮屈すぎます。そろそろ脱皮する頃合いでしょうか。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Puckered Scratches"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your skin starts burning around some of your scratches.  Some aspirin might "
"relieve the effects."
msgstr "傷の周りがヒリヒリと傷みます。アスピリンで症状を緩和できます。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Sleep Deprived"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your sleep debt has been steadily increasing for a while.  You should get "
"some rest."
msgstr "睡眠負債は増加し続けています。休息を取るべきです。"

#. ~ Miss message of effect type "Food Poisoning"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your stomach bothers you."
msgstr "胃の調子が悪くなりました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Food Poisoning"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your stomach is extremely upset, and you are quite nauseated."
msgstr "胃の調子が悪すぎて、凄まじい吐き気を催しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Engorged"
#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Engorged"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your stomach is full to bursting.  This was a mistake."
msgstr "胃が張り裂けそうです。食べ過ぎましたね。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Slightly Nauseated, Mildly Nauseated,
#. Nauseated, Very Nauseated, Extremely Nauseated"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your stomach is upset, you might throw up."
msgstr "胃の調子が悪すぎて、凄まじい吐き気を催しています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Tail"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your tail is broken.  You're not sure what to do with this information."
msgstr "尻尾が損傷しています。この情報をどう活用すればいいのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Tweaking"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid ""
"Your thoughts are going a mile a minute.  Your whole body is burning up with"
" chattery, nervous energy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of effect type "Wandering Mind"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your thoughts seem to wander around on their own."
msgstr "思考が迷走し、考えがまとまりません。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "darkness"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vision flickers and goes gray!"
msgstr "視界が点滅し、薄暗くなりました！"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Distracted, Inattentive, Dissociated"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vision grows blurry."
msgstr "視界がぼやけています。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Boomered"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vision is obscured by a disgusting splatter of bile."
msgstr "不快な胆汁に視界を塞がれています。"

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Contact Lenses"
#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Transition Contact Lenses"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vision starts to blur."
msgstr "視界がぼやけ始めました。"

#. ~ Decay message of effect type "Early Scurvy, Scurvy, Bad Scurvy"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your vitamin C deficiency is starting to resolve."
msgstr "ビタミンC不足はほぼ解消されました。"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Maimed Wings"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your wings are useless, robbing you of unlimited flight."
msgstr "翅はもう役に立ちません。無限の空は奪われました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Infected, Badly Infected, Pus Filled"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Your wound feels infected."
msgstr "傷が原因で感染症に罹ったようです。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "zapped"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Zapped"
msgstr "電撃"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "zolpidem"
#. ~ Vitamin name
#: data/json/effects.json data/json/vitamin.json
msgid "Zolpidem"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of effect type id "weed_high"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "Zooted"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Remove message of effect type "Transition Contact Lenses (Plano)"
#: data/json/effects.json
msgid "you pull off your photochromic contact lenses."
msgstr "調光コンタクトレンズを外しました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MARLOSS_R_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You daydream about luscious pink berries as big as your fist."
msgstr "握り拳ほどの大きさの、甘美で芳しい桃色のベリーを空想しています。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MARLOSS_B_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You daydream about nutty cyan seeds as big as your hand."
msgstr "手の平に乗る大きさの、木の実の味がする青緑色の種を空想しています。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_MARLOSS_Y_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You daydream about succulent, pale golden gel, sweet but light."
msgstr "汁気たっぷりの、甘いのにしつこくない、淡い黄金色のジェルを空想しています。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CAFFEINE_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You want some caffeine."
msgstr "カフェインを欲しています。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_CAFFEINE_ADDICTION"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/addictions_eocs.json
msgid "You've got a headache.  You need caffeine to function."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_CANCEL_FALLOUT_MESSAGE"
#: data/json/effects_on_condition/anamolous_weather_eocs.json
msgid "The ash has stopped falling, and the clouds no longer seem so ominous."
