"to identify it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "rewired card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
msgid "A smartcard reader.  The casing is damaged, and repaired with tape."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "PPE lockup card reader"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
