"has washed it in a long time, though; it is covered in dense scrawls of "
"equations and waveform diagrams."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "industrial green carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/LIXA_furniture_and_terrain.json
