msgstr "電柱"

#. ~ Description of furniture "anaerobic digester"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A 1000 L anaerobic digester."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "filled anaerobic digester"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A 1000L anaerobic digester."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "reinforced vending machine (off)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A bit tougher to crack open than a regular vending machine.  Out of order, "
"for lack of power.  That just makes it all the sweeter of a target, doesn't "
"it?"
msgstr "通常の自動販売機より略奪が困難です。その分、良いものが入っているような気がしませんか？"

#. ~ Description of furniture "reinforced vending machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A bit tougher to crack open than a regular vending machine.  That just makes"
" it all the sweeter of a target, doesn't it?"
msgstr "通常の自動販売機より略奪が困難です。その分、良いものが入っているような気がしませんか？"

#. ~ Description of furniture "stationary scutcher"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A bulky, simple-hinged wooden device to break up the hard parts of fiber "
"plants, with nail combs on the back for separating them out."
msgstr ""
"蝶番で留めた部品で植物の硬い繊維質を叩いてほぐす、シンプルな作りの大きな木製装置です。背面に櫛のように並んだ釘を使い、ほぐした繊維を梳いて選り分けます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mitre saw"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A circular sawblade on an arm that can slide and rotate in several "
"directions, this is a staple tool for nearly any carpentry.  You can take "
"this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr ""
"大抵の木材加工をこなせる、角度を変えられるアームに丸ノコギリ刃が取り付けられた装置です。取り外して任意の場所に移し、電気配線と接続して使用できます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "grappling hook"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A dangling piece of rope, hooked securely to something above you.  If you "
"want to take it down, you'll have to climb up to where it's anchored."
msgstr "もう一方を上部にしっかりと結びつけたロープが垂れ下がっています。上層や下層に移動できそうです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "bronze anvil"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A heavy block of oddly-shaped bronze with a pritchel hole and hardy hole.  "
"It's used for metalworking."
msgstr "丸い穴と四角い穴が開いた、奇妙な形状の非常に重い青銅の塊です。 金属加工に用いられます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "anvil"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A heavy block of oddly-shaped metal with a pritchel hole and hardy hole.  "
"It's used for metalworking."
msgstr "丸い穴と四角い穴が開いた、奇妙な形状の非常に重い金属の塊です。 金属加工に用いられます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "hanging meathook"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A hefty hook suspended from a chain for stringing up corpses."
msgstr "チェーンで吊り下げられた、死体を吊るすための大きなフックです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "planer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A hefty tool that will take in a board and cut it smooth and flat to a "
"specific width, particularly great if working with raw lumber stock, but "
"also good just for shaving wood down to size.  You can take this down and "
"plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr ""
"大きな板材の平滑化や凹凸の研削を行なう大型機械です。特に生材の加工に適していますが、加工済みの木材のかんな掛けも得意です。取り外して任意の場所に移し、電気配線と接続して使用できます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "clay kiln"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A kiln designed to bake clay pottery and bricks."
msgstr "陶器やレンガを焼くための窯です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "screw press"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A large screw press for manually pressing oil out of fruit or seed paste.  "
"The paste is placed in wetted bags and pressed down by the force of the "
"screw mechanism."
msgstr ""
"果実や種子のペーストを搾って油を採取するための、手動式の大型スクリュープレスです。湿らせた袋に入れたペーストを、ネジ機構で押し潰して搾ります。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "spinning wheel"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A large wooden device with a mechanical wheel used to combine fibers "
"together into a stronger material."
msgstr "繊維をより合わせて強度を高めるために使う、木製のホイールが付いた大きな装置です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "rope and tackle hoist"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A loop of rope hangs here, looped through a quality tackle to give a "
"significant mechanical advantage while lifting heavy objects."
msgstr "ロープで作った輪が、高品質の滑車にぶら下がっています。力学的に、重量物を非常に楽に持ち上げられるようになっています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "rope hoist"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A loop of rope hangs here, using a sturdy horizontal support as a basic "
"pulley.  While crude, it gives you some mechanical advantage for lifting "
"things."
msgstr ""
"地面と水平に伸びた頑丈な支柱を滑車代わりにして、ロープで作った輪がぶら下がっています。簡単な作りですが、力学的に荷物をある程度持ち上げやすくなる効果があります。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "disconnected catalytic cracking reactor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A makeshift extraction system, or as makeshift as you can consider something"
" that was purpose-built in a laboratory by a group of experts.  You can take"
" this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr ""
"その場しのぎで作られた抽出装置ですが、専門家集団が実験室で自作したものと比べても遜色ありません。取り外して任意の場所に移し、電気配線と接続して使用できます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "Beverly shear"
#. ~ Description of "Beverly shear"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid ""
"A massive bench-mounted device with a short guillotine blade mounted to a "
"long lever.  Designed for making straight or curved cuts through sheet metal"
" up to 3 millimeters thick."
msgstr "長いレバーの先に短い剪断刃が付いた、重量感のある卓上切断機です。厚さ3mmまでの板金を直線や曲線の形状に切断することができます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "metal butchering rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A metal butchering rack designed to hang a carcass in the air.  It can be "
"deconstructed and folded for easy transportation."
msgstr "枝肉を宙吊りにできる、金属製の食肉処理ラックです。分解すれば簡単に持ち運べます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "metal charcoal kiln"
#. ~ Description of furniture "filled metal charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A metal kiln designed to burn wood and organic material into charcoal in the"
" absence of oxygen.  Much more efficient than its archaic rock counterpart."
msgstr "木材や有機物を酸素のない状態で燃焼させて炭に加工する、金属製の窯です。石を並べて作った昔ながらの窯より遥かに高性能です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "active metal smoking rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A metal rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste."
msgstr "食品を燻して日持ちと味を向上させる金属製のラックです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "metal smoking rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A metal rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste.  "
"Works as a charcoal smoker in crafting recipes."
msgstr "食品を燻して日持ちと味を向上させる金属製のラックです。製作の際は燻製器として機能します。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "rock forge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A metalworking station made of rock, typically used in combination with an "
"anvil.  Works as a charcoal forge in crafting recipes."
msgstr "金床と共に使うのが一般的な、石でできた金属加工設備です。製作の際は炭火炉として機能します。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "forge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A metalworking station typically used in combination with an anvil."
msgstr "金床と共に使うのが一般的な、金属加工設備です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "drill press"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A powerful drill mounted on a slide that lets it drop precisely down.  "
"Useful in all kinds of projects from industrial fabrication to home "
"woodworking.  You can take this down and plug it into your own power grid to"
" use it."
msgstr ""
"正確な位置に穴を開けられる強力なドリルです。工業加工品から家庭の木工品まで、あらゆる製作の場面で役立ちます。電気配線と接続して使用できます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "charcoal kiln"
#. ~ Description of furniture "filled charcoal kiln"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A primitive rock kiln designed to burn wood and organic material into "
"charcoal in the absence of oxygen.  It isn't especially efficient compared "
"to a modern metal variant."
msgstr "木材や有機物を酸素のない状態で燃焼させて炭に加工する、原始的な窯です。現代の窯と比べると性能は高くありません。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "band saw"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A ribbonlike sawblade runs in a single direction in this tool, allowing "
"precise cuts at almost any angle.  You can take this down and plug it into "
"your own power grid to use it."
msgstr ""
"帯状ののこぎり刃が一定方向に回転する工具です。さまざまな角度を付けて素材を正確に切断できます。取り外して任意の場所に移し、電気配線と接続して使用できます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "table saw"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A rotating sawblade set into a large, flat table, for making straight "
"measured cuts.  It's a key tool in any carpenter's arsenal.  You can take "
"this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr ""
"広く平らなテーブルに回転のこぎり刃が固定されており、まっすぐ正確に素材を切ることができます。取り外して任意の場所に移し、電気配線と接続して使用できます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fermenting vat"
#. ~ Description of furniture "filled fermenting vat"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A sealable 50-liter vat for fermenting vinegar and various alcoholic brews."
msgstr "50Lの液体を密封できる、酢や酒を発酵させるための大桶です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wooden fermenting vat"
#. ~ Description of furniture "filled wooden fermenting vat"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A sealable 50-liter wooden vat for fermenting vinegar and various alcoholic "
"brews."
msgstr "50Lの液体を密封できる、酢や酒を発酵させるための木製大桶です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "aluminum stepladder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A short, foldable aluminum ladder.  Can help you climb to a rooftop, or "
"maybe slow something down."
msgstr "折り畳めるアルミニウム製の短い梯子です。屋上に登る際や、通行者の足止めをしたいときに役立ちます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wooden stepladder"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A short, foldable wooden ladder.  Can help you climb to a rooftop, or maybe "
"slow something down."
msgstr "折り畳める木製の短い梯子です。屋上に登る際や、通行者の足止めをしたいときに役立ちます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "small anvil"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A small handcrafted anvil."
msgstr "小さな手鏡です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "water mill"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A small water-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour."
msgstr "でんぷん質を含むアイテムを穀粉に加工する小型の水車です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "active water mill"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A small water-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour.  "
"Its brake has been removed and it is turning."
msgstr "でんぷん質を含むアイテムを穀粉に加工する小型の水車です。ブレーキ機構が解除され、回転しています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wind mill"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A small wind-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour."
msgstr "でんぷん質を含むアイテムを穀粉に加工する小型の風車です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "active wind mill"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A small wind-powered mill that can convert starchy products into flour.  Its"
" brake has been removed and it is turning."
msgstr "でんぷん質を含むアイテムを穀粉に加工する小型の風車です。ブレーキ機構が解除され、回転しています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "computer console"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A standalone computer terminal, the screen glowing with dim artificial "
"light.  If examined closely, you can read what's on the screen and perform "
"any allowed functions.  It might even be possible to hack it, given the "
"skills."
msgstr ""
"モニタから薄暗い人工光を発している、スタンドアロン型のコンピュータ端末です。調べることで、モニタに表示されている表示内容を読み、操作を実行できます。技術さえあれば、ハッキングもできるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "broken console"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A standalone computer terminal.  It doesn't seem to be working.  It's the "
"broken screen and shattered circuit boards telling you that."
msgstr "スタンドアロン型のコンピュータ端末です。正常に機能していないことは、割れたスクリーンと粉々になった回路基板を見れば明白です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "chain hoist"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy chain and heavy tackle hang well-supported from the ceiling here, "
"ready to lift most heavy items you could think of using mechanical "
"advantage."
msgstr "天井に重厚な滑車が備わっており、そこから頑丈なチェーンがぶら下がっています。力学的に、どんな重い物でも持ち上げられるようになっています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "jointer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A table-shaped tool with a rotating blade that will cut down, smooth out, "
"and square off a board to make it very smooth and nice indeed.  You can take"
" this down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr ""
"回転する刃が付いたテーブルです。木材を切り分け、滑らかにし、四角形に切り落とす一連の作業を素早く正確にこなします。取り外して任意の場所に移し、電気配線と接続して使用できます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "vine leading up"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A thick vine is rigidly anchored to something above you.  It looks quite "
"alive.  If you want to take it down, you'll have to climb up to where it's "
"anchored."
msgstr "まだ瑞々しい太い蔦が上層にしっかりと固定されています。上層に登るか、壊すことができます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "web leading up"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A thick, dangling strand of slightly sticky web, the other end is tied "
"securely to something above you.  You could use it to climb up."
msgstr "もう一方を上部にしっかりと結びつけた、少し粘つく太いクモ糸が垂れ下がっています。これを使えば上層に移動できそうです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "butchering rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A wooden butchering rack designed to hang a carcass in the air."
msgstr "枝肉を宙吊りにできる、木製の食肉処理ラックです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "active smoking rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A wooden rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste.  It "
"is lit and smoking."
msgstr "食品を燻して日持ちと味を向上させる木製のラックです。点火されており、内部で燻製が進行しています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "smoking rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A wooden rack designed to smoke food for better preservation and taste.  "
"Works as a charcoal smoker in crafting recipes."
msgstr "内部で食品を燻して日持ちと味を向上させる、木製のラックです。製作の際は燻製器として機能します。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "arc furnace"
#. ~ Description of furniture "filled arc furnace"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"An arc furnace designed to burn a powdery mix of coke and limestone to "
"create calcium carbide."
msgstr "アーク炉です。コークスと石灰石を混ぜた粉末を入れて燃焼すると、炭化カルシウムが生成できます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "automated gas console"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "An automated gas flow control console."
msgstr "自動でガソリン流量を制御する給油装置です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "broken automated gas console"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"An automated gas flow control console.  It's broken.  This is not a good "
"thing."
msgstr "自動でガソリン流量を制御する給油装置です。残念ながら壊れています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "heavy anvil"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"An enormously heavy block of oddly-shaped metal with all the accoutrements a"
" blacksmith could ask for.  It's used for heavy-duty metalworking."
msgstr "鍛冶屋が求めるあらゆる機能を備えた、奇妙な形状の非常に巨大な鋼鉄の塊です。大型の金属加工に用いられます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "still"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"An essential component for brewing and chemistry that allows for refining "
"liquid mixtures."
msgstr "混合した液体を精製する、醸造や化学実験に必要不可欠な道具です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "power lathe"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"An industrial-grade lathe, for turning chunks of metal and other hard things"
" into round chunks of metal and other hard things.  It's really heavy but "
"you could take this down and use it for your own purposes if you wanted."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "broken vending machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"An upright metal cabinet with a see-through door.  It's smashed open, so you"
" can take whatever you want for free."
msgstr "前面を透明なパネルで覆われた、金属製の四角い装置です。扉が開いているため、商品がタダで手に入ります。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "vending machine (off)"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"An upright metal cabinet with a see-through door.  Out of order, for lack of"
" power."
msgstr "前面を透明なパネルで覆われた、金属製の四角い装置です。扉が開いているため、商品がタダで手に入ります。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "vending machine"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"An upright metal cabinet with a see-through door.  The goods inside can be "
"yours if you have money on a cash card."
msgstr "前面を透明なパネルで覆われた、金属製の四角い装置です。残金があるキャッシュカードを所持していれば、内部の商品を買うことができます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
#: data/json/items/fake.json data/json/items/tool/deployable.json
msgid "Beverly shear"
msgid_plural "Beverly shears"
msgstr[0] "レバーシャー"

#. ~ Description of furniture "hydraulic press"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"If you really want to squash something a lot, this would be exactly the "
"right industrial tool for you.  You can take this down and plug it into your"
" own power grid to use it."
msgstr "何かを大量に潰したいと思っている人にうってつけの工業用機械です。取り外して任意の場所に移し、電気配線と接続して使用できます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "air compressor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"This durable tank is topped with a motor that will cram as much air into the"
" tank as possible.  You can take this down and plug it into your own power "
"grid to use it."
msgstr "大量の空気を吸入するモーターが搭載された、頑丈なタンクです。取り外して任意の場所に移し、電気配線と接続して使用できます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "manual tire changer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"This floor-mounted machine contains all the levers, clamps and mounts "
"required to remove or fit a tire, plus an integrated foot pump to inflate "
"it."
msgstr "タイヤの着脱に必要なレバー、クランプ、マウントに加え、タイヤを加圧するための足踏み式ポンプも内蔵している、設置して使う機械です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "router table"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"This table has an inset router, a rotating motor with an exchangeable blade "
"head for cutting specific profiles and grooves and stuff.  You can take this"
" down and plug it into your own power grid to use it."
msgstr ""
"交換可能なブレードを使って様々な素材の切断や溝彫りをこなすルーターが、テーブルに取り付けられています。取り外して任意の場所に移し、電気配線と接続して使用できます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "firefly terrarium"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"While many survivors would have focused on trying to bring back electric "
"lights, whoever lives here has apparently decided to make use of the changes"
" wrought by the Cataclysm to provide light.  This vivarium contains soil, "
"strange plants you don't recognize immediately, and most strikingly, a giant"
" mutant firefly."
msgstr ""
"大抵の生存者は電気を使って照明を復旧しようとするものですが、ここの住人は、大変動による環境変化を利用して光源を確保することにしたようです。飼育容器の中には、土と見たこともない奇妙な植物、そして驚くべきことに、変異した巨大なホタルが入っています。"

