"A hole has been dug into the roots here, and a pretty unpleasant smell emits"
" from it."
msgstr "根元に掘られた穴の中から、非常に不快な臭いが漂ってきます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "illuminating plant bulb"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-triffid.json
msgid ""
"A small plant grows among the roots here, its green, onion-like bulb "
"illuminating the area around it."
msgstr "小さな植物が根を張っており、タマネギのような球根が周囲を照らしています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "brambles"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-triffid.json
msgid ""
"A wall of tangled roots blocks the path here, you'd have destroy it to get "
"past."
msgstr "絡み合った根の壁が道を塞いでいます。破壊しなければ通り抜けられません。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-triffid.json
