#. ~ Description of furniture "M224 mortar"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_military.json
msgid ""
"A 60mm mortar tube deployed and ready for use, provided you're skilled "
"enough with launchers to understand the firing tables."
msgstr ""

