#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_60MM_SHOT" in furniture "M224 mortar"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_military.json
msgid "There is some 60mm propellant left over."
msgstr "全てをくみ取ることはできませんでした！"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_60MM_SHOT" in furniture "M224
#. mortar"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_military.json
msgid "You fire the M224 mortar."
msgstr "炭焼窯に火を付けました。"

#. ~ Message when furniture "M224 mortar"'s examine action fails its condition
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_military.json
msgid "You have absolutely no idea how to use this mortar."
msgstr "車を運転する方法が分かりません。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "nether lichen"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"A bed of orange, flowering lichen, covering the surface of the yellow ichor."
"  Every now and then, a flower disappears into the liquid, but seems to "
"reappear the moment you look away."
msgstr ""
"黄色い液体の表面を覆うように、オレンジ色の花を咲かせる地衣類が繁茂しています。花は時折落ちて液体の中へと消えていきますが、あっという間に再び開花します。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "nether grass"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"A bed of waist high segmented blue plants that remind you of grass.  As you "
"wade past, they react to your movement and always swivel to face you."
msgstr ""
"草でできたベッドを思わせる、腰の高さまで伸びた青色の植物です。草を掻き分けて通ろうとすると、全ての葉がその動きに反応し、身をよじって纏わりつこうとします。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "tall nether grass"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"A clump of tall, segmented blue plants that remind you of grass.  As you "
"approach, they bend towards you, hugging your body and making movement "
"difficult."
msgstr "一般的な草に似た、背が高く所々に節がある青色の植物が生い茂っています。近付くと葉がぴったりと身を寄せてきて、動きを阻害します。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "decaying tube"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "A decomposing fleshy stalagmite extends from the ceiling to the floor."
msgstr "腐敗した肉が、鍾乳石のように天井から床に垂れ下がっています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "glowing decaying tube"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"A decomposing fleshy stalagmite extends from the ceiling to the floor.  "
"Countless glowing spores weft from within, coating everything nearby."
msgstr "腐敗した肉が、鍾乳石のように天井から床に垂れ下がっています。その内部から無数の光り輝く粒子が溢れ、周囲に降り積もっています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "nether patchwork"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"A peculiar plant that is hard to distinguish, resembling a tangled mess of "
"different terrestrial flowers and weeds firmly wedged into the monstrous "
"flesh.  It pulses rhythmically as it rearranges its form into even weirder "
"shapes."
msgstr ""
"様々な変わった草花がモンスターの肉体にしっかりと根付き、互いに絡み合って一塊になっています。リズミカルに脈打ちながら、更に奇妙な形状へと変化し続けています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "beautiful nether lily"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"A very tall, mesmerizing blood red flower.  Its beautiful, pristine form is "
"rooted firmly on the innards of the beast.  The flesh around it is decayed, "
"being consumed to feed its ornate, magnanimous body.  You feel an urge to "
"sit and admire this priceless miracle of life."
msgstr ""
"血のように赤く魅惑的な花をつけた、非常に背の高い植物です。美しく清らかな姿ですが、モンスターの肉体にしっかりと根付いているようです。可憐かつ壮大な花を養うために周囲の肉の養分は吸い取られ、腐敗しています。このかけがえのない生命の奇跡をじっと眺めていたいという衝動に駆られます。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in effect in EoC "admire_lily_effect" in
#. furniture "beautiful nether lily"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "You admire the lily.  Isn't it beautiful?"
msgstr "異界のユリを賞賛しました。なんて美しいのでしょう？"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in effect in EoC "admire_lily_effect" in
#. furniture "beautiful nether lily"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "You bow to the lily, and gain immense satisfaction in having done so."
msgstr "異界のユリにこうべを垂れ、計り知れない満足感を得ました。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in effect in EoC "admire_lily_effect" in
#. furniture "beautiful nether lily"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "You focus on the lily and realize it truly is perfection *incarnate*."
msgstr "異界のユリを眺め、本当に完璧な*姿*であることを認識しました。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in effect in EoC "admire_lily_effect" in
#. furniture "beautiful nether lily"'s examine action
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "You worship the lily, and feel truly fulfilled."
msgstr "異界のユリを褒め称え、心の底から充実感に満ちています。"

#. ~ Bashing sound of furniture "beautiful nether lily"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_nether_monster.json
msgid "a chilling scream!"
msgstr "[ぞっとする叫び声！]"

