msgid "tall nether grass"
msgstr "生い茂った異界の草地"

#. ~ Description of furniture "display fridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A big glass chamber, designed to display different food in multiple rows, "
"while cooling it at the same time.   Deconstruct it if you want to connect "
"it to the grid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "chest freezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A chest freezer.  Big and power efficient, this is the dream for every "
"cataclysm survivor.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "display chest freezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A commercial chest freezer, used to show off ice creams, frozen veggies, "
"pizza, or anything else a consumer may want frozen and preserved.  "
"Conveniently tall enough for any curious child to gaze in at the sweets.  "
"Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "glass door freezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A commercial upright freezer, used to show ice creams, frozen veggies, "
"pizza, or anything else a consumer may want frozen and preserved.  "
"Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "heavy-duty fridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A heavy, bulky refrigerator, used in professional kitchens.  Deconstruct it "
"if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "heavy-duty freezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty upright freezer, one that is used in a professional kitchen.  "
"Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "single glass door fridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A modern refrigerator with a thick sheet of glass for a door, used in stores"
" to show off the goods while keeping them cool.  Deconstruct it if you want "
"to connect it to the grid."
msgstr ""
"断熱性を高める特殊処理が施されたガラス板をドアに使っている、最新式の冷蔵庫です。電源が入っていると内容物が冷やされ、腐るまでの期間が延長されます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "double glass door fridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A modern refrigerator with two glass doors, to fit twice as much goods for "
"consumers.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "chest minifreezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A small chest freezer, used to store a small amount of perishables for a "
"long time, if you're willing to dig them out each time that is.  Deconstruct"
" it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "minifridge"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A small fridge, often used in places where full-size fridge would be too big"
" or too much a hassle to transport, or when you only need a small amount of "
"items chilled.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "minifreezer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A small upright freezer, used to store a small amount of perishables long "
"term.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect it to the grid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of furniture "refrigerator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid ""
"A standard household refrigerator.  If powered, it will cool its contents to"
" extend the time before they spoil.  Deconstruct it if you want to connect "
"it to the grid."
msgstr "一般的な家庭用冷蔵庫です。電源が入っていると内容物が冷やされ、腐るまでの期間が延長されます。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
#: data/json/items/appliances/appliances_refrigeration.json
msgid "chest minifreezer"
msgid_plural "chest minifreezers"
msgstr[0] "小型冷凍庫"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "display chest freezer"
msgstr "超低温フリーザー"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_refrigeration.json
msgid "refrigerator"
msgstr "冷蔵庫"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass dresser"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A black glass cabinet with its doors slightly ajar.  Inside is a row of "
"hangers bearing neatly folded and entirely rigid clothing."
msgstr "扉が少し開いた状態の、黒いガラスでできた衣装棚です。内部では、完全に硬化した衣装がハンガーにかかって整然と並んでいます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass cupboard"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A black glass cupboard.  The doors are fused shut, but it presumably "
"contains glasses."
msgstr "黒いガラスでできた戸棚です。扉は閉まった状態で癒着していますが、恐らく中にもガラスが入っています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A black glass figure of a child.  It is difficult to make out their facial "
"features, but it seems as if they are smiling."
msgstr "黒いガラスでできた、子供サイズの像です。顔の特徴は分かりにくいですが、笑っているようです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass figure of a person covering their face with their hands."
msgstr "顔を手で覆うポーズをしている、黒いガラスでできた像です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A black glass figure of a someone frozen halfway through falling backwards, "
"and suspended on a single leg."
msgstr "後ろに倒れ込み、片足だけで体を支えている格好のまま固まっている、黒いガラスでできた像です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A black glass figure of someone clutching at their neck.  A delicate spray "
"of connected glass droplets emerges between their fingers."
msgstr "誰かに首を掴まれているような姿勢の、黒いガラスでできた像です。指の間で、繊細なガラスの筋がまるで液体のように拡散しています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass figure of someone doubled over in laughter."
msgstr "身体をくの字に曲げて笑っている姿の、黒いガラスでできた像です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A black glass figure of someone in a fighting stance, their face twisted "
"with howls of rage and anger.  They're gripping some sort of weapon that "
"isn't there."
msgstr "怒りと激情に顔を歪ませて叫び戦闘態勢をとる、黒いガラスでできた像です。武器を構えているかのように虚空を握っています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A black glass figure of someone in a firing posture.  Their jagged fingers "
"are frozen squeezing a trigger that isn't there."
msgstr "発砲しているようなポーズの、黒いガラスでできた像です。尖った指は、そこにない引き金を握ろうとする形のまま固まっています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A black glass figure of someone kneeling in prayer."
msgstr "跪いて祈るポーズをしている、黒いガラスでできた像です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A black glass figure of someone leaning into the space to their right, their"
" fingers bent as if interlaced with someone else's."
msgstr "右側に身を乗り出し、指は何かを握るように曲げているポーズの、黒いガラスでできた像です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A black glass figure.  Their features are too jagged to make out clearly, "
"but they remind you of someone you knew."
msgstr "黒いガラスでできた像です。表面がギザギザしており細かい特徴は分かりませんが、知り合いに似ているような気がします。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass refrigerator"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A black glass refrigerator, its door hanging open.  Inside is a seamless "
"surface with protrusions resembling fresh fruit and plastic bottles."
msgstr "扉が開け放たれたままの、黒いガラスでできた冷蔵庫です。内部の表面は滑らかで、新鮮な果物やペットボトルのように見える膨らみが並んでいます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass bed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A black glass sculpture of a bed.  The rumpled covers are jagged, and "
"splinter at the touch."
msgstr "黒いガラスでできたベッドです。皺だらけのカバーもギザギザのガラスで作られており、触ると割れてしまいます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass box"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A box of thin black glass.  Its edges are glisteningly sharp."
msgstr "薄く黒いガラスでできた箱です。角が鋭く尖っています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "ring of black stones"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A circle of smooth glass pebbles.  Inside are frozen tendrils of fire, "
"slightly translucent.  It seems colder as you approach."
msgstr ""
"滑らかなガラスのような小石が環状に並んでいます。内側では、凍り付いた火のような半透明のオブジェが蔦のように立ち昇っています。近寄ると寒さを感じるような気がします。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass water heater"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A cylinder of thick black glass.  The top has burst apart, and rivulets of "
"black sand run down the side."
msgstr "黒いガラスでできた分厚い円筒容器です。上部が割れて、側面から黒い砂が小川のように流れ落ちています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass flower"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A delicate little thing; a wispy stem slightly bowed under the weight of "
"translucent petals.  The tiny barbs that line it are almost impossible to "
"see, until it crumbles in your fingers."
msgstr ""
"繊細で小さな植物です。細い茎は半透明の花弁の重みによってわずかにたわんでいます。小さな棘が並んでいますが、その存在に気付く前に手の中で粉々になってしまいます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass fireplace"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A fireplace of pitted glass bricks.  The fire inside has been frozen in "
"glass at the moment it began to leap beyond the grate."
msgstr "ガラスでできた、内部が空洞になっている暖炉です。燃えていた火が火格子を飛び出そうとした瞬間に、凍り付いてガラスになってしまったようです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass sink"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A glass basin and tap.  The inside stops halfway down in sheet of concentric"
" ripples, with the tiny spire of a splashing droplet at the center "
msgstr "ガラスでできた洗面台と蛇口です。洗面台の表面には同心円状の波紋ができており、中央には飛び散る水滴を象ったガラスの尖塔がそびえています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass desk"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A glass desk.  There are a handful of shapes atop it that suggest pens, "
"paper, and miscellaneous knickknacks that are too jagged to identify."
msgstr "ガラスでできた机です。机上にはペンや紙、小物類と思しき形状の膨らみがありますが、ギザギザしており識別し辛い状態です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass dishwasher"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A glass dishwasher, its door hanging open.  Inside, glass plates and "
"utensils are half buried in black sand."
msgstr "ガラスでできた、蓋が開いたままの食器洗浄機です。内部では、ガラスの皿や器が黒い砂に埋もれています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass birdbath"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A glass pedestal and bowl.  Inside, frozen in the midst of washing itself in"
" the black sand, is the delicate figure of a bird."
msgstr "ガラスでできた台座の上にボウルが乗っています。ボウルの中では小さなガラスの鳥が、黒い砂で体を洗う姿勢のまま固まっています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass oven"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A glass sculpture of a gas oven.  Bristling from the burner is a crown of "
"jagged shards in the rough shape of an uncontrolled fire."
msgstr "ガラスでできたガスオーブンです。バーナーの部分からは、荒々しい炎を象ったギザギザの冠が立ち上っています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass mailbox"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A glass sculpture of a mailbox.  The door is open; inside is a pile of "
"envelopes, all razor-edged."
msgstr "ガラスでできた郵便受けです。扉は開いており、中に溜まった封筒の山はカミソリ刃のように尖っています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass display rack"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A glass sculpture of a shelving unit.  The angled shelves are covered in "
"jagged miscellany, most of which is firmly fused in place."
msgstr "ガラスでできた棚です。歪んだ棚板の上には雑多な物が並んでいますが、そのほとんどは置かれた位置にしっかりと接着されています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass washer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A glass washing machine.  The inside is completely filled with black sand, "
"some of which has spilled onto the floor."
msgstr "ガラスでできた洗濯機です。内部は黒い砂で満たされており、一部は漏れて床に零れ落ちています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass bookcase"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A heavy bookshelf, laden with books fused into the shelves and each other.  "
"You can make out titles on the spines, but the alphabet they're written in "
"is unfamiliar."
msgstr "重厚な本棚には本が詰め込まれており、棚と本との境界は癒着しています。背表紙に何かタイトルが書いてあるようですが、文字までは読み取れません。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass sofa"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A long bench, padded with cold glass cushions."
msgstr "冷たいガラスのクッションが詰まった、横に長い椅子です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass bench"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A long, low slab of black glass.  You can't tell if the fissures here and "
"there on the surface are natural cracks, or carved names."
msgstr "黒いガラスでできた、背が低く長いベンチです。表面のあちこちに亀裂がありますが、自然にできたのか、誰かが彫った痕なのか分かりません。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass dryer"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A mechanical dryer of black glass.  The door hangs open, and inside, you can"
" see a jumble of what might once have been clothes, now smashed to pieces."
msgstr "黒いガラスでできた電動乾燥機です。蓋は開いたままになっており、中にはかつて衣服だったであろう物体が粉々に砕けて散乱しています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass garden"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A planter of dark glass.  Sharp, twisting glass sprouts emerge from the "
"black soil within."
msgstr "黒っぽいガラスでできたプランターです。内部の黒い土から、捻じれて尖ったガラスの芽が顔を出しています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass chair"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A simple glass chair.  The seat is very thin, and crunches ominously under "
"any weight."
msgstr "シンプルなガラス製の椅子です。座面は非常に薄く、少しでも体重をかけると、ミシミシと嫌な音を発します。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass table"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A slab of smooth black glass on four stout legs.  In a few places, there is "
"shallowly rounded mass, like liquid spilled on the surface."
msgstr "4本の頑丈な脚の上に、滑らかな黒いガラス板が乗っています。表面に数か所、何か液体をこぼしたような薄く丸い痕が残っています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "incomplete plush doll"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "A soft plush torso, empty of features, is lying on this sofa."
msgstr "柔らかいぬいぐるみの胴体だけがソファに横たわっています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass locker"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A tall glass cabinet.  Whatever was inside will stay that way; the door is "
"seamless with the frame."
msgstr "ガラスでできた背の高い衣装棚です。中にあった荷物もそのまま残っていますが、扉と骨組みは癒着して一体になっています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass lantern"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A tall glass pole with a translucent shade atop it.  You know it could not "
"possibly turn on, but in the corner of your eye, you think you might see a "
"soft glow."
msgstr "上部に半透明のランプシェードが付いた、ガラスでできた背の高いポールです。点灯する筈もありませんが、柔らかな光を放っているような気がします。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass counter"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A thick cube of black glass.  On the surface, fused in place, are statues of"
" utensils and miscellany."
msgstr "黒いガラスでできた分厚い立方体です。表面には道具や雑貨と思しき膨らみが溶けて固定されています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass toilet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A toilet made of black glass.  The lid, perhaps mercifully, is fused shut."
msgstr "黒いガラスでできたトイレです。幸いなことに、蓋は完全に閉じています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass bathtub"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"A tub made from black glass, with a frozen column of onyx pouring from the "
"tap."
msgstr "黒いガラスでできた浴槽です。蛇口からは、凍った水のようにオニキス色の柱が流れ出しています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass armchair"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"An armchair that was presumably once very plush and comfortable.  Now the "
"overstuffed cushions are hard, cold, and slippery."
msgstr "普通の素材であれば非常に豪華で快適だったであろう肘掛け椅子です。これはクッションが硬く、冷たく、滑らかすぎます。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass shower"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"From the head of this shower descend a dozen streams of thin black glass, "
"with frozen droplets strung from them like pearls."
msgstr "シャワーヘッドからは黒い半透明のガラスの筋が数十本垂れ下がっており、その下には凍り付き固まった水滴が真珠のように連なっています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass figure"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid ""
"Most of a black glass human figure.  The face and much of the head is "
"missing, as if scooped out, and the inner surface is perfectly smooth."
msgstr "黒いガラスでできた、人間のように見える像です。頭部の大部分は抉られたように欠落しており、表面は滑らかです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "black glass bookcase"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "This bookcase is missing a book."
msgstr "この本棚は1冊だけ本が足りません。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "black glass armchair"
msgstr "黒ガラスの肘掛け椅子"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "black glass bathtub"
msgstr "黒ガラスの浴槽"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "black glass bed"
msgstr "黒ガラスのベッド"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "black glass bench"
msgstr "黒ガラスのベンチ"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "black glass birdbath"
msgstr "黒ガラスのバードバス"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "black glass bookcase"
msgstr "黒ガラスの本棚"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "black glass box"
msgstr "黒ガラスの箱"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "black glass chair"
msgstr "黒ガラスの肘掛け椅子"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
msgid "black glass counter"
msgstr "黒ガラスのカウンター"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/furniture_vitrified.json
