#. ~ Description of furniture "trailer sofa"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid ""
"A folding trailer sofa with a durable, somewhat comfortable weave of coarse "
"red fabric."
msgstr "キャンピングトレーラーに備わっている、耐久性がありそれなりに快適な、目の粗い赤い生地で作られた折り畳み式ソファです。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "trailer bathroom door"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid ""
"A gray textured door, rimmed in chrome, like a very tacky version of a "
"ship's hatch."
msgstr "金属で縁取られた灰色の扉です。船のハッチを非常に安っぽく再現したようなデザインです。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "brown laminate floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid ""
"A section of flooring made out of a tough, smooth material, colored in an "
"atrocious mottled brown."
msgstr "丈夫で滑らかな素材で作られた、濃淡が入り混じった茶色の床です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bullet trailer interior wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid ""
"A simple wall panelled in a coarsely textured grey laminate of some sort."
msgstr "粗い質感の灰色の集成パネルが張られたシンプルな壁です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "trailer bed"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid "A small but comfy-looking double bed."
msgstr "狭いながらも快適なダブルベッドです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "f_bullettrailer_table_top"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid "A small trailer table, designed to convert into a bed when not in use."
msgstr "使わないときはベッドになる、キャンピングトレーラーに備わっている小さなテーブルです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "mini desk"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid "A small wooden desk with a little attached bookshelf."
msgstr "小さな本棚と一体となった木製の小さなデスクです。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bullet trailer roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid "A smooth roof of gleaming chrome, slightly dusty from the road."
msgstr "道路を走り回っていたためか少しくすんでいる、滑らかでメタリックな壁です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bullet trailer exterior wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid "A smooth wall of gleaming chrome, slightly dusty from the road."
msgstr "道路を走り回っていたためか少しくすんでいる、滑らかでメタリックな壁です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "plywood sign for 'Dana's Bakery'"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid "A spraypainted plywood sign reads 'Dana's Bakery' in red letters."
msgstr "赤いスプレー塗料によって「Dana's Bakery」と書かれています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "trailer sink"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid "A tiny metal sink and connected cabinet."
msgstr "棚と一体となった金属製の小さな流し台です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "travel toilet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid ""
"A tiny plastic toilet for use in a travel trailer.  Unlike a normal toilet, "
"it doesn't store water locally for you to siphon out."
msgstr "キャンピングトレーラーに備わっている、プラスチック製の小さなトイレです。通常のトイレと異なり、洗浄水を貯めておくタンクはありません。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "trailer cabinets"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/special_use/bullet_trailer.json
msgid ""
"Cramped trailer cabinets, with some inbuilt appliances taking up even more "
"of the limited space."
msgstr "ただでさえ狭いトレーラー内の棚に電化製品が詰め込まれています。"

