#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A bare and cold concrete floor that can support a roof, could still insulate"
" from the outdoors but roof collapse is possible if supporting walls are "
"broken down."
msgstr ""
"屋根と同じ素材で作られた、剥き出しの冷たいコンクリート床です。断熱効果がありますが、支えている壁が破壊されると屋根が崩壊する可能性があります。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor, overhead light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A bare and cold concrete floor with a still-functioning light attached to "
"the ceiling above."
msgstr "剥き出しの冷たいコンクリート床です。天井に取り付けられた照明は、今も機能しています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A bare and cold concrete floor with a streak of red paint, could still "
"insulate from the outdoors but roof collapse is possible if supporting walls"
" are broken down."
msgstr ""
"屋根と同じ素材で作られた、赤いペンキで塗ってある剥き出しの冷たいコンクリート床です。断熱効果がありますが、支えている壁が破壊されると屋根が崩壊する可能性があります。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A bare and cold concrete floor with a streak of yellow paint and a still-"
"functioning light attached to the ceiling above, could still insulate from "
"the outdoors but roof collapse is possible if supporting walls are broken "
"down."
msgstr ""
"黄色いペンキで塗ってある剥き出しの冷たいコンクリート床です。天井に取り付けられた照明は、今も機能しています。断熱効果がありますが、支えている壁が破壊されると屋根が崩壊する可能性があります。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A bare and cold concrete floor with a streak of yellow paint, could still "
"insulate from the outdoors but roof collapse is possible if supporting walls"
" are broken down."
msgstr ""
"屋根と同じ素材で作られた、黄色いペンキで塗ってある剥き出しの冷たいコンクリート床です。断熱効果がありますが、支えている壁が破壊されると屋根が崩壊する可能性があります。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "simple metal floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A crudely welded-together metal floor with steel trusses and supporting "
"girders.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "鋼鉄製のトラス構造と梁に支えられている、粗く溶接された金属製の床です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "radiation platform"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A dual-purpose platform that exposes items placed on it to a radioactive "
"source by temporarily hoisting the radioactive material stored within, while"
" also safely containing all objects to avoid contaminating its surroundings."
"  Operated from an external console."
msgstr ""
"周囲が被曝しないように安全な状態で吊り下げられた照射装置が、台の上に置いた物品に一定時間放射線を照射します。操作は外部コンソールから行います。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dirt floor, overhead light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A floor consisting of finely mixed earth that has been tamped down, with a "
"still-functioning light attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr "目の細かい土を押し固めて作った床です。天井に取り付けられた照明は、今も機能しています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dirt floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A floor consisting of finely mixed earth that has been tamped down.  It can "
"support a roof."
msgstr "目の細かい土を押し固めて作った床です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "paper floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A floor made of ambiguous pulpy matter, covered in sticky wasp saliva."
msgstr "粘着性のあるスズメバチの唾液で覆われた、パルプ質の床です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "paper floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A floor made of ambiguous pulpy matter, covered in sticky wasp saliva.  It "
"has, or at least had, a roof of similar a material."
msgstr "粘着性のあるスズメバチの唾液で覆われた、パルプ質の床です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wax floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A floor section made entirely out of wax."
msgstr "床全体が蝋でできています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "hard paper floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A hardened cardboard floor made of chewed-up trees and resin mixed with wasp"
" saliva.  It has, or at least had, a roof of a similar material."
msgstr "噛み砕かれた木とスズメバチの唾液が混ざって硬化した、パルプ質の硬い床です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "sand"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid ""
"A large area of fine sand that could be useful in a number of ways, if it "
"was extracted properly."
msgstr "上手く掘り出せば色々なことに役立ちそうな細かい砂からなる地面です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "clay"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid ""
"A large area of malleable clay, suitable for kiln firing if it was extracted"
" properly."
msgstr "柔らかい粘土が広範囲にまとまっている場所です。粘土を上手く掘り出せば窯で陶製品を作れそうです。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "mound of clay"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "A mound of clay soil."
msgstr "粘土質の土の山です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rebar roof cage"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A network of architecturally sound rebar in order to support a floor and "
"roof support, looks like it's missing the poured concrete."
msgstr "床と屋根を支えるための構造的な鉄筋網です。注ぎ込むコンクリートが不十分です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "moss"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-flora.json
msgid "A patch of moist, spongy moss."
msgstr "湿った柔らかい苔が生えています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "brick floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A relatively flat area made of tightly placed bricks.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "レンガが敷き詰められた比較的平らな床です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rock floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A relatively flat area of rock and stone.  Looks stable enough to be mined "
"with the proper mining gear.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "比較的平坦な岩石の床です。安定しており、適切な道具があれば掘削できそうです。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "warped stone floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A rough stone floor.  Its patterns constantly shift as if your mind can't "
"quite understand what it's really seeing.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "きめの粗い石の床です。模様が常に変化しており、見つめていると自分の視覚が信用できなくなります。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "linoleum tile"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A section of flooring made out of a tough, gray, rubbery material.  Can "
"support a roof."
msgstr "ゴムのような丈夫な素材で作られた、灰色の床です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "linoleum tile"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A section of flooring made out of a tough, rubbery material.  Colored a "
"simple white.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "ゴムのような丈夫な素材で作られた、シンプルな白色の床です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "small rebar roof cage"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A series of structural supports crafted from rebar in order to allow the "
"pouring of concrete for a more stable floor and roof support."
msgstr "コンクリートを注いでより安定した床と屋根を作る準備が整った、鉄筋製の構造支持材です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "junk metal floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A simple roof of rusty scrap metal bolted and wire-tied to a makeshift "
"frame.  Very fashionable in post-apocalyptic shantytowns.  Hope you like the"
" sound of rain on corrugated metal.  Can support a roof."
msgstr ""
"頑丈な骨組みにボルトとワイヤーで固定された廃金属製の壁です。ポストアポカリプス的なボロ家に良く似合う見た目をしています。トタン屋根に雨粒が当たる音が気にならないと良いのですが。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "marble floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A smooth and flat flooring made of marble tiles.  Beautiful and expensive.  "
"Can support a roof."
msgstr "大理石タイルでできた滑らかで平らな床です。見た目が美しく、高価そうです。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "thick slag"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A thick layer of slag piled up and cooled here, knee high to a grown man."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "jagged slag"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A thick, jagged layer of slag, cooled into spiky projections."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "thin slag"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A thin layer of slag coats the floor in rippling waves.  It has cooled "
"completely solid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "paper brood cap"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"A thin paper floor, protecting the pupating wasp larva until it's ready to "
"emerge."
msgstr "巣立つ準備ができるまでスズメバチの幼虫を保護している、パルプ製の薄い蓋です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "primitive floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "A timber floor and supports that can support a roof."
msgstr "木製の床と支柱が芝の屋根を支えています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "sidewalk"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"An area of common poured concrete, damaged by frost heaves and large cracks "
"due to lack of maintenance, covered by a canvas floor.  May support a roof."
msgstr "公共区画に敷かれたコンクリートは氷結によって損傷し、整備不足のために大きなひびが入っています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "open air"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "An area of open air."
msgstr "何もない空間です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "mud"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid "An area of wet, slick mud."
msgstr "濡れて光沢を放つ泥です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "reinforced concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"An extremely resilient floor made from carefully placed rebar and poured "
"concrete, capable of providing protection from the elements.  It can support"
" a roof, but that still requires supporting walls, otherwise it may very "
"well cave in."
msgstr "規則正しく並べた鉄筋にコンクリートを注入して作られた、風雨を防ぐ非常に頑丈な床です。揃いの屋根は壁の支えがなければ、当然崩落します。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "strong concrete floor, overhead light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"An extremely resilient floor made from carefully placed rebar and poured "
"concrete, with a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr "規則正しく並べた鉄筋にコンクリートを流し込んで作った、非常に強靭な床です。天井に取り付けられた照明は、今も機能しています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "utility light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"An industrial floodlight set up to illuminate the surroundings.  Smashing it"
" doesn't seem like it'd produce any worthwhile salvage."
msgstr "周囲を照らすために設置された工業用の投光照明です。破壊しても、苦労に見合うものは回収できそうにありません。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "half-built reinforced concrete floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"An unfinished construction of rebar and poured concrete; the floor hasn't "
"been smoothed and the roof support isn't quite filled in yet."
msgstr "鉄筋の隙間にコンクリートを注いだだけの、未完成の床です。表面は滑らかになっておらず、屋根にも塞がれていない部分が残っています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "Base carpet!"
msgstr "絨毯のベースです！"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "Base concrete carpet!"
msgstr "コンクリート床上の絨毯のベースです！"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "Base gray linoleum floor carpet!"
msgstr "灰色リノリウム床上の絨毯のベースです！"

#. ~ Description of terrain "carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "Base metal carpet!"
msgstr "金属床上の絨毯のベースです！"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "Base primitive floor carpet!"
msgstr "丸太床上の絨毯のベースです！"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "Base rock carpet!"
msgstr "石床上の絨毯のベースです！"

#. ~ Description of terrain "Carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "Base white linoleum floor carpet!"
msgstr "白色リノリウム床上の絨毯のベースです！"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "Carpet"
msgstr "絨毯"

#. ~ Description of terrain "industrial green carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Firm, low-pile, high-durability carpet in a green color on a concrete floor."
"  Can support a roof."
msgstr "剥き出しのコンクリート上に敷設するための、毛羽が少なく丈夫で衝撃に強い緑色の絨毯です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "industrial green carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Firm, low-pile, high-durability carpet in a green color on a reinforced "
"concrete floor.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "剥き出しのコンクリート上に敷設するための、毛羽が少なく丈夫で衝撃に強い緑色の絨毯です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "industrial purple carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Firm, low-pile, high-durability carpet in a purple color on a concrete "
"floor.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "剥き出しのコンクリート上に敷設するための、毛羽が少なく丈夫で衝撃に強い紫色の絨毯です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "industrial purple carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Firm, low-pile, high-durability carpet in a purple color on a reinforced "
"concrete floor.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "剥き出しのコンクリート上に敷設するための、毛羽が少なく丈夫で衝撃に強い紫色の絨毯です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "industrial red carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Firm, low-pile, high-durability carpet in a red color on a concrete floor.  "
"Can support a roof."
msgstr "剥き出しのコンクリート上に敷設するための、毛羽が少なく丈夫で衝撃に強い赤色の絨毯です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "industrial red carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Firm, low-pile, high-durability carpet in a red color on a reinforced "
"concrete floor.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "剥き出しのコンクリート上に敷設するための、毛羽が少なく丈夫で衝撃に強い赤色の絨毯です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "industrial yellow carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Firm, low-pile, high-durability carpet in a yellow color on a concrete "
"floor.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "剥き出しのコンクリート上に敷設するための、毛羽が少なく丈夫で衝撃に強い黄色の絨毯です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "industrial yellow carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Firm, low-pile, high-durability carpet in a yellow color on a reinforced "
"concrete floor.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "剥き出しのコンクリート上に敷設するための、毛羽が少なく丈夫で衝撃に強い黄色の絨毯です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bunker green carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Firm, low-pile, totally non-flammable carpet in a green color, with an "
"insulation layer beneath on a metal floor.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "断熱層を備えた、毛羽が少なく丈夫で衝撃に強い緑色の絨毯です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bunker carpet purple"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Firm, low-pile, totally non-flammable carpet in a purple color, with an "
"insulation layer beneath on a metal floor.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "断熱層を備えた、毛羽が少なく丈夫で衝撃に強い紫色の絨毯です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bunker red carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Firm, low-pile, totally non-flammable carpet in a red color, with an "
"insulation layer beneath on a metal floor.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "断熱層を備えた、毛羽が少なく丈夫で衝撃に強い赤色の絨毯です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bunker yellow carpet"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Firm, low-pile, totally non-flammable carpet in a yellow color, with an "
"insulation layer beneath on a metal floor.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "断熱層を備えた、毛羽が少なく丈夫で衝撃に強い黄色の絨毯です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "waxed floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Hardwood flooring that has been treated with chemicals to improve slip "
"resistance and sliding, commonly for recreational sports.  It can support a "
"roof."
msgstr "表面に転倒を防止し滑らかさを改善する化学物質が塗られた、主にレクリエーションスポーツ用途で使われる硬材製フローリングです。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal floor, with overhead light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"High-quality and tough checkered metal flooring to reduce the risk of slips "
"and falls, with a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr "スリップや転倒のリスクを軽減する、高品質で強靭な金属でできた格子模様のフローリングです。天井に取り付けられた照明は、今も機能しています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"High-quality and tough checkered metal flooring to reduce the risk of slips "
"and falls.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "スリップや転倒のリスクを軽減する、高品質で強靭な金属でできた格子模様のフローリングと揃いの屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden floor, overhead light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Interlocking wooden tiles that are more than likely treated against fire, "
"with a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling above."
msgstr "防火性能が高そうな木製タイルを組み合わせた床です。天井に取り付けられた照明は、今も機能しています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Interlocking wooden tiles that are more than likely treated against fire, "
"with wooden posts and beams that can support a roof."
msgstr "防火性能が高そうな木製タイルを組み合わせた床と、木製の柱と梁に支えられた揃いの天井です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dirt"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"It's dirt.  Looks like some fine soil for tillage.  Could also be dug out "
"for construction projects.  Can support a roof."
msgstr "土です。耕作に適した土壌のようです。掘り返して建設準備を行うことも可能です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gray linoleum floor, overhead light"
#. ~ Description of terrain "white linoleum floor, overhead light"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid ""
"Linoleum flooring with a still-functioning light attached to the ceiling "
"above."
msgstr "リノリウムの床です。天井に取り付けられた照明は、今も機能しています。"

#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "small rebar roof cage"
#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "rebar roof cage"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-indoor.json
msgid "SCRRRASH!"
msgstr "ガシャーン！"

