#. ~ Description of terrain "surf"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid "A broad area of fine sand, washed by waves coming in from the sea."
msgstr "海から押し寄せる波に洗われている、細かい砂が広がる地形です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pool water"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
msgid ""
"A deep pool full of water, stagnant now that nobody's around to tend to it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "recess"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-liquids.json
