#. ~ Description of terrain "concrete roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat section of concrete rooftop."
msgstr "コンクリート製の平坦な屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "treated wooden roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat section of flame-resistant wooden rooftop."
msgstr "難燃性の木で作られた平坦な屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "shingle flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat section of rooftop covered with shingles."
msgstr "屋根板で覆われた平坦な屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "wooden roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat section of wooden rooftop."
msgstr "木製の平坦な屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid ""
"A flat surface made of ambiguous pulpy matter, covered in sticky wasp "
"saliva."
msgstr "粘着性のあるスズメバチの唾液で覆われた、パルプ質の平坦な屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid ""
"A flat surface made of hardened, ambiguous pulpy matter, covered in sticky "
"wasp saliva."
msgstr "粘着性のあるスズメバチの唾液で覆われた、硬いパルプ質の平坦な屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "tar paper flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat, gray section of rooftop covered with tar paper."
msgstr "タール紙で覆われた、灰色の平坦な屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A flat, gray section of rooftop."
msgstr "灰色の平坦な屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "skylight"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid ""
"A giant sheet of glass inserted into the roof to let light pass through."
msgstr "屋根の一部に大きなガラス板がはめ込まれ、光を通しています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A high-quality and sturdy section of metallic rooftop."
msgstr "高品質で頑丈な金属で作られた屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "downspout"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid ""
"A length of gutter running from the roof to the ground, you could place a "
"container underneath it to collect rainwater.  It might be possible to climb"
" up here, but it's too flimsy to support an adult."
msgstr "屋根から地面に向かって水を流す、縦に伸びた脆弱そうな溝です。下に容器を置けば水を溜められそうです。ここを伝って上に登れそうです。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "brick roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of brick rooftop."
msgstr "レンガでできた屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "canvas roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of canvas rooftop."
msgstr "帆布でできた屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rock roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of flat natural rock."
msgstr "平坦な天然の岩盤です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "metal flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of flat, sheet metal rooftop."
msgstr "板金製の平坦な屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "warped roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid ""
"A section of flat, stone-like rooftop.  It is patterned with grooves and "
"lines that constantly shift."
msgstr "石のような素材でできた平坦な屋根です。溝や模様が常に変化し続けています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "tile flat roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of flat, tiled rooftop."
msgstr "タイルで覆われた平坦な屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "thatched roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of roof made out of straw."
msgstr "藁で作られた屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "sod roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A section of rooftop made out of sod."
msgstr "芝で作られた屋根です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "gutter drop"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid ""
"A spot in the gutter where the water flows into a downspout.  It might be "
"possible to climb down here, but it's too flimsy to support an adult."
msgstr "屋根から地面に向かって水を流す、縦に伸びた脆弱そうな溝です。ここを伝って下に降りられそうです。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "red metal roof"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy section of metallic rooftop, painted red for visibility and weather"
" resistance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "skylight frame"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "A wooden skylight frame."
msgstr "天窓用の木製フレームです。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "rain gutter"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "Channels water from the roof towards the ground, it looks flimsy."
msgstr "屋根から地面に向かって水を流す、脆弱そうな溝です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "dead treetop"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid ""
"The bare upper branches of a dead tree.  There's just enough room to perch "
"here."
msgstr "葉が完全に落ちた枯れ木の先端部です。座れる程度のスペースがあります。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "giant fern top"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid ""
"The top of a willow tree.  There is enough room to perch up here, but only "
"just."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of terrain "giant fern top"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid ""
"The top of some unearthly gigantic fern.  There is enough room to perch up "
"here, but only just."
msgstr "気味の悪い巨大なシダ植物の先端部です。非常に狭いですが、座れる程度のスペースはあります。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "treetop"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-roofs.json
msgid "The upper branches of a tree.  There's just enough room to perch here."
msgstr "樹木の先端部です。座れる程度のスペースがあります。"

