#. ~ Description of terrain "broken wattle-and-daub wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-walls.json
msgid ""
"A wattle-and-daub wall section that has been destroyed, leaving mostly just "
"the frame, and even that is barely held together."
msgstr "荒打漆喰の壁が破壊され、ほとんど枠だけが残った状態でかろうじて立っています。"

