#. ~ Description of terrain "monster teeth"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"A fractal array of uncountable, bristling teeth that seem impossibly sharp, "
"even at a conceptual level.  An iridescent haze surrounds it, as if light "
"itself cannot help but be separated in their presence.  You surmise you "
"could extract some for your own use, if you had an appropriate tool to "
"remove them from the wall they're imbedded in."
msgstr ""
"限界まで尖りきった歯が無数に生え、数えきれないほどのフラクタル模様を形作っています。歯の隙間は虹色に輝いており、まるで光すら反射の限界を超えて分離してしまったように見えます。適切な道具を使えば、壁に埋め込まれた歯を引き抜いて何かに使えるかもしれません。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "monster hemolymph"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"A shallow stream of glowing yellow ichor streaks through the beast.  Peering"
" into it, you can see dark shadows moving under the surface."
msgstr "モンスターの体内で、黄色く光る分泌液が浅い川を形作っています。液を覗き込むと、中で暗い影が動いています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flesh wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"A thick wall of fleshy cartilage.  With the proper tools, you could smash "
"right through it."
msgstr "軟骨組織でできた厚い壁です。適切な道具を使えば破壊できます。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "cartilage"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "A thin, transparent cartilage webbing."
msgstr "薄く透明な網目状の軟骨が張り付いています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bone wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"An amazingly durable, impregnable wall of bone stands before you, forming "
"the outer shell of the eldritch monster."
msgstr "この世のものとは思えないモンスターの外殻を形成している、驚異的な耐久性を誇る骨の壁です。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "bone floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"An impossibly hard, impregnable bone structure covers the internals of the "
"beast."
msgstr "モンスターの肉体は、信じられないほど硬い骨格に覆われています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "nether brain"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "An oozing pile of wrinkled, decomposing flesh."
msgstr "腐敗した皺だらけの肉塊の山です。"

#. ~ Bashing sound of terrain "cartilage"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "Riiiiip!"
msgstr "ブチッ！"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flesh wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"This section of flesh seems hollowed out.  You can see silky, translucent "
"larvae wriggling inside, consuming flesh at a prodigious pace."
msgstr "この肉の内部は空洞になっているようです。中で艶のある半透明の幼虫が蠢き、猛スピードで肉を食らっています。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flesh floor"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"Walking over the innards of this monstrous beast, you can still feel "
"movement underneath your feet."
msgstr "モンスターの内臓の上を歩いていると、今も足元が動いているように思えます。"

#. ~ Description of terrain "flesh wall"
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid ""
"Warm to the touch, the tainted flesh of this monstrous being still twitches."
msgstr "モンスターの腐った肉に触れると温かさを感じ、わずかに痙攣しているような気がします。"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "bone floor"
msgstr "怪物の骨の床"

#. ~ Terrain name
#: data/json/furniture_and_terrain/terrain_nether_monster.json
msgid "bone wall"
msgstr "怪物の骨の壁"

