#. ~ Description of ".38 Special FMJ"
#: data/json/items/ammo/38.json
msgid ""
".38 Special ammunition with a 130gr FMJ bullet.  From its inception, the .38"
" Special round has been known for its accuracy and low recoil.  Because it "
"was initially a black powder cartridge, .38 Special is very low pressure."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約8.42gの.38口径スペシャル・フルメタルジャケット弾です。誕生以来、精度の高さと反動の弱さで知られています。当初は黒色火薬弾であったため、非常に圧力が低い点が特徴です。"

#. ~ Description of ".38 Special JHP"
#: data/json/items/ammo/38.json
msgid ""
"Jacketed .38 Special ammunition with a 130gr hollowpoint bullet.  From its "
"inception, the .38 Special round has been known for its accuracy and low "
"recoil.  Because it was initially a black powder cartridge, .38 Special is "
"very low pressure."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約8.42gの.38口径スペシャル・ジャケッテッドホローポイント弾です。誕生以来、精度の高さと反動の弱さで知られています。当初は黒色火薬弾であったため、非常に圧力が低い点が特徴です。"

#. ~ Description of ".38 Special +P"
#: data/json/items/ammo/38.json
msgid ""
"Overpressure .38 Special ammunition with a jacketed 135gr hollowpoint "
"bullet.  The round's increased velocity results in superior penetration and "
"stopping power at the cost of higher recoil."
msgstr ""
"弾頭重量約8.75gの.38口径スペシャル・ジャケッテッドホローポイント強装弾です。弾速が速くなった分反動も大きくなりますが、優れた貫通力と精度を実現しています。"

