#. ~ Description of "shotgun beanbag"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A beanbag round for shotguns.  Designated 'less-lethal' and intended to "
"disable, but remember that 'less-lethal' does not mean 'non-lethal'."
msgstr ""
"ショットガン用のビーンバッグ弾です。標的の無力化を目的とした「低致死性」弾薬ですが、決して「非致死性」ではないことに留意する必要があります。"

#. ~ Description of "shotgun slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A heavy metal slug used to give a shotgun the range capabilities of a rifle."
"  Extremely damaging but rather inaccurate."
msgstr "ライフルの射程距離をショットガンで実現するための、重金属スラッグ弾です。威力は絶大ですが、精度はかなり不正確です。"

#. ~ Description of "birdshot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A mass of lightweight pellets packed into a double ought shell.  While still"
" lethal at point blank, the cartridge is intended for hunting birds, trading"
" damage for an increased chance of scoring a hit on the wing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wax slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A round of 12 gauge birdshot that has had the crimp opened and wax poured "
"in.  This binds the pellets together, allowing them to stay wadded together "
"in flight and behave more like a slug, though without quite the same "
"ballistic performance."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "00 shot"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shell filled with metal pellets.  Extremely damaging, plus the spread "
"makes it very accurate at short range.  Favored by SWAT forces."
msgstr "金属製の小球が詰まった弾薬です。殺傷能力が高く、広範囲に拡散するため近距離で命中しやすい特徴があります。SWATが愛用しています。"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, reloaded"
#. ~ Description of "00 shot, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shell filled with metal pellets.  Extremely damaging, plus the spread "
"makes it very accurate at short range.  SWAT forces wouldn't use this "
"homebrew shell, but a sovereign citizen looking to fend off SWAT probably "
"would."
msgstr ""
"金属製の小球が詰まった弾薬です。殺傷能力が高く、広範囲に拡散するため近距離で命中しやすい特徴があります。SWATは手詰め弾を使いませんが、SWATを撃退したい民間人は使うかもしれません。"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, black powder, scrap loaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with black gunpowder and whatever scrap metal was "
"lying around.  The logical conclusion of ammunition bootlegging.  It'll kill"
" zombies just fine, but your gun will suffer for it."
msgstr ""
"どこにでもある金属片と黒色火薬を詰め込んだ、弾薬自作の論理性を突き詰めた12ga弾です。ゾンビを殺すならこれで十分ですが、銃への負荷も大きくなります。"

#. ~ Description of "dragon's breath shell"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a "
"distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, high-"
"temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel, igniting everything "
"in their path."
msgstr ""
"主に遭難時の信号弾や娯楽用に使われる、マグネシウムのペレットや破片が詰まったショットガン用の弾薬です。発射と共に砲身から高温の火花と炎が飛び出し、弾道に沿って炎が発生します。"

#. ~ Description of "dragon's breath shell, reloaded"
#. ~ Description of "dragon's breath shell, black powder"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with magnesium pellets or shards, used mostly as a "
"distress flare or pyrotechnics tool.  When the round is fired, high-"
"temperature sparks and flames shoot out of the barrel, igniting everything "
"in their path.  This one was made in somebody's garage.  Are you sure you "
"want to shoot this?"
msgstr ""
"主に遭難時の信号弾や娯楽用に使われる、マグネシウムのペレットや破片が詰まったショットガン用の弾薬です。発射と共に砲身から高温の火花と炎が飛び出し、弾道に沿って炎が発生します。誰かが手作りしたもののようですが、本当に発射しても大丈夫なのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Description of "flechette shell"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with tiny steel darts.  The spread makes it very "
"accurate at short range, but the ballistic performance of the unstabilized "
"flechettes is poor, especially against armor."
msgstr "鋼鉄製の小さな矢が詰まっている、ショットガン用の弾薬です。発射後に拡散するため、近距離での命中精度が非常に高くなっています。"

#. ~ Description of "00 shot, scrap loaded"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell filled with whatever scrap metal was lying around.  More "
"damaging than birdshot, but fairly inaccurate."
msgstr "どこにでもある金属片を詰めただけの12ga弾です。小ペレット弾よりは威力がありますが、精度はかなり劣ります。"

#. ~ Description of "explosive slug"
#: data/json/items/ammo/shot.json
msgid ""
"A shotgun shell shooting a small explosive.  Banned in several states.  "
"While an explosive from a shotgun sounds impressive, its practical "
"applications are limited at best.  The loss in mass in order to accommodate "
"an explosive give it much less impact force compared to traditional "
"ammunition.  The relatively small size of the slug can only accommodate a "
"limited amount of explosives, resulting in a fairly underwhelming explosion."
"  These traits make it a utility tool for damaging barriers and disrupting "
"other explosive devices, rather than something for anti-personnel use."
msgstr ""
"小規模の爆発を引き起こす、ショットガン用の弾薬です。特定の州では使用が禁止されています。ショットガンで爆弾を発射できると聞くと魅力的に思えますが、実用性はそれほどでもありません。爆薬を搭載したことで全体の質量が減ったことで従来の弾薬より威力が大幅に低下しており、更に、通常より小さい単発弾には少量の爆薬しか入らないため、結果的に爆発力もあまり期待できません。これらの特徴から、対人戦よりも障壁の破壊や他の爆発物への引火を目的として使う方が実用的です。"

