#. ~ Description of "cut-resistant sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"A long, stretchy pair of Kevlar sleeves with thumbholes.  These were often "
"used by loggers and landscapers for protection from thorns and chainsaw "
"accidents."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "biosilicified chitin arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of arm guards crafted from the carefully cleaned and pruned "
"biosilicified exoskeletons of acidic ants.  Acid-resistant but brittle."
msgstr "バイオシリコン製の強酸アリの外骨格を丁寧に洗浄して組み上げたアームガードです。耐酸性に優れているものの、耐久性に不安があります。"

#. ~ Description of "chitin arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of arm guards made from the exoskeletons of insects.  Light and "
"durable."
msgstr "軽量で頑丈な、昆虫の外骨格から作られたアームガードです。"

#. ~ Description of "tire arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of arm guards made from thick chunks of tire secured by simple "
"strings; the loose collection of rubber plates provides decent but not the "
"most convenient protection."
msgstr ""
"厚いタイヤのゴムを紐で簡単に繋ぎ合わせて作ったアームガードです。緩く繋いで重ねたゴム板にはそれなりの防護性能がありますが、完璧な装甲とは言えません。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of bronze bracers with a simple leather lining."
msgstr "革で簡単に裏打ちされた青銅製のアームガードです。"

#. ~ Description of "elbow pads"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of elbow pads made of stout plastic and spandex."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "2-by-arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"A pair of improvised arm guards made from broken pieces of a plank that are "
"tied to your arms with rags and string.  They offer good protection, but are"
" really uncomfortable to wear."
msgstr "布と糸を使って腕にくくりつける、木製の即席アームガードです。防御力に優れていますが、着心地はまったく期待できません。"

#. ~ Description of "leather vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of light leather bracers, often used in archery."
msgstr "アーチェリー用に作られた革製の軽量アームガードです。"

#. ~ Description of "hard arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of neoprene arm sleeves covered with molded plastic sheaths."
msgstr "プラスチック樹脂で強化されたネオプレン製のアームスリーブです。"

#. ~ Description of "neoprene arm sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "A pair of soft neoprene arm sleeves.  Often used in contact sports."
msgstr "ネオプレン製の柔らかなアームスリーブです。接触を伴うスポーツでしばしば利用されます。"

#. ~ Description of "leather arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"A set of tough leather braces and poleyns that provide protection against "
"blades and teeth alike."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "paper vambraces"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Bracers made of stacked sheets of paper held together with duct tape."
msgstr "紙束をダクトテープで貼り合わせて作ったアームガードです。"

#. ~ Description of "plate pauldrons"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"Domed steel plates that strap down over the shoulders, offering solid "
"protection at the cost of mobility."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "riot bracers"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid "Hard forearm guards used by riot police."
msgstr "機動隊が着用するハードアームガードです。"

#. ~ Description of "tire bracers"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"Improvised forearm guards made of thick chunks of tire held together with "
"duct tape."
msgstr "厚いタイヤのゴムをダクトテープで貼り合わせて作ったアームガードです。"

#. ~ Description of "sheet metal bracers"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"Leather bracers with sheet metal affixed over them, perfect for a metal "
"concert at the end of the world."
msgstr ""

