#. ~ Description of "quilted sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"Medieval cloth armor for the arms consisting of a pair of quilted sleeves "
"stuffed with batting.  Adjustable ties along their length allow them to be "
"worn under or over other gear.  Activate to change thier fit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plate arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"Overlapping steel plates which strap to the upper and lower arms.  They "
"don't cover the shoulders."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"Protective sleeves made of interlocking links of low-quality steel wire.  "
"The fit can be adjusted to allow them to serve as outerwear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"Protective sleeves made of interlocking links of steel wire.  The fit can be"
" adjusted to allow them to serve as outerwear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "chainmail sleeves (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"Protective sleeves made of interlocking links of steel wire.  The fit can be"
" adjusted to fit closer to the body."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "leather pauldrons"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"Shoulder guards made of thick leather.  They're a little restrictive, but "
"provide important protection."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "carpet bracers"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"Small squares of carpet rolled around your lower arms.  The bare minimum to "
"hopefully stop a bite or two."
msgstr "前腕に巻き付ける、小さく切った絨毯です。噛みつき攻撃を防ぐ、最低限の防具です。"

#. ~ Description of "carpet arm guards"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"Small squares of carpet rolled around your upper and lower arms.  Armor of "
"the truly desperate or crafty."
msgstr "上腕から前腕にかけて巻き付ける、小さく切った絨毯です。身を守ろうと必死な人、あるいは芸術家気取りのための防具です。"

#. ~ Description of "cloth-padded sleeves"
#: data/json/items/armor/arms_armor.json
msgid ""
"The sleeves of a thick shirt, with a bunch of cloth sewn in to act as extra "
"padding."
msgstr "厚手の綿製長袖シャツから切り取った袖を、布で補強したものです。腕以外は覆えないため、かなり心細い着心地です。"

