"A leather belt.  Designed to look good and hold up a pair of pants, but you "
"should be able to attach a small tool or weapon to one of the belt loops."
msgstr "革製のベルトです。ズボンをきちんと履くときに役立ちます。小さな工具や武器を1つ挟んで収納できそうです。"

#. ~ Description of "suspenders"
#: data/json/items/armor/belts.json
