#. ~ Description of "overgrown iridescent carapace plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly carapace that looks like it was at one point shaped "
"like armor, but is now bulky and overgrown with sharp pieces jutting out "
"haphazardly.  Scarred into the outer surface you can barely make out the "
"label \"STRIKE FACE\".  It looks like you could force it into a ballistic "
"vest."
msgstr ""
"地球外の素材でできた厚い甲羅です。元は鎧のような形をしていましたが、更に巨大化し、鋭い棘が無造作に飛び出しています。外側にはかろうじて「STRIKE "
"FACE」の印字が確認できます。防弾ベストになんとか挿入できそうな形状をしています。"

#. ~ Description of "iridescent carapace plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly carapace that seems to have been forced into the "
"shape of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  Scarred into "
"the outer surface is the label \"STRIKE FACE\".  It looks like you could "
"force it into a ballistic vest."
msgstr ""
"地球外の厚い甲羅を無理やり防弾プレートの形にしたような、やや凹んだ形状の装甲板です。外側には「STRIKE "
"FACE」と表記されたラベルが付いています。防弾ベストになんとか挿入できそうな形状をしています。"

#. ~ Description of "undergrown iridescent carapace plate"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly carapace that seems to have been forced into the "
"shape of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  Scarred into "
"the outer surface is the label \"STRIKE FACE\".  The armor coverage is "
"spotty and it appears to be oozing and pulsing like it is in pain."
msgstr ""
"地球外の厚い甲羅を無理やり防弾プレートの形にしたような、やや凹んだ形状の装甲板です。外側には「STRIKE "
"FACE」と表記されたラベルが付いています。表面には斑点模様が浮き出ており、痛々しい粘液を垂らしながら脈打っています。"

#. ~ Description of "plate of scarred flesh"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A chunk of otherworldly flesh that seems to have been forced into the shape "
"of a ballistic plate with a slightly concave profile.  There is no armor "
"left on this plate, just a mass of writhing alien flesh oozing in pain.  "
"However, it looks like it is slowly growing back."
msgstr ""
"地球外の肉塊を無理やり防弾プレートの形にしたような、やや凹んだ形状の物体です。既に装甲が残っておらず、ただ痛みに悶え粘液を垂れ流す奇妙な肉の塊があるだけです。装甲は少しずつ再生しているようです。"

#. ~ Description of "resonating gorget"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty gorget or collar made from odd materials that hums slightly.  "
"It feels damp to the touch and there is a mechanical button of some kind on "
"the front.  The inside reads \"CAREFUL CHOKING HAZARD!  THIS WAY DOWN\"."
msgstr ""
"奇妙な素材で作られた重厚な喉当てです。わずかに音を立てており、表面を触ると湿っています。前面には何らかのボタンが付いており、内側には「窒息に注意！上限ライン」と書いてあります。"

#. ~ Description of "second skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"A slimy layer of liquid has completely engulfed your body from the neck down"
" and seems to move with you - the sensation is uncomfortable.  The liquid "
"appears bound to the resonating collar at your neck; the inside of the "
"collar reads \"CAREFUL CHOKING HAZARD!  THIS WAY DOWN\".  The ooze flows "
"freely, covering your entire body but never crossing the gorget to get to "
"your head."
msgstr ""
"首から下がぬるぬるした液体に包まれ、動きに完全にフィットする不快な感覚に襲われています。液体は首の部分にある装置から流れ出ており、装置と液体は連動しているようす。襟には「窒息に注意！上限ライン」と書いてあります。液体は全身の表面を自由に移動しますが、首の装置より上部に到達することはないようです。"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "resonating gorget"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "Activate the device"
msgstr "起動"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "second skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "Deactivate the device"
msgstr "停止"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "resonating gorget"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid ""
"Murky ooze begins to leak out of the gorget and engulf your body from the "
"neck down!"
msgstr "装置から濁った液体が漏れ出し、首から下を完全に包み込みました！"

#. ~ "msg" action message of item "second skin"
#: data/json/items/armor/exotic.json
msgid "The gorget hums and the liquid gets sucked back into it."
msgstr "装置が音を立てながら、全ての液体を吸い込みました。"

#. ~ Description of "feeding kit"
