#. ~ Description of "jeans"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A classic pair of denim pants."
msgstr "丈の短いデニム生地のズボンです。"

#. ~ Description of "fur loincloth"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A fur pelt tied into a loincloth.  Covers your modesty, but not much else."
msgstr "毛皮を結び合わせた腰巻きです。品位を守ってはくれますが、それだけです。これを身に付ければ、真の蛮族の戦士になれますよ。"

#. ~ Description of "fur pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A hefty pair of fur-lined pants."
msgstr "裏地に毛皮を用いた丈夫なズボンです。"

#. ~ Description of "basketball shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of athletic shorts.  Comfortable and light."
msgstr "軽量で履き心地に優れたバスケットボール用のハーフパンツです。"

#. ~ Description of "leather pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of black leather pants.  Very tough, but cumbersome and without much "
