msgstr "アルペンスキー用のズボンです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "striped pants" of item "pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of pants with black and white stripes."
msgstr "黒と白の横縞模様が入ったズボンです。"

#. ~ Description of "Santa pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of red pants with white faux fur trim, commonly used by bearded men "
"on Christmas.  Somewhat warm and has two deep pockets."
msgstr ""
"髭面の男がクリスマスによく着用している、白いフェイクファーで縁取られた赤いパンツです。暖かく、やや暖かく、深めのポケットが2つ付いています。"

#. ~ Description of "Santa shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of red shorts with white trim.  For when Santa is on summer vacation."
msgstr "白く縁どられた赤いハーフパンツです。夏休み中のサンタが着用しています。"

#. ~ Description of "shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of short pants that leave the lower legs exposed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cargo shorts"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of shorts lined with pockets, offering decent storage."
msgstr "複数のポケットが付いた丈の短いズボンです。ある程度の収納容積を備えています。"

#. ~ Description of "police breeches"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A pair of tight-fitting police breeches.  They offer plenty of mobility for "
"motorized officers."
msgstr "肌に密着する警官用ブリーチェスです。バイク警官のために、動きやすさを追求した作りになっています。"

#. ~ Description of "hot pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A pair of very short shorts."
msgstr "毛皮製のシンプルなショートパンツです。"

#. ~ Description of "grass skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A primitive skirt made from grass."
msgstr "青色のデニム生地のスカートです。"

#. ~ Description of "leather skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A short leather skirt."
msgstr "チアミニスカート"

#. ~ Description of "Boston-Chan skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A short skirt for the Boston-Chan costume."
msgstr "ボストンちゃんが着用する短いスカートです。"

#. ~ Description of "skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A short, breezy cotton skirt.  Easy to move in, but only has a single small "
"pocket."
msgstr "丈が短く風通しの良い綿製のスカートです。着心地がよく、小さなポケットが1つだけ付いています"

#. ~ Description of "denim skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A skirt made from denim."
msgstr "青色のデニム生地のスカートです。"

#. ~ Description of "army pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "A tough pair of camouflage pants, lined with pockets."
msgstr "軍隊で愛用されている、複数のポケットが付いた丈夫なズボンです。"

#. ~ Description of "army winter pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A tough pair of pants lined with pockets, thickly padded for warmth.  "
"Favored by the military."
msgstr "軍隊で愛用されている、複数のポケットが付いた丈夫なズボンです。保温のため、中に分厚い綿が詰まっています。"

#. ~ Description of "antarvasa"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A traditional, ankle-length Buddhist skirt.  The bottom protrudes, and "
"appears in the rough shape of a triangle."
msgstr "足首まで隠れる、仏教徒が身にまとう逆三角形のような形状の伝統的な腰布です。"

#. ~ Description of "hiking pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A water-resistant pair of lightweight, flexible hiking pants with a good "
"number of pockets."
msgstr "軽量で柔軟性が高くポケットも豊富な、防水性の高いハイキングパンツです。"

#. ~ Description of "breeches"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"A well-made pair of old-fashioned pants, made of stiff yet baggy material.  "
"Comfortable, but lacks pockets."
msgstr "ダブつかない丈夫な素材で作られた、古風なズボンです。履き心地は快適ですが、ポケットはありません。"

#. ~ Description of "long skirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "An ankle-length skirt."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "nanoskirt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "Apparently the microskirt wasn't short enough."
msgstr "どうやらマイクロスカートでは長すぎたようです。"

#. ~ Description of "wool loincloth"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Bits of wool stitched together and tied into a makeshift loincloth.  Covers "
"your modesty, but not much else."
msgstr "縫合した羊毛を結び合わせた即席の腰巻きです。品位を守ってはくれますが、それだけです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid "Boston-Chan skirt"
msgid_plural "Boston-Chan skirts"
msgstr[0] "ボストンちゃんスカート"

#. ~ Description of "tactical pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Coated in more pockets than is probably either necessary or healthy and "
"looking like they belong within a SWAT locker, these rugged combat pants "
"possess a water-repellent coating, tough double-stitched seams, reinforced "
"belt loops, and articulated knees."
msgstr ""
"余るほどのポケットを持つ、SWATのロッカーにありそうな頑丈な戦闘用のズボンです。撥水コーティングが施され、ダブルステッチのしっかりとした縫い目、補強されたベルト通しと立体構造で曲げやすい膝周りを備えています。"

#. ~ Description of "utility kilt"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
msgid ""
"Common among American nerds and rivetheads, the utility kilt is a durable "
"canvas kilt with a large front pocket."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "work pants"
#: data/json/items/armor/legs_clothes.json
