#. ~ Description of variant "screaming mask" of item "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A black hood with a white facemask molded to look like a screaming phantom."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bandana"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A cotton bandana, worn over the mouth for warmth and minor protection from "
"dust and other contaminants.  It can be adjusted to wear it on the head "
"instead."
msgstr "綿製のバンダナです。埃や汚染物質を多少防ぎ、口を暖めます。"

#. ~ Description of "cut-resistant balaclava"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A face covering that helps protect from slashes and cuts, in addition to the"
" cold."
msgstr "寒さだけでなく斬撃や切り傷からも顔を守ってくれる防具です。"

#. ~ Description of "white beard"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A fake white beard that straps over the mouth.  Perfect for your Santa "
"costume!"
msgstr "紐で口元に固定する白い付け髭です。これで完璧なサンタになれますね！"

#. ~ Description of "pumpkin mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A flimsy plastic pumpkin mask to wear over your head."
msgstr "薄っぺらいプラスチックでできたカボチャのマスクです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "zombie mask" of item "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A flimsy rubber zombie mask.  It can't compare to the real thing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A flimsy rubber zombie mask.  When zombies were still works of fiction."
msgstr "薄っぺらい革製のゾンビのマスクです。ゾンビがまだフィクションだった頃の産物です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "president mask" of item "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A full-head mask that looks like one of the former leaders of the USA, back "
"when that was a thing."
msgstr "フランケンシュタインの怪物の頭によく似た、頭部を覆うマスクです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Frankenstein's Monster mask" of item "zombie
#. mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A full-head mask that looks like the head of Frankenstein's monster."
msgstr "フランケンシュタインの怪物の頭によく似た、頭部を覆うマスクです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "green mask" of item "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A green skinned full-face mask.  Sssssmokin'!"
msgstr "映画『マスク』のものによく似た、緑色の肌のフルフェイスマスクです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "plague doctor mask" of item "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A mask that looks like a long white beak."
msgstr "ゲーム『ホットライン・マイアミ』で殺人鬼がつけるものによく似た、雄鶏のマスクです。"

#. ~ Description of "skull mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A plastic mask that covers the face."
msgstr "顔を覆うプラスチック製のマスクです。"

#. ~ Description of "hockey mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A protective face mask made of thick plastic.  Commonly worn by hockey "
"goalies."
msgstr "厚手のプラスチックで作られた顔面保護用のフェイスマスクです。ホッケーのキーパーがよく着用しています。"

#. ~ Description of "ballistic mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A protective reinforced Kevlar mask that covers the face.  Provides "
"excellent protection from ballistic threats."
msgstr "顔を保護する強化ケブラー製のマスクです。防弾性能に優れています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "chicken mask" of item "zombie mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A rubber chicken mask that looks like a killer in Miami would wear."
msgstr "ゲーム『ホットライン・マイアミ』で殺人鬼がつけるものによく似た、雄鶏のマスクです。"

#. ~ Description of "dust mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A simple piece of cotton that straps over the mouth.  Provides a small "
"amount of protection from airborne illness and dust."
msgstr "口を覆う綿製のシンプルなマスクです。埃や空気伝染病を多少防ぎます。"

#. ~ Description of "face veil"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A simple piece of fabric that covers your face."
msgstr "顔を覆うシンプルな綿製の布です。"

#. ~ Description of "skull balaclava"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A skull-print balaclava covering the head and face."
msgstr "頭と顔を覆う骸骨柄のバラクラバです。バイク乗りやコスプレイヤーがよく着用しています。"

#. ~ Description of "rioter mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A t-shirt with the sleeves tied behind the back of one's head.  These are "
"usually worn by rioters to hide their identity."
msgstr "Tシャツの袖を後頭部で縛ったものです。暴徒が身元を隠すために着用します。"

#. ~ Description of "bondage mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A tight mask made of black leather.  The eyes and mouth can be closed using "
"zippers."
msgstr "黒い革製のタイトマスクです。目と口のジッパーを閉じられます。"

#. ~ Description of "bondage mask (zipped)"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid ""
"A tight mask made of black leather.  The eyes and mouth have been zipped "
"closed."
msgstr "黒い革製のタイトマスクです。目元と口元のジッパーは閉まっています。"

#. ~ Description of "fencing mask"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A tough hood made of steel mesh used by fencers."
msgstr "鋼製のメッシュで作られた、丈夫なフルフェイスマスクです。"

#. ~ Description of "balaclava"
#: data/json/items/armor/masks.json
msgid "A warm covering that protects the head and face from the cold."
msgstr "顔と頭を覆う防寒具です。"

