msgstr "ストッキングと併せて着用する、装飾が付いた黒い下着です。肌を隠すには向きませんが、セクシーさを引き立ててくれます。"

#. ~ Description of "leather corset (loose)"
#: data/json/items/armor/undergarment.json
msgid ""
"A leather corset with the strings loosened.  Has no pockets, but its thick "
