msgstr "黒く大きな腐敗物質の塊です。"

#. ~ Description of "chitin dust"
#: data/json/items/biosignatures.json
msgid ""
"The dust left over by winged insects such as butterflies or moths.  It's "
"mostly chitin but may also contain dirt and other gross materials."
msgstr "チョウやガなどの翅をもつ昆虫の鱗粉です。成分のほとんどはキチン質ですが、土などの他の物質が混じっている場合もあります。"

