#. Programming"
#: data/json/items/book/computer.json
msgid ""
"This book describes the key features of popular computer languages with "
"features you can use to enhance your working environment and experience, as "
"well as your code."
msgstr "人気の高いコンピュータ言語の主要な機能を解説し、コードと共に作業環境や知見まで改善できる手法を論じた書籍です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Fundamentals of Software Architecture" of item
#. "Principles of Advanced Programming"
#: data/json/items/book/computer.json
msgid ""
"This book examines different architecture patterns and components of good "
"application."
msgstr "優れたアプリケーションの様々なアーキテクチャパターンとコンポーネントについて検証する書籍です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Modern Software Engineering" of item "Principles
#. of Advanced Programming"
#: data/json/items/book/computer.json
msgid ""
"This book illuminates durable principles at the heart of effective software "
"development, with historic examples and personal experience."
msgstr "実用性が高いソフトウェア開発の核となる継続性の原則を、過去の事例や個人的な経験に基づいて啓発する書籍です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Mastering Apex Programming" of item "Principles
#. of Advanced Programming"
#: data/json/items/book/computer.json
msgid ""
"This book shows the most common pitfalls inexperienced programmers may meet "
"in their work, and different solutions one can use to resolve or avoid them."
msgstr "経験の浅いプログラマーが作業中に陥りやすい落とし穴を解説し、それらを解決、回避するための様々な対策を紹介する書籍です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Head First Programming" of item "Web Design
#. Basics"
#: data/json/items/book/computer.json
msgid ""
"This handbook describes the very basics of coding - creating and using "
"variables, loops, decisions, objects - and examples of how and where to use "
"them."
msgstr ""
"変数、ループ、決定、オブジェクトの作成と使用といったコード記述の基本について、どんな場面でどのように使うのか例を交えて解説するハンドブックです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Check Your English Vocabulary for Computers and
#. Information Technology" of item "How to Browse the Web"
#: data/json/items/book/computer.json
msgid ""
"This workbook is designed to help non-native English speakers improve their "
"knowledge and understanding of core computing and IT terminology, with "
"definitions and some examples."
msgstr "英語を母国語としない人がコンピューティングやITに関する重要語句の知識と理解を深めるための、英単語の定義と用例を掲載したワークブックです。"

#. ~ Description of "How to Browse the Web"
