#. ~ Description of "lazy lobster casserole"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/casseroles.json
msgid ""
"A classic New England casserole made with butter, lobster, and crackers, in "
"roughly that order."
msgstr "バター、ロブスター、クラッカーを順に加えて調理する、ニューイングランド地方の伝統的なキャセロールです。"

#. ~ Description of "eggplant parmigiana"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/casseroles.json
msgid "A good portion of tasty eggplant parmigiana."
msgstr "美味しく満足感の高いナスのパルミジャーナです。"

#. ~ Description of "fish noodle casserole"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/casseroles.json
msgid ""
"Fish noodle casserole is a casserole primarily made with pasta and canned "
"tuna, with canned peas and corn sometimes added."
msgstr "パスタとツナ缶詰で作るキャセロールです。エンドウ豆やコーンを追加することもあります。"

#. ~ Description of "hot corn casserole"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/casseroles.json
msgid ""
"It's cheesy and indulgent, although the mix of tender kernels of corn, "
"veggies, fresh herbs, and a pop of heat keep it in check so it's not too "
"heavy for the apocalypse."
msgstr ""
"柔らかいコーン、野菜、新鮮なハーブ、そしてホカホカの温もりが入ったキャセロールです。大変動の世界でもそれほど難しくない、安価で満足感の高い料理です。"

#. ~ Description of "cheesy baked spinach casserole"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/casseroles.json
msgid ""
"This cheesy spinach casserole is cheesy, packed with hearty spinach, and "
"totally delicious."
msgstr "ホウレンソウがたっぷり入った、チーズ風味のとても美味しいキャセロールです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/casseroles.json
