#. ~ Description of "chocolate bar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A bar of chocolate from a popular candy brand.  A delicious treat."
msgstr "人気お菓子ブランドの、美味しいチョコレートバーです。"

#. ~ Description of "cake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A cake coated in the thickest icing you've ever seen.  Someone has written "
"guff in quotation marks on it…"
msgstr "今まで見てきた中で最も分厚いアイシングで覆われたケーキです。引用符で囲った下らない言葉が書き添えられています。"

#. ~ Description of "candy bracelet"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A candy bracelet made by stringing candies onto a thread.  In theory, you "
"could both wear and eat the bracelet."
msgstr "キャンディを糸で繋いで作ったブレスレットです。理論上は、身に着けることも食べることもできます。"

#. ~ Description of "caramel apple"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A caramel-covered apple.  Best served on an autumn day, at a harvest fair, "
"on a stick - but those days are long gone."
msgstr "カラメルがかかったリンゴです。秋の収穫祭で棒に刺して食べるのが最高ですが...そんなことを楽しめる時代はとっくに過ぎ去ってしまいました。"

#. ~ Description of "pasta carbonara"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A famous Italian pasta dish made with egg, pecorino and bacon."
msgstr "卵、ペコリーノチーズ、ベーコンを使ったイタリアの有名なパスタ料理です。"

#. ~ Description of "amatriciana pasta"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A famous Italian pasta dish made with red sauce, pecorino and bacon."
msgstr "トマトソース、ペコリーノチーズ、ベーコンを使ったイタリアの有名なパスタ料理です。"

#. ~ Description of "strudel"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A flaky fruit-filled pastry."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "hard candy"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A handful of candy drops made primarily of sugar, boiled until rock hard."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "Necco wafers"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A handful of candy wafers in assorted flavors: orange, lemon, lime, clove, "
"chocolate, wintergreen, cinnamon, and licorice.  Yum!"
msgstr "オレンジ、レモン、ライム、クローブ、チョコレート、ウインターグリーン、シナモン、リコリスなど様々な風味のラムネ菓子です。美味しいよ！"

#. ~ Description of "chocolate candy"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A handful of colorful chocolate-filled candies."
msgstr "カラフルなチョコレートでコーティングされた飴です。"

#. ~ Description of "maple syrup candy"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A handful of golden, translucent leaf candies made with pure maple syrup.  "
"They melt slowly in your mouth as you savor the taste of real maple."
msgstr "純粋なメープルシロップを使った、黄金色をした半透明のリーフ型キャンディです。口の中でゆっくりと溶けて、本物のメープルの味を堪能できます。"

#. ~ Description of "gummy candy"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A handful of gummy candies made from sugar and gelatin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "vegan gummy candy"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A handful of gummy candies made using invert sugar instead of gelatin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "peanut butter candy"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A handful of peanut butter cups… your favorite!"
msgstr "ビーナッツバター味のキャンディ...これは大好物です！"

#. ~ Description of "peppermint patty"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A handful of soft, chocolate-covered peppermint patties… yum!"
msgstr "ペパーミントのパテをチョコレートでコーティングした、柔らかいお菓子です...美味しいよ！"

#. ~ Description of "marshmallows"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A handful of squishy, fluffy, puffy, delicious marshmallows."
msgstr "ぷにぷにで、ふわふわとした、ふっくらと美味しいマシュマロです。"

#. ~ Description of "chocolate-covered pretzel"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A handful of tiny bread twists covered in chocolate."
msgstr "チョコレートがかかっている、捻じれた形の小さな菓子パンです。"

#. ~ Description of "pretzels"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A handful of tiny, heavily-salted bread twists.  A tasty treat, but they'll "
"make you thirsty."
msgstr "塩がたっぷり入っている、捻じれた形の小さな菓子パンです。美味しいですが、喉が渇きます。"

#. ~ Description of "uncooked hot dog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A heavily processed sausage, commonplace at baseball games before the "
"Cataclysm.  It would taste much better cooked."
msgstr "市販のフランクフルトです。大変動以前は野球観戦のお供でした。加熱調理すればもっと美味しく食べられます。"

#. ~ Description of "uncooked corn dog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A heavily processed sausage, dipped in batter and deep-fried.  It would "
"taste much better cooked."
msgstr "衣をつけて揚げた市販品のソーセージです。加熱調理すればもっと美味しく食べられます。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked corn dog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A heavily processed sausage, dipped in batter and deep-fried.  Now that it's"
" been cooked, this corn dog tastes much better, but will spoil faster."
msgstr "衣をつけて揚げた市販品のソーセージを、再加熱したものです。加熱前よりはるかに美味しくなりましたが、腐敗も早まります。"

#. ~ Description of "homemade gelatin dessert"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A homemade jiggly, sugary treat made from gelatin and sugar, flavored with "
"fruit juice.  A kid favorite pre-Cataclysm."
msgstr "ゼラチンと砂糖とフルーツジュースで作った、プルプルとした甘いデザートです。大変動以前は子供に人気がありました。"

#. ~ Description of "homemade corn dog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A homemade sausage, dipped in batter and deep fried."
msgstr "衣をつけて揚げた自家製ソーセージです。"

#. ~ Description of "chili dog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A hot dog with chili con carne on top.  Yum!"
msgstr "チリコンカルネがかかったホットドッグです。美味しそう！"

#. ~ Description of "fruit filled gelatin dessert"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A jiggly, sugary treat made from gelatin and sugar, flavored with fruit "
"juice and set with fruit.  A kid favorite pre-Cataclysm and a healthy treat."
msgstr ""
"ゼラチンと砂糖とフルーツジュースで作ったゼリーにフルーツを加えた、プルプルとした甘いデザートです。大変動以前は子供に人気がある、健康的なお菓子でした。"

#. ~ Description of "processed gelatin dessert"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A jiggly, sugary, fruit-flavored treat made from boxed mix.  A kid favorite "
"pre-Cataclysm."
msgstr "市販されているフルーツ味のミックスパウダーで作った、プルプルとした甘いデザートです。大変動以前は子供に人気がありました。"

#. ~ Description of "s'mores"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A pair of graham crackers with some chocolate and a marshmallow between "
"them."
msgstr "マシュマロとチョコレートをグラハムクラッカーで挟んで作る菓子です。"

#. ~ Description of "rehydrated freeze-dried meal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A rehydrated beef and egg breakfast meal meant for camping or hiking."
msgstr "水で戻した状態の、主にキャンプやハイキングで朝に食べる牛肉と卵の食事です。"

#. ~ Description of "freeze-dried meal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A sealed plastic bag containing a full dehydrated meal.  This one contains a"
" hearty beef and egg breakfast."
msgstr "密封されたビニール袋の中に、完全に脱水された食事が入っています。牛肉と卵が入ったボリュームたっぷりの朝食です。"

#. ~ Description of "gelatin dessert powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A serving of sugary, fruit-flavored gelatin dessert powder.  Just add water "
"and set."
msgstr "一食分の、フルーツ味が付いた砂糖入りゼラチン粉末です。水を加えるだけでデザートが出来上がります。"

#. ~ Description of "toast-em"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A shelf-stable toaster pastry with icing on top and a sweet fruit filling in"
" the middle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "campfire hot dog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A simple hot dog, cooked over an open fire.  Would be better on a bun, but "
"it's quite an improvement over eating it uncooked."
msgstr ""
"直火で炙っただけのフランクフルトです。パンに挟めばより美味しく食べられそうですが、今の状態でも焼かずに食べるよりは随分美味しくなっています。"

#. ~ Description of "microwave burrito"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A small, microwavable steak & cheese burrito, like those found at gas "
"stations."
msgstr "ガソリンスタンドでよく見かける、電子レンジ調理に対応した細切りステーキとチーズ入りの小さなブリートです。"

#. ~ Description of "cookie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A sweet, delicious cookie, just like grandma used to bake."
msgstr "子供の頃おばあちゃんが焼いてくれたような、甘くて美味しいクッキーです。"

#. ~ Description of "licorice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "A swirly confectionary treat in strings of sweet-tasting candy."
msgstr "紐状の甘い飴を渦巻きのような形に丸めたお菓子です。"

#. ~ Description of "sugar beet syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A thick syrup produced from shredded sugar beets.  Useful in cooking as a "
"sweetener."
msgstr "刻んだサトウダイコンから作られた濃いシロップです。甘味料として使えます。"

#. ~ Description of "military chocolate bar"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A thick, dense bar of military chocolate.  While tough to chew and not very "
"appetizing, it provides almost a day's worth of calories in portable form."
msgstr "分厚く濃厚な軍用のチョコバーです。噛み辛く食欲もそそりませんが、持ち運びやすく、一日分のカロリーを摂取できます。"

#. ~ Description of "vegan gelatin dessert"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A vegan friendly homemade jiggly, sugary treat made from agar and sugar, "
"flavored with fruit juice.  A kid favorite pre-Cataclysm.  They'll never "
"know the difference."
msgstr ""
"寒天と砂糖とフルーツジュースで作った、ヴィーガンにも優しいプルプルとした甘いデザートです。大変動以前は子供に人気がありました。味は普通のゼリーと変わりません。"

#. ~ Description of "fruit filled vegan gelatin dessert"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"A vegan friendly jiggly, sugary treat made from agar and sugar, flavored "
"with fruit juice and set with fruit.  A kid favorite pre-Cataclysm and a "
"healthy treat."
msgstr ""
"寒天と砂糖とフルーツジュースで作ったゼリーにフルーツを入れた、ヴィーガンにも優しいプルプルとした甘いデザートです。大変動以前は子供に人気がある、健康的なお菓子でした。"

#. ~ Description of "unflavored gelatin dessert"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"An unflavored jiggly, sugary treat made from gelatin and sugar.  It would "
"taste better with some flavor."
msgstr "ゼラチンと砂糖から作られた、プルプルとした味のないデザートです。何か味を付ければもっと美味しく食べられそうです。"

#. ~ Description of "onion rings"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Battered and fried onions.  Crunchy and delicious."
msgstr "衣をつけて揚げたタマネギです。カリカリとした美味しい味です。"

#. ~ Description of "maple syrup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Boiling the sap of a maple tree has concentrated it into this sweet, "
"delicious maple syrup."
msgstr "カエデの樹液を煮詰めると、甘くて美味しいメープルシロップが出来上がります。"

#. ~ Description of "chocolate waffle"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Crunchy and delicious waffles with real maple syrup, with delicious "
"chocolate baked right in."
msgstr "本物のメープルシロップを使用した、カリカリで美味しいワッフルに、さらに美味しいチョコレートも加えました。"

#. ~ Description of "malted milk balls"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Crunchy sugar in chocolate capsules.  The malt gives them a distinct, yet "
"delicious flavor."
msgstr "ザクザクした食感のお菓子をチョコレートでコーティングしたものです。癖になる独特の風味があります。"

#. ~ Description of "cake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Delicious chocolate cake.  It has all the icing.  All of it."
msgstr "全体がクリーム状のペーストで覆われた美味しいチョコレートケーキです。"

#. ~ Description of "cake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Delicious sponge cake with buttercream icing.  Happy Birthday is written on "
"top in frosting."
msgstr "バタークリームで覆われた美味しいスポンジケーキです。アイシングで「ハッピーバースデー」と書いてあります。"

#. ~ Description of "deep-fried chicken"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Fast-food chicken, deep-fried in oil.  It's greasy and delicious."
msgstr "鶏肉を油で揚げた、脂っこくて美味しいファーストフード店の料理です。"

#. ~ Description of "candy cigarette"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Flavored sugar sticks designed to look like cigarettes.  Anti-smoking "
"reports from the Surgeon General have caused a pretty big drop in their "
"popularity since the 1960s."
msgstr ""
"タバコに似せたデザインの、風味付けした砂糖菓子です。公衆衛生局長官による喫煙批判レポートの影響を受け、1960年以降は人気が大幅に落ち込んでいます。"

#. ~ Description of "chocolate pancake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Fluffy and delicious pancakes with real maple syrup, with delicious "
"chocolate baked right in."
msgstr "本物のメープルシロップを使用した、ふんわりと美味しいパンケーキに、さらに美味しいチョコレートも加えました。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "French fries"
msgid_plural "French fries"
msgstr[0] "フライドポテト"

#. ~ Description of "potato chips"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Fried potato crisps loaded with salt, fat, and carbohydrates."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "cheese fries"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Fried potatoes with delicious cheese smothered on top."
msgstr "美味しいチーズがかかったフライドポテトです。"

#. ~ Description of "French fries"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Homemade deep-fried potatoes or other tubers, with a touch of salt.  Crunchy"
" and delicious."
msgstr "ジャガイモなどを揚げて作った、カリカリとして美味しい自家製料理です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Necco wafers"
msgid_plural "Necco wafers"
msgstr[0] "ラムネ菓子"

#. ~ Description of "uncooked TV dinner"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Now with ONE POUND of meat and ONE POUND of carbs!  Not as appetizing as it "
"would be if heated up."
msgstr "1ポンドの肉と1ポンドの炭水化物を、さあ召し上がれ！温めずにそのまま食べるものではありません。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked TV dinner"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Now with ONE POUND of meat and ONE POUND of carbs!  Now that it's been "
"heated up, it's much tastier but will also spoil more quickly."
msgstr "1ポンドの肉と1ポンドの炭水化物を、さあ召し上がれ！加熱調理して美味しく食べられる状態になりましたが、腐敗も早まります。"

#. ~ Description of "candy-coated peanuts"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Peanuts coated in a sweet, crunchy candy coating.  A regional delicacy."
msgstr "ピーナッツにキャンディを塗した、甘くて歯ごたえのある郷土菓子です。"

#. ~ Description of "cheese spread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Processed cheese spread."
msgstr "プロセスチーズのペーストです。"

#. ~ Description of "chocolate-covered coffee beans"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Roasted coffee beans coated with dark chocolate, a natural source of "
"concentrated caffeine."
msgstr "焙煎したコーヒー豆をカフェインがたっぷり入ったダークチョコレートでコーティングした菓子です。"

#. ~ Description of "meat nachos with cheese"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas smothered in cheese and ground meat.  "
"Delicious."
msgstr "トルティーヤから作った塩味のチップスに、チーズをかけて挽肉を添えました。最高の美味しさです。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetarian nachos with cheese"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, smothered in cheese and beans.  "
"Delicious, even if you're not a vegetarian."
msgstr "塩味の効いたトルティーヤチップスに豆を添え、溶かしたチーズをかけました。ベジタリアンではなくても美味しく食べられます。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetarian nachos"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, with beans on top.  Could probably "
"use some cheese, though."
msgstr "トルティーヤから作った塩味のチップスに、豆を添えました。溶かしたチーズをかけると更に美味しくなります。"

#. ~ Description of "cheese nachos"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, with cheese melted on top.  Could "
"stand to have some meat."
msgstr "トルティーヤから作った塩味のチップスに、溶かしたチーズをかけました。肉を添えると更に美味しくなります。"

#. ~ Description of "meat nachos"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas, with ground meat on top.  Could "
"probably use some cheese, though."
msgstr "トルティーヤから作った塩味のチップスに、挽肉を添えました。溶かしたチーズをかけると更に美味しくなります。"

#. ~ Description of "tortilla chips"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Salted chips made from corn tortillas.  They're not bad on their own, but "
"they could really use some cheese, maybe some meat."
msgstr "トルティーヤから作った塩味のチップスです。そのまま食べても美味しいですが、チーズや肉を足せば更に美味しくなります。"

#. ~ Description of "pork stick"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Salty dried pork.  Tastes good, but it will make you thirsty."
msgstr "塩味の乾燥肉です。食べると喉が渇きます。"

#. ~ Description of "fast-food French fries"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Salty, deep-fried potatoes from a fast food restaurant."
msgstr "ファーストフード店で売っている、塩味の効いたフライドポテトです。"

#. ~ Description of "buttercream icing"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Smooth, sugary buttercream icing.  Almost good enough to forget the end of "
"everything."
msgstr "甘く滑らかなバタークリームです。これがあれば世界が崩壊したことをすっかり忘れられそうです。"

#. ~ Description of "caramel"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid "Some caramel.  Sticky and sweet, but not very exciting by itself."
msgstr "カラメルです。後を引く甘さですが、そのまま食べてもあまり美味しくありません。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked hot dog"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Surprisingly, not made from dog.  Now that it's been cooked, this hot dog "
"tastes much better, but will spoil faster."
msgstr "意外にも、イヌは入っていません。加熱調理することで非常に美味しくなりましたが、腐敗も早まります。"

#. ~ Description of "graham cracker"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"These dry, sugary crackers will leave you thirsty, but they go well with "
"some chocolate and marshmallows."
msgstr "砂糖が入ったパサパサのクラッカーです。食べると喉が渇きますが、チョコレートやマシュマロとの食べ合わせは抜群です。"

#. ~ Description of "powder candy sticks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"Thin paper tubes of sweet & sour candy powder.  Who thinks of this stuff?"
msgstr "甘味と酸味が混ざった粉末状の飴が入った薄い紙管です。一体、誰がこんな物を考えたんだろうね？"

#. ~ Description of "unholy debug angel cake"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"This unholy confection of delight does not lie, it packs a heavenly amount "
"of calories in each sinful bite.  For debug use only."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "new york wiener"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/junkfood.json
msgid ""
"What's better than a hot dog?  A hot dog smothered in ground meat and "
"chopped onions, of course!"
msgstr "ホットドッグより美味しいものは？そう、挽肉と刻んだタマネギをたっぷり挟んだホットドッグです！"

