#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A rare substance of uncertain origins.  Causes you to mutate."
msgstr "希少価値の高い正体不明の物質です。これは突然変異を引き起こすでしょう。"

#. ~ Description of "batrachian mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"A shadowy mutagen that looks like it might be full of tiny swimming "
"tadpoles."
msgstr "小さなオタマジャクシがたくさん泳いでいるように見える、黒っぽい変異原物質です。"

#. ~ Description of "mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"A syrupy black goop that reeks of noxious chemicals.  Drinking this may "
"cause you to mutate randomly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "gastropod mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A thick, colorless slime."
msgstr "厚手の綿製シャツです。"

#. ~ Description of "congealed blood"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"A thick, soupy red liquid.  It looks and smells disgusting, and seems to "
"bubble with an intelligence of its own…"
msgstr "どろっとした濃厚な赤い液体です。おぞましい姿で悪臭を放っており、まるでこの液体に意思があるような気さえします..."

#. ~ Description of "lagomorph mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "A whitish fluid that smells of fresh-cut grass."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "purifier smart shot"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"An experimental stem cell treatment, offering limited control over which "
"mutations are purified.  The liquid sloshes strangely inside of this "
"syringe."
msgstr "治療する変異の種類を選択できる、実験的な幹細胞治療薬です。奇妙な事に、シリンジ内部の液体が盛んに波打っています。"

#. ~ Description of "alpha mutagen"
#. ~ Description of "theropod mutagen"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "An extremely rare mutagen cocktail."
msgstr "非常に希少価値の高い混合した変異原物質です。"

#. ~ Description of "lagomorph infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid "An orange colored mutagenic infusion."
msgstr "オレンジ色の変異原プライマーです。"

#. ~ Description of "purifier"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"This chunky, flesh-hued liquid helps revert the mutated to baseline "
"humanity, but cannot remove active mutagen present in the bloodstream.  Not "
"for use on animals."
msgstr ""
"この濃厚な肉色の液体には、変異した肉体を元の状態に戻す効果があります。ただし、血中の変異原を除去することはできず、人間以外の生物に使うこともできません。"

#. ~ Description of "purifier infusion"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/mutagen.json
msgid ""
"This thick, flesh-hued injection does wonders for returning mutants to "
"humanity, but cannot remove active mutagens from the bloodstream.  Not for "
"use on animals."
msgstr ""
"この濃厚な肉色の液体には、変異した肉体を元の状態に戻す効果があります。ただし、血中の変異原を除去することはできず、人間以外の生物に使うこともできません。"

#. ~ "activation_message" action message of item "congealed blood"
