#. ~ Description of "vegan butter"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid ""
"A light brown butter substitute made from nuts.  Differs from other nut "
"butters in that the fats are removed from the meat and only the fats "
"retained."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "blanching acorns"
#. ~ Description of "blanching acorns (obsolete)"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsoletion.json
msgid ""
"A mix of water and hulled acorns, slowly leaching the tannins.  It'll take "
"about a week before they're palatable."
msgstr "ドングリを殻ごと水に浸し、タンニンをゆっくりと抜いています。食べられる状態になるまで約1週間かかります。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked acorns"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid ""
"A serving of acorns that have been hulled, chopped, and boiled in water "
"before being thoroughly toasted until dry.  Filling and nutritious."
msgstr "調理したドングリです。殻を剥き、割って、一度茹でてから乾かしてこんがりと焼いてあります。腹持ちがよく栄養豊富です。"

#. ~ Description of "hickory nut ambrosia"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
msgid "Delicious hickory nut ambrosia.  A drink worthy of the gods."
msgstr "美味しいヒッコリーナッツアンブロシアです。神々の飲料です。"

#. ~ Description of "peanut butter spread"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/nuts.json
