#. ~ Description of "seed popcorn"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid ""
"A bunch of dry unpopped corn.  It's intended for planting, but could be put "
"to other uses."
msgstr "乾燥した、まだ弾けていないトウモロコシの粒です。植え付け用ですが、他の用途にも使えます。"

#. ~ Description of "buckwheat seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "A pile of buckwheat, ready to be planted."
msgstr "植え付けられる状態の蕎麦の種です。"

#. ~ Description of "corn seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid ""
"A pile of dried corn, designated for planting.  It could just as easily "
"become food."
msgstr "植え付け用の乾燥したトウモロコシ粒です。少し加工すれば食べられそうです。"

#. ~ Description of "oat seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "A pile of dried whole oats, ready for planting."
msgstr "植え付けられる状態の乾燥した燕麦粒です。"

#. ~ Description of "soybean seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid ""
"A pile of dry soybeans.  These are intended for planting, but there's no "
"reason they couldn't be made into food."
msgstr "乾燥した大豆です。植え付け用ですが、食用に使えないという訳ではありません。"

#. ~ Description of "wheat seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "A pile of dry wheatberries, designated for planting."
msgstr "植え付けられる状態の乾燥した小麦粒です。"

#. ~ Description of "mutant seed"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid ""
"A single rock-hard seed shaped like a kidney bean.  Two dark spots on one "
"end look a bit like a pair of eyes."
msgstr "インゲン豆のような形をした石のように硬い種です。 片方の端にある 2 つの黒い斑点が目のように見えます。"

#. ~ Description of "boiled lotus seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Boiled lotus seeds, with a soft taste."
msgstr "柔らかい口当たりの、茹でたハスの種です。"

#. ~ Description of "Kentucky coffee pod"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid ""
"Coffee pods taken from a Kentucky coffeetree.  If washed thoroughly and "
"roasted, you could use them to make a dark and bitter brew much like coffee."
msgstr ""
"ケンタッキーコーヒーノキから収穫した代用コーヒーの実です。徹底的に洗浄してから焙煎すれば、コーヒーのように濃くて苦い飲み物の材料になります。"

#. ~ Description of "lentil seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Dried lentils, ready for planting."
msgstr "そのまま植え付けられる状態の、乾燥したレンズ豆です。"

#. ~ Description of "bean seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Dry beans, ready for planting."
msgstr "植え付けられる状態の乾燥した豆です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Jerusalem artichoke seeds"
msgid_plural "Jerusalem artichoke seeds"
msgstr[0] "種(キクイモ)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Kentucky coffee pod"
msgid_plural "Kentucky coffee pods"
msgstr[0] "代用コーヒーの実"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Marloss seed"
msgid_plural "Marloss seeds"
msgstr[0] "種(マーロス)"

#. ~ Description of "seed potatoes"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Raw potato cut into pieces, separating each bud for planting."
msgstr "植え付け用に芽の部分で切り分けた生のジャガイモです。"

#. ~ Description of "hop rhizomes"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Roots of a hop plant, for growing your own."
msgstr "ホップの根茎です。自家栽培できます。"

#. ~ Description of "cannabis seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid ""
"Seeds of the cannabis plant.  Filled with vitamins, they can be roasted or "
"eaten raw."
msgstr "大麻の種です。各種の栄養を豊富に含みます。軽く炒って食べると美味ですが、そのままでも食べられます。"

#. ~ Description of "seed garlic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Several cloves of garlic, ready for planting."
msgstr "植え付けに使える数片のニンニクです。"

#. ~ Description of "datura seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid ""
"Small, dark seeds from the spiny pods of a datura plant.  Full of powerful "
"psychoactive chemicals, these tiny seeds are a potent analgesic and "
"deliriant, and can be deadly in cases of overdose."
msgstr ""
"チョウセンアサガオの実から採取した、黒に近い色の小さな種です。この小さな種に強力な向精神成分が含まれており、鎮痛剤として、あるいは幻覚剤として人体に作用します。過剰服用は死亡に繋がる危険性があります。"

#. ~ Description of "Japanese knotweed stems"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Some Japanese knotweed stems, prepared for planting."
msgstr "植え付け用に切り分けたイタドリの茎です。"

#. ~ Description of "Jerusalem artichoke seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Some Jerusalem artichoke seeds."
msgstr "キクイモの種です。"

#. ~ Description of "bamboo seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Some bamboo seeds."
msgstr "竹の種です。"

#. ~ Description of "bee balm seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Some bee balm seeds."
msgstr "ビーバームの種です。"

#. ~ Description of "bell pepper seeds"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/seed.json
msgid "Some bell pepper seeds."
msgstr "ピーマンの種です。"

#. ~ Description of "blackberry seeds"
