#. ~ Description of "48x-"Locutus""
#: data/json/items/comestibles/serums.json
msgid ""
"Little, sealed ampule with some white, semi-transparent liquid of unknown "
"origin.  Label on it says \"48x-\"Locutus\"\", whatever that means."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bone broth"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"A broth made from boiling bones, with vinegar added to extract more calcium."
msgstr "酢を加えた骨から抽出した、カルシウムなどの栄養が豊富で美味しいスープです。"

#. ~ Description of "three sisters stew"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"A hearty stew made of the traditional 'three sisters' plants corn, beans, "
"and pumpkins.  Variations of this dish were a staple of many Native American"
" cultures through the centuries up until current times.  This Abenaki recipe"
" has wild rice added to it."
msgstr ""
"伝統的に「三姉妹」と呼ばれるトウモロコシ、豆、カボチャを使った具沢山のシチューです。多くのネイティブアメリカンの文化で、主食として様々なバリエーションと共に伝わっています。これはアベナキ族のレシピであり、ワイルドライスが入っています。"

#. ~ Description of "blood soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A mushy, brown semi-liquid soup made from blood and flour."
msgstr "血液と小麦粉で作った、とろみのある茶色いスープです。"

#. ~ Description of "mushroom soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A mushy, gray semi-liquid soup made from mushrooms."
msgstr "キノコで作った、とろみのある灰色のスープです。"

#. ~ Description of "fish soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A nutritious and delicious hearty fish soup."
msgstr "栄養価が高く美味で健康的な魚煮込みスープです。"

#. ~ Description of "meat soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A nutritious and delicious hearty meat soup."
msgstr "栄養価が高く美味で健康的な肉煮込みスープです。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A nutritious and delicious hearty vegetable soup."
msgstr "栄養価が高く美味で健康的な野菜スープです。"

#. ~ Description of "woods egg soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A nutritious and delicious soup packed with eggs and vegetables."
msgstr "卵と野菜がたっぷり入った、栄養満点の美味しいスープです。"

#. ~ Description of "woods meat soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A nutritious and delicious soup packed with meat and vegetables."
msgstr "肉と野菜がたっぷり入った、栄養満点の美味しいスープです。"

#. ~ Description of "Cullen skink"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"A rich and tasty fish chowder from Scotland, made with preserved fish and "
"creamy milk."
msgstr "スコットランドの伝統料理、贅沢で美味しい魚のチャウダーです。塩漬けの魚とクリーミーな牛乳を使っています。"

#. ~ Description of "lobster stew"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"A rich and tasty lobster stew from New England, made with fresh lobster, "
"milk, cream, and butter."
msgstr "新鮮なロブスターと牛乳、生クリーム、バターで作る、ニューイングランド地方名物の濃厚なシチューです。"

#. ~ Description of "chicken and dumplings"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A soup with chicken chunks and balls of dough.  Not bad."
msgstr "鶏肉の団子と穀粉の団子が入ったスープです。悪くありません。"

#. ~ Description of "curry with meat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A spicy South Asian dish filled with chunks of meat and vegetables."
msgstr "野菜や肉がたっぷり入ったスパイシーな南インド料理です。"

#. ~ Description of "curry"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "A spicy South Indian dish filled with vegetables."
msgstr "野菜がたっぷり入ったスパイシーな南インド料理です。"

#. ~ Description of "hellfire stew"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"An old recipe from the American Civil War, designed to make hardtack more "
"palatable.  The hardtack is crushed and combined with water to make it "
"soggy, then fried up with melted chunks of fat until browned, and seasoned "
"with salt and pepper.  Surprisingly edible, considering its ingredients."
msgstr ""
"南北戦争時代のアメリカで生まれた、堅パンを食べやすくするための歴史あるレシピです。まず堅パンを砕き、水を加えてドロドロにします。そこへ溶かした脂肪を混ぜて焼き色が付くまで熱し、塩とコショウで味を調えて完成です。使った材料にしては、それなりに食べられる味がします。"

#. ~ Description of "chicken noodle soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"Chicken chunks and noodles swimming in a salty broth.  Rumored to help cure "
"colds."
msgstr "塩気のある煮汁に鶏肉と麺が入っています。風邪を治す効果があるという噂がありますね。"

#. ~ Description of "tomato soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"Condensed tomato soup.  Not very filling, but it goes well with grilled "
"cheese."
msgstr "トマトが入った薄味の赤いスープです。あまり食べ応えはありませんが、焼いたチーズと一緒に食べたいですね。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "Cullen skink"
msgid_plural "Cullen skink"
msgstr[0] "カレンスキンク"

#. ~ Description of "instant chicken noodle soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"Instant chicken noodle soup made from dehydrated noodles and chicken "
"reconstituted with water.  Not the most exciting meal but better than plain "
"water."
msgstr "乾燥させた麺と鶏肉を水でもどして作った、即席品のチキンヌードルです。豪華な食事とは言えませんが、ただの水で腹を満たすよりはマシです。"

#. ~ Description of "instant chicken noodle soup powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"Instant chicken noodle soup powder made from dehydrated noodles and chicken."
"  Mix with water to create a mildly improved meal."
msgstr "脱水した麺と鶏肉が入っている、即席品のチキンヌードルです。水分を加えれば、多少は食べやすくなります。"

#. ~ Description of "instant spring vegetable soup"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"Instant spring vegetable soup made from dehydrated noodles and vegetables "
"reconstituted with water.  Not the most exciting meal but better than plain "
"water."
msgstr "乾燥させた麺と野菜を水でもどして作った、即席品の春野菜ヌードルです。豪華な食事とは言えませんが、ただの水で腹を満たすよりはマシです。"

#. ~ Description of "instant spring vegetable soup powder"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid ""
"Instant spring vegetable soup powder made from dehydrated noodles and "
"vegetables.  Mix with water to create a mildly improved meal."
msgstr "脱水した麺と野菜が入っている、即席品の春野菜ヌードルです。水分を加えれば、多少は食べやすくなります。"

#. ~ Description of "meat broth"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/soup.json
msgid "Meat stock.  Tasty and fairly nutritious."
msgstr "野菜を煮込んで作っただし汁です。美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

