#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "sugar"
msgid_plural "sugar"
msgstr[0] "砂糖"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "thyme"
msgid_plural "thyme"
msgstr[0] "タイム"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/spice.json
msgid "wild herbs"
msgid_plural "wild herbs"
msgstr[0] "野草"

#. ~ Description of "Melitzanosalata"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A Greek eggplant dip.  The eggplants are baked until almost falling apart "
"and seasoned with a big help of garlic, then mixed with some oil and acid."
msgstr "ギリシャで食されるナスを使ったペーストです。身が柔らかくなるまで火を通したナスにニンニクをたっぷり加え、油と酢と共に混ぜれば完成です。"

#. ~ Description of "boiled lotus root"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A boiled lotus rhizome, with a soft taste."
msgstr "柔らかい口当たりの、茹でたレンコンです。"

#. ~ Description of "boiled potato"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A boiled potato or other tuber, the keystone of comfort food."
msgstr "懐かしの味といえばこれ、ジャガイモなどを茹でた料理です。"

#. ~ Description of "roasted chili pepper"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A chili pepper that has been roasted on high heat, with the skin removed.  "
"This has taken out most of the spice, and it's much better than eating it "
"raw."
msgstr "強火で炒めて薄皮を剥いだトウガラシです。辛さは弱まっており、生で食べるよりはるかに美味しいです。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked cattail stalk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A cooked stalk from a cattail plant.  Its fibrous outer leaves have been "
"stripped away, and now it is quite delicious."
msgstr "加熱調理されたガマの茎です。繊維質の外皮が剥がれ落ち、美味しく食べられる状態になりました。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked plant stalk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A cooked stalk from a plant.  Its fibrous outer leaves have been stripped "
"away, and now it is quite delicious."
msgstr "加熱調理された植物の茎です。繊維質の外皮が剥がれ落ち、美味しく食べられる状態になりました。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked bell pepper"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A cored and cooked bell pepper.  It is far more enjoyable now that the seeds"
" are removed."
msgstr "芯を取り除いて調理したピーマンです。生でそのまま食べるよりも断然美味しく食べられます。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable samosa"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A crispy, savory pastry filled with spicy potatoes and vegetables, popular "
"in Indian cuisine."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "dehydrated chili pepper"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A dehydrated chili pepper.  Still not great, but you can easily ground or "
"mill it into powder."
msgstr "乾燥させたトウガラシです。まだ美味しくはありませんが、粉末に加工できます。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable pie"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A delicious baked pie with a tasty vegetable filling."
msgstr "野菜の旨味がたっぷり詰まった美味しいパイです。"

#. ~ Description of "baked potato"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A delicious baked potato or other tuber.  Got any sour cream?"
msgstr "ジャガイモなどを丸焼きにした美味しそうな料理です。サワークリームを付けましょうか？"

#. ~ Description of "sauerkraut w/ sauteed onions"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A delicious sautee of lovely diced onions and sauerkraut.  The smell alone "
"is enough to make your mouth water."
msgstr "角切りにしたタマネギとザワークラウトを合わせてさっと炒めた美味しそうな料理です。匂いだけでよだれが溢れてきます。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable aspic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A dish in which vegetables are set into a gelatin made from a plant stock."
msgstr "煮汁から作ったゼラチンで野菜を固めた料理です。"

#. ~ Description of "dried salad"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A dried salad packed in a box with mayonnaise and ketchup.  Add water to "
"enjoy."
msgstr "マヨネーズとケチャップが付属している、市販の乾燥サラダです。水を加えて食べましょう。"

#. ~ Description of "insta-salad"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A dried salad with water added, not very tasty but still a decent "
"substitution for real salad."
msgstr "水で戻した乾燥サラダです。あまり美味しくありませんが、本物のサラダの代わりにはなります。"

#. ~ Description of "glazed carrot"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A grilled glazed carrot topped with aromatic herbs."
msgstr "ニンジンの照り焼きに香しいハーブを付け合わせた、とても美味しい料理です。"

#. ~ Description of "dehydrated corn kernels"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A handful of dried corn kernels."
msgstr "乾燥させたコーン粒です。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A hearty serving of cooked long-grain white rice."
msgstr "ボリューム満点の炊いた長粒種の白米です。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked wild rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A hearty serving of cooked wild rice."
msgstr "ボリューム満点の炊いたワイルドライスです。"

#. ~ Description of "nopalito"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A less prickly version of cactus pads."
msgstr "棘を取り除いたサボテンの茎節です。"

#. ~ Description of "roasted cattail rhizome"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A roasted root from a cattail plant.  Its fibrous outer core is charred "
"black, so you can remove it and chew on the dry inside."
msgstr "炙ったガマの根茎です。黒焦げになった繊維質の外皮を剥がし、乾燥した軸をかじって食べましょう。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable salad"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A salad made with all kind of vegetables."
msgstr "色んな種類の野菜を使ったサラダです。"

#. ~ Description of "beans and rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A serving of beans and rice that has been cooked together.  Delicious and "
"healthy!"
msgstr "豆と米を一緒に炊いた料理です。美味しくてヘルシーです！"

#. ~ Description of "cooked buckwheat"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A serving of cooked buckwheat porridge.  Healthy and nutritious but bland."
msgstr "調理して軽く潰した蕎麦の実です。健康的で栄養豊富ですが、薄味です。"

#. ~ Description of "pickled vegetable"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A serving of crisply brined and canned vegetable matter.  Tasty and "
"nutritious."
msgstr "新鮮な野菜を漬け込んで作った保存食です。美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

#. ~ Description of "fried pickled vegetable"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A serving of fried pickled vegetables, tangy with a crunchy golden-brown "
"coating."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sushi rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A serving of sticky vinegared rice, commonly used in sushi."
msgstr "寿司の材料としてよく使われる、酢をまぶした粘りが強いご飯です。"

#. ~ Description of "mashed pumpkin"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A simple dish made by cooking pumpkin pulp and then mashing."
msgstr "カボチャの果肉を煮て潰しただけの簡単な料理です。"

#. ~ Description of "roasted carrot"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A simple, tasty roasted carrot."
msgstr "シンプルで美味しい焼きニンジンです。"

#. ~ Description of "pickle"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A small pickled cucumber.  Rather sour, but tastes good and lasts for a long"
" time."
msgstr "キュウリの酢漬けです。少々酸っぱいですが美味しく食べられ、長持ちします。"

#. ~ Description of "tofu stirfry"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "A tofu stirfry with rice and a sweet, bold flavor."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "onigiri"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A triangular block of tasty sushi rice with a healthy green vegetable folded"
" around it."
msgstr "三角形に握った酢飯の中に健康的な緑黄色野菜を入れた美味しい携帯食です。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable pizza"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"A vegetarian pizza, with delicious tomato sauce and a fluffy crust.  Its "
"smell brings back great memories."
msgstr ""
"ベジタリアンも安心して食べられる野菜のピザです。厚みのあるふわふわの生地に美味しいトマトソースがたっぷりと使われています。どこか懐かしい匂いです。"

#. ~ Description of "corn on the cob"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "An ear of corn cooked in foil."
msgstr "ホイルで包んで焼いたトウモロコシです。"

#. ~ Description of "kombu"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"An essential component of Japanese cuisine, this dried sheet of seaweed has "
"hardened to the point of inedibility.  Boiled in water, it should make an "
"excellent broth."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "baked dahlia root"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Baking this dahlia root has broken down the starch, making it softer and "
"sweeter."
msgstr "ダリアの根を加熱すると、デンプンが分解されて柔らかくなり、甘みが増します。"

#. ~ Description of "boiled fiddleheads"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Boiled fiddleheads.  Not bad, but would be better sauteed in butter."
msgstr "茹でたゼンマイです。悪くはありませんが、できればバターを使ってソテーにしたいところです。"

#. ~ Description of "boiled ground nuts"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Boiled ground nuts.  They look and taste a little like potatoes, but with a "
"slight nutty taste."
msgstr "茹でて潰したホドイモです。見た目も味もジャガイモに似ていますが、ほんのりナッツの風味がします。"

#. ~ Description of "mashed potato"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Boiled potatoes mashed together with salt & oil."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "canned corn"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Canned corn in water.  Eat up!"
msgstr "水に浸したコーンが容器に入っています。美味しそう！"

#. ~ Description of "salsa"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Chopped tomatoes, spices, and any number of other vegetables, used as a "
"condiment in Mexican food.  Not so good on its own, but great in a dish."
msgstr ""
"メキシコ料理で調味料として使われる、トマトなどの刻んだ野菜とスパイスを混ぜたものです。そのまま食べてもあまり美味しくありませんが、料理に掛けると絶品です。"

#. ~ Description of "succotash"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Coming from a word meaning \"broken corn kernels\" in the language of the "
"Narragansett, it is a popular dish during hard times and Thanksgiving in New"
" England.  Incorporating maize and beans (or a similar legume), it is cheap "
"and made from common ingredients."
msgstr ""
"「割れたトウモロコシ粒」を意味するナラガンセット族の言葉に由来する、困窮しているときや感謝祭の宴でよく食べられるニューイングランドの料理です。トウモロコシと豆(またはそれに類するマメ科植物)が入っており、特別な材料も要らず安く作れます。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked burdock greens"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Cooked burdock leaves.  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "調理した野生のゴボウの葉です。美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked dandelion greens"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Cooked leaves from wild dandelions.  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "調理した野生のタンポポの葉です。美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked wild vegetables"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Cooked wild edible plants.  An interesting mix of flavors."
msgstr "調理した食用植物です。色々な食材が混ざった風変わりな味がします。"

#. ~ Description of "pan roasted corn"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Corn roasted in a frying pan with herbs and spices."
msgstr "薬草やスパイスと共に焼いたコーンです。"

#. ~ Description of "dehydrated garlic clove"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Dehydrated garlic.  You definitely don't want to eat these like this, but "
"they can be milled or grounded into garlic powder."
msgstr "脱水したニンニクです。このまま食べようとは思いませんが、ガーリックパウダーに加工できます。"

#. ~ Description of "dried rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Dehydrated long-grain rice.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, virtually "
"inedible when dry."
msgstr "乾燥させた長粒種の米です。このままでは食べられませんが、調理すれば美味しく栄養価が高い食品になります。"

#. ~ Description of "dehydrated vegetable"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Dehydrated vegetable flakes.  With proper storage, this dried food will "
"remain edible for an incredibly long time."
msgstr "乾燥させた野菜です。適切に保管すれば、非常に長期にわたる保存が可能です。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetable hosomaki"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Delicious chopped vegetables wrapped in tasty sushi rice and rolled up in a "
"healthy green vegetable."
msgstr "刻んだ野菜を酢飯の中心に置いて巻き、さらにそれを健康的な緑黄色野菜で巻いて包んだ美味しい食べ物です。"

#. ~ Description of "fried rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Delicious fried rice with vegetables.  Tasty and very filling."
msgstr "ご飯と野菜を一緒に炒めた料理です。美味しく、お腹も十分満たされます。"

#. ~ Description of "tofu fried rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Delicious tofu fried rice with vegetables.  Tasty and very filling."
msgstr "ご飯と豆腐と野菜を一緒に炒めた料理です。美味しく、お腹も十分満たされます。"

#. ~ Description of "roasted garlic"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Exposed cloves of garlic that have been coated in oil and then roasted.  "
"Much better than eating them raw."
msgstr "ニンニクの小鱗茎に油を塗して炒めたものです。生よりずっと美味しく食べられます。"

#. ~ Description of "dried starch"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Fibrous clumps of carbohydrate-rich paste extracted from a root vegetable.  "
"Now that it's dry, it could be milled into flour."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "sauteed fiddleheads"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Fiddleheads sauteed in fat.  Tender and delicious."
msgstr "油でソテーにしたゼンマイです。柔らかく美味です。"

#. ~ Description of "prepared ground nuts"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Ground nuts that have been peeled and then boiled, to destroy the harmful "
"protease inhibitors.  Safe to eat, but need further cooking to become "
"palatable.  Can be used much like potatoes."
msgstr ""
"皮を剥いて茹で、有害なプロテアーゼ阻害剤を破壊したホドイモです。このまま食べられますが、美味しく食べたいなら更にひと手間加える必要があります。ジャガイモの代用品として使えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Melitzanosalata"
msgid_plural "Melitzanosalata"
msgstr[0] "メリジャノサラタ"

#. ~ Description of "sauteed Jerusalem artichoke"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Most of this artichoke's inulin has been converted into fructose after "
"cooking, and it now tastes pleasantly sweet."
msgstr "キクイモを調理することで、含有していたイヌリンのほとんどが果糖に変化し、心地よい甘味を感じられるようになりました。"

#. ~ Description of "roasted salsify"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Now that it's been properly cooked, this salsify tastes vaguely like "
"oysters.  Makes a great side dish."
msgstr "しっかり火を通したサルシファイはどことなくオイスターのような味わいがして、副菜にも最適です。"

#. ~ Description of "pesto"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Olive oil, basil, garlic, and pine nuts.  Simple and delicious."
msgstr "オリーブオイル、バジル、ニンニク、松の実が入った、シンプルながら美味しいソースです。"

#. ~ Description of "sauteed onions"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Onions cooked up in oil and spices, often used as a topping or side in "
"dishes."
msgstr "副菜や、主菜の付け合わせなどによく使われる、玉ねぎに油と香辛料を加えて煮た料理です。"

#. ~ Description of "cooked bamboo shoots"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Peeled and cooked bamboo shoots.  Tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "皮を剥いて調理したタケノコです。美味しくて栄養も豊富です。"

#. ~ Description of "dehydrated fungus chunk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Pieces of strange-looking fungus that have been dried to prevent them from "
"rotting away.  They are probably still not safe to eat."
msgstr "腐らないように乾燥させた、毒性の高い肉です。食べるのは危険です。"

#. ~ Description of "hominy"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Popcorn kernels which have been cooked in an alkaline solution and then "
"rinsed, making them better suited for eating or cooking."
msgstr "アルカリ性の水溶液で茹でてから薄皮を取り除いたポップコーン粒です。そのままでも食べられますが、料理の材料にもなります。"

#. ~ Description of "fried bamboo shoots"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Raw bamboo shoots that have been peeled, battered and deep-fried.  Very "
"tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "皮を剥いたタケノコに衣をつけて揚げたものです。非常に美味しく栄養満点です。"

#. ~ Description of "dry wild rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Raw, milled wild rice.  Tasty and nutritious when cooked, virtually inedible"
" when dry."
msgstr "精米したワイルドライスです。このままでは食べられませんが、調理すれば美味しく栄養価が高い食品になります。"

#. ~ Description of "rehydrated chili pepper"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Reconstituted chili pepper.  It isn't less spicy after dehydrating and "
"rehydrating but it can be used to flavor your dishes again."
msgstr "水で戻したトウガラシです。乾燥させてから水戻ししても辛みは減らず、料理の風味付けに利用できます。"

#. ~ Description of "rehydrated corn kernels"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Reconstituted corn kernels, much more enjoyable to eat now that they have "
"been rehydrated."
msgstr "水で戻したコーン粒です。乾燥したまま食べるよりずっと美味しく食べられます。"

#. ~ Description of "rehydrated garlic clove"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Reconstituted garlic cloves, much more edible than its dehydrated state, "
"although the flavor and texture has changed in the process.  Can be used for"
" recipes, albeit its shelf life is shortened by a great margin."
msgstr ""
"水で戻したニンニク片です。乾燥した状態より遥かに食べやすいですが、風味と食感は多少変化しています。賞味期限は大幅に短くなりますが、料理の材料として利用できます。"

#. ~ Description of "rehydrated vegetable"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Reconstituted vegetable flakes, which are much more enjoyable to eat now "
"that they have been rehydrated."
msgstr "水で戻した乾燥野菜です。乾燥したまま食べるよりずっと美味しいです。"

#. ~ Description of "deluxe vegetarian beans and rice"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Slow-cooked beans and rice with vegetables and seasonings.  Tasty and very "
"filling."
msgstr "豆と米と野菜と調味料を一緒に炊いた料理です。美味しく、お腹も十分満たされます。"

#. ~ Description of "vegetarian baked beans"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Slow-cooked beans with vegetables.  Tasty and very filling."
msgstr "豆と野菜を一緒に炊いた料理です。美味しく、お腹も十分満たされます。"

#. ~ Description of "spaghetti al pesto"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "Spaghetti with a generous helping of pesto on top.  Yum!"
msgstr "ペストソースを贅沢に使ったスパゲッティです。美味しいよ！"

#. ~ Description of "starch"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Sticky, gooey carbohydrate paste extracted from a root vegetable.  It will "
"spoils rather quickly if not prepared for storage."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "boiled Jerusalem artichoke"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Still crunchy but much more palatable than raw, with a slight nutty taste."
msgstr "まだ少し硬いですが、生よりずっと食べやすく、ナッツのような味わいが多少あります。"

#. ~ Description of "succotash deluxe"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Succotash, but made more modern and tasty by adding some flavorful "
"ingredients."
msgstr "風味豊かな食材を加え、より現代的で美味しく仕上げたサコタッシュです。"

#. ~ Description of "roasted cooking banana"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"The much less sweet and more starchy relative of the banana, that has been "
"cooked to make it better suited for eating."
msgstr "バナナより甘味が少なくデンプン質が多い、バナナの仲間です。加熱することで食べやすくなりました。"

#. ~ Description of "sauerkraut"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"This crunchy, sour topping made from lettuce or cabbage is perfect for your "
"hot dogs and hamburgers, or, if you're desperate, straight to your stomach."
msgstr ""
"レタスやキャベツから作られた、ざくざくとした歯応えと酸味が特徴のトッピング食材です。ホットドッグやハンバーガーに最適ですが、状況によってはそのまま食べても良いでしょう。"

#. ~ Description of "canned vegetable"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"This mushy pile of vegetable matter was boiled and canned in an earlier "
"life.  Better eat it before it oozes through your fingers."
msgstr "調理済みの柔らかい野菜が容器一杯にぐっちょりと詰まっています。指の間からこぼれ落ちる前に食べましょう。"

#. ~ Description of "cornmeal"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid "This yellow cornmeal is useful for baking."
msgstr "焼いて調理すると美味しく食べられます。"

#. ~ Description of "salted vegetable chunk"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Vegetable chunks pickled in a salt bath.  Goes well with burgers, if you can"
" find one."
msgstr "塩漬けにした野菜です。ハンバーガーによく合います。ハンバーガーがあればの話ですが。"

#. ~ Description of "fried burdocks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Wild burdocks that have been battered and deep-fried.  Very tasty and "
"nutritious."
msgstr "野生のゴボウに衣をつけて揚げたものです。非常に美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

#. ~ Description of "fried dandelions"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Wild dandelion flowers that have been pan fried.  Very tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "野生のタンポポの花を揚げたものです。非常に美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

#. ~ Description of "fried dandelions and burdocks"
#: data/json/items/comestibles/veggy_dishes.json
msgid ""
"Wild dandelions and burdocks that have been battered and deep-fried.  Very "
"tasty and nutritious."
msgstr "野生のタンポポとゴボウに衣をつけて揚げたものです。非常に美味しく栄養も豊富です。"

