#. ~ Description of "clay hydria"
#: data/json/items/containers/containers.json
msgid "A 15-liter clay pot with three handles for carrying and pouring."
msgstr "持ち運んだり他の容器へ移し替えたりするときに便利な3つの持ち手が付いた、容量15Lの陶器製の鉢です。"

