#. ~ Description of "desiccated corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
msgid ""
"A badly mangled human body.  A giant puncture wound is visible on its upper "
"chest, and something has drained most of the moisture from the carcass, "
"leaving it desiccated and making it impossible to determine the body's age."
msgstr "酷く損傷した人間の死体です。胸の上部に大きな刺し傷があります。水分がほとんど失われているため、年齢が判別できません。"

#. ~ Description of "corpse"
#: data/json/items/corpses/corpses.json
