msgstr "マグカップの側面には「軽度アルコール依存症」と書いてあります。"

#. ~ Description of variant "coffee mug" of item "coffee mug"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid ""
"The side of the mug reads 'Do you even linux, bro?' and has a picture of a "
