#. ~ Description of variant "coffee mug" of item "coffee mug"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
msgid "The side of the mug reads 'STAR WARS' over a picture of a lightsaber."
msgstr "マグカップの側面にはライトセイバーと「STAR WARS」のロゴがプリントされています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "coffee mug" of item "coffee mug"
#: data/json/items/generic/dining_kitchen.json
