#. ~ Description of variant "$10 gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A $10 gift card, redeemable for purchases at your local hardware store."
msgstr "地元の工具店で使える、10ドル分のギフトカードです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "$100 gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A $100 electronic gift card, redeemable for purchases at your local "
"megastore."
msgstr "地元の超大型店で使える、100ドル分の電子ギフトカードです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "$20 gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A $20 gift card, redeemable for purchases at your local clothing store."
msgstr "地元の衣料品店で使える、20ドル分のギフトカードです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "$5 gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A $5 gift card, redeemable for purchases at your local bookstore."
msgstr "地元の書店で使える、5ドル分のギフトカードです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "baby shower card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A baby blue greeting card with a drawing of a teddy bear holding an "
"umbrella.  Words printed on it read: \"It's getting closer by the hour, so "
"let's have a baby shower!\""
msgstr ""
"傘をもったテディベアが描かれた、淡い青色のグリーティングカードです。「その時が刻一刻と近づいていますね。ベビーシャワーパーティーを開きましょう！」と印刷されています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sympathy card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A black greeting card with a picture of a dimly lit candle.  Words printed "
"on it read: \"Please accept our deepest and most heartfelt condolences at "
"this challenging time.\""
msgstr ""
"ほのかに灯るロウソクが描かれた、黒色のグリーティングカードです。「このたびは誠にご愁傷様です。心よりお悔やみ申し上げます」と印刷されています。"

#. ~ Description of "envelope"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A flat paper container with a sealable flap, used to enclose a letter or "
"other paper goods."
msgstr "手紙などを封入できる、薄い紙製の袋です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "pink slip" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A folded pink sheet of paper declaring the homeowner fired!  Oh no."
msgstr "折り畳まれたピンク色の用紙は、家主から住人に宛てた退去勧告でした！何ということでしょう。"

#. ~ Description of variant "restaurant gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A gift card for a local restaurant, covering the cost for an entire meal."
msgstr "地元のレストランで使える、一食分のギフトカードです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "greeting card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A greeting card for expressing best wishes.  Its corners are decorated with "
"paintings of flowers and leaves."
msgstr "贈られた人の幸せを願うグリーティングカードです。四隅に花や葉が描かれています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "birthday card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A greeting card given to a person to celebrate their birthday.  This one has"
" a floral design."
msgstr "誕生日を祝う、花柄デザインのグリーティングカードです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "retirement card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A greeting card wishing the recipient a long and happy retirement.  This one"
" displays a drawing of a rocking chair surrounded with white roses."
msgstr "退職後も末永く幸せであることを願うグリーティングカードです。白いバラに囲まれたロッキングチェアが描かれています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "friendship card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A greeting card with a stylized picture of a donut and a coffee cup.  Above "
"the picture, it says 'I am thankful for our friendship' and below are the "
"words 'we are better together'."
msgstr ""
"ドーナツとコーヒーカップが描かれた、お洒落なグリーティングカードです。絵の上下に「素敵な友情に感謝」「これからもずっと一緒」と印刷されています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "letter from the bank" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A letter from the bank stating the homeowners account is overdrawn and they "
"owe quite a bit of money."
msgstr "銀行からの通知書には、手紙の受取人の口座にかなりの額の借越があることが記されています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "late rent notice" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A letter to recipient notifying them of their overdue rent, they have 30 "
"days to pay or they are going to court!"
msgstr "家賃の滞納を知らせる書面です。30日以内に支払わないと裁判所に訴えられてしまいます！"

#. ~ Description of variant "automated speeding ticket" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A notice from the local police, there is a tiny picture of a car and a "
"demand of 350 dollars for speeding in a school zone."
msgstr ""
"地元の警察からの通知書には、スクールゾーンでスピード違反があったため350ドルの支払いを求める旨が記されており、車が写ったごく小さな写真が同封されています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "credit card offer" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A notification from a credit card company, the recipient has been "
"preapproved!  Attached in a thick wad of glue is a fake credit card, this "
"could be theirs if they wanted it."
msgstr ""
"事前審査に通過したことを知らせる、クレジットカード会社からの通知書です！糊で固定された偽造クレジットカードが同封されていますが、これを使うと、詐欺師に情報を渡すことになりそうです。"

#. ~ Description of "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid "A piece of card stock meant to convey an expression of sentiment."
msgstr "想いを伝えるためのカードです。"

#. ~ Description of "postcard"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A piece of thick, rectangular paper intended for writing and mailing without"
" an envelope."
msgstr "封筒に入れずにそのままメッセージを郵送できる、厚手の長方形の紙です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "thank you card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A plain white greeting card featuring an expression of gratitude to the "
"recipient."
msgstr "相手への感謝の気持ちを込める、無地の白いグリーティングカードです。"

#. ~ Description of "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A small card that can be exchanged for goods or services from a particular "
"business, usually given as a gift."
msgstr "特定企業の商品やサービスと交換できる、贈り物として渡されることが多い小さなカードです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "farewell card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A white greeting card with a stylized drawing of an empty road.  Words "
"printed on it read: \"You're going places (literally).  Wishing you the "
"best!\""
msgstr "前へ続く道が描かれた白いグリーティングカードです。「(見ての通り)道は広がっています。ベストを尽くせますように！」と印刷されています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sad letter home" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A written message from a soldier to their parents.  Their deployment has "
"been extended and they won't be home for the holidays.  This sad letter "
"makes you feel homesick."
msgstr ""
"兵士から両親へ宛てた手紙です。派遣期間が延長されたため、クリスマスシーズンも帰れない、といった内容が綴られています。悲しい手紙を読んでいると、こちらまで郷愁を感じます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "love letter" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A written message from a soldier to their partner, carefully folded into its"
" envelope.  Their deployment ends soon and they can't wait to see their "
"lover.  Reading the rest of it would be rude."
msgstr ""
"兵士からパートナーに宛てた手紙が、丁寧に折り畳まれて封筒に入っています。派遣期間が間もなく終わるため、会えるのが待ち遠しい、といった内容が綴られています。これ以上読むのは失礼にあたりますね。"

#. ~ Description of variant "angry letter home" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A written message from a soldier to their partner, stuffed angrily into its "
"envelope.  They know, they know she knows, and don't even pretend you don't "
"know.  This letter is full of expletives you don't dare read aloud."
msgstr ""
"兵士からパートナーに宛てた手紙が、封筒に乱雑に突っ込まれています。あなたの心の内はお見通しだ、しらばっくれるな、といった内容が、口に出すのも憚られるような罵詈雑言と共に綴られています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "letter home" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A written message from a student to their parents scrawled on notebook "
"paper.  They're having a great time at college and can't wait to introduce "
"you to their new lover.  Coincidently they have run out of money for gas "
"again and it sure would be great if you could send some."
msgstr ""
"便箋に乱雑な字で綴られた、学生から親への手紙です。大学生活を楽しんでおり、最近できた恋人を早く紹介したい、運が悪いことにまたガソリン代が足りなくなったので送金してほしい、といった内容が綴られています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sad letter home" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A written message from a student to their parents scrawled on notebook "
"paper.  They're having a really bad time at college and want to come home, "
"nothing seems to be going well, their grades and heart are in the dumps."
msgstr ""
"便箋に乱雑な字で綴られた、学生から親への手紙です。大学でとても嫌なことがあったので家に戻りたい、何もかも上手くいかない、成績も精神状態もどん底だ、といった内容が綴られています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "love letter" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A written message from a woman to her lover, it's sealed with a heart-shaped"
" sticker and smells of perfume.  You start to read it but it quickly becomes"
" embarrassing."
msgstr ""
"女性から恋人へ宛てた直筆の手紙です。封筒にはハート形のシールが貼られ、香水の香りが漂っています。内容を読もうとしましたが、すぐに恥ずかしくなってきて止めました。"

#. ~ Description of "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A written message from one person to another, usually put in an envelope.  "
"Reading it would be rude."
msgstr "通常は封筒に入れて送る、人から人へのメッセージを綴った紙です。勝手に読むのは失礼にあたります。"

#. ~ Description of variant "letter home" of item "letter"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"A written message home in a foreign tongue, carefully folded into its "
"envelope."
msgstr "外国語で綴られた手紙が、丁寧に折り畳まれて封筒に入っています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "barbershop gift card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"This gift card could be exchanged for a free cut at a local barbershop."
msgstr "地元の理髪店で使える、ヘアカット無料券です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "5% discount card" of item "gift card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"This gift card gives you a 5% discount for purchases at your local shopping "
"mall.  Can only be redeemed once."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "get well card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"This greeting card displays a cartoon turtle in a cozy blanket sipping hot "
"tea.  Above the turtle, it says 'Wishing you a SPEEDY recovery!'"
msgstr ""
"フワフワの毛布に包まって温かい紅茶を飲むカメのイラストが描かれたグリーティングカードです。イラストの上に「早くよくなってね！」と印刷されています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "congratulations card" of item "greeting card"
#: data/json/items/generic/mail.json
msgid ""
"This greeting card displays a picture of a graduate tossing their graduation"
" cap.  Above the cap is the word 'CONGRATULATIONS'."
msgstr "卒業帽を投げ上げる学生が描かれたグリーティングカードです。「おめでとう」と印刷されています。"

