#. ~ Description of gun "AR-10 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "AR-10 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"Somewhat similar to the later AR-15, the AR-10 is a gas-operated, rotating "
"bolt rifle chambered for 7.62x51mm rounds."
msgstr "後のAR-15とやや類似した構造の、ガス圧作動方式とロータリーボルト式を併用した7.62x51mmライフルです。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun "scouting rifle"
#. ~ Variant name of item "scouting rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid "Steyr Scout rifle"
msgid_plural "Steyr Scout rifles"
msgstr[0] "ライフル(.308口径/ｽﾃｱｰ･ｽｶｳﾄ)"

#. ~ Description of gun "M134D-H Minigun"
#. ~ Description of "M134D-H Minigun"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"The M134D-H Minigun is a (relatively) lightweight heavy rotary machine gun."
"  Its six barrels are rotated by an electric motor, powered by UPS or "
"vehicle.  If you could find enough ammo for it, it would become a "
"devastating weapon.  It must be mounted on a vehicle before use."
msgstr ""
"M134D-Hミニガンは(比較的)軽量な回転式ヘビーマシンガンです。6つの銃身はUPSか車両用モーターによって回転します。十分な弾薬を確保できれば、絶大な威力を発揮するでしょう。運用するには車両に取り付ける必要があります。"

#. ~ Description of gun "M24 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "M24 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"The M24 Sniper is the military and police version of the Remington Model 700"
" rifle, M24 being the model name assigned by the United States Army after "
"adoption as their standard sniper rifle in 1988.  The M24 is referred to as "
"a 'weapon system' because it consists of not only a rifle, but also a "
"detachable telescopic sight and other accessories."
msgstr ""
"M24スナイパーは、レミントンM700ライフルの軍用、警察用モデルです。1988年に標準装備の狙撃銃として採用され、アメリカ陸軍によってM24の名を与えられました。ライフル本体に着脱式のテレスコピックサイトなど様々な装備が付属しているため、「ウェポンシステム」とも呼ばれています。"

#. ~ Description of gun "M240 machine gun"
#. ~ Description of "M240 machine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"The M240 is a medium machine gun used by the US military, replacing the "
"older M60.  Quite inaccurate and difficult to control, the M240 is designed "
"to fire many rounds very quickly."
msgstr ""
"M60の後継として開発され、主にアメリカ軍で使われている中量級のマシンガンです。精度が低く、照準の制御も困難ですが、速やかに弾幕を展開できます。"

#. ~ Description of gun "M60 machine gun"
#. ~ Description of "M60 machine gun"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"The M60 is a general-purpose machine gun developed to replace the "
".30-caliber M1918 and M1919.  Heavy and difficult to handle fired from the "
"shoulder, as most people aren't action-movie heroes."
msgstr ""
".300口径のM1918及びM1919の後継として開発された汎用マシンガンです。大抵の人間はアクション映画の主人公ではないため、重すぎるこの銃を設置せずに撃つのは困難です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "scouting rifle" of gun "Steyr Scout rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Steyr Scout rifle" of item "scouting rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"The Steyr Scout is Steyr's interpretation of Jeff Cooper's concept of a "
"'scout rifle', a versatile, all-purpose hunting rifle.  To this end, it is "
"exceedingly lightweight, and contains a built-in polymer bipod, and fits a "
"spare magazine inside the stock for fast reloading.  While these features "
"made for a hunting rifle too universal for widespread adoption, they might "
"yet fulfill a vital scouting niche for survivors in the post-Cataclysm "
"world."
msgstr ""
"ステアー・スカウトは、ジェフ・クーパーが提唱した様々な場面で役に立つ多用途ライフル「スカウトライフル」という概念の、ステアー社による解釈です。非常に軽量な本体にはポリマー製二脚が内蔵されており、銃床内に予備弾倉を収納することで素早い装填が可能です。これらの利便性から広く普及し、本来の名称と目的が食い違うほど普遍的になっていましたが、大変動後の世界では生存者にとって重要な偵察(スカウト)用銃器としての役割を果たせそうです。"

#. ~ Description of gun "American battle rifle"
#. ~ Description of "American battle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"This civilian variant of an American battle rifle is essentially a rifle "
"from World War 2 with a detachable magazine stuck in it that was sold to the"
" military as a cheap, do-all rifle that could replace many other weapon "
"systems.  While it delivered none of those things, it was an acceptable "
"rifle, if marginally inferior to its contemporaries."
msgstr ""
"アメリカ製のバトルライフルの民生用モデルです。他の多くの武装に代わる安価な万能ライフルとして第二次世界大戦中に軍が導入したものに、着脱可能な弾倉を取り付けただけの代物ともいいます。万能とまでは言えませんが、同時代の銃より多少劣る性能も許容できるほど便利な銃です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "American battle rifle" of gun "M1A rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "M1A rifle" of item "American battle rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"This civilian variant of the M14 is essentially the M1 Garand from World War"
" 2 with a detachable magazine stuck in it that was sold to the military as a"
" cheap, do-all rifle that could replace many other weapon systems.  While it"
" delivered none of those things, it was an acceptable rifle, if marginally "
"inferior to its contemporaries."
msgstr ""
"M14の民生用モデルです。他の多くの武装に代わる安価な万能ライフルとして第二次世界大戦中に軍が導入したM1ガーランドに、着脱可能な弾倉を取り付けただけの代物ともいいます。万能とまでは言えませんが、同時代の銃より多少劣る性能も許容できるほど便利な銃です。"

#. ~ Description of gun "7.62x51mm bullpup rifle"
#. ~ Description of "7.62x51mm bullpup rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic bullpup rifle with a lightened body due to the use "
"of polymers and aluminum, using standard magazines of the heavy automatic "
"rifle and a 7.62x51mm cartridge."
msgstr ""
"ポリマーとアルミニウムを使うことで本体を軽量化した、セミオートブルパップライフルです。ヘビーオートマチックライフル用標準弾倉と7.62x51mm弾に対応しています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "7.62x51mm bullpup rifle" of gun "Kel-Tec RFB
#. rifle"
#. ~ Description of variant "Kel-Tec RFB rifle" of item "7.62x51mm bullpup
#. rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"This is a semi-automatic bullpup rifle with a lightweight, polymer frame, "
"using magazines from the FN FAL and the .308 Winchester cartridge.  The "
"rifle, forward-ejection, bullpup (abbreviated as RFB) features forward case "
"ejection, ambidextrous controls, and structural use of the barrel, uncommon "
"in modern designs."
msgstr ""
"FN "
"FAL弾倉と.308口径ウィンチェスター弾に対応する、軽量ポリマーフレームを備えたセミオートブルパップライフルです。RFBはライフル、フォワードイジェクション(前方排出)、ブルパップの頭文字であり、前方に薬莢を排出する機構、左利きでも撃ちやすい形状、現代の設計では珍しい銃身構造が特徴です。"

#. ~ Description of gun "scouting rifle"
#. ~ Description of "scouting rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/308.json
msgid ""
"This is a versatile, all-purpose hunting rifle.  To this end, it is "
"exceedingly lightweight, contains an inbuilt polymer bipod, and fits a spare"
" magazine inside the stock for fast reloading.  While these features made "
"for a hunting rifle too universal for widespread adoption, they might yet "
"fulfill a vital scouting niche for survivors in the post-Cataclysm world."
msgstr ""
"様々な場面で役に立つ多用途の狩猟用ライフルです。非常に軽量な本体にはポリマー製二脚が内蔵されており、銃床内に予備弾倉を収納することで素早い装填が可能です。これらの利便性から広く普及し、本来の名称と目的が食い違うほど普遍的になっていましたが、大変動後の世界では生存者にとって重要な偵察(スカウト)用銃器としての役割を果たせそうです。"

