#. ~ Description of gun "Big Horn Model 89 rifle"
#. ~ Description of "Big Horn Model 89 rifle"
#: data/json/items/gun/500.json
msgid ""
"Built in the image of the venerable Winchester Model 1886, Big Horn Armory's"
" Model 89 rifle packs all the power of the .500 S&W Magnum cartridge into a "
"package less likely to break one's wrist."
msgstr ""
"Big Horn Armory社のModel "
"89ライフルは、由緒あるウィンチェスターM1886をイメージして製造されました。自分の手首の骨を折ることなく、装填した.500口径S&Wマグナム弾の威力を発揮できます。"

#. ~ Variant name of gun ".500 Magnum revolver"
#. ~ Variant name of item ".500 Magnum revolver"
#: data/json/items/gun/500.json
