#. ~ Description of gun mod "MDRX .223 extended-assembly"
#. ~ Description of "MDRX .223 extended-assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible "
"bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis "
"of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-caliber munitions and requiring"
" STANAG magazines for feeding, the assembly makes the most from the weapon's"
" bullpup design with a 20-inch barrel configuration, coaxing increased "
"terminal performance from fired rounds."
msgstr ""
"互換性のあるボルトパーツと独自のマズルブレーキを備えたこの銃身は、デザートテック社のMDRXライフルのシャーシへ素早く取り付け、取り換えることができます。.223口径の弾薬に対応していますが、給弾にはSTANAG弾倉が必要です。約51cmの銃身とブルパップ方式を最大限に生かす設計になっており、命中の直前まで威力が減衰しません。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "MDRX .223 MICRON assembly"
#. ~ Description of "MDRX .223 MICRON assembly"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/conversions.json
msgid ""
"Crowned with a proprietary gas compensator and complemented by a compatible "
"bolt assembly, this is a quick-detach barrel installable within the chassis "
"of a Desert Tech MDRX rifle.  Bored for .223-caliber munitions and requiring"
" STANAG magazines for feeding, the assembly renders the MDRX into a compact "
"CQB carbine, with an 11.5-inch barrel recessed into the weapon's bullpup "
"layout."
msgstr ""
"互換性のあるボルトパーツと独自のマズルブレーキを備えたこの銃身は、デザートテック社のMDRXライフルのシャーシへ素早く取り付け、取り換えることができます。.223口径の弾薬に対応していますが、給弾にはSTANAG弾倉が必要です。約29cmの銃身をブルパップ機構に埋め込む形で取り付けることで、MDRXがコンパクトなCQBカービンに様変わりします。"

