#. ~ Description of gun mod "lightweight replacement furniture"
#. ~ Description of "lightweight replacement furniture"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/grip.json
msgid ""
"A set of lightweight composite grips and furniture that reduces a firearm's "
"weight, and as a consequence, its handling and melee damage."
