#. ~ Description of gun mod "balanced recoil system"
#. ~ Description of "balanced recoil system"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"A complex set of parts designed to minimize recoil using a reciprocating "
"counterweight."
msgstr "おもりの往復運動によって銃の反動を最小限に抑える、複雑な機構です。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "match trigger"
#. ~ Description of "match trigger"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"A precision weighted trigger assembly that slightly improves a firearm's "
"accuracy."
msgstr "プルウェイトを精密に調整したトリガー部品です。銃火器の精度を若干高めます。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "TEC-9 full auto sear"
#. ~ Description of "TEC-9 full auto sear"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"A relatively simple modification of some of a TEC-9's internal fire-control "
"components, converting it to a fully-automatic-only machine pistol.  Calling"
" this hilariously illegal would be an understatement, but anyone who'd care "
"is probably long gone by now."
msgstr ""
"TEC-9の内蔵火器管制装置を、フルオート射撃専用のマシンピストルに改造します。どう見ても違法改造ですが、そんなことを気にする人間はもういません。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "Glock auto sear plate"
#. ~ Description of "Glock auto sear plate"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"A relatively simple switch or button mechanism that replaces the back plate "
"of a Glock slide, allowing it to function as a select-fire machine pistol.  "
"A highly illegal modification, but the feds are zombie food anyway.  This "
"will fit any standard Glock pistol in 9mm, .40, .45, 10mm, or .357 caliber."
msgstr ""
"比較的シンプルな機構のスイッチやボタン類です。グロックのスライドに付いているバックプレートと取り換えれば、射撃モードの切り替えが可能なマシンピストルに改造できます。違法性の高い改造ですが、取り締まるFBIはきっとゾンビの餌になっています。9mm、.40口径、.45口径、10mm、.357口径の標準的なグロックピストルに取り付けられます。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "M240 select fire trigger"
#. ~ Description of "M240 select fire trigger"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"A trigger modification that allows the M240 to switch between semi and full "
"automatic modes."
msgstr "M240の射撃モードをセミオートとフルオートで切り替えられるようにするための改造用部品です。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "M249 select fire trigger"
#. ~ Description of "M249 select fire trigger"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"A trigger modification that allows the M249 to switch between semi and full "
"automatic modes."
msgstr "M249の射撃モードをセミオートとフルオートで切り替えられるようにするための改造用部品です。"

#. ~ Description of gun mod "drop-in auto sear"
#. ~ Description of "drop-in auto sear"
#: data/json/items/gunmod/mechanism.json
msgid ""
"A vaguely 'U'-shaped piece of metal with a vaguely 'T'-shaped flapper on a "
"pin.  Once tucked into an AR-15's lower receiver, the rifle will become "
"selective fire-capable.  The handcrafted-sear surface isn't as good as "
"actual full-auto parts, so precision and reliability suffer slightly."
msgstr ""
"ピンにT字型のフラップが付いたU字型の金属部品です。AR-15ライフルのレシーバー下部に取り付けると、セミオート/フルオート射撃の切替が可能になります。手製のシアーは実際のフルオート部品よりも低品質なため、精度と信頼性がわずかに低下します。"

