#. ~ Description of "qiang"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A Chinese spear in use since antiquity. The tip is larger than most european"
" spears, and there's typically a decorative tassel hung just below it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ji"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A bronze polearm that originated in the Shang dynasty of China, if not "
"earlier.  It combines a long spear head with a perpendicular axe plade "
"shaped like a crescent moon."
msgstr "遅くとも殷の時代には中国で使われていた、青銅製の長柄武器です。槍の穂先の下に、柄と直交する角度で戈の刃を組み合わせた形状をしています。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden javelin"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A fire-hardened wooden spear honed to a sharper point."
msgstr "先端を削って尖らせ焼き固めた投げ槍です。"

#. ~ Description of "naginata"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A lightweight Japanese polearm reminiscent of a sharply curved katana with "
"an exceptionally long handle.  Originally a battlefield tool, they "
"eventually came to be used for home defense, and were widely used for this "
"purpose by women of the samurai class."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "simple stone spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A long stick with a sharp stone spearhead."
msgstr "木の棒の先端に尖った石の穂先を取り付けた武器です。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze bush hook"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A long, slightly curved and hooked bronze blade on the end of a sturdy "
"shaft.  It could be used to thoroughly ruin something's day, or to cut "
"branches and small trees."
msgstr "頑丈な柄の先にやや湾曲した長い青銅の刃を付けた道具です。枝や低木の伐採や、丸一日を徹底的に無駄に過ごしたいときに使います。"

#. ~ Description of "bush hook"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A long, slightly curved and hooked steel blade on the end of a sturdy shaft,"
" usually used for clearing brush.  Some people call it a kaiser blade."
msgstr "頑丈な柄の先にやや湾曲した長い鋼鉄の刃を付けた道具です。枝や低木の伐採や、丸一日を徹底的に無駄に過ごしたいときに使います。"

#. ~ Description of "copper pike"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft tipped with a "
"copper spearhead."
msgstr "非常に長い木の柄の先端に銅の穂先が付いた、中世の武器です。"

#. ~ Description of "pike"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft tipped with a steel"
" spearhead."
msgstr "非常に長い木の柄の先端に鋼鉄の穂先が付いた、中世の武器です。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden pike"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A medieval weapon consisting of a very long wooden shaft with a fire-"
"hardened point."
msgstr "非常に長い木の棒の先端を火で炙って硬くした、中世の武器です。"

#. ~ Description of "sharpened pipe"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A pipe with one end cut off at an angle."
msgstr "一端が斜めにカットされたパイプです。"

#. ~ Description of "war scythe"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A pole weapon with a curving single-edged blade.  Its blade bears some "
"superficial resemblance to that of an agricultural scythe from which it "
"likely evolved."
msgstr "湾曲した片刃をもつ武器です。外見は元々の用途であった農業用の鎌に似ています。"

#. ~ Description of "poleaxe"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A polearm with an axe head, a small hammer on the back, and a short dagger-"
"like spike on top.  It's surprisingly lightweight for its size, and "
"specialized for cracking open heavy armor."
msgstr ""
"斧頭の後部に小さなハンマー、上部に短いナイフ状のスパイクが付いた長柄武器です。一般的な長柄武器よりは軽く先端も小さいため、多少は素早く振り回せます。"

#. ~ Description of "steel short spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A shorter spear designed for use in close quarters.  Weapons like these were"
" once used by fighting forces around the world, from the Vikings to the "
"Zulu."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bronze short spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A shorter spear with a bronze head.  What it lacks in reach it more than "
"makes up for in maneuverability."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pointy stick"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A simple wooden pole with one end sharpened to a point."
msgstr "一端を尖らせただけの、長い木の棒です。"

#. ~ Description of "bronze spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A spear with a bronze head."
msgstr "青銅製の穂先をもつ鍛造された槍です。"

#. ~ Description of "steel javelin"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A steel-tipped wooden throwing spear."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "crude wooden spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout pole with one end sharpened to a point."
msgstr "一方の先端を尖らせた、丈夫な長い木の棒です。"

#. ~ Description of "fire-hardened wooden spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a fire-hardened point."
msgstr "長い棒の先端を削って尖らせ焼き固めた、頑丈な木の槍です。"

#. ~ Description of "steel spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a hand-forged steel spearhead."
msgstr "頑丈な木製の棒に手鋳造された鋼鉄の穂先を取り付けた武器です。"

#. ~ Description of "stone spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a sharp stone spearhead."
msgstr "頑丈な木製の棒に鋭い石の穂先を取り付けた武器です。"

#. ~ Description of "copper spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A stout wooden pole with a spearhead worked from copper."
msgstr "頑丈な木製の棒に鋭く尖った銅の穂先を取り付けた武器です。"

#. ~ Description of "knife spear"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A stout wooden pole with the blade of a knife bolted into place at the end."
"  The shape of a knife blade isn't ideal for a spear, but it's still very "
"sharp and effective."
msgstr "頑丈な長い棒の先端にナイフの刃を固定した武器です。刃の形状は刺突攻撃には向きませんが、切れ味は抜群で実用的です。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift glaive"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A sturdy pole with a broad cutting blade securely bolted to one end.  It's "
"intimidating despite being clearly homemade."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "glaive"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid "A sturdy polearm with a sizable single-edged blade on the end."
msgstr "先端に大きな片刃の剣が付いた、頑丈な長柄武器です。"

#. ~ Description of "halberd"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"A versatile polearm with an axe blade, a spike, and a hooking beak attached "
"to a long, sturdy haft."
msgstr "頑丈な長い棒の先端に斧やスパイクなど賑やかなものを取り付けた、多芸な長柄武器です。"

#. ~ Description of "fire poker"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"Also known as a fire iron, this short rod has a pointed tip with a hook on "
"one side.  It was designed for stoking firewood, but it looks like it could "
"really do some damage in a fight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "pitchfork"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"An agricultural tool with a long wooden shaft and four spikes.  It's "
"normally used to lift hay, but the tines could do some damage in a fight."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "makeshift war scythe"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"This farming tool has been modified into an improvised weapon by rotating "
"its blade 90 degrees, transforming it into a deadly giant blade on the end "
"of a stick.  It's quite fragile, however."
msgstr "戦闘用に改造した鎌です。刃の角度を90度回転させることで、農具が棒に括りつけた威力の高い巨大な刃に変貌しました。壊れやすいのが難点です。"

#. ~ Description of "sharpened spear shaft"
#: data/json/items/melee/spears_and_polearms.json
msgid ""
"You've gone through the effort of making a proper spear shaft, but instead "
"of attaching something sharp to the end you just whittled a point into the "
"wood.  The peak of pointy stick technology."
msgstr "せっかく頑丈な木製の槍柄を作ったのに、先端を尖らせただけで穂が付いていません。棒を尖らせる技術の完成形です。"

