#. ~ Description of "antique silver locket"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A heart-shaped silver locket with an black-and-white image of a smiling "
"woman in it.  Her eyes seem to follow you whenever you look at it."
msgstr "ハート形のシルバーのロケットペンダントの中には、微笑む女性の白黒写真が入っています。写真をどの角度から見ても、女性と目が合います。"

#. ~ Description of "varsity jacket"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A jacket traditionally worn by school athletes.  The logo of the school has "
"an oddly detailed fractal pattern that draws your eye in whenever you look "
"at it."
msgstr "大学所属のスポーツ選手が着用する伝統的なジャケットです。大学のロゴは妙に細かいフラクタル模様になっており、見ていると目を離せなくなります。"

#. ~ Description of "ambiguous apron"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A long apron with a plain pattern on it.  Your eyes can't seem to decide "
"what color it is."
msgstr "地味な模様が入った丈の長いエプロンです。何度見ても何色なのかよく分かりません。"

#. ~ Description of "antique scissors"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A pair of ornately decorated steel scissors.  The handle is decorated with "
"vicious-looking birds."
msgstr "装飾が施されたスチール製のハサミです。持ち手の部分には凶悪そうな鳥が描かれています。"

#. ~ Description of "strange sunglasses"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A pair of thin, round sunglasses.  The tinted glass seems to reflect the "
"same shade of baleful orange light no matter what light it reflects."
msgstr "薄い丸型サングラスです。この着色ガラスはあらゆる光を派手なオレンジ色にして反射するようです。"

#. ~ Description of "Hawaiian shirt"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A slightly worn button-down shirt with a tropical pattern, straight out of "
"the 80's.  You swear that every time you look away and look back, the "
"pattern changes subtly."
msgstr "80年代を彷彿とさせるトロピカル柄の、少し着古したボタンダウンシャツです。目を離す度に柄が少しずつ変化しています。"

#. ~ Description of "engraved cube"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A small cube of smooth rock.  A uniform grid of nine squares is engraved in "
"each of its faces."
msgstr "滑らかな石で作られた小さな立方体です。各面に3×3の規則正しいマス目が刻まれています。"

#. ~ Description of "glitching stopwatch"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A small digital stopwatch, looking slightly old by today's standards.  Its "
"digital display prints ever-changing gibberish."
msgstr ""
"現代の製品と比べて少し古いように見える、小さなデジタル式ストップウォッチです。ディスプレイには刻々と変化する意味不明な数列が表示されています。"

#. ~ Description of "golden comb"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A small, delicate golden comb.  It was once carefully engraved, but time has"
" smoothed its designs to illegibility."
msgstr "小さく優美な黄金の櫛です。かつては細かな彫刻が施されていたようですが、時間経過によって元のデザインが分かり辛くなっています。"

#. ~ Description of "shifting keyring"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A smooth ring of steel, heavy under the weight of numerous keys.  The "
"designs of the keys change over time, but none will fit any keyhole you have"
" ever found."
msgstr ""
"多数の鍵がぶら下がって重くなった、滑らかなスチール製のリングです。鍵の形状が時間とともに変化しますが、今までに見たどの鍵穴にも入りそうにありません。"

#. ~ Description of "Utah teapot"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A squat teapot with a minimalist design.  Its surface shines under the glow "
"of unseen light sources."
msgstr "背が低いシンプルなデザインのティーポットです。どこかに不可視の光源があるのか、表面が輝いています。"

#. ~ Description of "defaced badge"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A strange golden badge in the shape of a shield with scratched out "
"lettering.  The faceless figures decorating the badge seem taller and "
"thinner than ordinary humans."
msgstr ""
"文字と人物像が載っている、盾の形をした奇妙な金色のバッジです。文字は摩耗しており読めません。人物像には顔がなく、普通の人間よりも背が高く痩せているように見えます。"

#. ~ Description of "Bakelite phone"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"A vintage, bright-red Bakelite phone of famous Swedish design.  It would "
"look almost normal, if not for the fact that its rotary dial has been "
"replaced with a doorknob."
msgstr ""
"有名なスウェーデン製の、真っ赤な古めかしい電話機です。回転ダイヤルがドアノブに置き換わっているということを除けば、ごく普通の電話機に見えます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "Bakelite phone"
msgid_plural "Bakelite phones"
msgstr[0] "電話機"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "Hawaiian shirt"
msgid_plural "Hawaiian shirts"
msgstr[0] "アロハシャツ"

#. ~ Description of "exposed-wiring prototype"
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid ""
"Some kind of prototypical electronic device with exposed wiring.  Some of "
"the wires have bare ends that could be connected together."
msgstr "配線が露出したままになっている、電子機器の試作品のようなものです。一部の配線の先端は剥き出しになっており、何かに接続できそうです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/relics/altered_items.json
msgid "Utah teapot"
