msgid ""
"A bone from a human being.  It could be used to make some stuff, if you're "
"feeling sufficiently ghoulish."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bone"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid ""
"A bone from some creature or other.  Could be used in cooking and crafting."
msgstr "動物か何かの骨です。料理や製作の材料として使えそうです。"

#. ~ Description of "bone"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "A bone from some unfortunate creature.  It doesn't look human."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bone skewer"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid ""
"A thin skewer carved from bone.  Sadly, it won't make squirrel on a stick "
"taste better."
msgstr "骨を削って作った細い串です。残念ながら、これでリスの串焼きを作っても味は向上しません。"

#. ~ Description of "large bone"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "A tremendous bone taken from some gigantic creature."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bone meal"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "An off-white powder made from grinding bones."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "tainted bone"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "Gray-brown cracks and gouges mar this bone like decay in an old tooth."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bear skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a bear."
msgstr "クマの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "beaver skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a beaver."
msgstr "ビーバーの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "cow skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a bovine, likely a domestic cow, with the horns still attached."
msgstr "角が付いたままになっている、家畜のウシの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "deer skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a cervine, either a deer or a reindeer."
msgstr "角が付いたままになっている、シカかトナカイの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "deer skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a cervine, probably a deer…  But why does it have eight eye "
"sockets?"
msgstr "角が付いたままになっている、シカなどの頭蓋骨ですが...どうして眼窩が8つもあるのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Description of "sheep skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a domestic sheep."
msgstr "家畜のヒツジの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "goat skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a goat with the horns still attached."
msgstr "角が付いたままになっている、ヤギの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "horse skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a horse.  Given the circumstances you can be pretty sure it was"
" a domestic horse."
msgstr "ウマの頭蓋骨です。状況からして、ほぼ間違いなく家畜のウマのものでしょう。"

#. ~ Description of "human skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a human being.  Carrying this around probably isn't going to "
"win you any friends."
msgstr "人間の頭蓋骨です。こんなものを持ち歩いていたら、友達ができませんよ。"

#. ~ Description of "llama skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a llama."
msgstr "ラマの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "medium feline skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a medium-sized feline, likely a bobcat."
msgstr "ヤマネコなどのものと思われる中型の頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "tusked moose skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a moose, sporting big curving tusks, like a boar."
msgstr "ヤマネコなどのものと思われる中型の頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "moose skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a moose."
msgstr "オポッサムの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "pig skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a pig, either a domestic or a wild one."
msgstr "家畜のブタか野生のイノシシの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "rabbit skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a rabbit or a hare."
msgstr "ウサギかノウサギの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "raccoon skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a raccoon."
msgstr "アライグマの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "skunk skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a skunk."
msgstr "オポッサムの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "small canine skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a small canine, likely a small dog breed."
msgstr "小型犬のものと思われる小さな頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "small feline skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a small feline, likely a house cat."
msgstr "イエネコのものと思われる小さな頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "rodent skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a small rodent, most likely a rat."
msgstr "ラットのものと思われる小さなげっ歯類の頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "tiger skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of a tiger."
msgstr "クマの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "tiny canine skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a tiny canine, likely a Chihuahua or another similarly sized "
"dog breed."
msgstr "チワワに近いサイズの犬種のものと思われる、非常に小さな頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "triclopean canine skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a what looks like a dog, although it has an extra eye socket."
msgstr "眼窩が多い気がしますが、恐らくはイヌの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "large canine skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid ""
"The skull of a wolf or a dog.  Essential material for building an "
"articulated wolf skeleton."
msgstr "オオカミかイヌの頭蓋骨です。オオカミの骨格標本を作るのに欠かせない部位です。"

#. ~ Description of "opossum skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "The skull of an opossum."
msgstr "オポッサムの頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "tainted human skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid ""
"The stained skull of what was once a human being.  It is rotted and "
"noticeably warped from its lively form.  Carrying this around probably isn't"
" going to win you any friends."
msgstr ""
"かつては人間のものだった、汚染された頭蓋骨です。生前の状態から形がかなり歪み、腐っています。こんなものを持ち歩いていると友達に恵まれませんよ。"

#. ~ Description of "abstract skull"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid "This is a dummy item.  If you see it something went wrong."
msgstr "疑似アイテムです。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Description of "tainted bone meal"
#: data/json/items/resources/bone.json
msgid ""
"This is a grayish bone meal made from rotten bones.  It's probably not safe "
"to use for anything edible."
msgstr "粉末状にした灰白色の腐った骨です。"

