#. ~ Description of "hinge"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A small metal hinge with two metal plates with screw holes.  Useful for "
"making doors or chests."
msgstr "ネジ穴付きの2枚の金属板からなる小さな蝶番です。ドアや箱の部品として使えます。"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum scrap"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small piece of aluminum, usable for crafting or repairs."
msgstr "小さなアルミニウムの欠片です。修復やアイテム製作の材料として使います。"

#. ~ Description of "aluminum chunk"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A small piece of aluminum; light but durable, this could be cast into "
"various shapes for construction or ground down to a powder, for more high-"
"profile applications."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "bronze fragment"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A small piece of copper alloyed with another metal such as aluminum or tin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "copper fragment"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small piece of copper, usable for crafting or repairs."
msgstr "小さな銅の欠片です。修復やアイテム製作の材料として使います。"

#. ~ Description of "iron scrap"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small piece of iron, usable for crafting or repairs."
msgstr "小さな錫の欠片です。修復やアイテム製作の材料として使います。"

#. ~ Description of "iron fragment"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small piece of iron."
msgstr "雪で作られた小さな山です。"

#. ~ Description of "steel fragment"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small piece of steel about the size of a golf ball."
msgstr "ビール瓶ほどのサイズの、毒グモの幼体です。"

#. ~ Description of "small metal sheet"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small sheet of metal."
msgstr "金属製の小さな薄板です。"

#. ~ Description of "solder"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A small spool of solder, useful for electronics crafting."
msgstr "電子工作に便利なひと巻き分のはんだです。"

#. ~ Description of "lead"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A soft, dull metal used since ancient times.  Due to its malleability, it "
"has a wide variety of uses including the manufacture of ammunition."
msgstr "古代より存在を知られている、鈍い色の柔らかい金属です。その展性を利用し、弾薬の製造など様々な用途で使えます。"

#. ~ Description of "silver"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A soft, shiny metal.  Before the Cataclysm it was worth quite a bit, but its"
" value is now greatly diminished."
msgstr "光沢のある柔らかい金属です。大変動以前はそれなりの値段が付けられていましたが、現在は大幅に価値が下がっています。"

#. ~ Description of "gold"
#. ~ Description of "platinum"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A soft, shiny metal.  Before the apocalypse this would've been worth a small"
" fortune, but now its value is greatly diminished."
msgstr "光沢のある柔らかい金属です。大変動以前は少量でも一財産になりましたが、現在は大幅に価値が下がっています。"

#. ~ Description of "pipe"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid ""
"A steel pipe.  A decent weapon in its own right, it could also be used in a "
"number of crafts."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "copper rod"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "A thin copper rod, ready to be made into copper wire."
msgstr "銅製の細い棒です。銅線に加工できます。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of brass"
#: data/json/items/resources/metal.json
msgid "Some decent-sized chunks of scrap brass."
msgstr "かなり大きな真鍮屑です。"

#. ~ Description of "tin scrap"
