#. ~ Description of "locksmith kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid ""
"A locksmith's set of sturdy steel lockpicks and torsion wrenches.  It is "
"essential for silently and quickly opening locks, provided you have some "
"lockpicking and mechanical skills."
msgstr ""
"鍵屋が使う高品質なロックピックとトーションレンチのセットです。ピッキングや機械整備にある程度通じている者にとっては、素早く音を立てずに鍵を開けるのに欠かせない道具です。"

#. ~ Description of "crowbar"
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid ""
"A long prying tool with a slender wedge at either end.  Use it to open "
"locked doors without destroying them, or to lift manhole covers."
msgstr ""
"曲がった部分を釘などに引っかけてこじ開ける小型の道具です。使用することで鍵のかかった扉を破壊せずに解錠し、マンホールの蓋を持ち上げます。もちろん、誰かの頭に叩きつけることもできますよ。"

#. ~ Description of "rudimentary lockpick"
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid ""
"A pair of thin pieces of metal, one bent in an 'L' shape to push tumblers "
"and the other acting as a torsion wrench.  These tools are almost totally "
"inadequate for picking locks, but when you've got nothing else, it might "
"work."
msgstr ""
"二本一組になった細い金属棒です。一本はタンブラーを押し上げるためにL字型に曲がっており、もう一本は頑丈なトーションレンチとして機能します。とてもピッキングに適した作りとは言えませんが、他に何も道具が無ければこれを使うしかありません。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift crowbar"
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid ""
"A pipe with both ends bent and hammered flat to resemble a crowbar.  It's a "
"poor weapon and a terrible prying tool, but sometimes you have to make do."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "ice axe"
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid ""
"A short ice axe with a spiked head and a small hammer on the other end, a "
"multi-purpose hiking and climbing tool used by mountaineers.  It is sturdy "
"enough to lift manhole covers."
msgstr "登山家が使う、片側にハンマーが付いた多目的ピッケルです。とても頑丈な作りで、マンホールの蓋を持ち上げたりする際にも使えます。"

#. ~ Description of "improvised lockpick"
#: data/json/items/tool/entry_tools.json
msgid ""
"An improvised pick and torsion wrench made from scrap metal.  You'll need "
"MacGyver-like skills to open locks with these as they are brittle, but they "
"lower the chances of alarms being set off."
msgstr ""
"金属屑で作った簡易的なロックピックです。とても脆いため、これでピッキングするにはマクガイバー並の技術が必要ですが、警報を鳴らしてしまう可能性は減りそうです。"

