#. ~ Description of "electric lantern (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A battery-powered lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long"
" time."
msgstr "電池で稼働するランプです。光は弱いですが、長持ちします。"

#. ~ Description of "active flare"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A bright burning flare that is producing light.  It will last for about a "
"minute before burning out."
msgstr "明るい光を発しながら燃えている発炎筒です。燃え尽きるまで1分程度光り続けます。"

#. ~ Description of "active flare"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A burning magnesium flare that is producing light.  It will last for about a"
" half hour before burning out."
msgstr "光を発している、燃焼中のマグネシウム発炎筒です。30分程度強く光り続けます。"

#. ~ Description of "heavy-duty flashlight (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A heavy-duty aluminum LED flashlight, often used by security guards.  It "
"even works underwater, and it's not bad for smacking hooligans."
msgstr "警備員がよく使っている、頑丈なアルミ製のLED懐中電灯です。水中でも稼働し、フーリガンを殴りつけるのにも役立ちます。"

#. ~ Description of "kerosene lamp"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A kerosene-fueled lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long"
" time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "kerosene lamp (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A kerosene-fueled lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a long"
" time.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "torch"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A large stick wrapped in rags that are soaked with flammable material.  It "
"is burning, producing plenty of light."
msgstr "可燃性の液体を染みこませてある布を巻きつけた棒です。燃え盛る炎が辺りを照らしています。"

#. ~ Description of "torch"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A large stick wrapped in rags that are soaked with flammable material.  When"
" lit, it produces a fair amount of light.  You'll need a lighter or matches "
"to light it."
msgstr "可燃性の液体を染みこませてある布を巻きつけた棒です。火をつけると光源になります。点火するにはライターやマッチなどが必要です。"

#. ~ Description of "reading light"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A little clip-on LED light, meant for reading books in the dark."
msgstr "暗闇の中で本を読むための、クリップで固定できるLEDライトです。"

#. ~ Description of "reading light (active)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A little clip-on LED light, meant for reading books in the dark.  This one "
"is turned on."
msgstr "暗闇の中で本を読むための、クリップで固定できるLEDライトです。ライトは点灯しています。"

#. ~ Description of "diving flashlight (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A little waterproof light.  It can easily be clipped to a belt or a helmet, "
"or to some diving masks."
msgstr "持ち手がアルミで作られている、電池で稼働する小型の防水懐中電灯です。一部のダイビングマスクやフードに取り付けられます。"

#. ~ Description of "LED strip (inactive)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A one meter strip of LED lights, usually used for decoration or accent "
"lighting."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "flare"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A slow-burning magnesium flare.  Use it to strike the striker and light it."
"  It will produce a bright light for about a half hour."
msgstr "ゆっくりと燃えるマグネシウム発炎筒です。使用すると点火して発光を始めます。30分程度強く光り続けます。"

#. ~ Description of "glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A small blue-light glowstick.  Use it to bend the plastic and break the "
"glass cylinder inside to start the reaction.  It will produce a small amount"
" of light."
msgstr "青く光る小さな棒です。プラスチック製の本体を折り曲げると内部のガラス容器が割れ、化学反応を起こし、淡く発光します。"

#. ~ Description of "gasoline lantern (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A small gasoline-powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, but it "
"lasts a long time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "小型のガソリンランタンです。光は弱いですが、長持ちします。現在火が灯っています。使用すると明かりを消します。"

#. ~ Description of "gasoline lantern (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A small gasoline-powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, but it "
"lasts a long time.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "小型のガソリンランタンです。光は弱いですが、長持ちします。使用すると明かりを灯します。"

#. ~ Description of "propane lantern (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A small propane-powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, but it "
"lasts a long time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "小型のプロパンランタンです。光は弱いですが、長持ちします。現在火が灯っています。使用すると明かりを消します。"

#. ~ Description of "propane lantern (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A small propane-powered lantern.  It does not provide much light, but it "
"lasts a long time.  Use it to turn it on."
msgstr "小型のプロパンランタンです。光は弱いですが、長持ちします。使用すると明かりを灯します。"

#. ~ Description of "smart lamp (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A smart lamp that can be activated remotely."
msgstr "遠隔操作で点灯するスマートランプです。"

#. ~ Description of "smart lamp (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A smart lamp which can be deactivated remotely.  Currently it is turned on."
msgstr "遠隔操作で点灯するスマートランプです。現在は点灯しています。"

#. ~ Description of "clay oil lamp (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A specialized small clay container with a wick, an ancient form of oil lamp."
"  Unlike newer designs, it isn't windproof, so the flame is likely to be "
"extinguished if exposed to wind; better use it indoors.  It does not provide"
" much light, but it lasts a long time.  Use it to light it."
msgstr ""
"オイルランプの燃焼に特化した、芯が入っている小さく古風な土器です。現代のランプと違って風が吹くと火が消えてしまうため、室内で使った方がよさそうです。光は弱いですが、長持ちします。使用すると点火します。"

#. ~ Description of "clay oil lamp"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A specialized small clay container with a wick, an ancient form of oil lamp."
"  Unlike newer designs, it isn't windproof, so the flame is likely to be "
"extinguished if exposed to wind; better use it indoors.  It does not provide"
" much light, but lasts a long time.  It is lit, consuming oil and providing "
"light.  Use it to extinguish the flame."
msgstr ""
"オイルランプの燃焼に特化した、芯が入っている小さく古風な土器です。現代のランプと違って風が吹くと火が消えてしまうため、室内で使った方がよさそうです。光は弱いですが、長持ちします。現在オイルを消費して点灯しています。使用すると火を消します。"

#. ~ Description of "dead glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid "A spent glowstick.  It is essentially trash."
msgstr "使用済みのケミカルライトです。使い道のないゴミですね。"

#. ~ Description of "candle"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A thick wax candle.  It doesn't provide very much light, but it can burn for"
" quite a long time.  This candle is lit."
msgstr "太いろうそくです。光は弱いですが、とても長持ちします。火が灯っています。"

#. ~ Description of "candle"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A thick wax candle.  It doesn't provide very much light, but it can burn for"
" quite a long time.  You'll need a lighter or matches to light it."
msgstr "太いろうそくです。光は弱いですが、とても長持ちします。点火するにはライターやマッチなどが必要です。"

#. ~ Description of "flashlight (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"A typical household flashlight with a plastic handle, powered by batteries."
msgstr "プラスチック製の持ち手が付いた、電池で稼働する一般的な懐中電灯です。"

#. ~ Description of "active glowstick"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"An active glowstick, currently producing light.  It will last for a few "
"hours before burning out."
msgstr "発光中のケミカルライトです。数時間光り続けます。"

#. ~ Description of "acetylene lamp (off)"
#: data/json/items/tool/lighting.json
msgid ""
"An antique brass lamp designed to run from a pressurized cylinder of "
"acetylene.  It is an efficient, if somewhat dangerous, light source."
msgstr "アセチレン入りの加圧シリンダーで作動する、真鍮製の古いランプです。取り扱いに気をつける必要はありますが、効率的な光源として活用できます。"

