#. ~ Description of "permanent marker"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A King Size™ industrial-strength permanent marker, about halfway between a "
"typical marker and a can of spray paint in size.  Activate it to write "
"something down.  However, writing \"Elbereth\" probably won't help you."
msgstr ""
"一般的なペンとスプレー缶の中間にあたる、キングサイズ™の業務用油性マーカーです。使用すると文字を書き込めます。「Elbereth」と書いても意味はありませんよ。"

#. ~ Description of "fur rollmat"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A bedroll made of pelts which can be rolled up for transport.  It insulates "
"you from the floor, making it easier to sleep.  Use it to unroll and place "
"on the ground."
msgstr "丸めて持ち運べる毛皮のマットです。断熱効果があり、床に敷いておくと寝心地が良くなります。使用すると地面に広げます。"

#. ~ Description of "leather bellow"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A bellow is a device constructed to furnish a strong blast of air"
msgstr "空気を勢いよく吹き出すための装置です。"

#. ~ Description of "car horn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A car horn meant to be attached to a car's electrical system."
msgstr "車の電気系統に接続するタイプのクラクションです。"

#. ~ Description of "whistle multitool"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A cheap gadget combining a whistle, thermometer, magnifying glass, and "
"compass."
msgstr "ホイッスル、温度計、虫眼鏡、コンパスが合体した安物のガジェットです。"

#. ~ Description of "clay urn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A clay container for storing cremated ashes."
msgstr "火葬した遺灰を入れる陶製の容器です。"

#. ~ Description of "porcelain urn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A container for holding the remains of a loved one.  Its prior owners must "
"have taken good care of it, as you can see your face reflected clearly upon "
"its surface."
msgstr "大切な人の遺骨を納める容器です。前の持ち主が大事に使っていたのか、表面に顔が映るほど丁寧に磨かれています。"

#. ~ Description of "cow bell"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A cow bell.  You feel like you need more of it."
msgstr "カウベルです。もっと鳴らしましょう。"

#. ~ Description of "garden hose"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A flexible garden hose.  If you cut it into smaller pieces, it could be used"
" for crafting or siphoning fuel from a vehicle."
msgstr "柔軟な散水ホースです。短く切れば、製作の材料になるだけでなく、車両から燃料を抜き取ることもできます。"

#. ~ Description of "hand pump"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A hand-powered pump suitable for pumping air into inflatable objects."
msgstr "手動で空気を送り込んで膨らませる道具です。"

#. ~ Description of "handheld glass cutter"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A handheld tool used for controlled breaking of glass.  A necessity for any "
"glass cutting projects."
msgstr "ガラスを思い通りに切断できる携帯式工具です。ガラスを切断したいときの必需品です。"

#. ~ Description of "stun gun"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A high-powered stun gun.  Use this item to attempt to electrocute an "
"adjacent enemy, temporarily paralyzing them."
msgstr "高出力のスタンガンです。使用すると隣接する敵を感電させ、一定確率で一時的に麻痺させます。"

#. ~ Description of "retractable telescope"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A homemade collapsible telescope, perfect for a pirate.  Too large and "
"inaccurate to use as a weapon scope, but carrying it in your inventory will "
"double the distance that is mapped around you during your travels."
msgstr ""
"海賊によく似合う、自作の伸縮式望遠鏡です。銃やクロスボウに照準器として取り付けるには大きすぎ、精度も不十分ですが、所持しておくと、全体マップの視認範囲が通常の2倍に広がります。"

#. ~ Description of "etched human skull"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A human skull covered with strange etchings."
msgstr "表面に奇妙な模様が彫られた人間の頭蓋骨です。"

#. ~ Description of "superglue bottle"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A little plastic bottle with a narrow tip, designed to store and dispense "
"superglue.  It's gunked up with the stuff and wouldn't be good for much "
"else."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "can of butane"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A non-refillable can of butane with an adapter for refilling lighters.  It "
"could be useful as a fuel, but also as a solvent or chemical reagent."
msgstr "ライター用の詰め替えアダプターが付いた、ブタンガスが入った再充填できない缶です。燃料としてだけでなく、溶媒や化学試薬としても有用です。"

#. ~ Description of "tear gas sprayer"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A pocket sized plastic canister filled with a pressurized tear gas spray, a "
"step above oleoresin capsicum pepper spray in terms of potency.  Most "
"commonly used by law enforcement and bear-wary hikers, but it became more "
"common in recent months due to anxiety over the riots.  Probably won't do "
"much against a zombie, but should give anything still breathing a rather "
"nasty surprise and give you time to get away.  It contains enough spray for "
"about twenty seconds of continuous application."
msgstr ""
"オレオレジントウガラシスプレー以上の効果を発揮する、加圧催涙ガスが充填されている小型のプラスチック製容器です。法執行機関やクマから身を守りたいハイカーが頻繁に利用していましたが、暴動への不安からここ数か月で更に普及しました。ゾンビに対してはあまり意味がないかもしれませんが、呼吸をしている敵を強くひるませることができ、逃げる時間を稼げます。約20秒間連続で噴射し続けられる量のガスが入っています。"

#. ~ Description of "large space heater"
#. ~ Description of "large space heater (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A portable electric heater that steadily emits warm air.  Raises temperature"
" about 10 degrees Celsius, and fills a larger volume of air than the smaller"
" version."
msgstr "暖かい空気を放出する携帯用電気ヒーターです。温度が約10度上昇します。低出力ヒーターよりも大量の暖気を放出します。"

#. ~ Description of "small space heater"
#. ~ Description of "small space heater (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A portable electric heater that steadily emits warm air.  Raises temperature"
" about 10 degrees Celsius."
msgstr "暖かい空気を放出する携帯用電気ヒーターです。温度が約10度上昇します。"

#. ~ Description of "travel toilet"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A portable plastic toilet, designed to use plastic bags for waste instead of"
" plumbing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "folded travel toilet"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A portable plastic toilet.  It has been collapsed for easy transport."
msgstr "アウトドア旅行に便利な金属製の折り畳み式テーブルです。現在は持ち運びやすい形状に折り畳まれています。"

#. ~ Description of "sarcophagus access code"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A printout displaying a string of numbers, the passcode to access the "
"elevator in the hazardous waste sarcophagus."
msgstr "有害廃棄物石棺のエレベーターを起動するためのパスコードが印刷された紙です。"

#. ~ Description of "notched plank"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A quarter of a wooden plank with notches cut into it, used with a fire drill"
" to create embers."
msgstr "溝が入った木材です。火起こし器を使って火口を作る際に使います。"

#. ~ Description of "safe deposit box"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A secure combination-lock box.  Sadly, you don't know the combination.  "
"Breaking into it would destroy anything of value."
msgstr "頑丈なダイヤル式金庫です。残念ながら暗証番号が分かりません。無理に開けようとすると中身まで壊してしまう可能性があります。"

#. ~ Description of "survival marker"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A sharpened piece of charcoal used as an improvised pencil.  Almost "
"guaranteed to get your hands all covered in charcoal.  Activate it to write "
"something down."
msgstr "即席の鉛筆として使える、尖らせた木炭です。使うと文字を書き記せますが、手が真っ黒になりそうですが、"

#. ~ Description of "rollmat"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A sheet of foam which can be rolled tightly for storage.  It insulates you "
"from the floor, making it easier to sleep.  Use it to unroll and place on "
"the ground."
msgstr "丸めて持ち運べるあるウレタン製のマットです。断熱効果があり、床に敷いておくと寝心地が良くなります。使用すると地面に広げます。"

#. ~ Description of "bicycle horn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A simple bulb horn found on many bicycles.  Activate it to honk.  Honk honk."
msgstr "多くの自転車に搭載されている、シンプルな電球型のホーンです。使用すると音を鳴らします。パフッパフッ。"

#. ~ Description of "grip hook"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A simple steel hook with a circular steel handle."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "aluminum stepladder (folded)"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A single-story aluminum A-frame ladder, collapsed for transport or storage."
"  Activate it to set it up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "wooden stepladder (folded)"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A single-story wooden A-frame ladder, collapsed for transport or storage.  "
"Activate it to set it up."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "plastic gasket"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A single-use plastic gasket."
msgstr "使い捨ての可塑性シール材です。"

#. ~ Description of "compressed air horn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A small can of compressed air attached to a plastic horn.  Pressing the "
"button on top causes it to emit a loud honking sound."
msgstr "小型の圧縮空気ボンベにプラスチック製のホーンが取り付けられています。上部のボタンを押すと大音量の警笛を鳴らします。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic pail"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A small plastic bucket, the kind of thing a child might have built "
"sandcastles with."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "vortex stone"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A stone with spirals all over it and holes around its perimeter.  Though it "
"is fairly large, it weighs next to nothing.  Air seems to gather around it."
msgstr "渦巻き模様と小さな穴で覆われた石です。かなりの大きさですが、まったく重く感じません。周囲に空気が集まってきているように見えます。"

#. ~ Description of "entrenching tool"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A stout, collapsible spade.  It's commonly used by military forces and "
"favored by hikers for digging."
msgstr "折り畳める頑丈なシャベルです。軍隊でよく使われており、穴を掘りやすいためハイカーにも人気があります。"

#. ~ Description of "telescoping umbrella (extended)"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A telescoping umbrella currently in its extended form, useful for keeping "
"dry when wielded.  May be collapsed down for easy storage."
msgstr "伸ばして広げた状態の折り畳み傘です。装備すれば雨が降っても身体が濡れません。使用すると小さく折り畳みます。"

#. ~ Description of "telescoping umbrella (collapsed)"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A telescoping umbrella which has been collapsed down for easy storage.  May "
"be used to keep dry when extended and wielded."
msgstr "小さく畳んだ状態の折り畳み傘です。広げて装備すれば、雨が降っても身体が濡れません。"

#. ~ Description of "truck horn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "A very loud horn, usually found on large trucks like semis."
msgstr "トレーラーなどの大型トラックに搭載されている、非常に騒々しいクラクションです。"

#. ~ Description of "alarm clock"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A wind-up alarm clock.  Though the noise it makes is unpleasant to wake up "
"to, it's always good to get an early start to your day.  Can also be "
"disassembled into some useful parts."
msgstr "ねじ巻き式の目覚まし時計です。不快な音がしますが、早起きは三文の徳とも言います。解体する事が可能です。"

#. ~ Description of "notched stick"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"A wooden stick with notches cut into it, used with a fire drill to create "
"embers."
msgstr "溝が入った木の棒です。火起こし器を使って火口を作る際に使います。"

#. ~ Description of "bug spray"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"An aerosol canister of pesticides that promises to kill ants, roaches, and "
"spiders in seconds."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "rubber sealant spray"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"An aerosol spray can that contains (if there's any left) quick-drying liquid"
" butyl rubber, which can be sprayed onto fabric and other materials to make "
"them waterproof, or onto surfaces like spraypaint."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "spraypaint"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"An aerosol spray can used to store paint under pressure.  Activate it to "
"make graffiti on the floor."
msgstr "塗料が入ったスプレー缶です。使用すると地形に文字を書きます。"

#. ~ Description of "crystal urn"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"An exquisite, translucent container for cremated ashes, decorated with "
"floral patterns."
msgstr "火葬した遺灰を入れる、花模様の装飾が施された優美な半透明の容器です。"

#. ~ Description of "pocket watch"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid ""
"An old-fashioned pocket watch.  Tells the time and looks good doing it.  Can"
" also be disassembled into some useful parts."
msgstr "時刻を確認できる、お洒落で古風な懐中時計です。解体すれば部品を入手できます。"

#. ~ Description of "umbrella"
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "An umbrella with a pointy end, useful for keeping dry when wielded."
msgstr "先がとがった傘です。手に持つと濡れずに済みます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/misc.json
msgid "C-4 payload"
msgid_plural "C-4 payloads"
msgstr[0] "C4爆弾積載物"

