#. ~ Description of "tarp raincatcher"
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid ""
"A collection of sticks and string with a tarpaulin to set up as an "
"improvised raincatcher."
msgstr "棒と防水シートを組み合わせた、即席の設置式集水器です。"

#. ~ Description of "metal funnel"
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid ""
"A large metal funnel used to collect rainwater.  Less portable than plastic "
"funnels, but collects more water.  Use it outside and place a container "
"beneath it to collect water when it rains."
msgstr ""
"雨水を集める金属製の大きな漏斗です。プラスチック製の漏斗より嵩張りますが、水をより多く集められます。使用して屋外に設置し、同じ場所に容器を置いておけば、雨が降ったときに水が溜まります。"

#. ~ Description of "funnel"
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid ""
"A plastic funnel used to collect rainwater.  Use it outside and place a "
"container beneath it to collect water when it rains."
msgstr "雨水を集めるプラスチック製の漏斗です。使用して屋外に設置し、同じ場所に容器を置いておけば、雨が降ったときに水が溜まります。"

#. ~ Description of "birchbark funnel"
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid ""
"A small birchbark funnel.  Place it above an outdoor container to collect "
"rainwater."
msgstr "樹皮製の小さな漏斗です。容器を置いた屋外の地形に設置すると、雨水を集めます。"

#. ~ Description of "leather funnel"
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid ""
"A small leather funnel used to collect rainwater.  Use it outside and place "
"a container beneath it to collect water when it rains."
msgstr "雨水を集める革製の小さな漏斗です。使用して屋外に設置し、同じ場所に容器を置いておけば、雨が降ったときに水が溜まります。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift funnel"
#: data/json/items/tool/raincatchers.json
msgid ""
"A small makeshift funnel used to collect rainwater.  Use it outside and "
"place a container beneath it to collect water when it rains."
msgstr "雨水を集める手製の小さな漏斗です。使用して屋外に設置し、同じ場所に容器を置いておけば、雨が降ったときに水が溜まります。"

#. ~ "done_message" action message of item "birchbark funnel"
