#. ~ Description of "bone sewing awl"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A crude, sharpened bone awl, used for leatherworking before metal was "
"discovered.  It can also serve as an improvised stabbing weapon, but will "
"break quickly."
msgstr ""
"骨を尖らせて作った簡易的な千枚通しです。金属が発見される前の時代に、革の加工に使われていました。即席の刺突武器としても使えますが、すぐに壊れてしまいそうです。"

#. ~ Description of "curved needle"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A curved, sharp needle made of steel.  Its rounded shape allows it to make "
"stitches that only pierce one side of the material.  While unsuitable for "
"most tailoring projects, it's a necessity for stitching neoprene."
msgstr ""
"弧を描くように曲がった針です。この形状のお陰で、素材の片面だけに糸を通せます。通常の裁縫には使いにくい針ですが、ネオプレンを縫うことができます。"

#. ~ Description of "electric spinwheel"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A device for spinning thread or yarn from fibers.  This particular model is "
"electrically-powered and easily portable."
msgstr "繊維から糸を紡ぐ装置です。これは電動式で、簡単に持ち運べます。"

#. ~ Description of "tailor's kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A high-quality kit consisting of a variety of needles, some plastic spools "
"for thread, scissors and shears, and an awl.  Use a tailor's kit on an "
"article of clothing to attempt to repair or refit if applicable.  This uses "
"your tailoring skill."
msgstr ""
"数本の針、プラスチック製の糸巻き、普通のハサミと毛刈りハサミ、千枚通しが入った、高品質の裁縫セットです。使用すると、裁縫スキルを活用して衣服の修復や仕立て直しを試みます。"

#. ~ Description of "Kevlar shears"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A pair of heavy-duty shears suitable for cutting particularly tough "
"materials, from polyaramid fabrics to tough plastics and thin metals.  The "
"blades feature flat shearing edges and fine serrations."
msgstr "ポリアラミド繊維や強靭なプラスチック、薄い金属板などの硬い素材の切断に特化した、頑丈なハサミです。刃の一部は細かい鋸歯状になっています。"

#. ~ Description of "knitting needles"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A pair of stout wooden needles with round ends, used to turn thread and yarn"
" into cloth."
msgstr "先端部が尖っていない、2本の頑丈な木製の針です。糸や毛糸を編むために使います。"

#. ~ Description of "sewing kit"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A plastic kit with a variety of needles, some plastic spools for thread, "
"small scissors, and a few other useful textile tools.  Use a sewing kit on "
"an article of clothing to attempt to repair or refit if applicable.  This "
"uses your tailoring skill."
msgstr ""
"数本の針、プラスチック製の糸巻き、小さなハサミなどの裁縫に役立つ道具が入った、プラスチック製の裁縫セットです。使用すると、裁縫スキルを活用して衣服の修復や仕立て直しを試みます。"

#. ~ Description of "frame loom"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A rather bulky and primitive wooden frame which can be used to weave cloth "
"sheets.  The process is very slow, though."
msgstr "原始的な木製のフレームです。生地を織るために使いますが、作業には非常に時間がかかります。"

#. ~ Description of "bone needle"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A sharp needle made from a bone.  Useful for making rough clothing and "
"items.  Its low quality makes it rather unsuitable for anything requiring "
"speed or precision."
msgstr "骨で作った鋭い針です。簡単な服や小物を作るのに便利ですが、即席の道具なので、速度や制度が必要な作業には不向きです。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden shed stick"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A short, thin, flat wooden stick, used as a tool while weaving cloth with a "
"frame loom."
msgstr "フレーム織機で布を織る際に使う、短く平らな木の棒です。"

#. ~ Description of "needle"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A stainless steel needle.  It would be useful for making clothing and items."
msgstr "ステンレス製の針です。衣服などのアイテム製作に役立ちそうです。"

#. ~ Description of "steel sewing awl"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A steel awl with a wooden grip, usually used for leatherworking.  It can "
"also serve as an improvised stabbing weapon, but will break quickly."
msgstr "木製の柄を取り付けた鋼鉄製の千枚通しです。主に革細工に使います。即席の刺突武器としても使えますが、すぐに壊れてしまいそうです。"

#. ~ Description of "tanning leather hide"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A treated animal hide that is undergoing the chemical processes required to "
"become leather.  You will be able to activate it to unroll and make use of "
"it when it is done."
msgstr "素材として使うために必要な化学処理を施した動物の皮です。使用すると革を広げ、他の用途に使える状態にします。"

#. ~ Description of "tanning fur pelt"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A treated animal pelt that is undergoing the chemical processes required to "
"become fur.  You will be able to activate it to unroll and make use of it "
"when it is done."
msgstr "素材として使うために必要な化学処理を施した動物の毛皮です。使用すると毛皮を広げ、他の用途に使える状態にします。"

#. ~ Description of "wooden needle"
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid ""
"A wooden needle whittled down to a sharp point.  It has a narrow hole carved"
" into the head for threading.  Its low quality makes it rather unsuitable "
"for anything requiring speed or precision, or involving tougher materials "
"like Kevlar."
msgstr ""
"木を削って尖らせた針です。一方の先端には小さな穴が開いており、糸を通せます。即席の道具なので、速度や精度が必要な作業や、ケブラーなどの硬い素材の加工には不向きです。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "Kevlar shears"
msgid_plural "pairs of Kevlar shears"
msgstr[0] "生地(ケブラー)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "bone needle"
msgid_plural "bone needles"
msgstr[0] "針(骨)"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
msgid "bone sewing awl"
msgid_plural "bone sewing awls"
msgstr[0] "千枚通し(骨)"

#. ~ Name of tool quality "SEW_CURVED"
#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json data/json/tool_qualities.json
msgid "curved needle"
msgid_plural "curved needles"
msgstr[0] "湾曲針"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/json/items/tool/tailoring.json
