#. ~ Description of "chainsaw (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "This chainsaw is on and making a lot of noise.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "チェーンソーは大きな騒音を立てて動いています。使用すると電源を切ります。"

#. ~ Description of "electric chainsaw (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"This electric chainsaw is on and making a lot of noise.  Use it to turn it "
"off."
msgstr "電動チェーンソーは大きな騒音を立てて動いています。使用すると電源を切ります。"

#. ~ Description of "pole saw (on)"
#: data/json/items/tool/woodworking.json
msgid "This pole saw is on and making a lot of noise.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "ポールソーは大きな騒音を立てて動いています。使用すると電源を切ります。"

#. ~ value of variable 'success_message' in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_toolweapon_activate__circsaw" in use action of item "circular saw
