#. ~ Description of variant "ant plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A ant plushie with a sturdy, hard yet soft shell mimic, and big, inquisitive"
" eyes."
msgstr "柔らかい布で頑丈そうな外殻を模した、好奇心旺盛な大きな瞳をもつアリのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Canadian lynx plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A beautiful, cute and cuddly hypoallergenic Canadian lynx plushie with a "
"ruff of fur around the neck, big whiskers, and a playful attitude."
msgstr ""
"美しく、愛らしく、低アレルギー素材が使われている、思わず抱きしめたくなるカナダオオヤマネコのぬいぐるみです。首の周りの発達した毛並み、長いヒゲ、好奇心旺盛な表情が特徴的です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "komodo dragon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A big komodo dragon plushie with textured yet soft light brown scales, big, "
"friendly eyes, and an adorable snout.  Extremely huggable."
msgstr ""
"フワフワした質感ながらリアルな見た目の薄茶色の鱗、大きく人懐こそうな瞳、愛らしい鼻面が特徴的な、思わず抱きしめたくなる大きなコモドオオトカゲのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "walrus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A big, soft and cuddly walrus plushie with fluffy brown fur, cute, soft "
"tusks, and big, wise soulful eyes."
msgstr "フワフワの茶色の毛皮、柔らかく愛らしい牙、賢そうな大きな目を備えた、思わず抱きしめたくなる大きく柔らかいセイウチのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "mosasaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A blue-grayish, large, chubby mosasaurus plushie with a friendly smile, big "
"eyes and soft flippers."
msgstr "大きくぽっちゃりした体形の、青みがかった灰色のモササウルスのぬいぐるみです。人懐っこそうな笑顔と大きな瞳、柔らかいヒレが特徴的です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "elasmosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A blueish, large, long-necked elasmosaurus plushie with a cute and friendly "
"expression.  It is very soft and huggable."
msgstr "首が大きく長い、青色のエラスモサウルスのぬいぐるみです。愛らしく親しみやすい表情をしており、非常に柔らかく思わず抱きしめたくなります。"

#. ~ Description of variant "plesiosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A blueish, soft and friendly plesiosaurus plushie with big floppy flippers, "
"a long neck and a cute, gentle expression."
msgstr "だらりと垂れた大きなヒレと長い首、キュートで優しい表情が特徴的な、青みがかった色のフワフワした優しそうなプレシオサウルスのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "bullfrog plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A bullfrog plushie with soft, green, and bumpy skin, big, playful eyes, and "
"typical frog legs.  This plushie produces realistic croaking sounds when "
"squeezed and a special texture that makes it fun to squeeze and manipulate."
msgstr ""
"凹凸がある柔らかい緑色の体表、好奇心旺盛な大きい目、カエルらしい発達した後ろ足が特徴的な、ウシガエルのぬいぐるみです。強く握ると本物によく似た音が鳴るようになっており、その特殊な質感も相まって、触ると楽しい気分になれます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "cayman plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cayman (some kind of dwarf crocodile) plushie with soft, light green skin,"
" big, playful eyes, and a cute smile.  This plushie has superior cuddly and "
"fluffy features, making it the perfect companion for bedtime snuggles."
msgstr ""
"柔らかい薄緑色の肌、陽気でつぶらな瞳、キュートな笑顔が特徴的な、カイマン(小型のワニの一種)のぬいぐるみです。思わず抱きしめたくなるフワフワの手触りは、就寝時のお供に最適です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "centipede plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A centipede plushie with soft, colorful segments and big, playful eyes.  "
"This plushie has a special climbing mechanism that lets it crawl over and "
"cling to objects."
msgstr "柔らかく鮮やかな胴、好奇心旺盛な大きな瞳が特徴的な、ムカデのぬいぐるみです。節に特殊な仕組みがあり、何かに巻き付けた状態で固定できます。"

#. ~ Description of "plastic scythe"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cheap plastic toy made to look like the Grim Reaper's scythe.  Let the "
"harvest begin."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "gavial plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddling gavial plushie with a soft body and long snout, with a playful "
"expression.  It has a chomping action when the tail is pulled, letting "
"people, specially children, playfully recreate the gavial's hunting tactics."
"  Don't worry, it is a complex system of cotton ligaments."
msgstr ""
"柔らかい手触りと長い鼻面、陽気な表情を備えた、思わず抱きしめたくなるガビアルのぬいぐるみです。尻尾を引っ張ると口が大きく開くようになっており、子供が遊びながら本物のガビアルの狩りについて学ぶことができます。綿の紐を複雑に結び合わせて作り上げた仕掛けなので、壊れる心配はありません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "gorilla plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly and adorable gorilla plushie with soft, black fur, big eyes, and a "
"friendly expression."
msgstr "柔らかい黒色の毛皮、大きな目、フレンドリーな表情が特徴的な、思わず抱きしめたくなるほど愛らしいゴリラのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "scarab beetle plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly and adorable scarab plushie with soft, brown fur and big, friendly "
"eyes.  This plushie features a special iridescent finish that makes it "
"faintly sparkle and shimmer like a real scarab beetle."
msgstr ""
"柔らかい茶色の体表、大きく愛らしい目が特徴的な、抱きしめたくなるほど愛らしいコガネムシのぬいぐるみです。表面に特殊加工が施されており、本物のコガネムシのようにキラキラと虹色に輝きます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "turkey plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly and big wild turkey plushie with brown cotton faux feathers, a "
"prominent, soft beak, and expressive, soulful eyes.  It has a special "
"feature of making gobbling sounds when squeezed, almost perfectly mimicking "
"the turkey's unique calls."
msgstr ""
"綿でできた茶色の羽毛、派手な柔らかいくちばし、表情豊かな瞳をもつ、抱きしめたくなるほど大きなシチメンチョウのぬいぐるみです。押すとゴロゴロと音を立てる仕掛けが備わっており、シチメンチョウの鳴き声をほぼ完璧に再現しています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "bald eagle plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly and majestic bald eagle plushie with soft, brown and white cotton "
"faux feathers, a hooked, soft beak, and a patriotic expression.  It has a "
"pair of special eyes that glow as brightly as the stars and stripes of Old "
"Glory, the perfect partner to fend off your enemies in the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""
"羽毛を模した茶色と白の綿、鉤状に曲がった柔らかいくちばし、そして愛国的な表情を備えた、思わず抱きしめたくなるような威厳あるハクトウワシのぬいぐるみです。星条旗のように力強く輝く瞳を称えたこのぬいぐるみは、大変動後の国を守る者にぴったりの相棒と言えます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "chameleon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly and soft chameleon plushie that can change colors, complete with "
"big, round eyes and a cute expression.  This plushie's soft body has a "
"simple color-changing mechanism on its fabric, that changes from green to "
"brown if you pet it properly, enabling people, especially children, to "
"explore and learn about the biology of this fascinating reptile."
msgstr ""
"大きくつぶらな瞳と愛らしい表情が特徴的な、色が変わるフワフワのカメレオンのぬいぐるみです。表面の布地には、一定方向に撫でると緑色から茶色に変化する単純な仕掛けが施されており、子供が遊びながらこの魅力的な爬虫類の生態を学べるようになっています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "snowy owl plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly and wise-looking snowy owl plushie with fluffy white cotton faux "
"feathers, orange eyes, and a cute expression.  .It features a special light-"
"up effect, mimicking the way the snowy owl's eyes glow brightly in the dark."
msgstr ""
"綿でできたフワフワの白い羽毛とオレンジ色の目、愛らしい表情を備えた、可愛らしく賢そうなシロフクロウのぬいぐるみです。暗闇で目立つ瞳を再現するために、目がうっすらと光るようになっています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "blue whale plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly blue whale plushie with soft blue-gray fur and a playful "
"expression."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "dromedary plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly camel plushie with a single humps, tan fur, and big soulful eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "camel plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly camel plushie with two soft humps, tan fur, and big soulful eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "common loon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly common loon plushie with soft, black-and-white cotton faux feathers"
" and a pleasing expression.  Its head can bob and turn to mimic the loon's "
"distinctive courtship calls."
msgstr ""
"羽毛を模した柔らかい白黒の綿と楽しそうな表情を備えた、思わず抱きしめたくなるハシグロアビのぬいぐるみです。頭部を上下に動かしたり回転させたりできる作りになっており、アビの特徴的な求愛行動を模倣できます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "duck plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly duck plushie with soft, yellow cotton faux feathers, cute orange "
"feet, and a lovable quack.  This plushie has special water-repellent "
"properties to make it float in water, just like a real duck!"
msgstr ""
"綿でできた柔らかい黄色の羽毛、可愛らしいオレンジ色の足、愛嬌のある表情が特徴的な、思わず抱きしめたくなるアヒルのぬいぐるみです。特殊な撥水加工が施されており、まるで本物のアヒルのように水に浮かべて遊べます！"

#. ~ Description of variant "harbor seal plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly harbor seal plushie with soft, grayish fur and big, soulful eyes.  "
"It features a realistic texture that mimics the soft and textural quality of"
" real seals' fur."
msgstr ""
"柔らかい灰色がかった体毛と生き生きとした大きな瞳が特徴的な、かわいいゼニガタアザラシのぬいぐるみです。毛並みは本物のアザラシを再現しており、質感が非常にリアルです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "iguana plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly iguana plushie with soft green scales, big eyes, and a friendly, "
"curious expression.  It possess a special ribbed texture to mimic the skin "
"of a real iguana."
msgstr ""
"柔らかい緑色の鱗、大きな目、好奇心旺盛で親しみやすい表情が特徴的な、可愛らしいイグアナのぬいぐるみです。特殊なヒダがある表面は本物のイグアナの質感を再現しています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "peregrine falcon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly peregrine falcon plushie with soft, brown and white cotton faux "
"feathers, a soft hooked beak, and an alert expression.  With a speedy and "
"sleek plushie design, this toy plushie is sure to take imaginative people on"
" make-believe high-flying chase scenes!"
msgstr ""
"羽毛を模した茶色と白の綿、鉤状に曲がった柔らかいくちばし、そして警戒心の高そうな表情を備えた、思わず抱きしめたくなるハヤブサのぬいぐるみです。素早く飛び回れそうな洗練されたデザインは、想像力豊かな人であれば思わず空中戦のごっこ遊びを始めてしまうことでしょう！"

#. ~ Description of variant "moose plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly plushie of the mighty moose, with soft brown fur, floppy ears, and "
"big antlers.  It has a special huggability feature that makes it "
"delightfully squishy, perfect for comforting cuddles."
msgstr ""
"柔らかい茶色の毛皮、垂れた耳、大きな角をもつ、巨大なヘラジカのぬいぐるみです。その心地よいフワフワとした触り心地は格別で、気持ちよく抱きしめられます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "lobster plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cuddly red lobster plushie with a soft red shell and big playful eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "alligator plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cute alligator plushie with soft green skin, big round eyes, and a playful"
" expression.  This plushie features glowing eyes that change color in the "
"dark, adding an eerie and mysterious touch to its playful design."
msgstr ""
"柔らかい緑色の皮、つぶらな瞳、お茶目な表情が可愛らしいアリゲーターのぬいぐるみです。目が暗闇でぼんやり光るようになっており、陽気な外見にどこか不気味で神秘的な雰囲気を加えています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "alpaca plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cute alpaca plushie featuring soft, curly fur in shades of white and "
"brown."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "gecko plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cute and colorful gecko plushie with soft, vibrant skin and big, playful "
"eyes.  This plushie has a special cotton-based internal mechanism that makes"
" its tail wiggle and move playfully when squeezed enough, just like a real "
"lizard's tail."
msgstr ""
"柔らかくハリのある体表、好奇心旺盛な大きな瞳をもつ、キュートでカラフルなヤモリのぬいぐるみです。内部には綿製の機構が備わっており、強く握ると尻尾が本物の爬虫類のように小刻みに震えます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "chimpanzee plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cute and cuddly chimpanzee plushie with soft, brown fur, big, curious "
"eyes, and a playful expression."
msgstr "柔らかい茶色の毛並み、好奇心旺盛な大きい目、陽気な表情が特徴的な、思わず抱きしめたくなるほど愛らしいチンパンジーのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "toad plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cute and cuddly toad plushie with soft, bumpy green skin, big eyes, and a "
"gentle expression.  This plushie features a special scent that captures the "
"earthy and musky aroma of a damp forest floor, not that everyone will like "
"it."
msgstr ""
"凹凸がある柔らかい緑色の体表、大きな瞳、キュートな優しい表情が特徴的な、思わず抱きしめたくなるヒキガエルのぬいぐるみです。湿気の多い森の土とジャコウの香りを混ぜたような特殊な香料が染み込ませてありますが、誰もが好む匂いという訳ではありません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "kitty plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cute and lovable domestic kitty plushie with soft, plush fur, big, round "
"eyes, and a gentle expression.  You can't tell if it is a short-haired one "
"or a long-haired one."
msgstr "フワフワの毛並み、大きくつぶらな瞳、優しい表情が愛らしい子猫のぬいぐるみです。短毛種なのか長毛種なのか、判別できません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "ladybug plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cute and lovable ladybug plushie with soft, red and black polkadotted "
"wings and big, friendly eyes.  This plushie features a special retractable "
"spotted soft wing mechanic sewed directly into the body that gives it the "
"authentic appearance of a ladybug about to fly."
msgstr ""
"赤と黒の水玉模様のフワフワした外羽と優しそうな大きな瞳をもつ、愛らしいテントウムシのぬいぐるみです。斑点模様の外羽の下には柔らかい後翅が格納されており、今にも飛び立とうとしている姿を本物そっくりに再現できます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "screech owl plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cute and wise-looking eastern screech owl plushie with big, round eyes and"
" soft, tan cotton faux feathers.  It has a soft and silky texture, making it"
" an excellent sensory object for people, specially children, to play and "
"explore while they navigate the world around them."
msgstr ""
"大きく丸い目と、綿でできた柔らかい黄褐色の羽毛を備えた、可愛らしく賢そうなアメリカオオコノハズクのぬいぐるみです。柔らかい羽毛は絹のように滑らかで、子供がこのぬいぐるみを飛び回らせながら辺りを探索し、感覚を刺激するにはうってつけのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "striped skunk plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cute striped skunk plushie with soft, black-and-white fur and a playful "
"expression.  Ironically, it has a weak, pleasant pine scent."
msgstr "白黒の柔らかな毛並みと好奇心旺盛な表情が可愛らしい、シマスカンクのぬいぐるみです。皮肉なことに、心地よいマツの木の香りがします。"

#. ~ Description of variant "chipmunk plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A cute, adorable eastern chipmunk plushie with soft, reddish-brown fur and "
"big eyes.  It features a harmless, special crinkly texture that mimics the "
"sound of chipmunks rustling in the leaves."
msgstr ""
"赤茶色の柔らかな毛並みと大きな瞳が特徴的な、利口そうで愛らしいトウブシマリスのぬいぐるみです。特殊な質感の素材が使われており、触るとシマリスが枯れ葉の中で動き回るような耳に心地のいい音を立てます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "ankylosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A cute, squat ankylosaurus plushie with a spiky tail and soft plating."
msgstr "尻尾の棘も全身の甲殻も柔らかい、ずんぐりとした可愛いアンキロサウルスのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "zombie teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A dark green teddy bear with stylized stitches all over and X's for eyes.  "
"The perfect size for a small child to hug the unlife out of.  Looks like the"
" zombie apocalypse hit the toy store shelves first."
msgstr ""
"全身に縫い跡が残り目はX字になっている、ダークグリーンのテディベアです。小さな子供が抱きしめるのに丁度いいサイズです。ゾンビの侵攻はおもちゃ屋の棚から始まっていたのかもしれませんね。"

#. ~ Description of variant "iguanodon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A earth-brown, huggable and soft iguanodon plushie with a friendly smile and"
" soft, round features."
msgstr "思わず抱きしめたくなる優しい笑顔と柔らかく丸い顔立ちが特徴的な、土色をしたフワフワのイグアノドンのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of "fidget spinner"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A fidget spinner.  An artifact from when the times were simpler."
msgstr "時代がもっとシンプルだった頃の遺物です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "allosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A fierce-looking allosaurus plushie with a soft, huggable body and clean "
"white teeth."
msgstr "真っ白な白い歯が生えており顔つきが精悍な、思わず抱きしめたくなるフワフワしたアロサウルスのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "carnotaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A fierce-looking, but extremely soft carnotaurus plushie with a brightly-"
"colored snout and a pair of round, soft horns."
msgstr "鮮やかな色の鼻と丸みを帯びた一対の柔らかい角が特徴的な、獰猛な見た目と裏腹にとてもフワフワしているカルノタウルスのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "unicorn figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A figurine of a blue unicorn.  It is in a sitting position, shyly covering "
"both eyes with its front hooves."
msgstr "青色のユニコーンのフィギュアです。座った状態で、恥ずかしそうに前足で両目を覆っています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "mermaid figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A figurine of a redheaded mermaid sitting on a rock.  Like in the film this "
"toy is based on, she gazes longingly out to a world she wants to be a part "
"of - or she would be, but the face isn't drawn very well and doesn't express"
" much emotion at all."
msgstr ""
"岩の上に座る赤毛の人魚のフィギュアです。このデザインの元になった映画と同じように、外の世界を思い描き憧れの表情を浮かべている筈なのですが、顔があまり上手く描かれていないため、無表情に見えます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "swamp monster figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A figurine of a scaly green swamp monster emerging from some fetid lagoon."
msgstr "腐った沼から姿を現している、鱗で覆われた緑色のスワンプモンスターのフィギュアです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "swordsman figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A figurine of some unnamed swordsman, covered with scars and equipped with "
"sturdy leather armor.  Seems to be ready to fight."
msgstr "頑丈そうな革鎧を身に着けた、傷だらけの名もなき剣士のフィギュアです。闘志を燃やしているようです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "opabinia plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A fluffy and colorful opabinia plushie with a cute, unconventional design, "
"with a lengthy hollow proboscis ending in a single, long and soft 'claw' "
"extending out of its head that's topped with five eyes on stalks.  Its "
"segmented body is colored a mix of light pink and white while its tail bears"
" purple stripes."
msgstr ""
"体の先端から一本の長く柔らかい「鉤爪」が伸びているという一風変わった愛らしい姿をした、フワフワとした色鮮やかなオパビニアのぬいぐるみです。5つの目は飛び出しており、体表は淡いピンクと白が混ざった派手な色に塗られています。肢には豪華な紫色の縞模様が入っており、大きな瞳に優しい表情を浮かべています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sanctacaris plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A fluffy and colorful sanctacaris plushie, the great great grandfather of "
"all arthropods.  It has a soft, chubby body, multiple soft legs, and eyes on"
" stalks.  Its plush is light blue colored, with accents of shimmering purple"
" on its legs and details on the body.  It has big, round eyes with a cute "
"and friendly expression."
msgstr ""
"あらゆる節足動物の祖先にあたる、フワフワで鮮やかなサンクタカリスのぬいぐるみです。丸みを帯びた胴と複数の肢は柔らかく、目は飛び出しています。体表はライトブルーで、肢や胴の一部はきらびやかな紫色です。つぶらな瞳に愛らしく親しみやすい表情を浮かべています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "mutt puppy plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A fluffy and cuddly plushie of a mutt puppy with soft, fuzzy fur, big, round"
" eyes, and a playful expression."
msgstr "柔らかいフワフワの毛並み、大きく丸い目、好奇心旺盛な表情が特徴的な、思わず抱きしめたくなるミックス犬の子犬のぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "rooster plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A fun and colorful rooster plushie with soft, vibrantly colored cotton faux "
"feathers, a long rooster tail, and a bold expression."
msgstr "綿でできた柔らかく鮮やかな羽毛、長い尾羽、勇敢そうな表情が特徴的な、愉快でカラフルなオンドリのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "termite plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A fun and colorful termite plushie with big, curious eyes and furry antenna."
msgstr "毛の生えた触角と好奇心旺盛な大きな瞳が特徴的な、陽気でカラフルなシロアリのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "baboon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A fun and playful baboon plushie with soft, brown fur and big, colorful feet"
" and cute expression.  Like almost all baboons, this one has a red butt and "
"can grip and hold small objects with its soft, plush hands."
msgstr ""
"柔らかい茶色の毛皮、発達した色鮮やかな足、愛らしい表情が特徴的な、陽気なヒヒのぬいぐるみです。実際のヒヒのように尻は赤く、柔らかい手は小さな物を掴んで持てる作りになっています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "velociraptor plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A furry velociraptor plushie with oversized eyes and little claws.  It has a"
" very friendly demeanor."
msgstr "大きな目と小さな爪をもつ、フワフワしたヴェロキラプトルのぬいぐるみです。これなら友達になれそうです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "aphid plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A giant aphid plushie with soft, textured green skin and big, curious eyes."
"  This plushie features a special attachment mechanism that lets it cling "
"and crawl on flat surfaces, just like a real aphid."
msgstr ""
"ザラザラした柔らかい緑色の体表と、好奇心旺盛な大きな瞳が特徴的な、巨大なアブラムシのぬいぐるみです。肢に特殊な機構が備わっており、本物のアブラムシのように平らな面にしがみつかせることができます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "goose plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A goose plushie with soft, white cotton faux feathers, a cute and soft "
"orange beak, and big, playful eyes.  This plushie produces realistic honking"
" sounds when hugged!"
msgstr ""
"綿でできた柔らかい白色の羽毛とオレンジ色のくちばし、好奇心旺盛な大きな瞳が特徴的なガンのぬいぐるみです。抱きしめると、本物のガンの鳴き声によく似た音が鳴ります！"

#. ~ Description of variant "baryonix plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A grayish, soft and cute baryonix plushie with a big head and small arms, it"
" is holding a fish, probably saving it for later."
msgstr "大きな爪と小さな腕をもつ、優しそうな表情の可愛らしいスピノサウルスのぬいぐるみです。手に魚を抱えていますが、後で食べるのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Description of variant "dilophosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A greenish, playful, smiling dilophosaurus plushie with a cute frilled "
"collar and a long, curly and soft tail."
msgstr "楽しそうな笑みを浮かべる、緑色のディロフォサウルスのぬいぐるみです。首には可愛らしいフリルが付いており、柔らかく長い尻尾が丸まっています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "spider monkey plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A huggable and cute spider monkey plushie with soft, brown fur and long, "
"playful arms with big, curious eyes."
msgstr "柔らかい茶色の毛皮、好奇心旺盛な大きな瞳、発達した長い腕をもつ、抱きしめたくなるほど愛らしいクモザルのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "humpback whale plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A huggable humpback whale plushie with soft gray and white fur and big "
"friendly eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "jacare plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A jacare (or yacare, kind of a South American crocodile) plushie with soft "
"sandy brown scales, a soft plush belly, and an adorable expression.  This "
"plushies has a special scented feature that makes it smell just like a warm "
"and tropical Brazilian jungle."
msgstr ""
"砂茶色の柔らかい鱗、フワフワのお腹、愛らしい表情が特徴的な、ジャカレ(別名ヤカレ、南米に生息するワニの一種)のぬいぐるみです。特別な香料が染み込ませてあり、暑いブラジルのジャングルのような匂いがします。"

#. ~ Description of variant "mech figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large figurine of a humanoid robot, armed with a rifle, with a smaller "
"figure sitting inside the head."
msgstr "ライフルで武装した人型ロボットの大きなフィギュアです。頭部に小さな人形が座っています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "knight figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large figurine of a knight in shining armor standing watch, with its sword"
" planted at the ground at its feet."
msgstr "きらびやかな鎧を身に着けた騎士の大きなフィギュアです。騎士は足元の地面に剣を突き立てて仁王立ちしています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "video game figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large figurine of a videogame character, holding a massive gatling gun in "
"his giant arms."
msgstr "巨大な腕で巨大なガトリングガンを構えている、テレビゲームのキャラクターの大きなフィギュアです。"

#. ~ Description of "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large manufactured figurine.  This is the default variant, if you see it "
"something went wrong."
msgstr "市販の大型フィギュアです。これは既定のバリエーションであり、通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "ferret plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large plush ferret with cute beady eyes."
msgstr "つぶらな瞳がかわいい、大きなフェレットのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "fox plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large plush fox.  It isn't realistic enough to trick a zombie into going "
"after it, but it's very cute and makes a comforting bedtime companion."
msgstr "大きなキツネのぬいぐるみです。ゾンビを騙せるほど本物らしくはありませんが、非常に可愛らしく、就寝時の心強い相棒になってくれます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "rabbit plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large plush rabbit."
msgstr "大きなウサギのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "remora plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large plush remora, a fish commonly seen alongside sharks.  Wait, wasn't "
"there a shark plushie somewhere here…"
msgstr "サメに並んでいる姿が連想される、大きなコバンザメのぬいぐるみです。確か、サメのぬいぐるみもどこかで見たような..."

#. ~ Description of variant "T-rex plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large plush t-rex."
msgstr "大きなティラノサウルス・レックスのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "ichthyostega plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large plushie of your ancestor, the ichthyostega!  It has a long, sturdy, "
"soft body, four soft, fat legs, and a soft fish-like tail.  Its body is "
"extremely soft and fluffy, and has bumpy green skin with lighter green "
"stripes as details.  It presents a cute expression with big, wise eyes."
msgstr ""
"人類の祖先にあたる、大きなイクチオステガのぬいぐるみです！長くがっしりした胴、太い4本の脚、魚のような尾は全て非常に柔らかくフワフワです。凸凹した緑色の体表には、鮮やかな緑色の縞模様が細かく入っています。聡明そうな大きな瞳に優しい表情を浮かべています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "tiktaalik plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large plushie of your ancestor, the tiktaalik!  It has a soft, huggable "
"fish-like body, stubby legs, and paddle-like soft fins.  Its color is a mix "
"of blue-gray soft scales pattern on the back and a plush beige belly.  It "
"has large eyes and a friendly expression."
msgstr ""
"人類の祖先にあたる、大きなティクタアリクのぬいぐるみです。魚に似た体型とずんぐりとした脚、平たく柔らかいヒレは全てフワフワで、思わず抱きしめたくなります。背中は青みがかった灰色の鱗模様、腹は明るいベージュ色をしており、大きな瞳に優しい表情を浮かべています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "pteranodon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A large pteranodon plushie with big wings and adorable eyes."
msgstr "大きな羽と愛嬌のある瞳をもつ、大きなプテラノドンのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "stegosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large stegosaurus plushie with a spiky back and soft, huggable body.  "
"Don't worry, it is completely docile!"
msgstr "背中に柔らかい棘が並んでいる、思わず抱きしめたくなる大きなステゴサウルスのぬいぐるみです。噛みついたりしないので、ご心配なく！"

#. ~ Description of variant "tylosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large, chubby and huggable tylosaurus plushie with a big head and soft "
"fins."
msgstr "大きな頭と柔らかいヒレをもつ、思わず抱きしめたくなるずんぐりとした体形の大きなティロサウルスのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sarcosuchus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large, chubby sarcosuchus plushie with a friendly, toothy grin and "
"adorable snout.  It resembles a crocodile."
msgstr "歯を見せて人懐っこく笑っている、ずんぐりとした大きなサルコスクスのぬいぐるみです。鼻面が発達しており、ワニに似ています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "triceratops plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large, round, cuddly dinosaur plushie with soft horns and a sturdy build."
msgstr "柔らかい角があり体格も立派でずんぐりとしている、思わず抱きしめたくなる大きな恐竜のぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "irritator plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large, soft and colorful reddish orange irritator plushie with a long "
"snout and playful expression."
msgstr "赤みがかったオレンジ色の、大きなフワフワのイリタトルのぬいぐるみです。長い鼻と楽しそうな表情が特徴的です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "archaeopteryx plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A large, soft, fuzzy and colorful archaeopteryx plushie with bird-like "
"features.  His feathers apparently are individually designed and placed."
msgstr "鳥のような特徴をもつ、大きくフワフワでカラフルな始祖鳥のぬいぐるみです。羽は一枚一枚が別のパーツになっており、体表に縫い付けてあります。"

#. ~ Description of variant "diplodocus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A long and floppy diplodocus plushie with a gentle expression and wrinkled "
"skin."
msgstr "優しい表情と皺のある肌が特徴的な、サイズが大きなフワフワしたディプロドクスのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "orangutan plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A lovable and huggable orangutan plushie with soft, orange-brown fur and "
"big, friendly eyes in a big, wise-looking face.  This plushie makes playful "
"and cuddly jungle sounds when squeezed and hugged."
msgstr ""
"柔らかい茶褐色の毛皮、大きく賢そうな顔、優しそうな目が特徴的な、思わず抱きしめたくなるほど愛らしいオランウータンのぬいぐるみです。強く握ると、ジャングルの自然音を模した楽しそうな音が鳴ります。"

#. ~ Description of "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A manufactured plush toy.  This is the default variant, if you see it "
"something went wrong."
msgstr "市販のぬいぐるみです。これは既定のバリエーションであり、通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sloth teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A mass-produced plush black teddy bear with a mark in its face that looks "
"like a pair of white glasses or a white bandit mask.  It is wearing a little"
" white t-shirt and a pajama hat, but no pants."
msgstr ""
"市販されている、体毛が黒色で目元だけが眼鏡か覆面のように白いテディベアです。小さな白いTシャツを着てナイトキャップを被っていますが、ズボンは履いていません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "black teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A mass-produced plush black teddy bear.  It is wearing a little white "
"t-shirt, but no pants."
msgstr "市販されている黒色のテディベアです。小さな白いTシャツを着ていますが、ズボンは履いていません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sun teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A mass-produced plush brown teddy bear with a yellowish snout.  It is "
"wearing a little white t-shirt with a small sun printed on it, but no pants."
msgstr ""
"市販されている、体色が茶色で鼻が黄色っぽいテディベアです。太陽マークがプリントされた小さな白いTシャツを着ていますが、ズボンは履いていません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "grizzly teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A mass-produced plush brown teddy bear.  It is wearing a little red t-shirt "
"but no pants."
msgstr "市販されている茶色のテディベアです。小さな赤いTシャツを着ていますが、ズボンは履いていません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "panda teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A mass-produced plush panda teddy bear.  It is wearing a little gray "
"t-shirt, but no pants."
msgstr "市販されているパンダのぬいぐるみです。小さな灰色のTシャツを着ていますが、ズボンは履いていません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A mass-produced plush teddy bear.  It is wearing a little red t-shirt but no"
" pants."
msgstr "市販されているテディベアです。小さな赤いTシャツを着ていますが、ズボンは履いていません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "polar teddy bear" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A mass-produced plush white teddy bear.  It is wearing a little white puffer"
" jacket, holding a glass of soda, but is wearing no pants."
msgstr "市販されている白色のテディベアです。小さな白いダウンジャケットを羽織り、手にはソーダのグラスを持っていますが、ズボンは履いていません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "zombie figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A nasty looking figurine of a mutant zombie, with a large tongue sprouting "
"from its face.  You thankfully haven't encountered something like that yet."
msgstr "大きな舌を垂らした、不気味なミュータントゾンビのフィギュアです。幸運なことに、このような化け物にはまだ遭遇したことがありません。"

#. ~ Description of "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A normal-sized manufactured figurine.  This is the default variant, if you "
"see it something went wrong."
msgstr "市販のフィギュアです。これは既定のバリエーションであり、通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Description of "buttons and thread"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A pair of mismatched buttons and some dull yellow thread, to put on a brave "
"face with."
msgstr "ぬいぐるみの顔として使えそうな、不揃いなボタンと鈍い黄色の糸です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "fashionable doll" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A plastic figurine of a young woman.  She's meant to be dressed up and "
"accessorized with a wide variety of clothing, sold separately."
msgstr "若い女性のプラスチック製フィギュアです。別売の様々な服やアクセサリーでドレスアップして遊びます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "avocado figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A plastic figurine of an anthropomorphic avocado, holding a salt shaker and "
"a spoon.  Makes a great gift for the guacamole lover in your life, or as a "
"decoration for your kitchen."
msgstr ""
"塩の小瓶とスプーンを持った、擬人化されたアボカドのプラスチック製フィギュアです。ワカモレ好きな人へのプレゼントや、キッチンのインテリアとして最適です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "nightmare figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A plastic figurine with a nightmarish, scarred face.  He wears a hat and has"
" three long blades extending from a glove on the back of his hand."
msgstr ""
"傷だらけの顔をした恐ろしい男性のプラスチック製フィギュアです。帽子とグローブを身に着けており、グローブの手の甲からは3本の長い刃が伸びています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "river otter plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A playful and fuzzy northern river otter plushie with brown fur and a "
"curious expression.  It has a special, state-of-the-art semi-waterproof "
"finish that makes it the perfect bathtub companion for those who love to "
"play with their toys while they get clean."
msgstr ""
"茶色の毛皮と好奇心旺盛な表情が特徴的な、フワフワした陽気なカナダカワウソのぬいぐるみです。毛皮には最先端の特殊防滴加工が施されているため、風呂場でぬいぐるみと遊びたい人にとっては最高の相棒になるでしょう。"

#. ~ Description of variant "suchomimus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A playful and very soft suchomimus plushie with a funny, toothy grin and "
"floppy, soft arms."
msgstr "歯を見せて笑っているような顔つきとフニャフニャの腕が特徴的な、陽気でフワフワしたスコミムスのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "coyote plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A playful eastern coyote plushie with soft, gray and brown fur and a big, "
"curled tail.  It is extremely huggable, but is not realistic enough to trick"
" anyone, yet, it is very cute."
msgstr ""
"柔らかな灰色と茶色の毛皮、丸まった大きな尻尾をもつ、陽気なイースタンコヨーテのぬいぐるみです。本物そっくりというほどリアルではなく、非常に可愛らしいデザインになっており、抱き心地は抜群です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "crow plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A plushie with black fluffy cotton faux feathers, big curious eyes, and an "
"inquisitive expression."
msgstr "綿でできた黒い羽毛、好奇心旺盛な大きい瞳と表情が特徴的な、カラスのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "racoon plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A plushie with soft, black-gray-and-white fur and a curious expression with "
"its iconic bandit mask.  It has a special feature that makes its tails "
"emerge from its hiding spot in the toy, reminiscent of one of the raccoon's "
"greatest attributes."
msgstr ""
"黒、灰色、白の柔らかい毛皮と覆面のような目元の模様をもつ、好奇心旺盛な表情のアライグマのぬいぐるみです。アライグマの最大の特徴とも言える尻尾は、胴がまるごと隠れるほど大きなサイズになっています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "cave bat plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A precious cave bat plushie with soft, black fur, big ears, and somewhat "
"small, curious eyes.  It produces a special squeaker sound effect when "
"squeezed."
msgstr "柔らかい黒色の表皮、大きな耳、好奇心旺盛そうな小さめの瞳が特徴的な、可愛らしいヒナコウモリのぬいぐるみです。強く握ると甲高い音が鳴ります。"

#. ~ Description of variant "llama plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A precious llama plushie with soft, fluffy fur in grayish white.  It has "
"expressive eyes and a tuft of fur on its head."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "chicken plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A precious soft and cuddly chicken plushie with soft, warm brown cotton faux"
" feathers and a gentle expression."
msgstr "綿でできた柔らかく温かみのある茶色の羽毛と優しい表情が特徴的な、思わず抱きしめたくなる非常にフワフワのニワトリのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "deinonychus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A reddish, cuddly deinonychus plushie with white, clean teeth and soft "
"claws.  Apparently, it is smiling."
msgstr "真っ白な美しい歯と柔らかい爪をもつ、赤みがかった可愛いデイノニクスのぬいぐるみです。にっこり笑っているようです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "T-rex figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A relatively large plastic figurine of a T-rex."
msgstr "ティラノサウルス・レックスの比較的大きなプラスチック製フィギュアです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "brontosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A silly, oversized and soft brontosaurus plushie with a long tail, a long "
"neck and a small head with a friendly smile."
msgstr "長い尾と首、優しい笑顔を浮かべる小さな頭が特徴的な、フワフワでとてつもなく大きなブロントサウルスのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of "yoyo"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A simple yoyo on a string.  Now you can be bored with style."
msgstr "紐が付いたシンプルなヨーヨーです。これでは流行に乗り遅れてしまいます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "kronosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A sleek-looking, soft kronosaurus plushie with white dinosaur smile smooth "
"texturized skin and large, cute eyes."
msgstr ""
"滑らかそうな見た目の、フワフワした白いクロノサウルスのぬいぐるみです。滑らかな表面の質感と、笑っているような大きく可愛らしい瞳が特徴的です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "crocodile plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A soft and cuddly crocodile plushie with soft green scales, a big smile, and"
" a long snout.  When squeezed or touched, this plushie produces authentic "
"hissing and growling sounds, just like a real crocodile."
msgstr ""
"柔らかい緑色の鱗、笑っている大きな口、長い鼻面が特徴的な、抱きしめたくなるようなフワフワのクロコダイルのぬいぐるみです。強く握ると、本物のクロコダイルの唸り声に似たシューシューという音が鳴ります。"

#. ~ Description of variant "compsognathus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A soft compsognathus plushie, with a cute and bright appearance like that of"
" a baby dinosaur."
msgstr "恐竜の赤ちゃんのようにも見える、キュートで朗らかな顔つきのコンプソグナトゥスのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "bobcat plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A soft, cute bobcat plushie with a cute, tufted pair of ears, a fluffy tail "
"and soft brown fur.  It has embroidered both soft whiskers and claws that "
"add a touch of realism to its cute and playful design."
msgstr ""
"毛の長い耳、柔らかい尻尾と茶色の毛並みが特徴的な、フワフワした可愛らしいボブキャットのぬいぐるみです。ヒゲと爪は刺繍で表現されており、キュートで愉快なデザインにリアルさを加えています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "flying squirrel plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A soft, playful and fuzzy flying squirrel plushie with brown fur and "
"oversized pair of armwings.  This plushie features almost undetectable "
"special suction cups on its paws that makes it possible to 'climb' and stick"
" to smooth surfaces, mimicking the cuddly creature's real-life abilities."
msgstr ""
"茶色の毛並みと前脚から後脚にかけて張られた大きな飛膜を備えた、フワフワした陽気なモモンガのぬいぐるみです。四肢の先の目立たない位置に特殊な吸盤が付いており、滑らかな場所に貼りつけて「登らせる」ことでこの可愛らしい生き物の実際の生態を模倣できます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "parasaurolophus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A soft, yellowish parasaurolophus plushie with a big crest in the head and "
"cute puppy-dog eyes."
msgstr "頭に大きなとさかが生えており子犬のように可愛らしい目つきをした、黄色がかったフワフワのパラサウロロフスのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of "shark plushie"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A somewhat large, mass produced shark plushie.  Meant to provide comfort to "
"people of all ages."
msgstr "市販されている、かなり大きなサメのぬいぐるみです。幅広い年齢層の人々に癒しを提供します。"

#. ~ Description of variant "black bear plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A somewhat realistic, but still childish black bear plushie with soft, black"
" fur, round ears, and a sweet expression.  It has a warm and fuzzy texture "
"that makes it the perfect companion for snuggles during evenings."
msgstr ""
"柔らかく黒い毛皮と丸い耳、優しい表情が特徴の、子供に与えるにしては少しリアルなデザインのアメリカグマのぬいぐるみです。フワフワした暖かい質感は、寝るときに寄り添うのに最適です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "tarantula plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A somewhat scary, but cuddly tarantula plushie with soft, fuzzy brown fur "
"and big, curious eyes."
msgstr "柔らかい茶色の表皮と好奇心旺盛な大きな瞳をもつ、少し不気味ですが思わず抱きしめたくなるタランチュラのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "spinosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A spiky spinosaurus plushie with big claws and a friendly demeanor, he is "
"holding a fish, probably saving it for later."
msgstr "大きな爪と棘をもつ、優しそうな表情のスピノサウルスのぬいぐるみです。手に魚を抱えていますが、後で食べるのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Description of variant "plateosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A squat, chubby, cute and very huggable plateosaurus plushie with a "
"prominent belly and a soft stubby tail."
msgstr ""
"ずんぐりむっくりした体形が可愛らしい、思わず抱きしめたくなるプラテオサウルスのぬいぐるみです。大きなお腹と丸みを帯びた柔らかい尻尾が特徴的です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "cow plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A stuffed dairy cow with soft, velvety fur spotted in Holstein black and "
"white."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "superhero figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A superhero action figure.  Its limbs can be adjusted for different poses, "
"and it is designed to do battle against a wide variety of crooks and "
"supervillains, sold separately."
msgstr "スーパーヒーローの可動フィギュアです。手足の向きを調節して色々なポーズを取り、別売の悪党やスーパーヴィランのフィギュアと戦わせて遊びます。"

#. ~ Description of variant "brachiosaurus plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A sweet-faced brachiosaurus plushie with a long neck and oversized head.  It"
" looks very wise!"
msgstr "長い首と発達した頭部をもつ、優しい顔をしたブラキオサウルスのぬいぐるみです。賢そうな表情ですね！"

#. ~ Description of variant "penguin plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "A velvety-soft plush penguin.  It makes a funny noise when you hug it."
msgstr "ビロードのように滑らかなペンギンのぬいぐるみです。抱きしめると変な音が鳴ります。"

#. ~ Description of variant "deer plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A very huggable white-tailed deer plushie with soft, brown fur and a cute "
"expression with adorable antlers."
msgstr "茶色の柔らかな毛並みと愛らしい角が特徴的な、思わず抱きしめたくなるオジロジカのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "robot figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"A very intricate looking model of a robotic skeleton with red eyes and a "
"futuristic weapon in its hand."
msgstr "未来的な武装を手にした、骸骨のような目が赤いロボットの非常に精巧なフィギュアです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "crab plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"An amazing crab plushie with soft, textured blue and red bumpy shell and "
"big, curious eyes."
msgstr "凹凸があるザラザラした柔らかい青と赤の甲羅、好奇心旺盛な大きな瞳が特徴的な、可愛らしいカニのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "lizardman figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"An expensive figurine of a buff man in streetwear with a lizard head, "
"holding a pair of knives in his hands."
msgstr "ストリートウェアを着こなし手にナイフを構えたトカゲ頭の男性の豪華なフィギュアです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "anime figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "An expensive figurine of a cartoon woman in flashy clothing."
msgstr "マンガに登場する派手な衣装を身に着けた女性の豪華なフィギュアです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "alien figurine" of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"An expensive looking figurine of a gnarly, jet-black alien covered in "
"menacing looking spines."
msgstr "凶悪そうな棘に覆われた、恐ろしい漆黒のエイリアンの豪華なフィギュアです。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "Canadian lynx plushie"
msgid_plural "Canadian lynx plushies"
msgstr[0] "ぬいぐるみ(ｵｵﾔﾏﾈｺ)"

#. ~ "description" action message of item "imperfect doll"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "Hug the imperfect doll."
msgstr "不完全なぬいぐるみを抱きしめます。"

#. ~ Description of "imperfect doll"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"Its legs are mismatched, its arms misshapen, its eyes more crooked than its "
"smile.  Everywhere, it sparkles with the golden thread that has put it back "
"together.  It's beautiful."
msgstr "脚の長さは揃っておらず、腕は歪んでおり、笑っているような目元の表情も異様です。修復に使った金の糸は輝き続けており、美しいと感じます。"

#. ~ Variant name of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "Japanese macaque plushie"
msgid_plural "Japanese macaque plushies"
msgstr[0] "ぬいぐるみ(ﾆﾎﾝｻﾞﾙ)"

#. ~ "menu_text" action message of item "fidget spinner"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "Spin"
msgstr "回す"

#. ~ Variant name of item "large figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "T-rex figurine"
msgid_plural "T-rex figurines"
msgstr[0] "フィギュア(Tﾚｯｸｽ)"

#. ~ Variant name of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "T-rex plushie"
msgid_plural "T-rex plushies"
msgstr[0] "ぬいぐるみ(Tﾚｯｸｽ)"

#. ~ Description of "threadbare cotton arms"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"The spun cloth fingers are fraying away.  There's nothing that they could "
"hold on to."
msgstr "指先の部分がほつれています。こんな腕では何も持てそうにありません。"

#. ~ Description of "floppy cotton legs"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"They're different colors and different lengths.  It would be hard to run "
"away with these."
msgstr "色も長さも不揃いです。こんな脚ではとても走れそうにありません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "Japanese macaque plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This Japanese macaque plushie features a soft, brown grayish fur, with a "
"reddish-brown face and hands."
msgstr "灰色がかった茶色の柔らかい毛皮、赤茶色の顔面と手が特徴的な、ニホンザルのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "wild boar plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This big wild boar plushie features a soft tuft of coarse, dark fur along "
"its spine, with a soft and plushy body.  It also has a pair of soft tusks "
"protruding from its snout and has a fierce expression."
msgstr ""
"背中にゴワゴワした黒い毛が生えた、フワフワで大きなイノシシのぬいぐるみです。鼻からは柔らかい牙が突き出ており、獰猛そうな表情を浮かべています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "golden lion tamarin plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This bright, extremely cute golden lion tamarin plushie features long, soft,"
" and golden-colored fur and a extremely playful demeanor.  On the label it "
"says that it is an ambassador of its species, and that the amounts collected"
" in the sales of the plushies were donated to help the conservation of the "
"species.  Surely now, without many humans, maybe these animals don't have to"
" worry so much about their habitat being destroyed."
msgstr ""
"長く柔らかい金色の毛皮、好奇心旺盛な表情が特徴的な、陽気でとても愛らしいゴールデンライオンタマリンのぬいぐるみです。ラベルには、ぬいぐるみの売上金がこの種の保護活動を援助するために寄付される旨が書かれています。人間がほとんどいなくなった今の状況では、動物たちの生息域が破壊される心配をする必要はあまりないかもしれません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "howler monkey plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This cute and cuddling howler monkey plushie has soft, brown fur, and "
"produces a sound that mimics the howler monkey's signature hooting noise "
"when hugged properly."
msgstr ""
"茶色の柔らかい毛皮をもつ、思わず抱きしめたくなるほど愛らしいホエザルのぬいぐるみです。強く握ると、ホエザルの特徴であるブーイングのような音が鳴ります。"

#. ~ Description of variant "black lion tamarin plushie plushie" of item
#. "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This extremely cute black lion tamarin plushie features a soft black fur, "
"bright orange hands and feet along with expressive, friendly eyes.  On the "
"label it says that it is an ambassador of its species, and that the amounts "
"collected in the sales of the plushies were donated to help the conservation"
" of the species.  Surely now, without many humans, maybe these animals don't"
" have to worry so much about their habitat being destroyed."
msgstr ""
"柔らかい黒色の毛皮、明るいオレンジ色の四肢、表情豊かで優しそうな顔つきが特徴的な、とても愛らしいクロライオンタマリンのぬいぐるみです。ラベルには、ぬいぐるみの売上金がこの種の保護活動を援助するために寄付される旨が書かれています。人間がほとんどいなくなった今の状況では、動物たちの生息域が破壊される心配をする必要はあまりないかもしれません。"

#. ~ Description of variant "fruit bat plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This fruit bat plushie is tan in color, with soft, fuzzy fur.  It has "
"delicate pointed ears and a sweet, friendly expression with big, brown eyes."
"  This plushie has special hanging capabilities that let it cling to objects"
" using its feet, simulating the playful behavior of a real fruit bat.  It "
"also come with a removable plush red fruit, probably a berry of some kind, "
"that it can 'eat'."
msgstr ""
"フワフワとした黄褐色の体表、細く尖った耳、大きな茶色の瞳、友好的な優しい表情が特徴的な、オオコウモリのぬいぐるみです。足を使って吊り下げられる特殊な仕掛けが付いており、遊びながら本物のオオコウモリの生態を学ぶことができます。恐らくベリーを模しているであろう赤色のボールが複数付属しており、自由に着脱して「食事」させることも可能です。"

#. ~ Description of variant "sheep plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This loving and fluffy sheep plushie features soft woolly fur in white, with"
" cute floppy ears and expressive eyes."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of variant "black sheep plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This loving and fluffy sheep plushie features soft, woolly fur in black, "
"with cute floppy ears and somewhat careless, bored eyes."
msgstr "柔らかい黒色の羊毛、垂れた可愛らしい耳、ぼんやりした目つきが特徴的な、愛らしいフワフワのヒツジのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "pink sheep plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This loving and fluffy sheep plushie features soft, woolly fur in pink, with"
" cute floppy ears and square-pixeled eyes, for some reason."
msgstr "柔らかいピンク色の羊毛、垂れた可愛らしい耳、何故か真四角になっている目が特徴的な、愛らしいフワフワのヒツジのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "pig plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This loving, precious pig plushie has a soft pink fur, with endearing floppy"
" ears and bright eyes.  It also has a plush snout with brown fur on its legs"
" and paws.  Its nose is somewhat long and black, and its eyes are large and "
"expressive."
msgstr ""
"柔らかいピンク色の表皮、垂れた愛らしい耳、明るい目と突き出た鼻、茶色い毛が生えた足が特徴的な、非常にかわいいブタのぬいぐるみです。黒っぽい鼻はやや長く伸びており、大きな目は表情豊かです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "white unicorn plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This majestic unicorn plushie features a soft white body and horn, with "
"tufts of white hair on its neck and tail.  Its black eyes are adorably large"
" and round."
msgstr "フワフワの白い体と角、首と尻尾の白く長い毛が特徴の、堂々としたユニコーンのぬいぐるみです。黒く大きな瞳がキュートです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "white unicorn plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This majestic unicorn plushie features a soft white body and horn, with "
"tufts of white hair on its neck and tail.  Its black eyes are adorably large"
" and round.  For some odd reason, this one is wielding a plush knife with "
"its forehooves."
msgstr ""
"フワフワの白い体と角、首と尻尾の白く長い毛が特徴の、堂々としたユニコーンのぬいぐるみです。黒く大きな瞳がキュートです。どういうわけか、前足で布製のナイフを構えています。"

#. ~ Description of variant "mandrill monkey plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This mandrill monkey plushie is striking due to the bright colorful features"
" present in its face (mandrills are known for that, after all).  This "
"plushie has a movable jaw that reveals soft plush teeth when opened, giving "
"it a realistic appearance."
msgstr ""
"顔の明るくカラフルな模様が特徴的な(マンドリルの特徴と言えばこれ以外思いつきませんが)、マンドリルのぬいぐるみです。顎が可動する作りになっており、口の中に並んでいる柔らかい布製の歯がリアルです。"

#. ~ Description of variant "marmoset plushie" of item "plush toy"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"This precious and cute marmoset plushie features a fluffy and dense brown "
"fur, and a long fluffy tail like the real animal."
msgstr "本物のマーモセットのように密集した茶色の毛皮と長いフワフワの尻尾をもつ、とても可愛らしいマーモセットのぬいぐるみです。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_spinner_spinning" in use action of
#. item "fidget spinner"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid "You spin your fidget spinner."
msgstr "ハンドスピナーを回しました。"

#. ~ Description of variant "reaper figurine" of item "figurine"
#: data/json/items/toy.json
msgid ""
"Your heart leaps to your throat as you see the face of Death itself staring "
"back at you, scythe raised for the harvest!  You relax significantly once "
"you realize it's only a few inches tall and made of plastic."
msgstr ""
"死そのものが形を成したような顔、今まさに魂を収穫せんと大鎌を振り上げる姿を見ると、緊張で心臓が飛び出しそうになります！しかし、この死神のサイズがわずか数センチで、しかもプラスチック製だということが分かれば気が休まります。"

