msgstr "強化鋼の大きなフレームです。軍用車両の建造に使います。"

#. ~ Description of "light wooden frame"
#: data/json/items/vehicle/frames.json
msgid ""
"A small frame made of a few pieces of wood, held together by rope.  Useful "
