#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_cop_fungal_infected"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"A maddened and crazed police officer infected by the fungus.  Their body "
"armor is overgrown with fungal matter.  Though obviously in pain they don't "
"seem any less keen to batter you to death with their baton."
msgstr ""
"繁殖した菌糸が胴から溢れ出している、狂気に陥った警官です。明らかに痛みを感じていますが、人間を警棒で殴り殺すことには抵抗を覚えていないようです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral prepper"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"A quick glance at this person would suggest that they have prepared well "
"enough for the apocalypse.  Unfortunately, they've been swept up in the tide"
" of madness that killed the world.  One of their hands clasps the handle of "
"a makeshift weapon, while the other grips a handgun."
msgstr ""
"一見すると、このような事態のためにしっかりと準備をしてきたようですが、血走った目や他のゾンビからの扱いを見れば、既に手遅れであることが分かります。片手にその辺りで拾ったような武器を、もう一方の手には銃器を握っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mad scientist"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"A researcher who has stared too long into the abyss, and now shambles about "
"muttering nonsense under their breath.  For some reason, the zombies don't "
"seem to mind that this person is obviously still alive.  They're clutching a"
" tiny but razor-sharp blade in one shaky hand."
msgstr ""
"深淵をじっと見つめすぎたためか、世迷言をブツブツと呟き続けており、小さいながらもカミソリのように鋭い刃を片手に握っています。どういうわけか、ゾンビは明らかに生きているこの狂人を気にも留めていないようです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral biker"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"A rough-looking human, clad in black leather and wielding a pump-action "
"shotgun.  It seems body-armor wasn't one of their priorities however."
msgstr "黒いレザーの服に身を包み、ポンプアクション式ショットガンを掲げる、ガラの悪そうな狂人です。ボディアーマーは着ていないようです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral cop"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Another of the crazed humans among the dead.  This police officer angrily "
"mutters to themself, wandering about with a baton in hand in search of "
"someone to brutalize."
msgstr "死者に混じって活動する狂った人間です。この警官は顔を歪め何かを呟きながら、警棒で打ちのめせる獲物を探して彷徨っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_labsecurity_flashlight"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"At first glance, this disheveled figure could almost pass for a survivor, "
"but the bloodshot eyes give them away as one of the humans who have gone "
"feral and joined the undead without dying.  Their uniform suggests that this"
" was at some point a security guard, and they still carry a stun gun and a "
"heavy-duty flashlight that looks like it could easily double as a club."
msgstr ""
"ボロボロの姿をしているものの、一見するとただの生存者のように見えます。しかし、血走った瞳は狂人のものであり、生きたままゾンビたちの群れに加わっています。かつては警備員であったことが制服から推察でき、棍棒に早変わりする頑丈な懐中電灯を未だに握りしめています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral pyromaniac"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Before the bombs fell, runaway fires were the biggest killers.  Now you "
"behold one of their architects: a gibbering madman, reeking of fuel and "
"painted all over with soot and ash that fail to conceal the glint of a "
"knife."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "feral crewman"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Clad in a grimy and tattered naval uniform, this former sailor clutches a "
"massive wrench as some form of makeshift weapon.  At a distance, you could "
"mistake them as being another survivor.  However, upon closer inspection you"
" make note of how their veins are visibly bulging, their wide open eyes have"
" a primal, animalistic quality to their gaze, and their breaths come in "
"ragged, wheezing pants.  Whatever the Cataclysm has done to the military "
"crewman that this twitching shell of their former self once was, you're "
"certain that they're not fully human anymore."
msgstr ""
"ボロボロの海軍制服に身を包んだ元水兵が、どこで拾ったのか巨大なレンチを振り回しています。遠目に見れば単なる生存者と勘違いしてしまいそうですが、よく見ると全身の血管が浮き出ており、本能と衝動のままに目を見開き、荒い息を吐いています。大変動がこの人物にどのように作用したのか分かりませんが、人間的な性質はその外見以外何も残っていません。"

#. ~ Description of monster "armored feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Clad in ancient armor and with a battle axe in hand, this maniac walks "
"around in search of their next prey.  You can see stains of dried blood all "
"over their axe."
msgstr "バトルアックスを片手に次の獲物を探す、古代の鎧を身にまとった狂人です。バトルアックスには乾いた血の跡が残っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "armored feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Clad in ancient armor and with a mace in hand, this maniac walks around in "
"search of their next prey.  You can see stains of dried blood all over their"
" mace."
msgstr "メイスを片手に次の獲物を探す、古代の鎧を身にまとった狂人です。メイスには乾いた血の跡が残っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_sailor_mop"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Clutching a stout mop in their quivering hands, this crewman was presumably "
"assigned to basic deck sweeping in their final moments, before the Cataclysm"
" struck and stripped them of their humanity.  Dressed in basic naval "
"fatigues, you'd be forgiven for believing them to be another survivor.  "
"However, their bloodshot eyes, blackened veins, and spastic twitching tell a"
" far different story."
msgstr ""
"大変動によって人間性を奪われるまでは簡単なデッキ掃除を任されていたのでしょう。この水兵は震える手で頑丈そうなモップを握りしめています。一般的な海軍の制服に身を包んだその姿は、一見するとただの人間と勘違いしてしまいそうですが、充血した目や黒ずんだ血管、引きつったような動きを見れば、かつての人間とはかけ離れた状態になっていることが分かります。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_pipe_fungal_corpse"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Delicate fungal stalks sprout in rows from sores covering this person's "
"body, and their facial expression is pure agony."
msgstr "全身を覆う傷口から細い菌糸が大量に生えており、顔は苦悶の表情のまま固まっています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_axe_fungal_corpse"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Delicate fungal stalks sprout in rows from sores on this person's arms, and "
"their facial expression is pure agony."
msgstr "両腕の傷口から細い菌糸が大量に生えており、顔は苦悶の表情のまま固まっています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_crowbar_fungal_corpse"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Delicate fungal stalks sprout in rows from sores on this person's arms, and "
"their facial expression is pure agony.  Their mouth opens and closes softly "
"in a silent moan."
msgstr "両腕の傷口から細い菌糸が大量に生えており、顔は苦悶の表情のまま固まっています。口だけがわずかに動き、小さく呻き声を上げています"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral survivor"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"If it weren't for the stooped posture and wild eyes, this person's gear and "
"bladed weapon might mark them as another survivor of the Cataclysm.  Now "
"they move among the dead like they're one of them, shaking like a rabid dog."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "feral servant"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Once a fancy servant of some rich family, this maniac walks around with a "
"broom in hand, searching for a victim to sweep off this mortal coil."
msgstr "かつては金持ちの家に仕えていた、優秀な召使いの狂人です。片付けるべき犠牲者を探して、箒を片手にうろついています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral servant"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Once a fancy servant of some rich family, this maniac walks around with a "
"candlestick in hand, ready to snuff out your life."
msgstr "かつては金持ちの家に仕えていた、優秀な召使いの狂人です。焼き尽くすべき命を探して、燭台を片手にうろついています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral servant"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Once a fancy servant of some rich family, this maniac walks around with a "
"knife in hand, searching for some victims to butcher."
msgstr "かつては金持ちの家に仕えていた、優秀な召使いの狂人です。解体すべき獲物を探して、ナイフを片手にうろついています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_sailor_axe"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Spattered from head to toe in large swaths of dried viscera, the deep blue "
"of this person's tattered naval uniform has been stained the color of rust."
"  Having seemingly had enough presence of mind to consider arming themself, "
"this former crewman carries a crash axe in their shaking hands.  The veins "
"on the back of their neck are visibly bulging, their eyes bloodshot, and a "
"mass of crisscrossing blackened veins stand out against the pale skin of "
"their face as they regard the area around them for perceived threats."
msgstr ""
"武装しているつもりなのか、この水兵は震える手で防災用の斧を握りしめています。全身に乾燥した肉片がこびりつき、元は青かったボロボロの海軍制服が錆色に染まっています。うなじの血管は膨張し、周囲を警戒するように睨む目は充血し、顔面の薄い肌には黒ずんだ血管が浮かび上がっています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_sailor_lug_wrench"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Still dressed in a grease spattered uniform, this crewman appears to have "
"once been a naval engineer.  With tangled hair, oil stained working attire, "
"and a lug wrench clenched in their fist, you assume that they were either "
"assigned to shipside maintenance or responsible for servicing onboard "
"aircraft.  Now all that's left of the crewman that this person once was is a"
" madly twitching, psychopathic monster."
msgstr ""
"油まみれの制服を着たこの水兵は、かつては海軍の機関兵だったようです。整っていない髪や汚れた服、握りしめたボックスレンチを見れば、船内か航空機の整備を担当していたことが推測できますが、それ以外の人間的な要素はすべて捨て去られ、ここには狂ったように震える怪物しか残っていません。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_knife"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"The Cataclysm began as an outbreak of what then seemed like violent "
"insanity, but there must be something more to it, as these lost souls freely"
" walk among the undead without being attacked.  This one has got their hands"
" on a kitchen knife, and they look eager to put it to use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral biker"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral biker fires their shotgun!"
msgstr "狂ったバイカーがショットガンを発砲しました！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "well dressed feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral human shoots their crossbow!"
msgstr "狂人はクロスボウを発射しました！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral human"
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "mon_feral_human_crowbar"
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "mon_feral_human_knife"
#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral mechanic"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral human throws a rock!"
msgstr "狂人は石を投げつけました！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral militia"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral militiaman fires their rifle!"
msgstr "狂った民兵はライフルを発射しました！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral officer"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral officer fires their M18!"
msgstr "狂った士官がM18を発砲しました！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral prepper"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral prepper haphazardly fires their firearm!"
msgstr "狂ったプレッパーがでたらめに銃器を発射しました！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral pyromaniac"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral pyromaniac throws a Molotov cocktail!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral security guard"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral security guard fires their Beretta M9A1!"
msgstr "狂った警備員はベレッタM9A1を発射しました！"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "feral warden"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid "The feral warden fires their rifle!"
msgstr "狂った民兵はライフルを発射しました！"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral warden"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"The warden of this prison is somehow still alive, but that doesn't mean they"
" haven't turned.  They still regard these surroundings with cold authority, "
"even wielding a rifle to back it up, but their staring bloodshot eyes and "
"eerie silence mark them as one of the billions whose minds shattered under "
"the unbearable weight of the Cataclysm."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "mon_feral_human_crowbar"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Their pupils are dilated and what can be seen of the iris and sclera are "
"bloodshot.  This crowbar-wielding maniac still breathes, but the zombies "
"treat them like one of their own."
msgstr "瞳孔が拡大し、虹彩や白目が充血した、バールを振り回す狂人です。まだ呼吸していますが、ゾンビには仲間だと思われているようです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral human"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Their pupils are dilated and what can be seen of the iris and sclera are "
"bloodshot.  This pipe-wielding maniac still breathes, but the zombies treat "
"them like one of their own."
msgstr "瞳孔が拡大し、虹彩や白目が充血した、パイプを振り回す狂人です。まだ呼吸していますが、ゾンビには仲間だと思われているようです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral axe murderer"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"They stumble along, clutching an axe.  Their face is twisted into a sadistic"
" grin, and they walk among the dead as though already one of them."
msgstr ""
"血塗れの斧を引きずりながら、よろよろと歩いています。歪んだサディスティックな笑みを浮かべ、既に死者の仲間入りを果たしているかのように振る舞っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral mechanic"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"This maniac was probably a mechanic before the Cataclysm.  Now, they're "
"reduced to a mad thing, still wearing the remains of a work uniform and "
"clutching a hammer that is now nothing more than a weapon."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "cunning feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"This person is lost to the madness that killed the world, but their "
"movements seem steadier than others of their kind.  They're carrying a crude"
" spear, and have assembled some basic armor from whatever they could find.  "
"Despite these signs of greater intelligence, this creature is still only a "
"few steps away from being a zombie themself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "feral officer"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"This person, clad in the tattered uniform of a naval officer, twitches "
"erratically as their bloodshot eyes dart about and their breaths come in "
"ragged pants.  The Cataclysm has clearly done something horrible to this "
"military professional, inaudible mutterings emanating from their lips as "
"they creep about like a skittish animal.  In their quivering hands they "
"clutch a service pistol, the officer's fingers nervously fidgeting with the "
"weapon.  They may not be an undead corpse, but you doubt that they're any "
"more rational than the zombies which now infest the world."
msgstr ""
"ボロボロの海軍制服を身に着けたこの人物は、充血した目をせわしなく動かしながら、息を荒げて不規則に痙攣しています。大変動がこの軍人に何らかの恐ろしい影響を与えたようです。不明瞭な言葉を発しながら臆病な動物のように忍び足で歩き回り、震える手で握りしめたピストルをしきりに弄っています。これがゾンビだとは思えませんが、一方でゾンビよりも理性的かと問われると疑問を感じずにはいられません。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral security guard"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"This security guard still breathes, but has been lost to some terrible "
"madness.  They move among the undead, handgun at the ready and saucer pupils"
" scanning for threats in a mockery of their former duty."
msgstr ""
"まだ生きてはいるようですが、強い狂気に呑まれています。実弾を込めた拳銃片手にゾンビに混じって行動し、見開いた瞳で敵を探しながらかつての職務の真似事をしています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral marine"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"This twitching, bloodied person is still clad in a ragged naval uniform, the"
" insignia of the marines visible on their coat and a corresponding tattoo on"
" their forearm.  Clutching a rifle in their quivering hands, you see them "
"repeatedly pull the weapon's trigger, constantly muttering incoherently and "
"yanking back on the gun's charging handle every time the rifle fails to "
"fire.  Seemingly having lost the capability to comprehend that their weapon "
"is empty, you'd feel relatively safe were it not for the gleaming bayonet "
"still attached to the end of their firearm."
msgstr ""
"全身血まみれで痙攣している、ボロボロの海軍制服を身に着けた人間です。服には海兵隊の記章が縫い付けてあり、前腕には刺青も見えます。震える手で弾が発射されなくなったライフルを握りしめ、引き金を何度も引き、支離滅裂な言葉をつぶやきながらチャージングハンドルを弄り続けています。どうやら弾切れを理解する能力すら失っているようですが、銃の先端に取り付けられた鋭い銃剣がある限り、決して無害とは言い切れません。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral militia"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Wearing a tactical getup with a Kevlar vest, this person seems to have been "
"a militia member, now lost to madness.  They scan for threats with bloodshot"
" eyes and a semi-automatic rifle, and a flashlight strapped to their helmet "
"illuminates their surroundings."
msgstr ""
"ケブラーベストと迷彩柄の軍服を着た、狂った民兵です。両手でセミオートライフルを抱え、血走った目で辺りを見渡しています。ヘルメットにヘッドランプを装着しており、周囲を照らし出しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "well dressed feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Wearing fancy clothes and with a crossbow in hand, this maniac was once a "
"socialite.  Their hands caress the crossbow as if touching a loved one."
msgstr "かつては社交界の人気者だった、クロスボウを手にしている派手な身なりの狂人です。愛する人に触れるかのように、クロスボウを撫でています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "well dressed feral"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"Wearing fancy clothes and with a rapier in hand, this maniac was once a "
"socialite.  They smile with madness and seem like they want to invite you to"
" dinner."
msgstr ""
"かつては社交界の人気者だった、レイピアを手にしている派手な身なりの狂人です。狂気に満ちた笑みを浮かべ、ディナーに招待すべき人間を探しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feral soldier"
#: data/json/monsters/feral_humans.json
msgid ""
"What was once a service member has been lost to the madness that devoured "
"the world.  Tense, dirty hands grip a combat knife as their bloodshot eyes "
"scan for threats."
msgstr ""
"この狂人は高度な訓練を受けた軍人のようです。軍服の上から装甲付きベストを身に着け、汚れが付着しこわばった手でコンバットナイフを握り、血走った目で辺りの脅威を探っています。"

