msgstr[0] "タイセイヨウサケ"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "European carp"
msgid_plural "European carp"
msgstr[0] "ヨーロピアンカープ"

#. ~ Description of monster "Atlantic bluefin tuna"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"One of the largest and fastest fish in the waters of New England, the "
"bluefin tuna is a streamlined predator with a dark blue back and silvery "
"sides."
msgstr "ニューイングランドの海域で非常に大きく素早い魚であるタイセイヨウクロマグロは、濃い青色の背と銀色の側面が特徴的な、流線形の肉食魚です。"

#. ~ Description of monster "lakebed creeper"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"Pink and translucent, with all of its otherworldly organs visible through "
"its skin, this meter-high conical creature creeps along the seabed with its "
"stubby, furry legs.  It contracts some kind of retracted barbed filaments "
"into an orifice at its rear as it aims it at potential prey."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Death message of monster "fish fry"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is smashed to non-recognizable pieces."
msgstr "%sはグチャグチャに潰れました。"

#. ~ Description of monster "bluefish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"The bluefish, a moderately proportioned marine fish, is known for its "
"aggressive nature and sharp teeth.  It sports a distinct blue-green "
"coloration."
msgstr "攻撃的な性格と鋭い歯で知られている、海に棲む特徴的な青緑色の中型魚です。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Atlantic halibut"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"The largest flatfish in the ocean, known for its dense, firm texture and "
"mild flavor."
msgstr "カレイ目の中では最大の種であり、引き締まった身の食感とまろやかな味わいが特徴です。"

#. ~ Description of monster "crayfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"This crustacean looks like a tiny lobster, but is actually a completely "
"different species.  If you could get ahold of a bunch more of these, a hefty"
" pot of boiling water, and some spicy seasonings…"
msgstr "小型のロブスターにも見えますが、実は全くの別種です。ここに大量のザリガニ、沸騰したお湯、更に香辛料があれば最高なのですが..."

#. ~ Description of monster "giant crayfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid "This crustacean, larger than a man, resembles a mud-colored lobster."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "giant carp"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"This thing looks like a carp, but huge and very, very angry.  Death is the "
"gift of the carp god."
msgstr "ただのコイに見えますが、ただのコイよりずっと巨大で、しかも怒り狂っています。死はコイの神からの贈り物です。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shortnose sturgeon"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"While the shortnose sturgeon is still large, it is nothing compared to its "
"cousin - the lake sturgeon.  What really sets it apart, however, is its "
"signature shorter snout."
msgstr "ウミチョウザメは大型ですが、近縁種であるミズウミチョウザメには及びません。非常に妙な形状の短い鼻が特徴的です。"

#. ~ Description of monster "goldfish"
#: data/json/monsters/fish.json
msgid ""
"Yes, this is that common pet fish.  Though, given its size and the fact that"
" it's still alive, you can take a wild guess that this one is feral."
msgstr ""
"どう見ても、一般的なペットとして飼われている魚です。ただし、そのサイズと、今も生き延びているという事実を考えると、野生種と言えなくもありません。"

