#. ~ Description of monster "blight horse"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"A carpet of shaggy mold covers this decaying horse, scattering a puff of "
"spores with each staggering step.  It travels towards anything moving, even "
"though in the center of each eye lies multiple fungal blooms."
msgstr ""
"この巨大なウマは、たてがみに付いた大きな真菌の塊が芽を出しており、一歩進む度に足の動かし方を学び直そうとしているようなぎこちなさがあります。目からは無数の真菌の花が飛び出していますが、そんなことはお構いなしに動くものに向かって突進します。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal boomer"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"A rotund and bloated human body with pasty, fungus-ridden flesh.  Its mouth "
"drips with a frothing gray sludge."
msgstr "真菌に支配された、大きく膨れ上がった青白い丸い人型の何かです。口からは泡立った灰色のヘドロが溢れています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "pollinator zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Every breath of this crooked, fungus-ridden zombie emits a fine dust of "
"spores, and it constantly looks like it's emerging from a cloud of mist."
msgstr "完全に真菌に乗っ取られたゾンビです。口から常に細かな胞子を放出しており、まるで神秘的な雲間から出現したように見えます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal runner"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Fungal sprouts seem to support the host's broken legs like crude splints.  "
"Even with its eyes shrouded with tiny spores, it darts towards anything that"
" seems to move in a small radius."
msgstr ""
"真菌の芽が粗末な添え木のように宿主の折れた脚を支えています。たとえその目が細かい胞子に覆われていようとも、小回りの利く動きで周囲の獲物に向かって全速力で突進します。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal juggernaut"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Fungi bloom from the crevices in the ossified plates of this ponderous bone "
"titan, and it seems even its eyes are lost to it.  A dust of spores lands on"
" the ground with every sluggish stomp of its heavy legs."
msgstr ""
"巨大な骨の巨人がもつ装甲の割れ目からは真菌の花が咲き、視力も失われているようです。重い足取りでゆっくりと動き回る度に、埃のような胞子が足下に降り注いでいます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal skeletal zombie"
#. ~ Description of monster "fungal skeletal brute"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Fungi bloom from the crevices in the twisted bone growths that cover this "
"creature.  Spores linger in the air around it."
msgstr "肉体を覆う発達した骨の隙間から菌糸が顔を出しています。周囲には胞子が漂っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal raptor"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Infested by a thick crust of fungal growth, this small, winged predator "
"darts through the air on three spongy wings that look like stretched human "
"hands.  A sheer, jagged spike juts out from the point where the wings meet."
"  It looks like nothing you've seen on Earth, and yet strangely like it is "
"made of human parts."
msgstr ""
"翼を使って空を飛ぶゾンビです。人間の手のような形状の、真菌に覆われたスポンジ状の3枚の翼が生えています。翼の付け根には、細く鋭い複数の棘が突き出ています。地球上で見たこともないような姿ですが、不思議なことに各部位は確かに人間のものです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal child"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"It is hard to recognize a human child in this creature.  Disgusting-looking "
"mold covers most of its skin.  Many cracks perforate its body, with small "
"fungal stalks poking through."
msgstr ""
"この怪物が人間の子供であったと認識するのは困難です。皮膚の大部分がおぞましい菌糸で覆われており、体にできた大量の亀裂からは小さな真菌の芽が飛び出しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Once alive, then undead, now something else entirely.  Fungal tendrils "
"sprout from its mouth, eyes, and other orifices, holding together a "
"shambling mass of mold-covered flesh."
msgstr ""
"かつては人間でしたが、動く死体になり、更に全く別のものに成り果てました。口や目など全身のあらゆる穴から真菌の蔓が生え、カビに覆われた肉塊をかろうじて繋ぎ合わせています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "bloated fungal zombie"
#. ~ Death message of monster "truffle pig"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bursts, releasing a cloud of spores."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "spore host"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"The air around this stumbling corpse seems to constantly warp and shift; "
"Colors and shapes visibly distort in its presence.  It's no spacial anomaly,"
" just a trick of the light passing through the ultra-fine haze of spores "
"surrounding it."
msgstr ""
"周囲の空気が絶えず歪み揺らめいている、真菌にフラフラと歩く覆われた死体です。肉体の色や形は視認できるほど変化しており、何故このような異常な状態に陥っているのか解明できそうにありません。湿ったカーペットとカビの臭いが遠くからでも漂ってきて、鼻を刺激します。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mold dog"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"The deformed, animated, and again reanimated corpse of a what looked like "
"the concept of a canine.  It has lost almost all of its dog-like features, "
"except for its constant aggressive growling, and tendency to bite.  It "
"shakes its fur like a wet dog, sending tiny spore clouds everywhere."
msgstr ""
"変質し、蘇り、再び動き始めた、どことなくイヌのように見える死骸です。攻撃的な唸り声を絶え間なく発していることと噛み付き攻撃を除けば、イヌらしい特徴はほとんど失われています。濡れた毛皮を乾かすように全身を震わせ、小さな胞子を辺りに撒き散らしています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "decaying fungal zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"The rotten skin that flakes from the host's body seems to be covered in tiny"
" blue dots; occasional popping and crackling sounds are heard, like cracking"
" wood.  This corpse can't be discerned as human by the naked eye."
msgstr ""
"腐って肉体から剥がれかけた皮膚は、小さな青い斑点に覆われています。時折、木材が割れるようなパチパチという音が体内から聞こえてきます。一目見ただけでは元が人間だったとは気付けません。"

#. ~ Description of monster "scarred fungal zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"The tough callouses and scar tissue of this unfortunate corpse are the only "
"remaining signs of something once made of flesh; any spot seemingly soft "
"enough has been thoroughly punctured by thick fungal tendrils that have "
"started to creep over this disfigured husk."
msgstr ""
"かつては肉体を持っていたことを示す唯一の痕跡が、この不幸な死体に残る硬い瘤やかさぶた状の組織です。弾力がある部位は全て真菌の太い蔦に蹂躙され、変質した外皮は完全に覆われてしまっています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungideer"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"This bumpy, discolored reindeer resembles a malformed Rudolph, its nose "
"having a faintly glowing red fungal sprout.  It'd look almost comical if it "
"wasn't mutilating bodies with its innate strength."
msgstr ""
"この奇形のトナカイは、鼻先から赤色の真菌の芽を生やしており、ほのかに光ってまるでルドルフのようです。四肢がちぎれかけていなければ、滑稽に見えたのですが。"

#. ~ Description of monster "moldering deer"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"This deer's thick fur is spotted with blue orbs that seem to pop and ooze "
"every few minutes, and its rotten skin seems unable to fall off, held "
"together by thick fungal bedding underneath."
msgstr ""
"このシカの分厚い毛皮には無数の青色の球体が付着しており、時々弾けて中身が滲み出ています。腐った皮膚は厚い菌床と癒着しており、剥がれ落ちることはありません。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal moose"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"This formerly-majestic beast has lost any semblance of what a moose is, "
"aside from its outgrown antlers, now covered in writhing fungal tendrils, "
"seemingly trying to break into the cracking bone.  The animated corpse seems"
" to be in a state of constant disrepair, held together by strange, sticky "
"blue orbs."
msgstr ""
"かつて雄大な姿を誇っていましたが、今ヘラジカの面影を見出せるものは伸びすぎた角以外何もありません。蠢く菌類の蔓は全身を覆い、ひび割れた骨すら侵食しようとしています。蘇った死体は奇妙な粘着質の青い塊によって肉体を繋ぎ合わされ、絶え間ない崩壊を辛うじて耐えているようです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal zombie crawler"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"This fungal monster struggles to move as bulbous mushrooms grow from its "
"exposed back.  Its leg seems to be wrapped in sturdy tendrils, and its arms "
"visibly swell and pop gruesomely with each drag along the ground."
msgstr "露出した背中から球根状の菌塊が生えており、動き辛そうです。脚は頑丈な蔦に包まれており、地面を掴むたびに腕の表面が膨らみ、陰惨に弾けます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal tiger"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"This rotting tiger has lost its stumble, as large fungal bulbs seem to have "
"extended its pawpads thoroughly.  Its head crackles when trying to turn, "
"seemingly stuck facing forward."
msgstr ""
"この腐敗したトラの死体は、真菌の大きな塊が足の裏から生えているため、上手く歩けないようです。向きを変えようとする度に頭部からパチパチと音が聞こえ、思った方向へことすらできていません。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal wretch"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"This severely deformed child lies on its back, its ribs exposed to the sky."
"  With its limbs contorted in ways only possible through a lack of bones, "
"the child's ribcage stretches far beyond the boundaries of human biology, "
"appearing akin to a bony hive coated in quivering fungal matter.  Spores "
"occasionally waft from its hollowed interior, and, periodically, you can "
"catch sight of weak movement within the abomination's guts."
msgstr ""
"背中から肋骨が飛び出した状態で這いつくばっている奇形児です。骨が入っていないのか四肢は不自然に曲がっており、人間の生物学的な限界をはるかに超えた状態の胸郭内では真菌の塊が震えており、まるで骨で作った真菌の巣です。空洞になった体内からは時折何かが噴き出し、臓器の内部で何か忌まわしいものが弱々しく胎動しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal bulk"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"This terrifying fungal construct seems to have lost all facial features, its"
" face covered in thick fungal sprouts.  Its arms end in jagged points as "
"fungal tendrils burst forth."
msgstr "厚い真菌の芽に覆われた顔からは、あらゆる表情が失われています。腕の先からは菌類でできた蔓が飛び出し、その先端はギザギザに尖っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "fungal feeder"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Thousands upon thousands of fungal bulbs, sprouts and tendrils jut out from "
"every angle of this walking carcass.  Large patches of yellow pulsating mold"
" seem to be growing in the zombie's fat folds."
msgstr "この歩く死体は体中から何千もの真菌の根や芽、蔦を生やしています。熱い脂肪の襞の中では、黄色い菌塊が膨らみ脈動しています。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "fungal wretch"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"Through a plume of fungal spores, a small beast struggles to take flight "
"from the wretch's abdomen!"
msgstr "胞子を噴出する哀れな怪物の腹の中で、小さな獣が外へ飛び立とうと暴れています！"

#. ~ Description of monster "truffle pig"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"What was once a pig is now covered in black mold.  Its eyes have been eaten "
"away, but its nose still twitches and sniffs the air, and the tumorous "
"fungal growth riddling its body make for formidable armor.  Its belly is "
"worryingly distended."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "bloated fungal zombie"
#: data/json/monsters/fungus_zombie.json
msgid ""
"With its swollen gray skin overgrown by thick layer of mold, this balloon-"
"like fungal zombie looks like it could violently burst into a cloud of "
"noxious spores at any moment."
msgstr "真菌に覆われたこのゾンビは、灰色の皮膚が破裂しそうなほど膨れ上がっており、少しの衝撃を与えただけでも有害な胞子をまき散らしそうです。"

