#. ~ Description of monster "jabberwock"
#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
msgid ""
"A putrid amalgamation of body parts from man and beast have fused together "
"in this aberration of healthy and rotting flesh.  The eyes of all the heads "
"dart about rapidly and the mouths form a chorus of groaning screams."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "protean giant"
#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
msgid ""
"A seeping conglomeration of spasming muscle and organs have fused together "
"into this towering caricature of the human form.  Various organs fall off of"
" its hulking body only to be reabsorbed moments later.  Despite the stench "
"of death rolling off of it, its flesh looks vital, and in places almost "
"healthy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "fleshy shambler"
#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
msgid ""
"An amalgamation of throbbing organs from various creatures have fused "
"together into this lurching, vaguely-humanoid shape.  Its myriad roughly-"
"formed mouths susurrate in a chorus of sibilant groans and whispers."
msgstr "脈動する様々な生物の臓器が融合し、ふらふらと歩く人型の肉塊を形作っています。無数の口らしき穴からは、耳障りな呼吸と囁き声が聞こえます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
msgid "fleshy shambler"
msgid_plural "fleshy shamblers"
msgstr[0] "さまよう肉人"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
msgid "jabberwock"
msgid_plural "jabberwocks"
msgstr[0] "ジャバウォック"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/jabberwock.json
msgid "protean giant"
msgid_plural "protean giants"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Description of monster "octopus spawn"
#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
msgid ""
"A young Cecaelia.  If one is out here, a very protective parent is likely "
"nearby."
msgstr "若いシセイリアです。近くに過保護な親がいる可能性があります。"

#. ~ Description of monster "kraken"
#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
msgid "The kind of octopus that can take down small boats by itself."
msgstr "小さな舟なら転覆させられてしまいそうなタコです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "scylla"
#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
msgid ""
"The water froths as a great bulk of tentacles breach the surface.  A great "
"bulk swiftly rises until the beak rises above the water and a shriek erupts "
"from the beast."
msgstr "水面を泡立たせながら大量の触手が伸び上がると、次に大きな塊が水中から顔を出し、顎板から悲鳴のような音を響かせます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "stalker octopus"
#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
msgid ""
"This octopus seems larger than you remember from visits to the aquarium and "
"doesn't seem as slowed by land as would be expected.  Its body seems to "
"mimic its surroundings."
msgstr "水族館でもこれほど大きなタコは見たことがありません。陸上でも思った以上に素早く動き、表皮の色を変えて周囲の景色に溶け込みます。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/kraken_spawn.json
msgid "kraken"
msgid_plural "kraken"
msgstr[0] "クラーケン"

#. ~ Monster name
