#. ~ Description of monster "GM security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "OM security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "BM security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "LGR security drone"
#. ~ Description of monster "BS security drone"
#: data/json/monsters/lab_security_drones.json
msgid ""
"A small quadcopter drone, it has a camera and speaker visible.  It patrols "
"the surrounding area in a regular manner, continuously scanning individuals "
"it encounters even if there is hardly anything left of them."
msgstr ""
"カメラレンズとスピーカー、4つの回転翼を備えた小型のドローンです。定期的に周囲を巡回し、世界の荒廃に構うことなく侵入者をスキャンし続けています。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Green Maintenance Badge Trait"
