#. ~ Description of monster "giant slug"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid ""
"A disturbingly large mutated slug as large as a human.  Venom drips from its"
" spearlike tongue, and it is covered with sticky mucus."
msgstr "人間ほどのサイズの、とてつもなく大きく変異したナメクジです。口と思しき穴からは毒性の液体が滴り落ちており、全身が粘液で覆われています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "colossal slug"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid ""
"A mutated slug as wide as a golf cart.  A spearlike tongue protrudes from "
"its mouth as it oozes around slowly, leaving a trail of glistening slime."
msgstr ""
"ゴルフカートほどの大きさの、マダラコウラナメクジの変異体です。牙の付いた口から毒液が滴り落ちており、ゆっくりと這う度にてらてらと輝く粘液が痕跡となって残ります。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized snail"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid ""
"A shelled gastropod either of native or introduced stock.  Worryingly, this "
"one is the size of a cat."
msgstr "在来種、あるいは外来種の、小さな殻をもつ水生腹足類です。通常の個体より大きく見えます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "oversized slug"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid ""
"A slimy gastropod without a shell.  Normally smaller than a human finger, "
"this one is bigger than a squirrel."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "sludge crawler"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid ""
"A sluglike creature the size of a refrigerator.  Its black body glistens as "
"it oozes its way along the ground.  Eyestalks occasionally push their way "
"out of the tar-like mass and look around."
msgstr ""
"全長約2.4m、冷蔵庫ほどの太さのナメクジのような生き物です。黒い体表は粘液によって輝いており、這った跡が地面に残ります。ぬめぬめとした肉体から時折目玉が顔を出し、周囲を見回しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "slug larva"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "A small slug larva."
msgstr "小さなナメクジの幼体です。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant snail"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "A snail grown to human size, oozing with slime."
msgstr "人間サイズまで成長したカタツムリです。酸性の唾液と分泌液を垂らしています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "freshwater snail"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid ""
"A tiny and shelled aquatic gastropod of either native or introduced stock.  "
"Dangerous to eat raw but properly cooked and cleaned it may serve as a fine "
"dish."
msgstr "在来種、あるいは外来種の、小さな殻をもつ水生腹足類です。生食は危険ですが、適切に洗って調理すれば立派な食材になります。"

#. ~ Description of monster "snail larva"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "A tiny little snail.  Its body bulges and squirms unnaturally."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "colossal snail"
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid ""
"An enormous gastropod with a massive shell on its back.  It slowly crawls "
"over the ground while leaving a trail of mucus in its path.  A bladed radula"
" hands from its mouth like a biological chainsaw, backed up by a probing "
"tongue like a harpoon on the end of a tentacle."
msgstr "巨大な殻を背負った腹足類です。酸の粘液を垂らしながら地面をゆっくりと這い回っています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "colossal slug"
msgid_plural "colossal slugs"
msgstr[0] "超巨大ナメクジ"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mollusk.json
msgid "colossal snail"
msgid_plural "colossal snails"
msgstr[0] "超巨大カタツムリ"

#. ~ Monster name
