msgid_plural "snail larvae"
msgstr[0] "カタツムリ(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "experimental mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid ""
"A deformed mutant in a torn jumpsuit, looking at you with insane hatred.  "
"Their skin is a chaotic mix of scales, fur and chitin, and their fingers end"
" in long talons."
msgstr ""
"破れたジャンプスーツに身を包んだ異形の変異体が、狂気と憎悪に満ちた目でこちらを見ています。皮膚は鱗、毛皮、キチン質がつぎはぎのように混ざっており、指先からは長い爪が生えています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "ungulate mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic mutated test subject, still wearing the tattered remains of an "
"orange jumpsuit.  They walk on four warped legs ending in hooves, and their "
"head is dominated by a glistening, tangled crown of antlers."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "arthropod mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid ""
"A horribly mutated experimental subject.  Their original body - still "
"wearing an orange jumpsuit - flops around lifelessly, carried by twelve "
"segmented legs covered in hairy chitin erupting from their back.  At the "
"base of the front pair of legs, an almost-human scalp gives way to a dozen "
"irregularly-sized eyes and a set of mandibles, and from their hind end a "
"stinger not unlike a scorpion's emerges."
msgstr ""
"恐ろしい姿に変異した被験体です。毛の生えたキチン質に覆われている12本の肢が背中から伸び、オレンジ色のジャンプスーツに身を包んだ元の胴体を支えながら機械的に飛び回っています。前肢の付け根には人間の頭部らしき部位が残っており、不揃いなサイズの12個の目と大顎が確認できます。胴体の終端にはサソリのような針が生えています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "camouflaged mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid ""
"A mutated test subject, running on all fours at alarming speed.  Their short"
" fur changes color to match the background in an instant, making you "
"struggle to keep the thing in focus.  Their thin limbs end in long talons, "
"and their mouth is held perpetually open by a set of knife-sized fangs."
msgstr ""
"四つん這いになって驚くほどの速さで走り回る、変異した被験体です。短い毛皮が背景に溶け込むように一瞬で色を変えるため、見つけ出すのに苦労します。細い手足には長い爪が生えており、ナイフのような大きな牙が生えた口は常に開いたままになっています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mutant child"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid ""
"A thin child with a shaved head, wearing a too-large white lab coat over a "
"baggy orange jumpsuit.  They turn their head towards you with uncanny speed,"
" and you're taken aback by the inhuman curiosity burning in their eyes.  "
"Their angelic smile does very little to reassure you of their intentions."
msgstr ""
"オレンジ色のだぶついたジャンプスーツの上から大きな白衣を羽織った、坊主頭の痩せこけた子供です。驚くべき速度でこちらを振り返り、人間離れした好奇心の宿る瞳でじっと観察してきます。天使のような微笑みを見ていると、本当に害意を持っているのか疑いたくなってきます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "bestial mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid ""
"A towering mutated test subject, covered in thick fur and the torn bottom "
"part of a jumpsuit.  Their legs end in large padded feet not unlike a dog's,"
" but they still manage to stand upright, freeing up their clawed hands to "
"tear you apart."
msgstr ""
"変位によって巨大化した被験者のジャンプスーツは破れて下半身だけに残っており、上半身は厚い毛皮で覆われています。足にはイヌに似た大きな肉球が付いていますが、直立歩行は可能なようで、爪が生えた手で敵を引き裂きます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shelled mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid ""
"An enormous mutant hidden beneath a gray segmented shell, crawling on a "
"carpet of innumerable tentacles covered with suckers.  They hold three "
"thicker, branching limbs high on their front end, each dotted with dozens of"
" unblinking eyeballs."
msgstr ""
"吸盤が付いた無数の触手を絨毯のように敷いて這い回る、セグメント化された灰色の甲殻をまとった巨大な変異体です。胴の前方には3本の太い枝状の肢が生えており、その表面には瞬きしない無数の目玉が付いています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "transcendent mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid ""
"An experimental subject wearing a surprisingly clean orange jumpsuit.  They "
"look unchanged at a distance, but as you approach their head spins towards "
"you with unnatural speed.  Their face is disconcertingly beautiful, but "
"their eyes shine with an intelligence far beyond human - and a deep disgust "
"directed at you."
msgstr ""
"新品のように綺麗なオレンジ色のジャンプスーツを着た被験体です。遠くから見た限りでは普通の人間のように見えますが、近づいてみると異常な速度で首を捻ってこちらを捕捉します。どこか違和感のある美しい顔立ちをしており、その瞳は人間を遥かに超えた知性と深い嫌悪感によって輝いています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "mutant child"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid ""
"The child's eyes widen, and they try to say something before falling to the "
"ground."
msgstr "子供は目を見開き、何か言おうとしましたが、そのまま倒れこみました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "transcendent mutant"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid ""
"The mutant gestures at you and barks a few orders, sending its pack of "
"mutants into a frenzy."
msgstr "一体の変異体がこちらを指して何かの身振りをすると、他の変異体の群れが狂乱しました。"

#. ~ Description of monster "chud"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid ""
"This was once a person, but they've undergone some hideous transformation.  "
"Their pallid skin is clammy and wet, and their face is dominated by "
"unnaturally large, reflective eyes that no longer hold the spark of "
"intelligence."
msgstr ""

