msgstr[0] "超越変異体"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant.json
msgid "ungulate mutant"
msgid_plural "ungulate mutants"
msgstr[0] "有蹄変異体"

#. ~ Description of monster "Loper puppy"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"An adorable, but unusual puppy.  It wags its tail happily but something "
"about its legs seems off."
msgstr "奇妙な愛らしい子犬です。嬉しそうに尻尾を振っていますが、脚に変異の兆候があります。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Mauler puppy"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"An adorable, but unusual puppy.  It wags its tail happily but something "
"about its mouth seems off."
msgstr "奇妙な愛らしい子犬です。嬉しそうに尻尾を振っていますが、口元に変異の兆候があります。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Thrasher puppy"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"An adorable, but unusual puppy.  It wags its tail happily but something "
"about its paws seems off."
msgstr "奇妙な愛らしい子犬です。嬉しそうに尻尾を振っていますが、足先に変異の兆候があります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Cerbearus"
msgid_plural "Cerbearuses"
msgstr[0] "ケルベアロス"

#. ~ Description of monster "destrier"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"From a distance, this freak of nature could almost be taken for a draft "
"horse but for its tufted ears and the set of its eyes, mounted at the front "
"of its face beneath the cunning brow of a predator.  Its hooves are splayed "
"out to form three-toed claws that grip rock and soil alike as it prowls the "
"fields, and from time to time an overlong forked tongue slips out of its "
"fanged maw to taste the air."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "dextrous raccoon"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"Its paws have grown to be longer, and it seems capable of briefly standing "
"on its hindlimbs.  You wonder if this sleazy beast is able to open doors "
"yet."
msgstr ""
"足が長く発達し、少しの間なら後ろ足で立つこともできるようになったアライグマです。手先が更に器用になった卑劣な害獣は、扉も勝手に開けてしまうかもしれません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Loper"
msgid_plural "Lopers"
msgstr[0] "ロープ犬"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Loper puppy"
msgid_plural "Loper puppies"
msgstr[0] "ロープ犬(幼体)"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Mauler"
msgid_plural "Maulers"
msgstr[0] "歯列犬"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Mauler puppy"
msgid_plural "Mauler puppies"
msgstr[0] "歯列犬(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "Cerbearus"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"Sometime between the Cataclysm and now, this black bear has gained two extra"
" heads.  This doesn't seem to have improved its disposition."
msgstr "大変動から現在に至るまでに2つの余分な頭を獲得したアメリカグマです。その性分は普通のクマと何ら変わっていないように見えます。"

#. ~ Feed message of monster "destrier"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The %s devours the meat.  It growls low at you, but no longer seems quite as"
" unfriendly."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Pet message of monster "Loper puppy"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "Mauler puppy"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "Thrasher puppy"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s happily wags its tail while you pat their head."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "Thrasher"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"This dog has undergone visible mutation.  Its paws are larger than normal "
"and have developed long digging nails.  Its fur is extremely short, barely "
"covering its leathery skin."
msgstr ""
"このイヌが変異を起こしていることは見た目から明らかです。足が通常より発達しており、地面を掘るのに適した長い爪が生えています。毛足が非常に短く、革のように強靭な皮膚をもっています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Loper"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"This dog has undergone visible mutation.  While its body is larger than "
"normal, its legs are noticeably elongated, muscular and covered in long "
"cord-like fur.  It easily stands as tall as a man and watches its "
"surroundings with reflective eyes."
msgstr ""
"このイヌが変異を起こしていることは見た目から明らかです。体が通常より大きく、脚が非常に長く筋肉質で、長いロープのような毛皮に包まれています。立ち上がると人間ほどの背丈になり、輝く瞳であらゆる動きを注意深く観察しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mongrel"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"This dog of unidentifiable breed looks like it has seen better days.  Its "
"wiry hair is patchy, revealing scales underneath, but it still happily wags "
"its tails anyways."
msgstr ""
"昔はもっとまともだったのでしょうが、今や犬種も分かりません。しなやかな毛皮には斑点が浮かび、皮膚には鱗が生えていますが、そんなことはお構いなしに尻尾を振って喜んでいます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "feaver"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"This mutant beaver's body is covered with brightly-colored feathers in a "
"particularly eyecatching pattern.  It must have been very lucky not to have "
"been caught by a predator before now."
msgstr "非常に目立つ鮮やかな模様の羽毛で覆われた、ビーバーの変異体です。今まで捕食者に見つからなかったのは幸運だったとしか言いようがありません。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dambreaker"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"This mutated beaver is almost double its normal size, and its back is "
"covered with tough-looking bristles."
msgstr "本来のサイズの2倍近くまで成長した、ビーバーの変異体です。背中は丈夫そうなな剛毛で覆われています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "spideer fawn"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"This obviously mutated adolescent deer moves unsteadily on its eight legs, "
"nervously scanning the area with all five eyes."
msgstr "8本の足でフラフラと動き、5つの目で周囲を神経質そうに見渡す様子を見れば、この幼いシカが変異していることは明らかです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "spideer"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"This once-ordinary deer has grown a disturbingly agile array of extra limbs,"
" plus three extra eyes.  Its antlers wriggle subtly in the wind."
msgstr "どこにでもいるようなシカが、気味が悪いほど機敏に動く余分な肢と3つの目を得ました。枝角が風を受けてかすかに揺らめいています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Mauler"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"This stocky dog has undergone visible mutation.  Its jaw has widened and "
"features more teeth than any canine should ever have."
msgstr ""
"このずんぐりとした体形のイヌが変異を起こしていることは見た目から明らかです。顎が非常に発達しており、イヌとは思えないほど多くの歯が生えているのが特徴です。にっこり笑っているような表情を浮かべ、元気に尻尾を振っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dire wolf"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"This wolf has grown to terrifying proportions, rivalling a small car.  Its "
"teeth give steak knives a run for their money, and it definitely doesn't "
"look friendly."
msgstr "小型車と同程度のサイズまで急激に成長したオオカミです。その牙はまるでステーキナイフのようで、どう見ても友好的に触れ合えるとは思えません。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Thrasher"
msgid_plural "Thrashers"
msgstr[0] "大爪犬"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "Thrasher puppy"
msgid_plural "Thrasher puppies"
msgstr[0] "大爪犬(幼体)"

#. ~ Description of monster "slavering coyote"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"Unnatural bulges line the neck of this obviously-mutated coyote; green-"
"tinted foam flecks from its lips, and there's a crazed look in its eyes."
msgstr "このコヨーテは明らかに変異しており、首に不自然な瘤が並んでいます。口元には緑がかった泡が付着し、目は狂気に光っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "grinning coyote"
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid ""
"Were it not for the misshapen snout and visible teeth, this would look like "
"an ordinary Northeastern coyote.  Closer inspection of its mouth reveals row"
" after row of serrated, shark-like teeth."
msgstr ""
"歪んだ鼻と特徴的な歯がなければ、アメリカ大陸北西部に生息する普通のコヨーテのように見えます。口元をよく見てみると、サメのような鋸歯状の歯が列をなしていることが分かります。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "dambreaker"
msgid_plural "dambreakers"
msgstr[0] "巨大ビーバー"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "destrier"
msgid_plural "destriers"
msgstr[0] ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/mutant_mammal.json
msgid "dextrous raccoon"
msgid_plural "dextrous raccoons"
msgstr[0] "狡猾アライグマ"

