msgid "%1$s tries to fasten onto your %2$s, but can't penetrate your armor."
msgstr "%1$sが%2$sに掴みかかろうとしましたが、装甲に阻まれました。"

#. ~ Description of monster "person"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A common human.  It looks exactly like a human looks.  You can see them.  "
"They can see you.  You know they know you can see them.  They know you know "
"you can see them.  They move towards you."
msgstr ""
"一般的な人間です。人間の外見をしています。あなたは人間を視認できます。人間はあなたを視認できます。あなたは人間があなたを視認できることを知っています。人間はあなたが人間を視認できることを知っています。人間はあなたの方に向かっています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dementia"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A crazed individual, the bloody scars on the side of its shaved head suggest"
" some sort of partial lobotomy."
msgstr "一見するとただの狂人のようですが、流血を続ける傷口から判断するに、どうやらロボトミー手術を受けた個体だと思われます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "blood sacrifice"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A defiled human body, once living.  Tortured to death long ago, it remains "
"chained to the altar, the putrescent flays of its peeled skin quivering like"
" so much flotsam upon a murky pond."
msgstr ""
"かつてここの住民だった、汚らわしい人間の肉塊です。ずっと昔に拷問で死んだようです。祭壇に繋がれ、鞭で打たれて皮が剥げ腐りかかった体は、池のほとりに漂着したごみのようにゆらゆらと揺れています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "tentacle dog"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A dog's body with a mass of ropey, black tentacles reaching out from its "
"head."
msgstr "胴体はイヌのものですが、頭から縄状の黒い触手の塊が伸びています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "dog"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A domesticated mongrel of the canine persuasion.  In the absence of human "
"society, it has turned feral."
msgstr "かつてどこかで飼われていた雑種のイヌです。人間が居なくなった今は野生化しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mercenary officer"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A figure in a high-tech suit, their outline contorted as though you were "
"viewing them through a prism.  Their movements are strained but determined, "
"pushing through apparent pain with feverish resolve, dead-set on reaching "
"their target."
msgstr ""
"ハイテクスーツを着た人物は、まるでプリズムを通して見ているかのように輪郭が歪んでいます。緊張した動きですが決意が籠っており、明らかな痛みを熱狂的な精神で抑え込み、目標に到達しようと全力を尽くしています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "mercenary ghost"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A figure in combat gear, distorted and shattered like broken glass.  They "
"thrash around as they move, an expression of shock and anguish frozen on "
"their face."
msgstr "割れたガラスのように歪んで粉々に割れている、戦闘服を着た人物です。驚愕と苦痛の表情を凍り付かせ、のたうち回るように動き回っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "nuckalavee"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A four-legged monster that almost resembles a skinless rider and horse fused"
" into one grotesque apparition.  Its arms hang nearly to the ground, and a "
"noxious fog streams from both of its mouths."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "wraith"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic shadow, chaotically changing in shape and volume.  Two piercing "
"orbs of light dominate what can only be described as its head."
msgstr "無秩序に形を変える巨大な影です。刺すように輝く二つの目によって、なんとか頭部と思しき場所を判別できます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "hound of Tindalos"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A grotesque dog-like beast, its frame is angular and emaciated and its head "
"is like that of an abyssal fish.  When it moves, its twisted limbs "
"duplicate, merge, disappear, and reform in dissonance, as if a hundred "
"copies of itself were somehow forced to inhabit the same space.  Extraneous "
"to our reality, it moves between the corners of the world, hunting those "
"that would dare step beyond time and space."
msgstr ""
"やせ衰えて骨ばった身体と深海魚のような頭部をもつ、イヌに似た気味の悪い獣です。動く度に捻じれた四肢が増殖し、融合し、消滅し、再び生成される不自然な様子は、この獣のコピーを同じ空間に無理やり100体出現させたかのようにも見えます。人間の認識する現実を超えて世界中のあらゆる鋭角を飛び渡り、時空に干渉しようとした愚か者を追いかけます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "flying polyp"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A half-polypous, utterly alien creature.  It is a large writhing tumor of "
"eyes, mouths and tentacles; It's only partly material and has the ability to"
" fly, despite the absence of wings.   "
msgstr ""
"半ポリープ状の、見るからに地球外生物といった姿の怪物です。全体が同一の素材からなり、翼が無いにもかかわらず空を飛びます。他のどんな音よりも耳につく、奇妙な口笛のような音を発生させます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "yugg"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A huge, slimy worm-like creature.  Its pale, flattened head drips an oily "
"mucus as it breaches the ground, searching for prey.  Its pinkish mouth "
"opens and closes, revealing long fangs glistening with ropey strands of "
"saliva, which leave smoldering stains wherever they drip."
msgstr ""
"ぬめぬめとした巨大なワームのような怪物です。薄く平たい頭部から油のような粘液を垂らして、獲物を求めて地中を突き進みます。ピンク色の口が開閉する度に口内の長い牙が姿を現し、粘着質の糸を引く唾液が滴った地面には、煙を立てる染みが残ります。"

#. ~ Description of monster "twisted body"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A human body, but with its limbs, neck, and hair impossibly twisted.  It "
"clambers around swiftly, making awful screeching sounds."
msgstr ""
"手足、首、髪など色々な箇所が見るも無残に捻じ曲がった、かつて人間だった何かです。聞くに堪えない絶叫を口から吐き、周辺を素早く這い回っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "writhing root"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A small chunk of curious looking roots, constantly trying to grow and expand"
" but failing miserably.  It has grown weak, as if incompatible with the very"
" soil it is in."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "nether fish symbiote"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A small fish symbiote that resembles a deformed, eyeless piranha.  It swims "
"blindly in the yellow ichor, wriggling incessantly with malicious intent."
msgstr "目が退化した奇妙なピラニアのような姿の、小さな共生魚です。敵意をむき出しにしながら、黄色い体液の中をひたすら泳いでいます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "missing researcher"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A spindly abomination taller than a house and whipping its disgusting body "
"around in apparent agony.  It's awful to look at, but worst of all is the "
"realization that this is a human being, twisted and stretched like a piece "
"of chewing gum, and somehow still alive."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "spearfisher"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A strange quadrupedal creature with long, lanky limbs and a gaping maw.  A "
"long sharp spike protrudes from it's back, which occasionally launches from "
"its' joint to stab prey before slinking back in."
msgstr ""
"ひょろ長い肢と大きな口をもち、背中から長く鋭い棘が飛び出している、痩せ細った四足歩行生物です。時折関節をバネのように使って獲物に襲い掛かり、狩りを終えるとどこかへ隠れてしまいます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "glowstalk"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A tall, thin stalk of rubbery flesh, creeping around on a sluglike foot at "
"its base.  The blob you might call the \"head\" is riddled with brightly "
"glowing, yellow-green pustules, while a line down the middle seems to "
"function as its mouth.  It looks unhealthy, like it's withering away."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "impossible shape"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A twisted shape floating in midair; its angles don't seem to quite add up - "
"it hurts to look at.  Is it inanimate?  Alive?  Something else?  You can't "
"make heads or tails of it at all, but you can see through it - not as if it "
"were transparent, but as if it isn't quite fully here."
msgstr ""
"捻じれた物体が空中に浮かんでいます。その形状や角度にはどこか違和感があり、見ていると心を苛みます。無生物なのか？生物なのか？どちらでもないのか？全く分かりません。透明な素材でできているわけでもないのに透き通っており、実体の一部をこの世界の外に置いてきたかのような印象を受けます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "vortex"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A twisting spot in the air, with some kind of morphing mass at its center."
msgstr "不定形の塊を中心に空気が渦を巻いています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "strange leech"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A very wet, snake-like creature which you estimate to be five feet long, "
"covered in slime and slithering about.  Occasionally, it will attach itself "
"to the flesh around it and begin to suck."
msgstr "体長約150cm程度の湿り気を帯びたヘビのような生物が、粘液を滴らせながら這い回っています。付近に肉を見つけると取りつき、食事を摂ります。"

#. ~ Description of monster "carrion grub"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A wriggling brown grub of unnatural origin, slithering along the ground and "
"unnaturally pulsating.  As it moves along, it chews through any available "
"flesh with surprising speed."
msgstr "どこから来たのかも分からない、脈動しうねり這い回る異様な茶色い地虫です。ひとたび動き出すと、肉であれば何でも驚くべき速度で噛み砕きます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "chunk of alien flesh"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"A writhing mass of strange flesh and something that oddly resembles "
"tentacles.  It is getting more pale by the minute."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "thing"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"An amorphous black creature, detaching and sprouting tentacles without any "
"apparent pause."
msgstr "不定形の黒い物体は、分裂したり不規則に触手を伸ばしたりしています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "sloth"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"An animate blotch of conflicting shapes, when you look at or think of this, "
"a desire to stop moving rises."
msgstr "相反する形状が混在し、常に動き続けています。じっと見たり形を思い描いたりすると、もう動きたくないという欲求が心に湧き上がってきます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "guilt"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"An animate blotch of conflicting shapes, when you look at or think of this, "
"memories of your wrongdoings rise to the surface."
msgstr "相反する形状が混在し、常に動き続けています。じっと見たり形を思い描いたりすると、自らが犯した罪の記憶が心に浮かび上がってきます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shifting mass"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"An animate blotch of conflicting symmetries, erratically hovering through "
"the air.  It's not even real enough to hold a stable shape, and its entire "
"form is constantly in flux.  You can see through it - not as if it were "
"transparent, but as if it isn't quite fully here."
msgstr ""
"互いに矛盾する鏡像が混じり合ってできた染みが、不規則に宙を舞っています。その形状は常に不安定で、流動し続けています。透明な素材でできているわけでもないのに透き通っており、実体の一部をこの世界の外に置いてきたかのような印象を受けます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shadow snake"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"An animate shadow in the form of a long and sinuous snake.  Translucent and "
"dark, it glides silently across the floor, wriggling and flexing as it "
"moves."
msgstr "うねうねと動くヘビの形の影です。半透明の暗い色をしており、体をくねらせ脈動しながら、地面を静かに滑るように進みます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shadow"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"An animate shadow.  Looking like nothing more than an errant patch of normal"
" shadow, it draws your attention by the way it moves subtly and whispers "
"softly in the back of your mind.  Strange intrusive thoughts accompany the "
"quiet murmur, trying to forcefully supplant your own."
msgstr ""
"動き回る影です。見た目は通常の影に過ぎませんが、その巧妙な動きと心の奥底に囁きかけてくる声には注意が必要です。聞こえてくる密やかな音が耳に入ると、心に異様な思考が侵入し、心を塗り潰されてしまうような感覚に陥ります。"

#. ~ Description of monster "flaming eye"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"An enormous disembodied eyeball the size of a person, flying through the air"
" through some unknown agency.  Wreathed in unnatural flickering blue flame, "
"it possesses a blazing yellow iris with a slitted pupil like that of a cat, "
"and trails a set of flailing black tendrils as it slowly drifts about.  You "
"involuntarily get a heavy, sinking feeling deep in your gut as you watch its"
" gaze comb over the world around it."
msgstr ""
"人間と同じサイズの巨大な眼球が、何らかの未知の力によって空中に浮かんでいます。猫のようなスリット状の瞳孔と鮮やかな黄色い虹彩をもつ瞳は、超自然的に青く揺れる炎に包まれており、周囲には黒い触手がゆらゆらと漂っています。その視線が周囲を舐めるように動くと、重く沈んだ嫌な感覚が腹の底から自然と湧き上がってきます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "human snail"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"An enormous fleshy snail, with an oddly human face.  Eyestalks protrude from"
" where the eyes should be."
msgstr "人間の顔をした奇妙で巨大なカタツムリです。本来は目である所から眼柄が突き出ています。"

#. ~ Feed message of monster "dog"
#. ~ Pet message of monster "dog"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "If you're seeing this message it's a bug."
msgstr "このメッセージが見えている場合は、バグが発生しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "structural spur"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"Misshapen spikes of concrete and rebar crumble upwards from the floor, held "
"aloft by strands of visual distortion.  Sound around it is drowned and "
"distorted into an incessant drone."
msgstr ""
"歪んだコンクリートと鉄筋で作られた棘が、空間の歪みによってできた糸で吊り下げられているかのように、空中に浮かんでいます。唸るような音を常に発しており、周囲の音がかき消されてしまいます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "star vampire"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"Originally invisible, you can now see the myriad writhing tentacles tipped "
"with gnashing maws that make up this creature.  The small central body is "
"dominated by an enormous fanged mouth from which emerges a near-constant "
"high-pitched tittering."
msgstr ""
"透明だった星の精が現れ、先端で鋭い歯が音を立てている無数の蠢く触手が見えるようになりました。中央部の小さな胴体には巨大な牙のある大きな口があり、そこから甲高い鳴き声が常に聞こえてきます。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "structural spur"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "Scraps of metal fly off the spur and into the nearby swarms!"
msgstr "構造体から金属片が飛び出し、付近にいる無数の棘に加わりました！"

#. ~ Death message of monster "memory"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s begins to cry as it disappears."
msgstr "%sは泣きながら消失しました。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "dog"
#. ~ Death message of monster "tentacle dog"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s emerges!"
msgstr "%sが出現しました！"

#. ~ Death message of monster "veiled butterfly"
#. ~ Death message of monster "writhing root"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s fades away into nothingness."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Death message of monster "shifting mass"
#. ~ Death message of monster "impossible shape"
#. ~ Death message of monster "guilt"
#. ~ Death message of monster "sloth"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s fades away."
msgstr "%sは消えました。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "shrapnel swarm"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s grows inert."
msgstr "%sは活動を停止しました。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "person"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s just disappeared."
msgstr "%sは消えました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "veiled butterfly"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s's wings move in odd ways and a strange glow envelops you!"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "mercenary officer"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "The creature screams \"SOMEONE HELP ME, ANYONE!\"."
msgstr "モンスターが叫びました。「誰か、だれか助けて！」"

#. ~ Death message of monster "structural spur"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
#, c-format
msgid "The distortion fades as the %s crumbles."
msgstr "空間の歪みが消え、%sが崩れ去りました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "guilt"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"The guilt makes no physical movement and yet you feel the force of its "
"assault.  Everything feels heavier."
msgstr "物理的に動いていない筈の咎から、強い圧力を感じます。何もかもが重く感じます。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "shifting mass"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"The shifting mass passes through you as if you were an illusion, and a "
"slight wave of fatigue washes over you."
msgstr "変位物体がまるで幻のように肉体を通り抜け、軽い倦怠感に襲われました。"

#. ~ Description of monster "memory"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"The silhouette of a human body, reaching towards you like it needs help.  It"
" has no eyes, but you can still feel it staring through you."
msgstr "助けを求めるように手を伸ばす人の影です。目はありませんが、じっと見つめられているような気がします。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "sloth"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"The sloth does nothing, and you feel time itself aiding your desire to do "
"nothing."
msgstr "怠惰は動きません。何もしたくないという欲求に時間が応えてくれている気がします。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "mercenary ghost"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "The soldier fades away to nothing."
msgstr "兵士の姿が消え失せました。"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "yugg"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "The yugg launches a viscous barb!"
msgstr "%sは腐食性の液体を発射しました！"

#. ~ Description of monster "veiled butterfly"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"There is barely anything there, but you do notice hints of a faint, "
"translucent veiled creature that you can only describe as butterfly-like.  "
"While strangely alluring, it seems unsuited to the atmosphere and is slowly "
"falling apart."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "unseen hunter"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"There was nothing here a moment ago, but now you see the faintest outline of"
" an otherworldly creature approaching you with jittery leaps.  Trying to "
"focus on it reveals a pointed beak dripping translucent fluid and rows upon "
"rows of bladed legs grasping the floor, before your eyes begin to burn and "
"your head starts to spin."
msgstr ""
"先ほどまで何も居なかった場所に異界の生物の輪郭がうっすらと見えており、ビクビクと跳ねながら近づいてきます。焦点を合わせようとすると、半透明の液体を垂らす尖ったくちばしと、何層にも重なる刃が生えた足先が見え、目眩と頭痛に襲われます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "hunting horror"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"This is some sort of great viperine creature, possessed of a curiously "
"distorted head and massive clawed appendages.  It partially supports itself "
"with the aid of black, rubbery wings of monstrous dimensions.  The wings "
"beat slowly like an eagle while the body coils through the air like how an "
"eel swims in water."
msgstr ""
"奇妙な歪んだ頭部と巨大な爪状の部位をもつ、ヘビに似た怪物です。黒いゴムのような材質の翼によって体をなんとか支えています。ワシのようにゆったりと翼を羽ばたかせ、ウナギのように全身をくねらせて動きます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "gozu"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"This is some sort of unnatural cross between a bull and a man.  Quite "
"different from the minotaur of legend, it possesses a shaggy white bull's "
"head on an otherwise unremarkable human body.  It grunts and snuffles, "
"drooling ropey strands of white slobber down its chest.  You occasionally "
"catch a glint in its eyes and freeze up involuntarily, like a deer in "
"headlights."
msgstr ""
"雄牛と人間を掛け合わせたような超自然の怪物です。かの有名なミノタウルスとはまったく異なる、一般的な人間の胴体に毛足の長い白牛の頭がのった姿をしています。たるんだ靴と汚れた丈の短いズボンを身に着け、鼻息は荒く、ごわついた白く太い毛は胸の長さまで垂れ下がっています。その輝く瞳に見つめられると、ヘッドライトに照らされたシカのように身体が固まってしまいます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "strange bug"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"This small, three legged bug-like creature curiously wriggles its 5 "
"antennae.  Its body somewhat reminds you of a stink bug.  It looks like a "
"fish out of water and is getting weaker by the minute."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "blank body"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"This thing has the general shape of a human, but that's where the "
"resemblance stops.  Featureless and pale, its face is entirely missing, "
"leaving only a huge hole that leads down what might be a throat.  Adding to "
"its unearthly appearance is the way it moves, stiff and doll-like as though "
"it was only feigning knowing how to walk."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "shrapnel swarm"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"Uncountable jagged spikes, cleaving reality as they fly through its "
"invisible seams."
msgstr "鋭く尖った大量の棘が、空間上の見えない亀裂を通り抜け、現実世界に突き刺さろうとしています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "hanging roper"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid ""
"What looks to be a loose mass of worm-like appendages reveals a solid body "
"beneath, a great maw of rows of serrated fangs taking up most of the body.  "
"It is either very lethargic or stalking prey, sitting in place without much "
"obvious motion."
msgstr ""
"ワームのような紐状の肉塊が落ちていますが、その下には鋸歯状の牙を大量に生やした大口をもつ強力な本体が潜んでいます。まったくその場で動かないか、目立たないようじわじわと獲物に忍び寄るように動きます。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "person"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "You feel something was destroyed inside you."
msgstr "自分の中の何かが壊れたような気がしました。"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "impossible shape"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json data/mods/innawood/monsters/nether.json
msgid "You get a very clear view of the impossible shape."
msgstr "不可能物体の形状が心に焼き付きました。"

#. ~ Description of monster "tainted shadow"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "Your shadow is host to something alien."
msgstr "自分の影が未知のものに憑りつかれています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "tainted shadow"
#: data/json/monsters/nether.json
msgid "Your shadow seemingly becomes normal again."
msgstr "影が元に戻ったような気がします。"

