#. ~ Description of monster "mutant frog"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A hopping amphibian that has grown big enough to eat a small dog.  It looks "
"unwell, as if this growth spurt was less than comfortable."
msgstr "大抵のイヌよりも大きな、変異したウシガエルです。急激な変異がたたったのか、調子が悪そうです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "juvenile mutant rattlesnake"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A large mutated timber rattlesnake in its hatchling stage.  It will "
"eventually grow a rattle and learn how to hunt."
msgstr "孵化したばかりの、変異した大型のヨコシマガラガラヘビ です。やがて特徴的な尾が発達し、狩りを学びます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant rattlesnake"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A large mutated timber rattlesnake, about six times as large as the norm.  "
"While it still isn't big enough to regard humans as potential prey, it is "
"much more aggressive and dangerous compared to a normal rattler."
msgstr ""
"通常の約6倍のサイズに変異した、巨大なヨコシマガラガラヘビです。人間を潜在的な獲物とみなせるほど大きくはありませんが、通常のガラガラヘビに比べてはるかに攻撃的で危険です。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant frog"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A mutated frog taller than a man.  Its huge mouth and dumpy body aren't "
"quite as funny at this size."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "mutant rattlesnake"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A mutated timber rattlesnake, about three times as large as the norm.  While"
" it isn't big enough to regard humans as potential prey, it is more "
"aggressive and dangerous compared to a normal rattler."
msgstr ""
"通常の約3倍のサイズに変異した、大きなヨコシマガラガラヘビです。人間を潜在的な獲物とみなせるほど大きくはありませんが、通常のガラガラヘビに比べてはるかに攻撃的で危険です。"

#. ~ Description of monster "deathrattle serpent"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A primal fear strikes when the club-like tail of this massively warped snake"
" shifts, an assortment of bones rattling softly.  Multiple sets of hollow "
"fangs have erupted in its maw, which itself is flanked by skinless ropes of "
"powerful muscle.  Its scales constantly shed off and regrow with unnatural "
"speed."
msgstr ""
"鎌首をもたげた巨大なヘビが棍棒のような尾を掲げて振るうと、複数の骨が擦れて柔らかい音を立て、聞く者に原始的な恐怖を沸き立たせます。口からは中空の牙が飛び出しており、その根元には縄のように引き絞られた剥き出しの筋肉が覗いています。常に脱皮を続けており、異常な速度で肉体が再生しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "giant tadpole"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A tadpole the size of a bass.  At this size, it's easy to spot the little "
"growths that will eventually become its limbs."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "tadpole"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A teeny tiny baby frog, smaller than a penny.  It's basically just a head "
"with a tail."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "juvenile rattlesnake"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"A timber rattlesnake in its hatchling stage.  It will eventually grow a "
"rattle and learn how to hunt."
msgstr "孵化したばかりのヨコシマガラガラヘビです。やがて特徴的な尾が発達し、狩りを学びます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "sewer snake"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"An aggressive mutant variety of the worm snake, turned pale yellow from lack"
" of sunlight.  It swarms beneath the ground, and is named for its habit of "
"infesting sewer lines."
msgstr ""
"地下生活を続けるうちに淡黄色に変色した、攻撃性の高いメクラヘビの変異体の一種です。地下に群れで生活しており、下水道に入り込む習性があります。"

#. ~ Description of monster "megafrog"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"Big enough to swallow a person whole, this enormous frog is especially "
"lumpy, burdened by tumors and extra toes as its unnatural growth runs out of"
" control."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of monster "bullfrog"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"The American bullfrog, a slimy green amphibian the size of a rat.  It feeds "
"on insects, mice, lizards and any other living thing it can stuff down its "
"gullet."
msgstr "自然に生息しているウシガエルです。虫やネズミ、トカゲなど、飲み込める物なら何でも食べます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "rattlesnake"
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid ""
"The timber rattlesnake, the most venomous viper native to New England.  "
"Climatic changes have extended its range far into the north."
msgstr ""
"ヨコシマガラガラヘビはニューイングランドに生息する毒蛇の中で最も毒性の強い種です。気候変動によって、その生息域ははるか北にまで広がっています。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/reptile_amphibian.json
msgid "bullfrog"
msgid_plural "bullfrogs"
msgstr[0] "ウシガエル"

