#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid "\"Teep.\""
msgstr "「ピー。」"

#. ~ Description of monster "Hub 01 camspy"
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid ""
"A white and brown quadcopter drone mounting what looks to be a camera dome "
"and a large antenna array.  It calmly hovers a comfortable distance above "
"the ground, surveiling its surroundings with cold indifference."
msgstr ""
"カメラドームと大きなアンテナが取り付けられた、4つの回転翼をもつ白色と茶色のドローンです。地上から少し離れた地点で静かに浮遊し、周囲を冷徹に監視しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "Hub 01 exterminatron"
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid ""
"An an armed and up-armored skitterbot, clad in white plastic plating and "
"mounting a stripped down 7.62 battle rifle over its original cam-arm."
msgstr ""
"元々のカメラアーム上部に7.62mmバトルライフルを取り付けて全体を白いプラスチック装甲で覆った、攻撃力と防御力を強化された高速ロボットです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid "Hub 01 camspy"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 camspies"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01監視ドローン"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid "Hub 01 exterminatron"
msgid_plural "Hub 01 exterminatrons"
msgstr[0] "ハブ01強化高速ロボット"

#. ~ Description of special attack of monster "Hub 01 exterminatron"
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid ""
"The exterminatron legs lock into place as it swings its turret to bear."
msgstr "強化高速ロボットが脚部を固定し、銃器発射の衝撃に備えました。"

#. ~ Description of monster "prototype laser turret"
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid ""
"This appears to be a very experimental automated tower.  Lacking armor "
"plating and seemingly half-built, it's little more than an oversized laser "
"emitter and a camera, both welded to a swiveling platform."
msgstr ""
"非常に実験的な自動化されたタレットのようです。外装もなく未完成品のような姿をしており、特大のレーザー放射装置とカメラを回転台に溶接しただけの作りです。"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/robofac_robots.json
msgid "prototype laser turret"
msgid_plural "prototype laser turrets"
msgstr[0] "試作レーザータレット"

#. ~ Description of monster "tunnel runner"
#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid ""
"Prior to the Cataclysm someone might have referred to this dog-sized rat as "
"a 'mass of claws and teeth,' but that could describe nearly everything you "
"meet these days.  In any case, this particular mass of claws and teeth is "
"eyeing its surroundings hungrily."
msgstr ""
"大変動以前なら、このイヌほどのサイズのラットは「爪と歯が生えた毛玉」と呼ばれていたかもしれませんが、最近見かける生物の大多数にこの愛称が当てはまってしまいます。いずれにせよ、この爪と歯が生えた毛玉は、飢えた目で周囲を見つめています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "big rat"
#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid ""
"This cat-sized rat snuffles along the ground looking for things to eat.  It "
"hisses at anything that comes near it, baring sizable teeth."
msgstr "ネコほどのサイズのラットが地面を這い回り、食べ物を探しています。近寄ろうとすると、大きな歯を見せて威嚇します。"

#. ~ Description of monster "pack rat"
#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid ""
"This mutated rodent stands on two legs, as tall as a man.  It has a habit of"
" shoving shiny objects into its cheek pouches, and eyes its surroundings "
"with too-human eyes that sparkle with greed, but not intellect."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid "big rat"
msgid_plural "big rats"
msgstr[0] "巨大ラット"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid "pack rat"
msgid_plural "pack rats"
msgstr[0] "変異ラット"

#. ~ Monster name
#: data/json/monsters/rodentkin.json
msgid "tunnel runner"
msgid_plural "tunnel runners"
msgstr[0] "穴掘りラット"

#. ~ Description of monster "slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"A black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of living "
"oil."
msgstr "粘性のある黒い塊です。まるで命を宿した石油のように地面を這っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "amoebic mold"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"A formless slime mold the size of a cow.  Crusty bits of cytoplasm fall away"
" as it oozes across the ground."
msgstr "ウシほどのサイズのねばねばした何かです。動く度に外皮のような細胞片が剥落しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "shoggoth"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"A gargantuan protoplasmic blob, constantly reshaping, forming new pseudopods"
" seemingly at will.  All over its body are eyes that form and disappear.  "
"The rapid and chaotic way it reconstitutes itself gives the impression of it"
" boiling over with some kind of primordial fury."
msgstr ""
"巨大な原形質のブロブは常に形を変え、自らの意思で足のような突起を生み出しているように見えます。混沌とした肉体を再構築し続けており、根源的な怒りによって沸騰しているようにも見えます。"

#. ~ Description of monster "brain slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"A gigantic black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob "
"of living oil.  Other slimes seem to swarm around it."
msgstr "粘性のある黒い巨大な塊です。まるで命を宿した石油のように地面を這っています。他のスライムはこの個体を中心として群れを成しているようです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "big slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"A large black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of "
"living oil."
msgstr "粘性のある黒い大きな塊です。まるで命を宿した石油のように地面を這っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "small slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"A small black blob of viscous goo, oozing across the ground like a glob of "
"living oil."
msgstr "粘性のある黒い小さな塊です。まるで命を宿した石油のように地面を這っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "slime microbian"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid "A small wriggling slime, a first line of defense for the colony."
msgstr "コロニーの第一防衛ラインとなる、蠢く小さなスライムです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "slime ocularium"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"A spire of hardened slime, coated in rotating eyespots and glistening ocular"
" nerves."
msgstr "自由に動く眼球と濡れた眼球神経が生えた、硬質化したスライムの柱です。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "sewer slime"
#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s bursts, releasing its vile contents!"
msgstr "%sが爆発し、中身がぶちまけられました！"

