#: data/json/monsters/slimes.json
msgid ""
"This moving, black glob emits a foul stench.  It has incorporated the both "
"the liquid and solid contents of the sewer water."
msgstr "悪臭を放つ黒い塊です。下水道に含まれる液体と固体、両方の成分が含まれています。"

