msgid_plural "wretched pukers"
msgstr[0] "廃棄ゾンビ"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "charged amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#, c-format
msgid "A bolt of electricity arcs from %s!"
msgstr "%sが放出する電撃が弧を描いて迫ってきました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "charged amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#, c-format
msgid "A cloud of electricity explodes from the %s"
msgstr "%sが周囲に電撃を放出しました"

#. ~ Description of monster "leaping amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid ""
"A four-legged white creature about the size of a human, running with a "
"decidedly feline gait, the three remaining limbs holding an almost-"
"translucent skin membrane outstretched on its side and rear.  Much of its "
"head is taken up by a beak like a raven's, which opens to reveal a set of "
"jagged black teeth."
msgstr ""
"人間ほどのサイズの7本足の白っぽい生物です。4本の肢を使ってネコ科動物のように走り回り、半透明の被膜に覆われた残り3本の肢は胴の側面と背面から飛び出しています。頭の大部分はカラスのようなくちばしで占められており、口の中にはギザギザの黒い歯が生えています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "caustic amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid ""
"A gangly creature running on six legs, its form made irregular by the green "
"pustules at the limbs' base, each feeding into a large vein leading to two "
"blackened claws.  What must have been a seventh leg fused with the "
"creature's head forming a jagged proboscis emerging from below its eyes, "
"dripping a caustic liquid."
msgstr ""
"6本の肢で走り回る、体格の立派な生物です。それぞれの肢の付け根には緑色の嚢が生えており、各嚢と黒ずんだ2本の爪は、太い血管のようなもので繋がっています。7本目の肢は頭と融合し、目の下から伸びたギザギザの口吻に変化しており、そこから絶えず腐食性の液体を垂らしています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "brutish amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid ""
"A large, thickly armored creature built not unlike a bear, if a bear had a "
"long, clubbed tail and two short limbs ending in black talons framing a "
"vertical mouth on an otherwise smooth, featureless head.  On second thought,"
" not that much like a bear at all."
msgstr ""
"クマのように見えますが、もしクマが黒い鉤爪の生えた短い手足と長い棍棒状の尾をもち、頭部には縦に裂けた口以外何も付いておらず、大きく厚い装甲で覆われていたとすれば、それはもう単なる化け物です。やはり、これはクマではありません。"

#. ~ Description of monster "large meat cocoon"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid ""
"A mass of pink flesh the size of a fridge squirming constantly, black veins "
"anchoring it to the ground.  Occasionally a malformed limb pushes against "
"the skin from the inside, before a churn of the cocoon pushes it back.  Not "
"ready yet, it seems."
msgstr ""
"絶えずもがき続ける冷蔵庫ほどのサイズのピンク色の肉塊が、黒い管によって地面に固定されています。時折、奇形の手足が肉塊の皮を内側から押し、押し返されています。まだ生まれる準備ができていないようです。"

#. ~ Description of monster "gigantic meat cocoon"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid ""
"A rigid, off-white lump of flesh the size of a small car constricted by "
"bands of rope-sized pulsing black veins that tie it to the floor below.  The"
" whole thing is shuddering constantly, and gives off an otherworldly stench."
msgstr ""
"小型車ほどのサイズの白っぽく硬い肉塊が、ロープのような黒い管の束によって地面に固定されています。全体が絶えず振動し、嗅いだこともない悪臭を放っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "small meat cocoon"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid ""
"A sack of pink flesh sitting in the middle of a net of black roots.  At "
"irregular intervals it shudders as something (or multiple somethings?) "
"inside changes position.  You're not sure you want to know what's inside."
msgstr ""
"網の目のように張り巡らされた黒い根の中心に、ピンク色の肉の嚢が固定されています。中にいる物体(あるいは物体たち？)は、不規則に動いて位置を変え、その度に嚢が震えています。中身の正体を知りたいとは思えません。"

#. ~ Description of monster "charged amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid ""
"A short, crablike creature waddling around on six multi-jointed legs, its "
"body dominated by a large glowing organ bulging from between the white armor"
" plates.  A single raised appendage connects to the mass, its tip surrounded"
" by brilliant white sparks."
msgstr ""
"6本の多関節の肢でよたよたと歩く、背の低いカニ型の生物です。胴は白い外殻で覆われており、大きく膨らんだ器官が放つ光がその隙間から漏れ出ています。器官からは尖った部位が一本突き出しており、先端部は火花を散らしながら白く輝いています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "tiny meat cocoon"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid ""
"A small, wet sack of pink skin, with something dog-sized moving around "
"underneath the surface.  Black roots anchor it to the ground."
msgstr ""
"ピンク色の皮で覆われた、小さな湿った嚢です。底から生えている黒い根によって地面に固定されており、内部ではイヌほどのサイズの何かが動き回っています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "vigilant amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid ""
"An inflated white body carried by five dainty legs, waving its remaining two"
" limbs constantly.  Each one is tipped by a head-sized compound eye, "
"independently scanning the horizon for prey."
msgstr ""
"太った白い胴から生えた7本足のうち5本の華奢な肢で移動し、残り2本は絶えず振り回しています。胴の先には頭ほどのサイズの複眼が付いており、それぞれが好き勝手に動き、獲物を探しています。"

#. ~ Description of monster "swarming amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
msgid ""
"An small, flat creature dashing around erratically on seven short legs.  Its"
" form is dominated by an oversized set of black mandibles on an almost "
"comically small head, featureless apart from a single, black eye.  The rest "
"of the body is covered with sickly white skin crisscrossed by black veins."
msgstr ""
"7本の短い肢で不規則に動き回る、平たい小さな生物です。不釣り合いなほど小さな頭部に生えた特大の黒い顎と黒い一つ目以外、何の特徴もありません。頭部以外の体表は病的なほど白く、表面には黒い管が網の目のように走っています。"

#. ~ Death message of monster "tiny meat cocoon"
#. ~ Death message of monster "small meat cocoon"
#. ~ Death message of monster "large meat cocoon"
#. ~ Death message of monster "gigantic meat cocoon"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
#, c-format
msgid "The %s explodes in a shower of gore!"
msgstr "%sが破裂し、血肉を撒き散らしました！"

#. ~ Monster message of special attack of monster "vigilant amalgamation"
#: data/json/monsters/zed_amalgamation.json
