#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I know this might seem weird but… your shelter wasn't on the way out of "
"town, was it?  A hole in the ground, surrounded by trees?  Full of supplies "
"with a sign out front that says 'I'm gonna shoot you'?"
msgstr ""
"妙なことを聞いて悪いけど、そのシェルターは郊外にある？もしかして木に囲まれた地下シェルター？物資がたくさんあって、「入ったら発砲する」みたいな看板が立っている？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I marked the spot for you.  When you get there, pry off the metal above the "
"door and you'll see the special latch I made to keep thieves out.  I trust "
"you to make the right decisions."
msgstr ""
"目的地に印を付けておいた。シェルターのドアの上の金属部を動かすと、私が防犯対策で取り付けた特殊な掛け金が見える筈だ。君が正しい判断をしてくれると信じているよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I might not have 'real' authority anymore, and we might not have a real "
"'society', but it's still not nice to make fat jokes…"
msgstr "もう「本物」の権威なんてないだろうし、「社会」も消えてしまったかもしれない。でも、デブを揶揄するジョークは勘弁してもらいたいね..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
