msgid ""
"I never made it there and can't imagine I ever will.  Every time I've tried "
"I've been headed off by the <zombies>."
msgstr "一度も辿り着いたことはないし、これからも行けそうにない。何度やってみても<zombies>に阻まれてしまうんだ。"

