#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm just doing what I have to do.  Stick with me and we'll find plenty of "
"stuff to replace it."
msgstr "私はやるべきことをやっただけだ。一緒に行動すれば、もっと物資を見つけられる筈だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"I'm not sure yet.  It's suspicious, yes, but they seem to be nearly as "
"confused as we are about some things.  Almost like they're scared by what's "
"happened."
msgstr "まだよく分からない。確かに怪しい集団だけど、私たちと同じように混乱しているようだった。現状に怯えていたと言い換えてもいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
