#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Nope.  Not mine.  Listen, maybe we shouldn't talk about this right now."
msgstr "違う、私のじゃない。ええと、今は別の話をしたい気分だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "OK, I understand.  Sorry for being nosy."
msgstr "オーケー、分かった。お節介なことを言って悪かった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Oh…  Yeah, that would definitely do it.  It's a shame someone already got "
"in.  I had a lot of stuff saved up there.  But I suppose it wouldn't matter "
"much now."
msgstr ""
"ああ...そうか、それはあり得る話だ。残念ながら、既に侵入されていたんだろうな。色々と物資を溜めていたのに。でも、今さら後悔しても仕方ないか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Okay, calm down…"
msgstr "まあまあ、落ち着いて..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Okay, listen… across the hall from the bedroom… by the pillars… it's a fake "
"wall.  Directly across the hall.  If you push in a little bit, the whole "
"thing kinda slides aside.  I hid some guns back there and a handful of "
"rounds, too.  I meant to bring a lot more - I had boxes on back order - but "
"it started getting hard to buy past a certain point.  Might as well share "
"now that we're here.  A spare bullet could save your life."
msgstr ""
"分かったよ、いいか...寝室を出て、真っすぐホールを横切った先にある...柱の傍の壁は...偽物だ。少し押し込むと、横にスライドする。その奥に銃と弾薬が隠してある。本当はもっと沢山持ってくるつもりだったんだ...何箱も注文してあったのに...ある時点から、取り引きすら難しくなってね。ここを使うからには、共有した方がいい。多めに持っておいた弾薬が命を救うことだってあるからな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Ooooh, boy.  I was ready for this.  The winds were blowing this way for "
"years.  I had a full last man on earth shelter set up just out of town.  So,"
" of course, just my luck: I was miles out of town for a work conference when"
" China attacked and the world ended."
msgstr ""
"おいおいおい。準備はとうにできていたさ。何年も前からそんな傾向はあったからな。郊外にLMOEシェルターを建てておいたんだ。ところが、私はひどく運が悪かった。中国が攻撃を開始して世界が崩壊した時、私は仕事の会議の関係で街から何マイルも離れた場所にいたんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
