#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid ""
"Possibly, but we can never know for sure.  Sometimes bad things gather into "
"uncontrollable avalanches."
msgstr "可能性はあるが、確かなことは分からない。悪いことが重なって、制御不能な雪崩を引き起こすことだってあるだろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Prepare to meet your end, <npc_name>.  *Attack <npc_name>.*"
msgstr "<npc_name>、最期を迎える準備をしろ。*<npc_name>を攻撃する*"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgid "Right…"
msgstr "なるほど..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/Backgrounds/prepper_1.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Scared?  Yeah, that's fair.  I wouldn't say it's a friendly world out here."
"  Still, it's best to be friends.  Anyone that prepared for the apocalypse "
"is probably armed to the teeth anyway."
msgstr ""
"怯えるだって？まあ、無理もないか。平和で楽しい世界なんて無いからね。でも、仲間を作っておくことは重要だ。世界の崩壊を予見していた集団なら、きっと完全武装が揃っているに違いない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
