msgid "I'd like to ask you a few questions."
msgstr "いくつか聞きたいことがある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid "I'd like to buy in bulk."
msgstr "物資をまとめ買いしたい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid ""
"I'll see what I've got around here for you.  I've gotta warn you: it's gonna"
" be expensive.  Hard to stay supplied in the apocalypse, you know.  What do "
"you need?"
msgstr "ありものでよければ用意しよう。言っておくけど、高くつくよ。崩壊した世界で安定供給するのは難しいんだ。何が必要？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/cabin_chemist/chemist_npc.json
msgid "Is there anything else you need?"
msgstr "他に買いたいものはある？"

