msgid ""
"Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we"
" ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr ""
"近くの街に住んでいた。9時から5時までの、普通の社会人さ。ことが起きた時は、私たちは安全な逃げ道を確保できた。今じゃ安全なんてどこにもないんだろうか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"Lived in a nearby town.  Normal life.  9 to 5 job.  When it all happened, we"
" ran away to find some safety.  But there's no safety anymore, is there?"
msgstr ""
"近くの街に住んでいた。9時から5時までの、普通の社会人さ。ことが起きた時は、私たちは安全な逃げ道を確保できた。今じゃ安全なんてどこにもないんだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "No one gets out alive.  Always been that way.  So we keep going."
msgstr "死人は生き返らない。いつもそうだった。だから私たちは生き続けなければならない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Oh.  Hey there."
msgstr "おや、どうも。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "On a second thought, wait here a while."
msgstr "いや、しばらく考えた方がいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Right.  Okay."
msgstr "そうか。なるほど。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "So shouldn't you be more concerned?  Trying to survive?"
msgstr "だったらもっと関心を持つべきことがあるのでは？生き残る気があるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "So you're just going to give up?"
msgstr "だからって、諦めるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "That's a start."
msgstr "人生これからさ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Thought I heard someone.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "誰かの声が聞こえた気がしてね。ここで何をしている？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Wait, 'we'?"
msgstr "えっ、「私たち」？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "We all lost someone.  No reason to sit down and die."
msgstr "誰かを失ったのはあなた一人じゃない。その場でうずくまって死を待つのはごめんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Would you like to come with me?"
msgstr "一緒に来てもらえないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Yeah.  I do."
msgstr "ああ、もちろん。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "Yeah.  I think I will."
msgstr "ああ。その意見はもっともだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "You can't let yourself be consumed by grief.  It will get better."
msgstr "悲しみに身を任せていてはいけない。いつか元気を取り戻せるはずだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Nihilist.json
msgid "You do realize there is an apocalypse going on, right?"
msgstr "世界が大変なことになってるのは、知っているのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Ah, not much really.  Passing through, trying to make a living by trading "
"with folk.  If you're interested, I got a lot of good things on sale, "
"stranger."
msgstr "いや、詰まらない仕事さ。ここを通りがかる人と取り引きして、生計を立てているんだ。見知らぬ方、もし興味があるなら自慢の商品を見てってくれ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Any news on that Remington?"
msgstr "レミントンはどうなった？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Fair enough.  Goodbye."
msgstr "分かったよ。さようなら。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Fantastic!  I'll try and get it to the buyer, if he's still alive.  If not, "
"well, still a good gun to sell.  Now, how would you like to be compensated?"
msgstr ""
"やった！買い手に届けてくるよ。まだ生きててくれたらいいんだけど。もし死んでたら、まぁ、良い銃だし他でも売れるだろう。さて、お礼は何にしようかな？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Great!  Let me know when you get it, and I'll try to get in touch with him."
msgstr "素晴らしい！そいつに連絡を入れたいから、手に入れたら知らせてくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Hah, real cute.  Seem the End times didn't take your sense of humor, eh, "
"stranger?"
msgstr "ハハ、それは面白いな。見知らぬ方、世界が崩壊してもユーモアのセンスを忘れなかったんだな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Hey!  Who goes there?"
msgstr "やあ！誰だ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "How did you even get this option to display the hell."
msgstr "一体どうして現物を出してくれないんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"I am a ghost.  I died here 37 years ago, yet I cannot depart this mortal "
"realm."
msgstr "私は幽霊だ。37年前にここで死んだが、土地に縛られて動けないんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "I have my moments.  So what are you doing here?"
msgstr "たまには良いじゃないか。それで、ここで何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "I'm you, from the future.  I've come to warn you."
msgstr "私はお前だ。未来から警告しに来た。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "If you think so."
msgstr "それなら仕方ないな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Is there something I can help you with?"
msgstr "私に何か手伝えることはあるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Just another survivor.  What are you doing here?"
msgstr "ただの生存者だ。ここで何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Not a bad way to live."
msgstr "悪くない生き方だ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
msgstr "ショットガン(ﾚﾐﾝﾄﾝ870ｴｸｽﾌﾟﾚｽ)を入手する"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Speaking of which, I'd like to see your wares."
msgstr "それなら、商品を見せてもらえないか。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Suit yourself.  Ain't a rush."
msgstr "それもいいだろう。別に急ぎの用じゃない。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Then where is it?"
msgstr "それはどういうことだ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Well, a gun store is a solid bet, but the model is common enough.  Maybe you"
" can find one in a police station, or a store with hunting gear."
msgstr "そうだな、銃器店にいけば確実だろうが、それほど珍しいモデルの銃でもない。警察署や狩猟道具を置いてる店にもあるだろうな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "Well, now that you mention it…"
msgstr "ちょっと頼みたいことが..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"Worked as a salesman - high end farming equipment.  Now I know, it may not "
"sound that fancy, but you'd be shocked at how pricy those machines can get."
"  I was lucky enough to be on a fairly remote farm when everything went to "
"shit.  In a way, being a salesman saved me and the experience from the job "
"might allow me to make a living in the apocalypse, bartering for gear and "
"trinkets, so I got that going for me, I suppose."
msgstr ""
"セールスマンをしていた。高性能な農機具のね。信じられないかもしれないが、農機具ってのは非常に高価なんだ。世界が崩壊したときは、幸運なことに郊外の農場に来ていた。ある意味ではセールスマンという仕事に救われたとも言えるな。仕事の経験を生かして機械や道具を上手く物々交換することで、この世界を生き延びられたんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid "You do?  Let me take a look."
msgstr "そうなのか？では見せてもらおうかな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain a Remington 870 Express shotgun"
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"You see, some time ago, I ran into this guy who offered me a substantial "
"payment in exchange for a Remington 870 Express.  I asked if he'd like "
"another weapon, since nowadays, any gun will do, but for some reason, he's "
"dead set on that particular model.  If you could obtain one for me, well, "
"I'd be quite grateful."
msgstr ""
"ほんの少し前、私はある男に出会った。そいつは、レミントン870エクスプレスと引き換えに相当な額を支払ってくれるって言うんだ。今ならどんな銃でも手に入るんだし、他の武器じゃダメなのかって聞いたんだけど、何故かその男は目当ての銃にこだわってる。レミントン870エクスプレスを手に入れてもらえると、とても助かるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/Rural-Cowboy_Trader.json
msgid ""
"You seem like a decent sort, but I'm not really looking for company right "
"now.  Think I'm better off on my own."
msgstr "確かにあなたはまともな人のようだが、私は別に就職先を探している訳ではないんだ。一人でいさせてくれ。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A rural holdout survivor living in a barn or a forest or something, all
#. by themselves.  At some point this NPC should get special dialogue.
#. ~ A member of the Gray Moose Militia, trying to safe in their isolated
#. location
#. ~ A survivor who sometimes visits the refugee center.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ A wandering survivor, a pretty tough and capable dude.  Represents an NPC
#. version of a person much like the player.
#. ~ A random scavenger visiting the refugee center to check it out, just like
#. you.
#: data/json/npcs/holdouts/rural.json
#: data/json/npcs/militia/GM_Militia_Merchant.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/john_bailey.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Survivor"
msgstr "サバイバー"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"&There's a person reclined on the sofa here.  They're very tall, with their "
"legs reaching to the other armrest, and they're wearing a set of dubious-"
"looking military gear.  They raise a hand in greeting.  \"Placeholder "
"text.\""
msgstr ""
"&ハブ01のアーマーを身に付けた人物が一人、ソファに寝そべっています。非常に背が高く、肘掛けの端まで足が届くほどです。テーブルの傍の床には青と茶色の二色デザインの防護スーツが乱雑に置かれ、奥の肘掛けには見たこともないデザインのライフルが立て掛けてあります。\n"
"\n"
"その人物は入室者を見上げ、手を挙げました。「ここにテキストを入力。」"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*frowns at you.  \"I've been with you this whole time, dude.  C'mon."
msgstr "*は顔をしかめました。「一緒に行動していたのに、そりゃないよ。まったく。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"*goes quiet.  They chew their lip, looking off towards a point in space."
msgstr "*は口を噤みました。唇を噛み、虚空を見つめています。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"*smiles at you, genuine and warm.  \"It feels nice to tell it.  You're "
"welcome.\""
msgstr "*は心からの温かい微笑みを浮かべました。「こっちも話してると気分がよくなる。どういたしまして。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"*stares at a point at the wall, thinking.  Their wedding ring glints on "
"their left hand."
msgstr "*は壁の一点を見つめています。左手の指には結婚指輪がきらめいています。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "*waits expectantly."
msgstr "*は期待を込めてこちらを見ています。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"A while later, I made it here.  The gate was open, so I just walked right "
"in.  I tried the intercom, but nobody answered, which I'm sure you had "
"happen to you, too.  Then I realize: this building is super reinforced, "
"unlocked, and seems abandoned now.  Why don't I just stay here?  So I set up"
" my stuff in this here lobby and I spend the night there.  Then I try the "
"intercom again."
msgstr ""
"しばらくして、ここにたどり着いた。ゲートは開いてたから、そのまま中へ入ったんだ。通信装置を鳴らしたけど、誰も出てこない。そのうち、この建物はすごく頑丈に造ってあるのに、鍵もかかっていなくてまるで廃墟だってことに気付いたんだ。じゃあ、このままここで暮らせばいいんじゃないか？というわけで、このロビーに荷物を置いて、一晩過ごした。その後改めて、通信装置を鳴らしてみた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "About the gold you wanted…"
msgstr "あなたが欲しがっていた金について..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "About those jobs…"
msgstr "それらの仕事について..."

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Active Noise Control"
msgstr "ノイズを消し去る"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Actually, I don't think I have time for that, sorry."
msgstr "悪いけど、そんな暇はないんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Actually, I have some places to be right now.  Good to meet you."
msgstr "悪いけど、今から行く場所があるんだ。話せてよかった。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Active Noise Control"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Return to Hub 01"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Alright, let's be off.  You don't mind taking point, right?"
msgstr "よし、さっそく現場へ向かおう。もちろん、来てくれるよな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "And *now* the rest is history."
msgstr "*今度こそ*、そこから先は、私も知っている。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "And the rest is history."
msgstr "そこから先は、私も知っている。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Anything on your mind?"
msgstr "何か気になることが？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"But like, I was a park ranger.  I wasn't exactly making six figures, and you"
" know how bad rent was.  I couldn't buy a ton of canned food, but what I "
"*could* do is can things myself.  Not in tin cans, but in jars; the old way."
"  So every paycheck, I'd use a little bit to buy one or two big glass jars, "
"and on the weekends I'd spend a few hours filling them up with food and "
"sealing them.  I started brushing up at the range too.  Proud gun owner, "
"baby."
msgstr ""
"でも、私は自然保護官だ。年収は6ケタに届かないし、家賃の高さは知っての通り。缶詰を大量に買うことはできないから、自分で保存食を作った。昔ながらの瓶詰めだね。給料が出る度に大きなガラス瓶を1つか2つ買って、休みの日に数時間かけて食材を浸けて封をしたんだ。射撃場で練習も始めた。誇り高き銃所持者って奴だね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "But what?"
msgstr "思っていたのに...？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Computer network?"
msgstr "コンピュータネットワーク？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Cool."
msgstr "いいじゃん。"

#. ~ Unique name of an NPC
#. ~ Appears in the the surface of Hub 01 as an external mercenary.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Cranberry Foster"
msgstr "ｸﾗﾝﾍﾞﾘｰ ﾌｫｽﾀｰ"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Did they answer that time?"
msgstr "今度は返答があったのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Did you want something?"
msgstr "何か用か？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Dude, I wish.  It sounds like there's different people on the mic at "
"different times, but all of them give me the same spiel: nobody's allowed in"
" right now.  I guess I shouldn't raise a fuss about it, honestly.  All being"
" considered, this compound is pretty safe, and the couch ain't so bad."
msgstr ""
"用意してくれたらいいんだけどな。通信係は時間帯によって違うみたいだけど、皆が口をそろえてこう言う。今は誰も入れない。別に怒るほどのことでもないし、いいんだけどさ。よく考えるとここは結構安全だし、ソファも悪くない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid ""
"Exchanging my money for goods and services.  Just as the founding fathers "
"intended."
msgstr "お金を商品やサービスと交換する。建国の父の思し召し通りだ。"

#. ~ Job description of "Hub Mercenary" NPC class
#. ~ Job description of "Mercenary" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Fighting for the all-mighty dollar."
msgstr "全能なる金のために戦っている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Good to have some company."
msgstr "仲間がいてくれて良かったよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Got some gold for me?"
msgstr "金を持ってきてくれた？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_Cranberry_Foster.json
msgid "Have something to say?"
msgstr "何か話があるのか？"

