msgstr "U. ﾙｰｸ"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A generic guard for Hub 01.
#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
msgid "Hub Security"
msgstr "警備員(ハブ01)"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Just on watch, move along."
msgstr "見張りをしてるだけだ、どっか行け。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
msgid "Keep it civil, merc."
msgstr "大人しくしていろよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Ma'am"
msgstr "お嬢さん。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/NPC_robofac_generic_security.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard_generic.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_guard.json
msgid "Sir."
msgstr "よお旦那。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Around <interval>, if the caravan doesn't run into trouble."
msgstr "隊商にトラブルがなければ、<interval>後には入荷できる。"

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Caravaneer"
msgstr "隊商指揮者"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ A free merchant caravanner that temporarily supplies the hq with
#. foodstuff.
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Free Merchant"
msgstr "自由商人"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Here to trade, I hope?"
msgstr "取り引きするかい？"

#. ~ Job description of "Caravaneer" NPC class
#. ~ This is a unique NPC who doesn't get randomly selected background traits
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "I'm the owner of a trade caravan."
msgstr "私は隊商のオーナーだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Keep safe, then."
msgstr "では、おたっしゃで。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_intercom/robofac_intercom.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "Let's trade."
msgstr "取り引きしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Safe travels, scavenger."
msgstr "お気を付けて、スカベンジャー。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Thanks for the info, bye."
msgstr "情報をありがとう、さようなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid ""
"We have been supplying this lab here with food from a few hunting and "
"farming communities nearby.  The roads are tough and dangerous, but it makes"
" good money, and beats scavenging the cities for scraps."
msgstr ""
"私たちは、研究所の近くにあるハンターや農家のコミュニティから食料の供給を受けてきた。路上は危険だが、金になる物はあるし、都市部でガラクタを集めて回るよりもいい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "Welcome…"
msgstr "ようこそ..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/ROBOFAC_SURFACE_FREEMERCHANT.json
msgid "When is the next shipment?"
msgstr "次の商品入荷はいつ頃？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&A grim expression and deep sunken eyes imply some malady that can't be "
"simply drowned with alcohol alone.  They interrupt you just as you were "
"about to introduce yourself.  \"This anchor I'm wearing, I don't think I'll "
"be needing it any more.  I-I'm just looking for someone to rid me of it"
msgstr ""
"&険しい表情と深く落ち窪んだ目元から、この人物がアルコールでは紛らわせない病気を患わっているのは明らかです。こちらの自己紹介の言葉を遮り、語り出しました。「この5点法アンカー、もう必要ないんだよな。だ、誰か買い取ってくれないか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
