#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Just leave, this isn't right at all."
msgstr "立ち去ろう、何かがおかしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Offer to buy the anchor for 1 HGC."
msgstr "5点法アンカーを1HGCで買おう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Sorry, I don't think I can help you."
msgstr "申し訳ないが、お役には立てないな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Take the anchor and leave the coin.  Do we have a deal?"
msgstr "アンカーを貰って、コインは置いておこう。これで取り引き成立かな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Take the anchor."
msgstr "5点法アンカーを貰っておこう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"The mercenary stares in silence, a flickering of the overhead lighting "
"thankfully cuts the moment short."
msgstr "傭兵は黙ってこちらを見つめている。頭上の明かりがちらついていなければ、更に長時間この凝視に晒される羽目になっただろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
