#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_anchor_seller.json
msgid "Well, what's that thing for anyways?"
msgstr "うーん、それは何に使う道具だ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"&A pair of veteran mercenaries share stories between bouts of heavy "
"drinking.  You could probably join them if you wanted to."
msgstr "&経験豊富そうな二人の傭兵が、豪快に酒を酌み交わしながら会話しています。声を掛ければ、話に加われそうです。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"&As you sit, the older mercenary continues their narration of <merc_story>.\n"
"\n"
"When their tale reaches conclusion, you stop to consider what sort of story you could tell."
msgstr ""
"&席に座ると、熟練の傭兵たちが話を再開しました。それは<merc_story>。\n"
"\n"
"傭兵の物語が一段落しました。さて、こちらも何か語るべきでしょうか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"&The clearly drunk mercenaries hail you as minor celebrity and invite you to"
" a pair of rounds when your tale is finished."
msgstr "&話し終えると、完全に酔いが回った傭兵たちから知る人ぞ知る偉人として認められ、今後もぜひ一緒に飲もうと誘われました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"&The expressions on both the mercs' faces are a mix of confusion and "
"visceral disgust as you relate your tale.  Finally, the younger mercenary "
"blurts out, \"None of us wanted to touch that contract since the intercom "
"was being so shifty about it.\"  \"You're my kind of free-range lunatic!\"  "
"The older mercenary interjects.  \"I'll drink to that!\"."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"&The veteran's expressions turn to a mixture of awe and fear as your tale "
"nears conclusion, the younger mercenary is finally after a long  \"We heard "
"someone had gone and completed that death trap contract, but I still "
"couldn't believe it.\"  \"You're a damn madman!\"  The older mercenary "
"interjects in agreement.  \"I'll drink to that!\"."
msgstr ""
"&物語は佳境を迎え、二人の熟練者の顔には尊敬と恐怖の表情が浮かんでいます。若い方の傭兵が言いました。「死の罠としか思えないあの依頼、誰かがやり遂げたとは聞いてたけど、今だに信じられないな。あんたはとんでもない狂人だよ！」年上の傭兵が頷きました。「まったくだ、とにかく飲もう！」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"&The veterans eagerly accept your challenge, and none of you can really "
"stomach the prospect of more drinks after the first pair of tales."
msgstr "&熟練の傭兵たちは熱心に冒険譚を聞いています。しかし、自分たちがもう話し終えたからか、酒を飲むペースは早くなる一方です。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"&The veterans seem happy to have you, and you listen as the older mercenary narrates <merc_story>.\n"
"\n"
"You all share some drinks while going over the details and as the conversation winds down."
msgstr ""
"&熟練の傭兵たちは話し相手が増えて嬉しそうです。二人の話に耳を傾けてみると、それは<merc_story>。\n"
"\n"
"詳細を尋ねたり、気楽な余談を交えたりしつつ、皆で酒を酌み交わしました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"&While the veterans indulge your storytelling, they clearly seem not too "
"pleased nor impressed by your tale."
msgstr "&熟練者たちは話を聞き流しています。明らかに退屈しているか、下らないと思っているように見えます。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"&You make some small talk and share a pair of drinks after finishing your "
"story."
msgstr "&話が終わった後も、楽しく雑談しながら飲み明かしました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_BEM_BEM_CHATTING_VETERANS_DRUNK_MESSAGE"
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "<ANCILLA_BAR_HANGOVER>"
msgstr "<ANCILLA_BAR_HANGOVER>"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Bar… barshender!  We… we?"
msgstr "て...てんいんしゃぁん！あ...あれぇ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"Recall that time when you rescued a farmer's son from a citadel full of "
"alien horrors."
msgstr "恐怖に満ちた宇宙生物の砦から農家の息子を救い出した話を語る。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Recall that time when you used a tactical nuclear weapon."
msgstr "戦術核兵器を使ってみた体験を語る。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"Recall the long story of how you agreed to help the remnants of the Federal "
"Government."
msgstr "連邦政府の生き残りを支援することになった長い経緯を語る。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"Recall the time you were tricked into fighting against distorted versions of"
" yourself while lost in a place beyond time."
msgstr "時空の狭間で迷子になり、自らの歪んだ影と戦う羽目になった話を語る。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"Speak about the alien construct you found while lost in an endless sea of "
"black glass."
msgstr "果てしなく続く黒いガラスの海に迷い込み、やがて奇妙な建物に辿り着いた話を語る。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"Tell them about the horrors uncovered by the mining expeditions of New "
"England."
msgstr "ニューイングランドの鉱山を探索したときの恐怖体験について語る。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"Tell them about the horrors wandering in these very same subway tunnels."
msgstr "地下で同じ形状の穴を多数見つけた恐怖体験について語る。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"Tell them about your hunting of a pyramidal robot using a prototype energy "
"rifle."
msgstr "試作エネルギーライフルでピラミッド型のロボットを倒した話を語る。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"Tell them the story of how you dived into and were forced to fight for your "
"life within a disgusting, toxic hellscape made from the un-living innards of"
" some crushed zombie monstrosity.  All so the intercom could have some "
"damned HDD back."
msgstr ""
"ふざけたHDDを通信装置の声の主に渡したせいで、ゾンビの内臓を固めて作ったような有毒ガスが充満する地獄のような建物内に飛び込み、命懸けで戦う羽目になった経験を語る。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid ""
"Tell them the story of how you were trapped in an infinitely looping "
"corridor, fighting the warped remnants of the researchers there and somehow "
"the damned corridor itself.  And at the end of the day, you're not even sure"
" the headache was worth it."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Try to gross each other out with tales of mutant butchery."
msgstr "変異体を虐殺した話で相手を怖がらせてみる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Well, I should be going now."
msgstr "さて、そろそろ行かないと。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/hub01/robofac_ancilla_npcs/BAR_ENCOUNTER_MERCENARIES/BEM_chatting_veterans.json
msgid "Well, ugh…  I should be going now…"
