msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"&Continued prodding manages to extract a baffling response from your "
"interlocutor \"I- I've seen it, the god of our new world, a god of flesh and"
" bone.\" <mypronoun> says with a maddened glare, as though this were some "
"sort of shocking revelation."
msgstr ""
"&辛抱強く呼びかけ続けていると、相手から不可解な返答がありました。「わ、わ、わたしは、見た。新世界の神、肉と骨の神。」\n"
"<mypronoun>は狂気の眼差しをこちらに向け、衝撃の事実を告げるような口ぶりでそう語りました。"

