msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I surely do.  Here, it ain't much, but oats are easy enough, and good "
"food too."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Darryl_Johnstone.json
msgid "You know what?  Nevermind.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "何だって？今の話は忘れてくれ。前の話をもう一度聞かせてくれる？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid ""
"&Greenwood looks over his their shoulder, briefly glancing around before "
"speaking in a low whisper.  \"Don't tell anyone I said this, but I don't "
"like Helena at all.  Her father was a real nut, he'd rave on and on about an"
" apocalypse he'd prepared for.  He always thought that his church would be "
"the ark to weather the storm, that God would destroy the world by unleashing"
" the armies of Hell; and he wasn't talking about the Second Coming of "
"Christ.  Helena's just as fanatical as he was, and it reflects in her "
"inadequate leadership.  To be honest, I'm highly concerned for some of the "
"people here; they're obsessively zealous with Helena, and harbor a "
"xenophobic hatred of everything.  As in Matthew 15:14, 'They are blind "
"guides.  And if one blind person guides another, they will both fall into a "
"pit'.\""
msgstr ""
"&グリーンウッドは周囲を気にするようにさっと見回し、声を低くして囁きました。「この話は内密に願います。私はヘレナを全く信用していません。彼女の御父上もとんでもなくおかしな人物で、勝手にでっち上げた黙示録の話を延々と繰り返していました。そして、神が地獄の軍勢を解き放ち世界を滅ぼすとき、自分の教会こそが嵐を乗り越える方舟になると信じ続けていました。これはキリストの再臨とは全く異なる話です。ヘレナも同じ話を狂信しており、そのせいか、どうも指導力に不安がある。実を言うと、ヘレナに強く心酔してしまい、あらゆるものに異常な憎しみを抱いている信徒の方もおられるのですよ。私は心配でならない。マタイによる福音書15章14節にもこうあります。「彼らは盲人を手引きする盲人である。もし盲人が盲人を手引きするなら、二人とも穴に落ち込むであろう。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "Actually, I'm just heading out."
msgstr "ちょっと立ち寄っただけだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "Alright.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "分かった。他のことについて話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "Could I ask you a few more questions?"
msgstr "もう少し聞かせてもらってもいい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "Could you tell me a bit about this church?"
msgstr "この教会について教えてもらえるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "Good to see you again, Reverend.  I wanted to talk."
msgstr "また会えて光栄だ、神父様。話したいことがある。"

#. ~ Name of effect type id "godco_confessed"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "Had a Confessional"
msgstr "告解した"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "How may I help you, sister?"
msgstr "どうかされましたか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid ""
"I had a pretty comfortable life growing up.  My parents were florists, owned"
" a shop along the main street of town.  They were always so cheery, as if "
"nothing bad could phase them.  When I was about fifteen, I dreamt that the "
"Lord spoke to me; as if urging me to go and spread his Gospel, so I did.  I "
"took odd jobs at several churches for a while, before I went to seminary.  I"
" went between three different churches, before I found this one.  I've been "
"here since."
msgstr ""
"私は、幼少期はそれなりに恵まれた生活を送っていました。街の大通りで花屋を営んでいた両親は、辛いことなど一つもないかのように、いつも陽気に過ごしていました。私が15歳くらいのとき、夢の中で主にまみえたのです。主は家を出て福音を広めるよう言われたので、私はその通りにしました。いくつかの教会でしばらく雑用係を経験し、それから神学校へ入学しました。その後は3か所の教会に赴任し、その後この教会に出会いました。それ以来、ずっとここにいます。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "I'm looking for work.  Can I do anything for your congregation?"
msgstr "仕事を探している。ここにいる信徒のために、何かできることはあるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid ""
"I'm seeking forgiveness, Father.  I've made mistakes in my life that I can "
"never take back."
msgstr "神父様、私には告解が必要だ。私は決してやり直せないような過ちを犯してしまった。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "Nice meeting you, Reverend.  I'd best get going though."
msgstr "初めまして、神父様。もうそろそろ行かないと。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "Nice to meet you too, Reverend."
msgstr "初めまして、神父様。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "Thanks for the info, I'd best be going then."
msgstr "情報をありがとう。それならここを離れた方がいいな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "Thanks for your time, Reverend."
msgstr "時間を作ってくれてありがとう、神父様。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid ""
"The Lord be with you, sister.  You seem new, nice to meet you.  Welcome, and"
" welcome aboard!"
msgstr "主はあなたと共にあります。初めてお会いする方のようですね。ようこそ、歓迎しますよ！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid ""
"The full name is the New England Community Church.  Helena's father started "
"it about twenty years ago.  The flock may be small, but we've always helped "
"each other when times were tough; we're like a family now."
msgstr ""
"正式名称はニューイングランド教会コミュニティです。ヘレナの御父上が20年ほど前に設立されました。信徒数は多くありませんが、苦しいときはいつも助け合う、家族のような仲間ですよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid ""
"This is the New England Community Church, the congregation of it.  Praise "
"the Lord that we made it through!"
msgstr "ここはニューイングランド教会コミュニティの集会場です。生き延びられたことを主に感謝しましょう！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid ""
"We all came out here when <the_cataclysm> rocked the world.  It's an old "
"retreat Helena bought in the hopes of renovating it, good thing we did."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>によって世界が揺るがされ、皆がここへ集まったのです。後から改装するつもりでヘレナが買った古い別荘だったのですが、助かりました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "We all have, sister, we all have."
msgstr "ええ、皆がそうなのです、皆が過ちを犯しました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid ""
"Well, it's your appearance.  You're… how do I say, significantly different "
"than what most people are used to.  With the sudden appearance of strange "
"phenomenon following the Rapture, some have taken your changes as a mark of "
"demonic corruption, and won't be very kind to you either.  Be wary of this."
msgstr ""
"その、あなたの姿ですね。あなたは...何と言うべきか、外見が普通とは大きくかけ離れている。携挙の後、急に奇妙な現象が起きだしたこともあり、そういった外見の変化を邪悪な堕落の印と受け止め、突き放した態度を取る者もいるのです。くれぐれも慎重に行動してください。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ Snippet in category "schizo_self_talk"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
#: data/json/snippets/schizophrenia.json
msgid "What are you doing out here?"
msgstr "ここで何をしている？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/free_merchant_caravans.json
msgid "What can I do for you?"
msgstr "ご用件は？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "What do you think about Helena?"
msgstr "ヘレナのことをどう思う？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "What's wrong with me, if you could say?"
msgstr "私が何か気に障ることをしたか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "Where am I again?"
msgstr "ここが何の場所なのか、もう一度聞きたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "Where am I?"
msgstr "ここは何の場所だ？"

#. ~ Description of effect type "Had a Confessional"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "You decided to take responsibility for your actions."
msgstr "自らの行動に責任を持とうと決めました。"

#. ~ Apply message of effect type "Had a Confessional"
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Father_Greenwood.json
msgid "You finally got the weight off your chest."
msgstr "ようやく胸のつかえが取れた気がします。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "Could you tell me more about Olwen?"
msgstr "オルウェンのことをもっと教えてもらえるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "Could you tell me more about Tom?"
msgstr "トムのことをもっと教えてもらえるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "Felicity?  Nice to meet you.  How are things here?"
msgstr "フェリシティっていうのか？会えて嬉しいよ。ここはどんな感じ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "Good luck with that."
msgstr "上手くいくことを祈っているよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid ""
"He wasn't always like this.  Olwen came not long after we married, he was a "
"great, caring father to her.  A few months before <the_cataclysm> is when he"
" lost it, got in some survivalist circle.  He'd stay up pouring over "
"newspapers and any documents he could find, and wound up quitting his job to"
" study it more.  We didn't see much of him for a while, always in the "
"basement, and took out a chunk of our savings to buy canned goods en masse."
msgstr ""
"前からあんな性格じゃなかったんだけどね。旦那と結婚してすぐ、オルウェンを産んだ。その頃は立派に父親をやっていて、娘の面倒もよく見てくれてた。様子が変になったのは、<the_cataclysm>の何か月か前、サバイバルサークルに参加してからだ。仕事を辞めて新聞や書類を読み漁り、なにやら熱心に研究してたみたいだよ。貯金をはたいて缶詰を大量に買い込んだり、しばらく地下に籠りっきりになったりしていたね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "Hi Felicity.  Got a minute?"
msgstr "やあ、フェリシティ。ちょっといいかな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "Hi Felicity.  I'm afraid I can't talk right now."
msgstr "やあ、フェリシティ。悪いけど、また後で話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "How's the manuscript coming?"
msgstr "原稿の進捗はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "How's your family?"
msgstr "あなたの家族はどうしてる？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid ""
"I don't know.  I've tried talking to him, tried to convince him to give it "
"up.  I think he's stressed out with everything going on, and snapped because"
" of that.  I just want my husband back…"
msgstr ""
"さあねぇ。あまりのめり込むのは良くないって説得はしたんだよ。きっと色々なストレスが重なって、限界がきていたのかもしれないね。何とかして戻ってきてほしいけれど..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "I suppose we do."
msgstr "そうかもしれない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "I'd better get going.  Bye, Felicity."
msgstr "もう行くよ。さようなら、フェリシティ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "I'll see what I can do.  Bye, Felicity."
msgstr "何かできないか考えてみるよ。さようなら、フェリシティ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid ""
"I'm actually from New England, Rhode Island specifically.  I grew up in "
"Providence, the state capital.  It was lovely there, I'd always walk to "
"school and stopped in the park on my way home.  Mom was an accountant for "
"various companies, she went to Rivtech back when it was a startup.  Dad was "
"a baker, ran a shop on the corner of Chalkstone and Mt Pleasant.  It smelled"
" so good when you walked by…  I always wanted to be a writer, but I wound up"
" as a proofreader for Stillwater, a publishing firm.  I met Tom at that "
"office, we got married about three years later."
msgstr ""
"実はニューイングランド地方ロードアイランド州の出身なのさ。子供の頃は州都プロビデンスに住んでた。学校へはいつも歩いて通って、帰りに公園で寄り道するのが日課だったね。母は色々な会社の会計士で、まだできて間もない頃のRivtech社にも関わったんだって。父はチョークストーン通りとマウントプレザント通りが交差する角地でパン屋を営んでた。私は小さい頃から作家になりたくて、スティルウォーター出版社に就職して校正係をやってた。その職場でトムと出会って、3年後に結婚したんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid ""
"I'm always good for a talk.  It's nice to have company, even if we don't "
"have much else to offer."
msgstr "お喋りはいつでも歓迎だよ。大したニュースがなくても、仲間がいてくれるのはいいことだね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "I'm still working on it.  I'll have it ready soon."
msgstr "鋭意執筆中だよ。近いうちに完成させるつもり。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "If that's the case, I'll leave."
msgstr "そうだとしたら、ここを離れた方が良さそうだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "Is there any way to get him out of it?"
msgstr "どうにかして、旦那さんを正気付かせる方法はないだろうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Is there anything I can do for you?"
msgstr "何か私にできることはある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "It's been nice talking to you, but I need to head out."
msgstr "話せてよかったよ。私はそろそろ行かないと。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid ""
"It's finally finished!  Here, I want you to have a copy of it.  This is my "
"first time writing like this professionally, I hope you enjoy it."
msgstr "ようやく完成したよ！はい、あんたが持っててちょうだい。こうやってプロの作家として文を書くのは初めてなんだ。楽しんでもらえたら嬉しいね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "It's nice to meet you, but I need to head out."
msgstr "元気そうでよかった。私はもう行かないと。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "Lets talk about something else."
msgstr "他の話をしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid ""
"My family's alright.  I have a wonderful daughter, Olwen; she's an "
"electronics nut, had a great job with it too.  My husband Tom is the crazy "
"one, always rambling on about conspiracy theories, secret agents, all that."
msgstr ""
"家族はみんな無事だよ。愛娘の名前はオルウェン。電子工学オタクで、趣味を仕事に上手く活かしてる。旦那のトムはちょっと変わってて、陰謀論とか秘密工作員とか、そういう話題が大好きなんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "Oh, hi there.  My name's Felicity, nice to see a new face."
msgstr "ああ、ごきげんよう。私の名前はフェリシティ。はじめまして。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Olwen's a bright girl, always has been.  She studied electricity and "
"computer science when she was in college, found a job with a research and "
"development firm.  My girl's a fiancee now, her and Julian were going to get"
" married in a few months.  She might teach you something, if you ask."
msgstr ""
"オルウェンは、小さい頃から聡明な娘だったね。大学で電気学とコンピューターサイエンスを専攻して、研究開発会社に就職したんだ。今は婚約者のジュリアンと一緒だよ。数か月後には式を挙げる予定だったんだけどねぇ。本人に聞けば、もっと色々と話してくれると思うよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "Thank you, I'm sure it's lovely."
msgstr "ありがとう。きっと素敵な物語なんだろうな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid ""
"They're alright, but they won't take kindly to someone with your… "
"appearance.  What can i do for you?"
msgstr "問題ないけど、あなたのその...見た目せいで、ここで好かれることはないだろうね。ところで、何か用？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "They're alright.  What can I do for you?"
msgstr "問題なし。何かご用？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Tom and I wanted to get away from the city, so we found a home up here.  We "
"didn't move again until <the_cataclysm>, when we came here."
msgstr ""
"トムも私も都会にはうんざりしてたから、この近辺で自宅を探したの。こっちへ移ってきてからは、<the_cataclysm>まで一度も引っ越さなかったよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid ""
"We've been through a lot without much help, it's been difficult to cope.  "
"Still, we put on a happy little face, and some of us pretend everything's "
"all right."
msgstr "助けもあまり得られていないし、厳しい状況だね。それでも、なるべく幸せそうな表情を作って、何もかも上手く行ってるふりをする人もいる。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/Smokes/free_merchant_shopkeep_talk.json
msgid "What's on your mind?"
msgstr "どうした？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Felicity_Powell.json
msgid "Why'd you move out here?"
msgstr "どうしてロードアイランドを離れたんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid ""
"&Gemma is in deep, silent thought for a moment, before clearing her throat."
"  \"They read: 'I am the Lord your God, who brought you out of Egypt, out of"
" the land of slavery.  You shall have no other gods before me.  You shall "
"not make for yourself a carved image, or any likeness of anything that is in"
" heaven above, or that is in the earth beneath, or that is in the water "
"under the earth.  You shall not take the name of the Lord your God in vain."
"  Remember the Sabbath day, and keep it holy.  Honor your father and your "
"mother.  You shall not murder.  You shall not commit adultery.  You shall "
"not steal.  You shall not bear false witness against your neighbor.  You "
"shall not covet your neighbors house.\"  They're written in Exodus 20:1-17, "
"for future reference."
msgstr ""
"&ジェマはしばし黙想し、咳払いをしてから続けました。「わたしはあなたの主なる神であり、あなたをエジプトという奴隷の国から連れ出した。わたしのほかに神があってはならない。あなたは自分のために、天の上にあるものや地の下にあるもの、水の中にあるものを像に彫り、また似せたものを造ってはならない。あなたの主なる神の名をみだりに唱えてはならない。安息日を覚え、聖別せよ。父と母を重んじよ。人を殺してはならない。姦淫してはならない。盗んではならない。隣人について嘘を言ってはならない。隣人の家を妬んではならない。このお話は、出エジプト記の第20章第1節から17節に書かれているわ。参考にしてちょうだいね。」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Can I help you with anything?"
msgstr "手伝えることはあるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "Fine then, screw you."
msgstr "ああそうかい、クソっ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Got it."
msgstr "分かった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid ""
"Great to see a new face.  I'm Gemma.  Will you be staying here with us?"
msgstr "初めて見る方ね、歓迎しますよ。私はジェマ。ここに滞在されるのかしら？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "Hello, Gemma.  I'm afraid I can't talk right now."
msgstr "ごきげんよう、ジェマ。悪いけど、また後で話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "Hi, Gemma.  How're you doing?"
msgstr "やあ、ジェマ。調子はどう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid ""
"I always have things on the go: tidying, organizing, cleaning, but I don't "
"complain.  I never complain."
msgstr "私はいつも片付けや整理整頓、掃除、他にも色々な仕事をしているわ。仕事について絶対に文句は言わないと決めてるの。絶対にね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid ""
"I heard what it's like out there.  You must be weary from exploring this "
"unforgiving wasteland.  I'm sorry that you're leaving us this soon."
msgstr "外がどんな様子かは聞きました。過酷な荒野の探索は大変でしょうね。こんなに早く旅立つなんて、残念だわ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "I meant \"Are there any jobs you know of?\""
msgstr "「何か仕事はないか？」と言いたかったんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "I want to join the community."
msgstr "このコミュニティに参加したい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "I'd better get going.  Nice meeting you."
msgstr "もう行くよ。話せてよかった。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
msgid "I'll see you around."
msgstr "また会おう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'm already staying here.  Nice to meet you."
msgstr "ここに滞在することにした。これからよろしく。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'm feeling alright, just working away."
msgstr "問題ないわ。ただひたすら働くのみよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "I'm happy to hear that, Gemma.  I'd best be going."
msgstr "それは良かった、ジェマ。そろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"It's nice to meet you too, survivor.  It's a tragedy what's become of the "
"New England Church Community, perhaps it'll flourish again someday."
msgstr "ええ、よろしくね、生存者さん。今のニューイングランド教会コミュニティは辛い状況だけど、いつかまた、賑わいが戻ってくると思うわ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"It's nice to meet you too, survivor.  It's a tragedy what's become of the "
"New England Church Community, perhaps it'll flourish again someday."
msgstr "ええ、よろしくね、生存者さん。今のニューイングランド教会コミュニティは辛い状況だけど、いつかまた、賑わいが戻ってくると思うわ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"It's nice to meet you too, survivor.  It's a tragedy what's become of the "
"New England Church Community, perhaps it'll flourish again someday."
msgstr "ええ、よろしくね、生存者さん。今のニューイングランド教会コミュニティは辛い状況だけど、いつかまた、賑わいが戻ってくると思うわ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid ""
"Its also called the Ten Commandments, if you've heard it by that.  A long "
"time ago, Moses lead the Israelites out of slavery in Egypt, towards the "
"Promised Land.  They broke their Covenant with God, and were cursed to "
"wander the desert for forty years, as opposed to the nineteen days it would "
"normally take.  On the way there, Moses went atop Mount Sinai to speak with "
"God.  He saw a burning bush, and heard the voice of the Lord; who engraved "
"the Decalogue on two tablets of stone."
msgstr ""
"シナイ契約とも呼ばれていますね。昔々、モーセという方が奴隷として働かされていたイスラエルの民をエジプトから脱出させ、約束の地へと導きました。その道中で彼らは神との約束を破り、普通は19日で到着するところを、40年間砂漠を彷徨わなくてはならない呪いを受けることになったのです。彷徨の中で、モーセはシナイ山の山頂に登り、神の声を聞きました。燃える柴の中から神の声が響き渡り、モーセはそこで聞いた10の戒律を2枚の石板に刻みました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid ""
"My flowers look a bit dehydrated, I'd appreciate it if you watered them for "
"me.  These indoor plants are the most calming reminders of life before "
"<the_cataclysm>."
msgstr ""
"お花がに水が足りないみたいだから、水をやっておいてもらえると助かるわ。部屋に植物を置いていると、<the_cataclysm>前の生活を思い出して、穏やかな気分になるわね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "My story?  It's been told a thousand times."
msgstr "私の話？平凡過ぎてつまらないと思うわ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Gemma.  I'm just passing through."
msgstr "はじめまして、ジェマ。私はただの通りすがりだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Gemma.  I'm seeking asylum."
msgstr "はじめまして、ジェマ。避難先を探していたところなんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "Sure.  See ya."
msgstr "分かった。さようなら。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "Sure.  Well, bye."
msgstr "分かった。じゃあ、また今度。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "Thank you.  See you around, Gemma."
msgstr "ありがとう。また会おう、ジェマ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "There sure is.  Well, bye."
msgstr "そのようだ。じゃあ、また今度。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid ""
"We are all under God's protection here.  Our community, like all moral "
"civilizations, has a set of rules.  Obey the Decalogue, have respect for "
"your neighbors and we'll get along just fine, okay?"
msgstr ""
"ここでは私たちは皆、神の庇護の下にあります。私たちのコミュニティはいわば道徳的な文明社会、規則は守ってもらいますよ。十戒に従い、隣人を敬い、皆で仲良くやっていきましょう。いいですね？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "What does a dorm leader do exactly?"
msgstr "寮監は具体的にどんな仕事をするんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "What is the Decalogue?"
msgstr "十戒とは何だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Jenny_Forcette.json
msgid "What was it you said earlier?"
msgstr "以前は何と言っていたっけ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid "What's the harsh reception about?"
msgstr "随分と手厳しい対応だな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid ""
"You are most welcome here.  In the good old days we would've held a ceremony"
" for you.  Oh well, times have changed.  Accept this blanket, you may choose"
" either bed by the window.  If you're hungry, you can go see Simon for a "
"meal, up to one per day."
msgstr ""
"心から歓迎するわ。昔なら、あなたのために歓迎セレモニーを開けたのに。ああ、これも時代の変化というものね。さあ、このブランケットを持っていってちょうだい。窓際のどちらのベッドを使っても構わないわ。お腹が空いたら、サイモンのところへ行って配給を貰えるわ。ただし、一日に一食だけよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Gemma_Johnstone.json
msgid ""
"You certainly have the marks of one.  I don't understand how you can go "
"walking around looking like an abomination, cursed by God, and think "
"everything's alright.  I'm not interested in learning, either, so be gone "
"with you."
msgstr ""
"その印を見れば分かりますよ。神に呪われた忌まわしい姿で彷徨う者が、まともな筈がないでしょう。ちっとも理解できないし、理解しようとも思わないわ。さあ、もう行って。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid ""
"&Helena flips through her Bible before stopping.  \"They read: 'I am the "
"Lord your God, who brought you out of Egypt, out of the land of slavery.  "
"You shall have no other gods before me.  You shall not make for yourself a "
"carved image, or any likeness of anything that is in heaven above, or that "
"is in the earth beneath, or that is in the water under the earth.  You shall"
" not take the name of the Lord your God in vain.  Remember the Sabbath day, "
"and keep it holy.  Honor your father and your mother.  You shall not murder."
"  You shall not commit adultery.  You shall not steal.  You shall not bear "
"false witness against your neighbor.  You shall not covet your neighbors "
"house.\"  They're written in Exodus 20:1-17, for future reference."
msgstr ""
"&ヘレナは聖書をパラパラとめくり、目的のページを見つけました。「わたしはあなたの主なる神であり、あなたをエジプトという奴隷の国から連れ出した。わたしのほかに神があってはならない。あなたは自分のために、天の上にあるものや地の下にあるもの、水の中にあるものを像に彫り、また似せたものを造ってはならない。あなたの主なる神の名をみだりに唱えてはならない。安息日を覚え、聖別せよ。父と母を重んじよ。人を殺してはならない。姦淫してはならない。盗んではならない。隣人について嘘を言ってはならない。隣人の家を妬んではならない。出エジプト記の第20章第1節から17節です。ご参考までに。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid ""
"A generous soul, are we?  That's not what I was expecting, but I'll see to "
"it."
msgstr "必要なのは寛大な心、ということですか？想定とは違いますが、手配しておきましょう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Alright, I'll go and see what's up."
msgstr "よし、引き受けた。現場を見てこよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Corrie and I have finished that solar cart."
msgstr "コリーと協力してソーラーカートを完成させた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Fine then."
msgstr "そうか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Garry_Villeneuve.json
msgid "Good to see you again."
msgstr "また会えて嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid ""
"He had many visions, and he had many secrets.  I don't know all of them, but"
" there was one he was highly vocal about, regarding <the_cataclysm>, that "
"according to him \"The spawn of Satan shall descend upon the Earth, and all "
"will be consumed in death and destruction\".  He never said much else about "
"it, and always had a mortified face whenever someone brought it up."
msgstr ""
"叔父は様々な幻視を体験しましたが、多くを秘密にしていました。私も全てを知っている訳ではありませんが、叔父が特に強く訴えていたのが、<the_cataclysm>についてです。彼は「サタンの子孫が地球に降り立ち、全てが死と破壊に呑み込まれる」と言っていました。しかし、それ以上は多くを語らず、誰かが詳しく問いただそうとしても、辛そうな顔で沈黙するだけでした。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Here's your money.  Don't spend it all in one place."
msgstr "さあ、これがここでの通貨です。無駄遣いはいけませんよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid ""
"I am a prophet, like my uncle before me.  He saw <the_cataclysm>, the "
"righteous judgement of God and set about preparing an ark to save us.  He "
"passed before his visions could be fulfilled, and now I carry his righteous "
"banner."
msgstr ""
"私は預言者です。かつて叔父がそうであったように。叔父は<the_cataclysm>を、神による正義の裁きを幻視し、私たちを救うために方舟の準備に取り掛かったのです。彼は預言が現実になる前に亡くなりましたが、今は私が先頭に立っています。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "I can't talk right now."
msgstr "今は話している時間がない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid ""
"I like what you and Corrie's put together.  I did promise payment for a "
"proof-of-concept, what'll it be?"
msgstr "あなたとコリーがお互い協力できるのは、好ましいことですね。確か、完成した折には報酬を用意すると約束したはずです。何を望みますか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "I presume you want me to pay a visit?"
msgstr "その一団と接触してこようか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "I want Corrie to have some extra rations."
msgstr "コリーへの食料配給を少し増やしてほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "I'll have some icons."
msgstr "聖画カードが欲しい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "I'm Helena, the caretaker of this flock.  Who might you be, wanderer?"
msgstr "私はヘレナ、こちらの信徒の皆さんのお世話をしています。放浪者さん、あなたはどなた？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "I'm glad you could make it here.  May the Lord have mercy on you."
msgstr "よくぞここまで来てくださいました。あなたに主の御慈悲がありますように。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "I'm glad you could make it here.  May the Lord have mercy on you."
msgstr "よくぞここまで来てくださいました。あなたに主の御慈悲がありますように。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "I'm glad you could make it here.  May the Lord have mercy on you."
msgstr "よくぞここまで来てくださいました。あなたに主の御慈悲がありますように。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "I'm just passing through.  I'll see you around."
msgstr "ただの通りすがりだ。また会おう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "I'm not doing much wandering, I'm staying here."
msgstr "私はもう放浪は止めた。ここに滞在しようと思うんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "It certainly seems like it."
msgstr "確かに、似たようなものだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Just like all the sinners, roaming through Hell."
msgstr "地獄をさまよう罪人と同じように、ですか。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<done_conversation_section>"
#. ~ Avatar response to an NPC that can be used for TALK_NONE responses.
#. Could be used in a lot more dialogs.  Could also use a lot more variety.
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Let's change the subject."
msgstr "話題を変えよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Let's negotiate some other time."
msgstr "報酬の交渉はまた今度にしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Oh, I've met them before!"
msgstr "ああ、その人たちには会ったことがある！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Okay, I'll see about that later."
msgstr "分かった、後で聞いてみよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Okay, I'll see about that.  Goodbye."
msgstr "分かった、後で聞いてみよう。さようなら。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Olwen's finished the radio transmitter she was working on."
msgstr "オルウェンが作っていた無線通信機が機能するようになった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Really?  I'd pay a small sum for information about them."
msgstr "本当ですか？詳しく教えていただけるなら、多少ではありますが報酬を支払いましょう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "See ya later, crazy lady."
msgstr "おかしな女だ、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Stranger, what brings you to our holy home?"
msgstr "見知らぬ方、私たちの聖なる家に何かご用ですか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Thank you, I hope he shares that sentiment."
msgstr "ありがとう、私も神の御慈悲を願うよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Thank you.  I'll see you around."
msgstr "ありがとう。それじゃ、また会おう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid ""
"Thanks to my uncle's forethought, we've been blessed by God.  We have plenty"
" of food for ourselves, safety from the hordes of Hell, and the continued "
"protection of the Lord our God."
msgstr "叔父の預言のお陰で、私たちは神に祝福されました。十分な食料もあり、地獄の軍勢からも守られています。私たちには主たる神の加護があります。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid ""
"They denied us, they labeled us as a doomsday cult, threw sticks and stones "
"at us, and yet, we were standing resiliently.  Why?  Because we knew God was"
" on our side."
msgstr ""
"教会は私たちを否定し、終末論を説くカルトというレッテルを貼り、攻撃してきましたが、それでも私たちは毅然と立ち続けました。なぜか？それは、私たちには神の加護があるという自覚をもっているからです。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid ""
"We are all under God's protection here.  Our community, like all moral "
"civilizations, has a set of rules.  Obey the Decalogue, have respect for "
"your neighbors and we'll get along just fine.  Go see Gemma or Julian for a "
"bed, if one's available.  We do have limited space on our Ark, though."
msgstr ""
"ここでは私たちは皆、神の庇護の下にあります。私たちのコミュニティは道徳的な文明社会ですから、規則は守ってくださいね。十戒に従い、隣人を敬い、皆で仲良くやっていきましょう。いいですね？寝床が必要なら、ジェマかジュリアンに聞きなさい。この方舟はあまり広くはありませんが。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "Well, they're…"
msgstr "そうだな、まず..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid "What do you need?"
msgstr "何が必要？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid ""
"Yes, I was just informed of that.  I also heard that she found a large group"
" of people living out in an old evacuation center, who consider themselves "
"merchants.  That would be a good place to resume our spread of the Truth, "
"perhaps we could find others who were faithful before <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr ""
"ええ、先ほど知らせを聞きました。しかも、古い避難所を拠点に商人として活動している大集団を見つけたそうですね。再び真理の普及を始めるにはうってつけの場所かもしれません。もしかしたら、<the_cataclysm>以前からの信徒を見つけられる可能性もある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Helena_Misinter.json
msgid ""
"Yes, you seem like a good fit for the job.  I'll pay you a small sum for "
"getting some information about them."
msgstr "ええ、あなたにぴったりの仕事です。情報を持ち帰っていただけたら、多少ではありますが報酬を用意しましょう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "Alright.  Wanna chat?"
msgstr "分かった。他の話をしようか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Always nice to meet a fellow outsider.  How can I help you?"
msgstr "訪問者はいつだって歓迎するよ。どんな用事で来たんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Always nice to meet a fellow outsider.  How can I help you?"
msgstr "訪問者はいつだって歓迎するよ。どんな用事で来たんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Always nice to meet a fellow outsider.  How can I help you?"
msgstr "訪問者はいつだって歓迎するよ。どんな用事で来たんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "Are you taking care of Arturo?"
msgstr "アルトゥーロの治療をしているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "Could you provide any medical services?"
msgstr "手当てをしてもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "Do you have any work available?"
msgstr "私にできる仕事はある？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "Do you want to come with me?"
msgstr "私と一緒に来るか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid ""
"He's an alright physician, but the Church massively overrates him.  They "
"think his 'natural medicine' can cure anything, like he's a magic medicine "
"man.  God created everything, so what on Earth isn't natural?!"
msgstr ""
"確かに立派な医者だが、教会は彼を過大評価している。あの「自然医学」って奴のことを、何でも治せる魔法の薬だと思っているんだ。神がすべてをお創りになったって言うなら、医薬品だって神の恵みじゃないのか！？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "Hi, Jane.  Got a minute?"
msgstr "やあ、ジェーン。ちょっといいかな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "How do you feel about him personally?"
msgstr "個人的にはコスタスのことをどう思っているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "I can pay for quality work.  Here it is."
msgstr "いい仕事にはちゃんと対価を支払うべきだ。はい、どうぞ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid ""
"I could always use more bandages, disinfectant, and the like.  What do you "
"have?"
msgstr "包帯や消毒薬がもっと揃うと嬉しいね。何がある？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid ""
"I do what I can, but he's mostly beyond my skillset.  Coke's a <swear> "
"<name_b>, really messes a person up.  Arturo was on it for several years "
"before he tried to get help, now he has auditory hallucinations; hears "
"voices from nowhere.  Traumatic experiences have a harsher effect on "
"recovering addicts, but <the_cataclysm> is worse than anything we've gone "
"through before."
msgstr ""
"できる限りの治療はしているが、私の能力ではこれ以上は無理だ。<swear>、コカインは<name_b>だな。人を壊してしまう。アルトゥーロは数年前から依存症で、今も幻聴の症状がある。トラウマを残すほどの強烈な体験は、回復途上の依存症患者により強い影響を与える。<the_cataclysm>なんて、これまで経験したどんなものより酷い体験だろうな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "I don't have anything right now.  I'll come back with something later."
msgstr "今は持ってきていないんだ。用意してこよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "I don't have anything right now.  Lets talk about something else."
msgstr "今は持ってきていないんだ。他の話をしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/foodguard.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/homeless/group_camp/TALK_homeless_broker.json
msgid "I have <topic_item>."
msgstr "<topic_item>を持っている。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid ""
"I might have some medicine for the community.  Anything you're missing?"
msgstr "コミュニティのために薬品を持ってきた。何か足りないものはある？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid ""
"I really don't, actually.  Even my help is thankless here.  Bandaging cuts, "
"setting bones, disinfecting wounds; who needs all that when they can pray "
"anything away?"
msgstr ""
"いや、手伝うことはない。私の治療すら、ここではまったく感謝されない。包帯での切創保護、骨折箇所の固定、創傷の消毒。何でも祈れば治るというなら、どうして私はこんな仕事をやってるんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid ""
"I was a physician, one of the more unfortunate people who didn't call in "
"sick during the riots.  I remember it all so clearly, the cuts, bruises, "
"deep bites, then those oily black eyes, caustic yellow blood, spastic fungal"
" growths… it was <swear> gnarly.  Then things descended into all-new levels "
"of fucked up, and some of my coworkers were preparing to just get the hell "
"out.  I followed them."
msgstr ""
"私は医者だ。暴動中でも職場に病欠の電話を入れなかった、不幸な医者たちの一人ってところか。切創、打撲創、深い咬創、油状の黒い眼、腐食性の黄色い血液、真菌感染症によるけいれん発作...<swear>、酷いものだった。更に、事態が今までとまったく別次元の酷い状況になった。同僚の何人かが脱出の準備をし始めたから、私も後に続くことにしたんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid ""
"I'd like to leave, but I've got to take care of Arturo.  He's always low or "
"nearly out of antipsychotics, so I do what I can."
msgstr "すぐにでも出ていきたいが、アルトゥーロの治療は続けなければ。抗精神病薬もほとんど渡せていない。できる限りのことはしておきたいんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid ""
"I'm doing somewhat well, thanks to my occupation.  The other joinees, well, "
"they're barely scraping by.  It's been tense, and I'm not seeing it change "
"for the better."
msgstr "私はこういう職業だから、まぁ問題なくやれてるよ。他の人たちはというと、ううん、ギリギリってところか。毎日緊張が続くのは、良い兆候ではない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_old_guard_doctor.json
msgid "I've changed my mind.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "気が変わった。何か他の話をしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "Need any help?"
msgstr "何か手伝おうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "Nice to meet you too, Jane."
msgstr "初めまして、ジェーン。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "No, not by the government."
msgstr "ああ、でも政府の用意した避難所じゃない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid ""
"No, not really.  I came here after I was split from my friends by a horde of"
" <zombies>.  They let me in after I gave away some food I found.  The church"
" distrusts my profession; I get by helping Kostas."
msgstr ""
"いや、そうでもない。私は<zombies>の大群のせいで同僚たちとはぐれて、ここに辿り着いた。持っていた食料を譲ったら、入れてもらえたよ。どうも、教会は私の仕事に不信感を抱いているらしい。コスタスの手伝いって名目で、何とか居座らせてもらってる状況だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid ""
"Oh, I don't think we've met before.  My name's Jane, I'm the local doctor."
msgstr "ああ、初めてましてかな。私はジェーン。地元の医者だよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid ""
"Personally, I like him.  We've worked together for a few cases, but most "
"people refuse to let me work; they only want to see him."
msgstr "個人の付き合いなら、何も問題はない。何回か一緒に仕事をしたこともある。だが、私が前に出ると嫌がり、彼と話をさせろと言う奴が多くてね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "Sure, I don't see why not.  I've gotta keep my mind off stuff anyway."
msgstr "ああ、断る理由もない。こういう息抜きは大事だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid ""
"Sure, I've got some supplies on hand, just give me a minute and I'll look "
"you over.  It'll cost ten icons."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid ""
"Thorazine would go us a long way, but Arturo's having trouble getting it.  "
"They think he's the key and that my help would obstruct him.  Regardless, "
"there's just so much anti-medical sentiment here that I've given up on "
"prescribing anything."
msgstr ""
"ソラジンが必要だ。アルトゥーロへの処方に苦労している。教会の言い分では、彼は重要人物で、私の治療が彼を害しているそうだ。とにかく、ここは反医学的な感情が強すぎる。薬剤の処方なんてまともにできそうにない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "Were you evaced'?"
msgstr "避難したのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "What about Kostas?  The Church seems to trust him."
msgstr "コスタスに仲介を頼んではどうだ？彼は教会に信用されているようだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jane_Schulz.json
msgid "Would you like to buy any supplies?"
msgstr "消耗品を買わないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"&Jeremiah leans his head towards your ear, speaking in a low whisper.  \"To "
"be honest with you, I don't like my mom at all.  She's like a <swear> "
"helicopter, always telling me what to do, where to go, who I can be with.  "
"She never thinks of me as an individual, only some idea of who she thinks I "
"am.  My dad's alright, he's the chef around here.\""
msgstr ""
"&ジェレミアはこちらの耳元に口を近付け、低い声で呟きました。「正直言って、母さんのことは苦手だ。オレに何をしろとか、どこへ行けとか、誰と一緒にいろとか、<swear>、ヘリコプターみたいにブンブンうるさい。オレのことをちゃんとした人間だと思ってない。自分の思い通りに動かしたいんだ。父さんはマトモだよ。近所で料理人やってる。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"Darryl should have something for you to do if you like gardening, Jane could"
" use some medical supplies, too.  If you like to be bossed around, Helena "
"probably has a few things that need doing.  I'd just ask around, really."
msgstr ""
"ガーデニングが得意ならダリルの仕事を手伝えばいいし、医療品が余ってるなら、ジェーンに渡してあげれば喜ぶと思う。他にも何か手伝いたいなら、ヘレナに聞いたらどうだろう。とにかく、みんなの話を聞くのが一番いいだろうな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "Hey, Jerry.  What's up?"
msgstr "やあ、ジェリー。調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "Hey, kid.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr "やあ、少年。話は後にしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"I have a name, you know.  It's Jeremiah, but people just call me Jerry."
msgstr "少年じゃなくて名前がある。ジェレミアだ。皆はジェリーって呼んでる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "I noticed you're holding a D&D handbook.  Do you play much?"
msgstr "D&Dのルールブックを持っているな。よく遊ぶの？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"I thought asking about each other's emotions went out of style after "
"<the_cataclysm>.  Uhm, okay then.  I'm fine, I guess."
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>が起きてから、お互いの調子を聞く機会なんて来ないと思ってた。ううん、よし。元気、だと思う。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"I was in school, like anyone else my age.  Then out of nowhere, my mom "
"pulled me out of school to \"save me\".  I got packed into a bus with my "
"parents and their old-timey friends.  We've been stuck here ever since.  "
"Actually, it's not all that bad.  I'm studying to be a herbalist like "
"Kostas, which is cool I guess."
msgstr ""
"オレは高校生で、生活も普通の高校生っぽい感じだった。でもある日突然、母さんが「あなたを守るため」とか言って、学校から引っ張り出したんだ。両親の昔からの知り合いも一緒に来て、オレはバスに乗せられた。それからは、ずっとここで暮らしてる。まぁ、そんなに悪い生活でもないけどな。コスタスみたいな薬草学者になるために、勉強してるんだ。クールだろ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"I'd like to study herbology with Kostas, it seems like a useful skill these "
"days.  I do feel bad for Jane though, she's a skilled doctor and nobody here"
" cares, they all just think any illness can be prayed away."
msgstr ""
"コスタスに薬草学を教わろうと思ってるんだ。今こそ役に立つ知識だと思う。そういや、ジェーンもかわいそうだよな。立派な医者なのに、ここじゃ誰も気にかけない。教会の人は、病気は祈れば治ると思ってるからな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "I'll be on my way."
msgstr "そうか。もう行くよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "I'll see what I can do for you."
msgstr "できる限りやってみよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "I'm just a traveler, kid.  I won't be staying here for long."
msgstr "少年、私はただの旅人だ。ここに長居するつもりはないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "I'm not exactly new here, kid."
msgstr "少年、もう知らない人じゃない。ここに滞在するつもりだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "I've convinced Kostas to take you on."
msgstr "コスタスを説得できた。弟子として迎えるそうだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "Is there anything you need?"
msgstr "私にできることはある？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"My take?  You already know how things are.  People are dead, my friends are "
"dead, so yeah.  At least there's no school, the adults just love reminding "
"me that.  You know what?  I kinda miss school."
msgstr ""
"どう思う、だって？見たら分かるじゃん。人が大勢死んで、友達も死んで、それだけさ。でも学校が無いのはいいな。なぁ、大人っていつもこういう話をさせたがるよな？やっぱり学校が無いのは寂しいや。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "No thanks, I'd better get going."
msgstr "止めておこう、そろそろ行かないと。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "No thanks.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "止めておく。他の話をしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "Oh, uh… you look new.  Didn't think we'd see new people here.  Hey."
msgstr "おっと、うーん...初めて見るね。ここで知らない人に会うなんて思わなかった。どうも。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "Sorry, Jeremiah.  I'll be on my way."
msgstr "失礼、ジェレミア。また今度話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "Sorry, Jerry.  What's up?"
msgstr "失礼、ジェリー。調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "Sure, I'm up for it."
msgstr "もちろん、ぜひやりたいね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "Tell me about your parents."
msgstr "あなたのご両親について聞きたい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "That's great!  Thanks <name_g>, here's the money."
msgstr "よっしゃあ！ありがとう、<name_g>。これがお礼だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"Well…  Kostas is a bit unsure about teaching me, for some reason.  If you "
"could change his mind, I'd pay you some \"icons\", what we've started using "
"for money around here."
msgstr ""
"それが...コスタスはオレに教えるのをちょっと嫌がってるみたいでさ。もし、あんたがコスタスを説得してくれたら、ここでお金として使ってる「聖画カード」を支払うよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "Were could I find work around here?"
msgstr "ここで私にできる仕事はあるかな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "What are your parents like?"
msgstr "ご両親はどんな人なんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "What are your plans after <the_cataclysm>?"
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>後は何をしようと思っている？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
msgid "What's your take on the situation here?"
msgstr "今の状況をどう思う？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "When do you plan on starting that apprenticeship?"
msgstr "いつから弟子入りするつもりなんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I play.  I ran a campaign for a while with some of my friends, we'd "
"play after school.  I don't know where they are now, though.  Do you wanna "
"play some?"
msgstr "ああ、やるよ。放課後に友達と集まって、キャンペーンやったこともあるんだ。そいつらも今どこにいるか分からないけど。一緒にやるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Jeremiah_Weaver.json
msgid "You're welcome."
msgstr "どういたしまして。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid ""
"&Julian suddenly appears disturbed, and looks away from you for a moment.  "
"\"It's a long story, and not an interesting one at that.  I was a cop "
"before.  You must've heard about those riots and all that.  I'm glad we all "
"managed to make it out alive.\""
msgstr ""
"&ジュリアンはふと不安そうな表情を浮かべ、こちらから目を逸らしました。「話せば長くなるし、面白い話でもない。僕は以前、警官だったんだ。暴動の話は耳にしてるだろう。ここの皆は巻き込まれず生きていてくれてよかった。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Advantages?  All I do is work!"
msgstr "良かったこと？ひたすら仕事しかないよ！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid ""
"Aight, here are the rules: don't commit sins, don't litter, and try not to "
"die.  Have some mutual respect, capiche?"
msgstr "よし、ここにはルールがある。罪を犯すな、ゴミを散らかすな、命を落とすような行動はするな。お互い敬意を払って暮らしていこうな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Alright, let's talk about something else."
msgstr "分かった、他のことについて話そう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Anything I can do to help you out?"
msgstr "何か手伝えることはあるか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Go on…"
msgstr "続けて..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Hello, Julian.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr "やあ、ジュリアン。話は後にしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid ""
"Hey, a new face.  I'm Julian, the guy in charge of this room.  You're "
"planning on sticking around or somethin'?"
msgstr "やあ、新入りだな。僕はジュリアン、この部屋の責任者だ。君はここに滞在するのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Hey, good to see you again."
msgstr "やあ、また会えて嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "How did you make it out?"
msgstr "どうやって生き残ったんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "I get the picture, screw this."
msgstr "よく分かった、もういいよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "I'd rather not talk about it."
msgstr "今は話す気になれない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "I'm a joinee actually.  Nice to meet you."
msgstr "ここに滞在することにしたんだ。これからよろしく。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss.  I gotta go."
msgstr "それは辛かっただろうな。私はもう行くよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss.  Maybe we should change the subject."
msgstr "それは辛かっただろうな。何か他の話をしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid ""
"It's been a struggle, trying to keep this bunch together.  Oh things could "
"be better here, of course.  It could always be, but sometimes we don't even "
"realize how good we have it here."
msgstr ""
"これだけの集団を維持するんだから、大変なことばかりさ。もちろん、状況が好転する可能性もある。自分たちのいる場所がどれだけ恵まれているか分からなくなるってのは、よくあることだね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid ""
"Listen, I have some bad news.  I don't personally have anything against you,"
" but many of the people here are very… discriminatory against those who look"
" like you.  I hate to say it, but I'll have to turn you away.  I'm sorry."
msgstr ""
"聞いてくれ、悪い知らせだ。個人的には、君に対して悪い感情はないんだが、ここにいる人の大半は、君のような人に対して、強く...偏見をもっている。こんなことを伝えるのは辛いが、君を追い返さなければならない。申し訳ない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Need anything?"
msgstr "どうした？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Julian.  I'm just passing through."
msgstr "はじめまして、ジュリアン。私はただの通りすがりだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Julian.  I'm seeking asylum."
msgstr "はじめまして、ジュリアン。避難先を探していたところなんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Thank you.  See you around, Julian."
msgstr "ありがとう。また会おう、ジュリアン。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid ""
"Well, I might as well be honest with you.  I ran mostly, ran like the devil "
"was chasin' me.  I was at one of the police stations in town, when we were "
"called out to handle a violent mob on the loose.  When we got there, the "
"people were crazy, smashing and killing everything in their way.  They had "
"these bloodshot eyes and a weird goo in their mouths.  We pulled out all the"
" stops to handle them.  When tear gas wouldn't work, the chief told us to "
"draw guns and kill them all.  We did…  There was so much blood…  That "
"maneuver killed a lot of them, but not all.  One snuck up behind a lady who "
"worked with us, tore a whole section of her spine out.  She never even had "
"time to scream, just slumped over the cruiser door…  So I jumped post and "
"ran, never looked back.  God, I can still hear the cries…"
msgstr ""
"まあ、正直に言った方がいいか。逃げたよ。悪魔に追われてるのかってぐらい逃げまくった。ある街の警察署に勤務中、暴徒がいると通報があって、出動したんだ。現場に着いたとき、暴徒は怒り狂って、邪魔するものを手当たり次第に壊し、殺していた。目は血走って、口からは妙な粘液が垂れていた。僕らはあらゆる手を尽くして、暴動を止めようとした。催涙ガスも効果がなくて、署長は、銃を構えろ、皆殺しにしろと命令した。その通りにしたよ...あたりは血まみれだ...全滅は避けられたけど、かなりの同僚が死んだ。ある仲間なんて、後ろから忍び寄ってきた奴に背骨を引きちぎられた。彼女は悲鳴すら出せず、ただパトカーのドアにかぶさって倒れ込んだ...その瞬間、僕はそのパトカーに乗り込んで、決して振り返らず逃げたんだ。ああ神様、まだ声が耳にこびりついている..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "What are the advantages of being a dorm leader?"
msgstr "寮監になって良かったことは？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid ""
"When I was younger, I used to go to church with my family.  When I started "
"growing up, I saw all this evil around me, people hating and persecuting "
"others, despite the teachings of Jesus; I just stopped going one day, "
"decided to make my own way.  I joined the NECC a few years back to rekindle "
"my relationship with God, get back to who I was."
msgstr ""
"子供の頃は、よく家族と一緒に教会へ行っていた。大人になってから、イエス様の教えとは裏腹に、他人を憎み迫害する人間をたくさん目の当たりにして、道は自分で切り開くしかないと思い詰め、ある日を境に教会通いを止めた。ニューイングランド教会コミュニティの一員になったのは今から数年前だな。神との関係をもう一度蘇らせて、本来の自分を取り戻そうと思ったんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Why did you join the Church?"
msgstr "この教会の一員になった理由は？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Yeah, I can understand.  See ya later."
msgstr "ああ、分かったよ。また今度。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid "Yeah, it must be exhausting.  Well, bye."
msgstr "ああ、大変だろうな。じゃあ、また今度。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You sure?  I mean, you've been traveling for a long time, haven't you?  "
"Alright, it's your decision.  Let me know when you changed your mind."
msgstr "本気か？その、ずっと長旅続きだったんじゃないのか？いや、君自身の決断が大事だ。気が変わったらまた言ってくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You sure?  I mean, you've been traveling for a long time, haven't you?  "
"Alright, it's your decision.  Let me know when you changed your mind."
msgstr "本気か？その、ずっと長旅続きだったんじゃないのか？いや、君自身の決断が大事だ。気が変わったらまた言ってくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You sure?  I mean, you've been traveling for a long time, haven't you?  "
"Alright, it's your decision.  Let me know when you changed your mind."
msgstr "本気か？その、ずっと長旅続きだったんじゃないのか？いや、君自身の決断が大事だ。気が変わったらまた言ってくれ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Julian_Ray.json
msgid ""
"Your name is now on the books.  Here's your blanket, joinee.  Those two beds"
" next to the window, you can choose one of them.  It's safe, don't worry.  "
"I'm armed.  By the way, if you're hungry you can go bug Simon for a meal, up"
" to one in a day."
msgstr ""
"確かに名簿に記録したよ。さあ、毛布をどうぞ。窓際の2つのベッド、どちらかを選んでくれ。心配するな、ここは安全だ。僕がしっかり武装してる。ああそれと、もし腹が減ったら、サイモンのところで食事をするといい。ただし、一日一回だけだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Alright, fuck you then."
msgstr "ふん。こんな場所、こっちから願い下げだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Can you can take in joinees once there's a vacancy?"
msgstr "もし余裕が出たら、避難者を受け入れられるのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Can you tell me about Arturo?"
msgstr "アルトゥーロについて教えて？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Can you tell me about Corrie?"
msgstr "コリーに付いて教えて？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Can you tell me about Jane?"
msgstr "ジェーンに付いて教えて？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Can you tell me about Jeremiah?"
msgstr "ジェレミアに付いて教えて？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Can you tell me about Simon?"
msgstr "サイモンに付いて教えて？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Can you tell me about Sonia?"
msgstr "ソニアに付いて教えて？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Can you tell me about Zachary?"
msgstr "ザカリーに付いて教えて？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Do you know where I could find some work?"
msgstr "どこで仕事を見つけられる？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"He was quite reserved when I met him, seemed distant in his thoughts.  "
"Theresa has the answers you are looking for."
msgstr "私がお会いしたときは、とても控えめな方で、瞑想をされているように見えたね。テレサに聞けば詳しく話してくれると思う。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"He's my son, such a wonderful boy.  He's always been the light in my life, "
"and I've tried to teach him well.  We've been a bit distant as of late, but "
"I'm sure he'll come around."
msgstr ""
"とっても素敵な、私の息子よ。あの子は私の人生の光だから、たくさんの知識を教えてあげたいと思ってる。最近は少し距離を感じるけど、きっと一時的なものだと思う。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Hi, Katherine.  How's it going?"
msgstr "やあ、キャサリン。調子はどう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"I hear she knows this and that about electronics.    She keeps herself "
"occupied by doing menial tasks around the camp, looking for payment."
msgstr "彼女は電気関係に詳しいらしいね。拠点内で雑用を請け負って、生計を立ててるそうだよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Guneet_Singh.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Mandeep_Singh.json
msgid "I just had some questions."
msgstr "聞きたいことがあるんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"I understand.  I don't have the answers you are looking for, I'm afraid."
msgstr "なるほど。でも残念ながら、私に答えられそうなことはないよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"I worked for the Church, organized charities and filed paperwork.  That's "
"how I met the Founder.  I did so much for everyone, yet they never noticed…"
msgstr ""
"私は教会で働いていた。チャリティーを企画したり、色々な書類を用意したりね。そんな時に、創設者と出会ったの。私は皆のために頑張っていたけれど、なかなか気付いてはもらえなかった..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "I'll be on my way then."
msgstr "それじゃあ、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "I'll talk to her then."
msgstr "今度聞いてみよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"I'm not planning to communicate with him, that's for certain.  He can keep "
"his distance with his smug nothingness.  At least he knows how to cut "
"lumber."
msgstr ""
"一つ言えることは、あの人とコミュニケーションを取るつもりはない。どうも気取った感じで、こっちに歩み寄ろうとしないんだよね。でもまぁ、材木の切り方は知ってるみたい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"I'm sure you've met my husband, Simon.  He was also a volunteer at a "
"homeless shelter, working as a cook.  We were brought together by the hands "
"of fate as some would say.  We have a son together, Jeremiah, the light in "
"my life.  Such a creative and well-behaved boy, I just wish we could find an"
" appropriate woman for him."
msgstr ""
"私の夫、サイモンにはもう会ったでしょう。彼もボランティア精神溢れる人で、ホームレスシェルターで料理人をしていたんだ。私たち夫婦は、運命によって結ばれたんだね。息子のジェレミアは、まさに人生の光よ。とってもクリエイティブで礼儀正しい子だから、どうにかして相応しい女性を見つけたいと思ってるわ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"I've been a member of the New England Church Community for a quarter of a "
"century, took part in each and every sermon and gathering they held even "
"while I was carrying my boy Jeremiah.  Not to mention the countless times we"
" visited those filthy homeless shelters and prisons filled with sinners.  I "
"even met the Founder himself.  I can confidently say I'm more worthy to be "
"here than those impostors who leech on us at this camp."
msgstr ""
"私はニューイングランド教会コミュニティに25年所属していて、息子のジェレミアを身ごもっているときも、説教や集会には毎回参加していたわ。もちろん、不潔なホームレス施設や罪人だらけの刑務所にだって、数えきれないほど訪問した。教会の創設者ご本人に会ったこともあるんだから。この拠点で私たちをいいように使っているペテン師たちよりも、ずっと価値のある人間だと自信をもって言えるわ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"If there's a vacancy.  Even then, there's the decision of which joinee to "
"include.  Those people don't share or respect the same values as we do.  "
"None of them are promising candidates."
msgstr ""
"余裕ができたとするよ。じゃあ、どの避難者を優先して受け入れるかって判断をしなきゃいけない。避難者が、必ずしも私たちと同じ価値観を共有したり、尊重できたりするわけじゃない。見込みのある人間は結局来ないものさ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"If you're here for an exciting story, you're talking with the wrong person."
"  Ever since I was born I've lived very modestly.  Did I regret it?  No, it "
"will all be worth it in the end…"
msgstr ""
"刺激的な話を聞きに来たのなら、尋ねる相手を間違えたね。生まれてから今まで、私はずっと質素に暮らしてきた。後悔してるかだって？いいえ、最後にはすべてが価値あるものになるのだから..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "It's always a pleasure.  How may I help you?"
msgstr "歓迎するよ。何か用があって来たの？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Jesus warned us about false prophets."
msgstr "イエス様はこうおっしゃってた。偽預言者に気を付けろってね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"My dear, sweet husband.  He worked as a cook for one of the homeless "
"shelters, that's how we met.  He's always liked to try new things.  He "
"should be in the dining hall, if you want to see him."
msgstr ""
"私の愛する優しい夫だよ。私たちが出会ったとき、彼はホームレスシェルターの料理人をしてた。夫は新しいことに挑戦するのが大好きなの。食堂にいるだろうから、挨拶していくといいよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Katherine."
msgstr "はじめまして、キャサリン。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Oh well, yet another survivor.  Welcome to our group, I'm Katherine."
msgstr "おや、まだ生存者がいたとはね。ようこそ、私はキャサリン。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "Oh well, yet another survivor.  Welcome to our group, I'm Katherine."
msgstr "おや、まだ生存者がいたとはね。ようこそ、私はキャサリン。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Oh well, yet another survivor.  Welcome to our group, I'm Katherine."
msgstr "おや、まだ生存者がいたとはね。ようこそ、私はキャサリン。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"Our prayers were heard.  We knew the day was coming, so we prepared.  Our "
"community stockpiled months' worth of canned goods, well enough until the "
"chaos ends.  With the food we have left, we could live peacefully, but we "
"foolishly didn't take extra people into consideration.  With so much at "
"risk, I don't think we can afford more people.  Though I'm not the one who "
"makes the decisions here, and it's probably for the better."
msgstr ""
"私たちの祈りは聞き届けられた。その日が来ることは前から分かっていたんだ。だから、混乱が収まるまで飢えずに過ごせるよう、コミュニティ内で数か月分の缶詰を備蓄していたんだ。食料が十分あれば、平和に暮らしていけるはず。でも、私たちには考えが足りなかった。外からの避難者を考慮してなかったの。こんなリスクだらけの状況で、人員を増やす余裕があるとは私には思えない。でも、ここで決断するのは私じゃないし、たとえ私が決断したとしても状況は良くならないでしょうね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"She occasionally plays her guitar in the hall, and she's quite good at it.  "
"Unsurprisingly, she doesn't know any hymns.  Wouldn't let her near my son."
msgstr ""
"彼女は時々広場でギターを弾いてるけど、これが結構上手いんだ。意外でもないけど、讃美歌は知らないみたいね。息子に近寄らないよう見張っておかないと。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Tell me about the community."
msgstr "このコミュニティについて聞きたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Tell me about your family."
msgstr "あなたの家族について聞きたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "The Founder?"
msgstr "創設者？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"There's not an illness God can't cure.  Yet, by fate, we were given a "
"doctor.  She's now taking care of Arturo, that poor thing.  Oh well, who am "
"I to question God's ways?"
msgstr ""
"神に癒せない病はない。でも、何かの縁で私たちのもとに医者が訪れた。今はアルトゥーロの治療に躍起になってるみたいだけど、気の毒なもんだね。まあ、神のお導きに疑問をもつつもりはないけどさ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "We have many things to pray for, I'm afraid."
msgstr "祈らなければいけないことが多すぎる。恐怖しかないよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#: data/json/npcs/random_encounters/camper_van_traveler.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_1_Reena_Sandhu.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_4_Brandon_Garder.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_5_Yusuke_Taylor.json
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "What did you do before <the_cataclysm>?"
msgstr "<the_cataclysm>の前は何をしていたんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid "You don't seem to like the joinees very much.  Why is that?"
msgstr "ここへ避難してくる人のことをよく思っていないようだ。どうして？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Katherine_Weaver.json
msgid ""
"You're right, I don't.  They should've come when they had the chance.  Now "
"that our Ark has sailed, they want to jump aboard.  Such is the way of "
"sinners, I suppose."
msgstr "確かに、そうね。チャンスがある内に来るべきだったと思うんだ。方舟が出港してから、今更飛び乗ろうとするなんて。そんなのは罪人のやり口だよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard1.json
msgid "Alright then."
msgstr "分かった。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Alright, I'll take a look."
msgstr "分かった、見てみよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Alright, thanks for informing me. Bye!"
msgstr "そうか、教えてくれてありがとう。また今度！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr "よしよし、分かった。ジェレミアを弟子にして、知識を学ばせるとしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr "よしよし、分かった。ジェレミアを弟子にして、知識を学ばせるとしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Alright, you've convinced me.  I'll take Jeremiah on and show him the ropes."
msgstr "よしよし、分かった。ジェレミアを弟子にして、知識を学ばせるとしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Alright.  See you around, Kostas."
msgstr "分かったよ。また会おう、コスタス。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Are there any jobs I could do?"
msgstr "私にできる仕事はないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Can I try your pine needle tea?"
msgstr "松葉ティーをぜひ飲ませて貰えないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Care to share your knowledge about herbalism?"
msgstr "薬草についてのアドバイスが聞きたい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Fuck you, I'm blowing this joint."
msgstr "畜生、こんな所にいられるか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Hey Kostas, find something interesting lately?"
msgstr "やあコスタス、最近は何か商品を入荷した？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Hey, Kostas.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr "やあ、コスタス。話は後にしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Hi, Kostas.  Care to trade?"
msgstr "やあ、コスタス。物資の取り引きをしないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid ""
"I can tell you this: pine needles make the best tea.  Perhaps I'll make you "
"one someday."
msgstr "松葉を煎じた茶はとても美味いぞ。いつか作ってあげよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "I have the pine needles you asked me for."
msgstr "頼まれていた松の枝を持ってきた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "I heard Jeremiah wanted to learn a few things from you."
msgstr "ジェレミアがあなたから知識を学びたがっているそうだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "I know him pretty well, I'm sure he'll learn as he goes along."
msgstr "ジェレミアのことはよく知っている。きっと熱心に学んでくれるだろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid ""
"I'm afraid I haven't gone out there for a while, maybe come back in "
"<interval>.  These are all I have, care to take a look?"
msgstr "悪いが、ここ最近は外出できていない。<interval>経てば、何か手に入るかもな。今ある商品だけでも見ていくか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid ""
"I'm talking about you and your filthy, unnatural appearance.  I don't like "
"your kind, and neither does anyone else.  Go repent before the Lord for your"
" many sins, if he'll even listen to you."
msgstr ""
"お前自身と、お前の異常で穢れた姿のことだ。お前のような奴に親切にする者など、ここには誰一人おらんわ。慈悲深い神がお前の言い分を聞いてくださる機会が訪れたら、犯した罪を全て告白し、悔い改めるのだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid ""
"If you don't take him under your wings, I'll rip them off for you.  Capiche?"
msgstr "弟子入りを拒むようなら、今後は薬草医に近付くなと釘を刺しておこうか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid ""
"It's been quiet and peaceful.  Nature is recovering, and so are we.  There's"
" something bittersweet about <the_cataclysm>, isn't there?  Our species was "
"on the path of destruction, but Mother Nature spared us.  A sign of mercy "
"for a creature that did not deserve it."
msgstr ""
"静かで平和な日々が続いている。自然は回復し、私たちも回復している。<the_cataclysm>とは、かくもほろ苦いものだな？人類という種は、常に破壊の道を辿ってきた。しかし、母なる自然は私たちを赦したのだ。慈悲に値しない生物にすら、慈悲を与えるという赦しの証だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid ""
"Jeremiah's a bright kid.  I'll just tell him to not wander as a stipulation."
msgstr "ジェレミアは聡明な子だ。迷子にならないよう、本人にちゃんと言い聞かせておくよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid ""
"My story?  I'm afraid it's not as gripping as the other tales around here.  "
"My father was an herbalist, my grandfather was an herbalist and - as "
"ancestral pressure would have it - I also became an herbalist.  I studied "
"from the best teachers and, through the years, a generation's knowledge "
"passed on to me.  I've spent a good portion of my life warning others of the"
" fakery that is plastic medicine and helping them rediscover the forgotten "
"beauty that lies in our surroundings.  I joined the New England Church "
"Community to express my gratitude towards the benevolence of nature.  This "
"is where it brought me."
msgstr ""
"私の話？他の奴に聞いた方が、面白い話を聞けると思うがな。父は薬草医、祖父も薬草医、そして伝統という荷を背負い、私も薬草医になった。素晴らしい師匠から学び、何年もかけて代々伝わる知識を受け継いだ。私は人生の大半を、科学療法というペテンへの警鐘と、暮らしの身近にある忘れ去られた美の再発見に費やしてきたのだ。私がニューイングランド教会コミュニティに入ったのも、自然という天の恵みに感謝するためだ。そして、今ここにいるというわけだな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Nice to meet you too, Kostas."
msgstr "初めまして、コスタス。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "No, I'm still certain about this.  Jeremiah just isn't a good fit."
msgstr "いや、やはり駄目だ。人には向き不向きというものがある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid ""
"Sorry these are all I have.  However I'll be back from my next run in "
"<interval>.  Care to take a look in the meanwhile?"
msgstr "すまんが、今用意できるのはこれだけだ。<interval>後には新しい商品が入るだろう。折角だ、商品を見ていくか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Sure.  Bring me a dozen pine boughs and I'll boil you some."
msgstr "ふむ。松の枝を12本ほど持ってきたら、煎じてやろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "Thank you.  See you around, Kostas."
msgstr "ありがとう。また会おう、コスタス。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid ""
"This recipe is a gemstone of my family heritage.  Lucky for us that the most"
" common evergreen tree in the U.S. is non-toxic.  Start by rinsing the "
"needles, and separating any woody parts from them.  Then, cut the pine "
"needles in half.  Add one bough's worth of chopped needles to a cup or mug "
"and fill it with boiling water.  Let the needles steep for ten minutes, "
"until they turn brownish and sink down to the bottom.  As a final step, you "
"can strain the needles, but then you'd be wasting precious calories.  A "
"drink like this is perfect for mid-winter colds."
msgstr ""
"このレシピは、私の家族に代々伝わる宝だ。アメリカで最もよく見かける常緑樹に毒がなくて、本当によかった。まず、松葉を洗い、残っている樹皮を取り除く。次に、松葉の長さを半分に切る。コップなどの容器に葉を一枝分入れ、沸騰した湯を注ぐ。葉が茶色くなって容器の底に沈むまで、10分ほど待つ。最後に煮出した葉を捨ててもいいが、貴重なカロリーを無駄にすることはない。寒い冬に風をひいたときは、この飲み物がよく効くぞ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "What can I do for you, <name_g>?"
msgstr "<name_g>、何か用か？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_guard3.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "What do you do around here?"
msgstr "ここで何をしているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "What the hell are you talking about?"
msgstr "一体何のことを言っている？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, yeah…  I don't think he'd be a good fit for an herbalist.  He has a "
"bad habit of wandering off someplace, could get him killed one of these "
"days."
msgstr ""
"ああ、ふむ...あいつは薬草医には向いていない。どうもぼんやりと歩き回る悪い癖があってな。あれでは、いつ何に襲われるか分かったものではない。"

#. ~ Player message in an effect
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid "You learn how to craft pine tea."
msgstr "松葉ティーの製作レシピを習得しました。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"You must be new here, nice to meet you.  They call me Kostas, I'm the local "
"herbalist."
msgstr "初めて見る顔だな、どうぞよろしく。私はコスタス、地元で薬草医をしている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"You must be new here, nice to meet you.  They call me Kostas, I'm the local "
"herbalist."
msgstr "初めて見る顔だな、どうぞよろしく。私はコスタス、地元で薬草医をしている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"You must be new here, nice to meet you.  They call me Kostas, I'm the local "
"herbalist."
msgstr "初めて見る顔だな、どうぞよろしく。私はコスタス、地元で薬草医をしている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Kostas_Walsman.json
msgid ""
"You must be new to herbalism, no?  In short, I scavenge the land for herbs "
"to supply our humble community with medicine.  And that's just one part of "
"my job.  Say, are you interested in buying campsite gear?  I came across an "
"abandoned camp while foraging.  One can only wonder what happened to its "
"poor inhabitants…"
msgstr ""
"薬草医を見るのは初めてか？簡単に説明すると、私は薬草を採取して、このささやかな共同体に薬として提供している。他にも色々と仕事はあるんだがな。そうそう、キャンプ道具を買う気はないか？採集中に、野営の跡地で道具を拾ってきたんだ。あそこで寝泊まりしていた人らは一体どうなったのか..."

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Alright, I'll get to it."
msgstr "よし、早速注文するよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Alright, alright, chill the <swear> out, I'm leaving!"
msgstr "分かった、分かった、<swear>、落ち着こう、もう出ていくから！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Could you sew something for me?"
msgstr "衣服を作ってもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Could you tell me about Theresa?"
msgstr "テレサのことを教えてもらえるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Could you tell me about yourself?"
msgstr "あなたのことを教えてもらえるか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid ""
"Here it is, I hope you enjoy it.  If you want something else, just come to "
"me."
msgstr "はいどうぞ、気に入って貰えると嬉しいな。また欲しい衣類があったら注文しに来てね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Hey Maria.  I can't stay to talk right now."
msgstr "やあ、マリア。今は話している時間がないんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Hey Maria.  What's up?"
msgstr "やあ、マリア。調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "How's my order going?"
msgstr "頼んでいたものはどうなった？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid ""
"I always wanted to be a fashion designer when I was young.  I used to have a"
" set of dolls, and I'd make dresses for them out of spare cloth I could "
"find.  I took up sewing in high school, and I was trying to get a job with "
"Fashion Nova before <the_cataclysm> screwed that up."
msgstr ""
"小さい頃からファッションデザイナーに憧れてたんだ。人形たちに、ありあわせの布でドレスを作って着せてあげたりしてね。高校生の頃から本格的に縫製の勉強をして、ファッション・ノバ社に就職しようとしてたんだけど、<the_cataclysm>のせいで台無しだよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid ""
"I arrived a bit later than everyone else, I was at my studio when "
"<the_cataclysm> came.  Had to dodge a big horde of <zombies> on my way out "
"of town, totaled my car, and hiked the rest of the way."
msgstr ""
"私は他の皆よりちょっと遅れてここに着いたの。<the_cataclysm>が起きたとき、私は自分の工房にいた。なんとか<zombies>の大群を避けて街を出たけど、途中で車が壊れて、残りはハイキングって感じ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid ""
"I don't think I've met you before, have I?  I'm Maria Serrano, it's nice to "
"see an new face."
msgstr "初めて見る方ね？私はマリア・セラーノ。知り合えて嬉しいわ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a backpack."
msgstr "バックパックだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a dress."
msgstr "ドレスだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a gambeson."
msgstr "ギャンベソンだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a jacket."
msgstr "ジャケットだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a longcoat."
msgstr "トレンチコートだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a pair of pants."
msgstr "コットンパンツだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I ordered a t-shirt."
msgstr "Tシャツだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid ""
"I sure can!  For now, I can make t-shirts, pants, dresses, longcoats, "
"backpacks, jackets, and a gambeson; if that's your thing."
msgstr ""
"任せといて！今できるのは、Tシャツ、コットンパンツ、ドレス、ダスターコート、トレンチコート、バックパック、ジャケット、ギャンベソンだね。どれでも好きなのを選んでよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a backpack."
msgstr "バックパックが欲しい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a dress."
msgstr "ドレスが欲しい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a gambeson."
msgstr "ギャンベソンが欲しい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a jacket."
msgstr "ジャケットが欲しい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a longcoat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a pair of pants."
msgstr "コットンパンツが欲しい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I'll have a t-shirt."
msgstr "Tシャツが欲しい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "I've been busy lately, what did you ask for again?"
msgstr "最近忙しくてさ、注文は何だっけ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "Is everyone treating you fairly?"
msgstr "ここでの扱いは皆平等なのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "It's a pleasure to meet you, Maria."
msgstr "はじめまして、マリア。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Let's get to it."
msgstr "早速注文しよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Nevermind, I have to leave."
msgstr "何でもない、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Nevermind.  Let's talk about something else."
msgstr "いや、何でもない。他の話をしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid ""
"She's a kind old lady, does a lot of knitting.  She could probably make you "
"something if you asked nicely."
msgstr "編み物をたくさんこなしてくれる、親切なお婆さんだよ。何か作ってほしいなら、頼んでみるといいかもね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid ""
"T-shirts, pants, jackets, and dresses are four icons.  Longcoats and "
"backpacks are six icons.  A gambeson is fifteen."
msgstr ""
"聖画カード4枚でTシャツ、コットンパンツ、ジャケット、ドレス、6枚でダスターコート、トレンチコート、バックパック、15枚でギャンベソンを注文できるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid ""
"T-shirts, pants, jackets, and dresses take me two days.  Longcoats and "
"backpacks take four days, while a gambeson takes six days."
msgstr "Tシャツ、コットンパンツ、ジャケット、ドレスは2日、ダスターコート、トレンチコート、バックパックは4日、ギャンベソンは6日掛かるね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid ""
"Things are alright, could be better.  I've been mending clothes and sheets "
"ever since I arrived, fixing this and that.  Theresa's been a big help in "
"those regards, we've traded quilt patterns and designs quite a bit."
msgstr ""
"まあまあ、いや、かなりマシってとこね。ここに着いてからずっと、色んな服やシーツを縫ったり直したりし続けてる。テレサには本当に感謝しかないよ。キルトのパターンやデザイン案をたくさん教えてもらったんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "What can you sew?"
msgstr "何が作れるんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "What'll ya have?"
msgstr "何にする？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "What's the price?"
msgstr "値段は？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Maria_Serrano.json
msgid "Yeah, they are.  I just wish my work was more appreciated."
msgstr "ええ、そう思う。もう少し私の作品を褒めてもらえると嬉しいんだけどね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Any old port in a storm, I guess."
msgstr "まるで、嵐の海に浮かぶ古びた港だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Could you teach me anything?"
msgstr "何かスキルを教えてくれないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Could you tell me about your past?"
msgstr "あなたの過去について教えてもらえるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Hey, Olwen.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr "やあ、オルウェン。話は後にしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Hi, Olwen.  What's up?"
msgstr "やあ、オルウェン。調子はどう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "I definitely haven't met you yet.  Nice to meet you, I'm Olwen."
msgstr "確か、挨拶がまだだったね。はじめまして、オルウェンです。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "I heard you were handy with computers."
msgstr "コンピューターが得意だと聞いた。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid ""
"I suppose a lot of us are these days, with all the nasty things wandering "
"around.  I hope you like it here, might not be the most comfortable, but "
"it'll do for me."
msgstr "外は化け物が徘徊してるし、避難したい人は多いだろうね。ここが気に入るといいんだけど。最高に快適、って訳じゃないけど、必要な場所だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "I'd rather not say, I gotta go."
msgstr "話している時間はない。もう行くよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "I'm just a curious traveler."
msgstr "私はただの好奇心旺盛な旅人だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "I'm just a traveler."
msgstr "私はただの通りすがりだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "I'm seeking asylum here."
msgstr "ここに滞在させてほしいんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "In that case, I'd better get going."
msgstr "そういうことなら、立ち去った方がよさそうだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid ""
"My dad's having a hard time letting go of the past.  Got any more interview "
"questions?"
msgstr "父は過去を捨てられずにいる。他に質問は？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Not many travelers come through here these days.  There's not much left to "
"wander too, besides a horde of <zombies>."
msgstr "ここを通りがかる人も滅多に見なくなったよ。<zombies>じゃない放浪者が今も残っているなんてね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Not many travelers come through here these days.  There's not much left to "
"wander too, besides a horde of <zombies>.  The people here won't be too "
"friendly with you either, so that sucks."
msgstr ""
"ここを通りがかる人も滅多に見なくなったよ。<zombies>じゃない放浪者が今も残っているなんてね。あなたみたいな人は、ここじゃ歓迎されないよ。残念だけど。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Not much too it, really.  I came here on that bus with everyone else when "
"<the_cataclysm> happened to stroll by.  I've been servicing everyone's "
"electronics since then."
msgstr ""
"別に話すことないよ、ホントに。<the_cataclysm>が起きてから、バスに乗ってみんなと一緒にここへ来た。それ以来、ここにある電化製品の修理をやってる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "Sure does."
msgstr "そうかもしれない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid ""
"They're alright, I suppose.  Helena's an asshole as usual, we're low on "
"supplies, and all scared to go twenty feet outside the gate."
msgstr "まあ、大丈夫なんじゃないの。ヘレナはいつも通りバカやってるし、物資は少ないし、怖くてゲートの外へ数メートルも出られないけど。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Well, this is a really xenophobic bunch, and regard some of your, changes, "
"as a curse brought on by God.  I'm cool with you though, not like some of "
"these other <name_b>.  There are a few who wouldn't mind you, though."
msgstr ""
"そうだね、ここの境界は余所者のことをひどく嫌ってるし、変異した肉体を神の呪いだと考えてる。でも、私はそういうの気にしないよ、他の<name_b>とは違う。それに、全員が全員、変異を嫌悪してるって訳でもない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Aleesha_Seward.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Alonso_Lautrec.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "What's up?"
msgstr "調子はどう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Why not?  Oversharing is kind of my thing anyway.  Got any more interview "
"questions?"
msgstr "どんどん聞いてよ？個人情報バラ撒きは私の趣味みたいなものだからさ。何かインタビューしたいことある？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I got a master's in computer science from the University of Rhode "
"Island.  Everyone around here comes to me when they want to keep their "
"computers running.  Corrie works more with the hardware portion of these "
"things; I'd recommend visiting her."
msgstr ""
"ロードアイランド大学でコンピューターサイエンスの修士号を取ったんだ。コンピューターについての話なら、ここの人はみんな私に聞きにくる。ハードウェアについてはコリーの方が専門家だから、彼女に聞くのをお勧めしとく。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Olwen_Powell.json
msgid "You look somewhat interesting.  So, what's your story?"
msgstr "なんだか面白そうな人。もっと詳しく教えてよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"&Russel's expression becomes somber, and he briefly stares at the wall.  "
"\"She was my dog, had her for seventeen years.  We used to go duck-hunting, "
"she'd swim out and get anything I shot.  She helped me track many a deer "
"through the woods…   When <the_cataclysm> hit, she saved me from some "
"<zombies> when we were skippin' town, but she died…  Then she came back, "
"wasn't herself…  I had to put her down.\""
msgstr ""
"&ラッセルは表情を曇らせ、壁をぼんやりと見つめながら話を続けました。「愛犬だ。17年間飼ってた。よく一緒にカモ猟へ行ったが、泳ぎが上手くて、撃った獲物を必ず取ってきてくれた。<the_cataclysm>が起きたとき、あいつは街中で逃げ回ってた俺を<zombies>から救ってくれた。そして、死んじまった...その後また立ち上がってきたが、アレはベッツィーじゃない...俺はあいつを撃たなきゃならなかった。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "And I hate to break it to you, but my point still stands."
msgstr "俺だって言いたかないが、意見を変えるつもりはない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Chill out man, I'll leave you alone."
msgstr "ちょっと落ち着け、私はもう行くから。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Could you tell me more about Betsey?"
msgstr "ベッツィーのことをもっと教えてもらえるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Do you really need these trophies?"
msgstr "戦利品なんて本当に必要なのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Draco_Dune.json
msgid "Find somebody else, dude."
msgstr "他の人を当たることにするよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Go and hunt them yourself.  You have a gun after all."
msgstr "自分で狩りに行けばいい。銃を持っているじゃないか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Hey, Russell.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr "やあ、ラッセル。話は後にしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Hi, Russell.  Got a minute?"
msgstr "やあ、ラッセル。ちょっといいかな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"Huh, so it was you over there.  It's always great to see a new face.  Name's"
" Russell, Russell Connelly."
msgstr "へぇ、あっちに見えたのは君だったか。新しい出会いはいつだって素晴らしい。ラッセル、ラッセル・コネリーだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I can help.  Anyway, how are things?"
msgstr "よし、協力しよう。それはそれとして、調子はどう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"I can't give a discount, but here's some meat instead.  Made by yours truly."
msgstr "値引きはできないが、代わりに肉を持っていけ。俺が狩ってきた獲物だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"I hate to break it to you, but I came here because I don't want to see the "
"world."
msgstr "言いたくはないが、私がここへ来たのは、これ以上外で過ごしたくないからだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"I hunt with most of my time these days.  Whatever game I spot, I bag and "
"donate.  Thing is, it's getting harder and harder.  Have you also noticed "
"how corruption is slowly overtaking the natural wildlife in this God-given "
"planet?  They think the flesh is just rotten.  No, it's mutated, become "
"something else."
msgstr ""
"最近は、ほとんど狩りをして過ごしてるな。見つけた獲物は全部しとめて、教会に寄進している。だが、それも段々と難しくなってきた。それと、神の恵みである野生の動物が、少しずつ汚染されてきていることには気付いたか？皆は、捌いた肉が腐っただけだと思っているが、そんなもんじゃない。あれは、別の何かに変化しているんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"I may be more skilled or better equipped but you, my friend, have something "
"I don't: experience.  A good hunter never leaves his hunting ground.  I sure"
" ain't gonna leave it!  Now you <name_g>, you know what it's REALLY like out"
" there!"
msgstr ""
"確かに俺の方が技術も装備も上かもしれないが、我が友よ、あんたは私にはないもの、経験を持ってる。腕のいい狩人は自分の狩場から離れないものさ。かと言ってこのまま放っておく訳にもいかねぇ！そこで<name_g>、外の様子をよぉく知ってるあんたの出番だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"I won't let you leave just yet.  You're the new one here, I have so much to "
"ask.  Let me put it another way: what have you seen out there?  I'm talking "
"about the monsters that lurk deep in the woods.  Have you witnessed them "
"with your very own eyes?"
msgstr ""
"まあ待て、まだ行くな。新入りには聞きたいことがたくさんある。分かりやすく言おうか。外で何を見た？森の奥に潜む怪物のことだよ。その目で見たのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I wouldn't be here if I saw one.  Why do you ask?"
msgstr "見ていたら、きっと私はここにいないだろう。どうしてそんな質問をするんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I'm humbled by your words.  See ya later."
msgstr "そこまで褒められるなんて、恐縮だ。じゃあ、また後で。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I'm humbled by your words.  Well, bye."
msgstr "そこまで褒められるなんて、恐縮だ。じゃあ、もう行くよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I'm just a curious traveler.  What's up with you?"
msgstr "私はただの好奇心旺盛な放浪者だよ。調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I'm seeking asylum here.  What's up with you?"
msgstr "ここに滞在しようと思っているんだ。調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss.  I'd better get going."
msgstr "それは辛かっただろうな。そろそろ行かないと。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I'm sorry for your loss.  Let's change the subject."
msgstr "それは辛かっただろうな。何か他の話をしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"I've been better.  Having a hellish time keeping up with strange wildlife "
"that suddenly want us dead… hey, let's forget the world while we're talking."
"  How's life treatin' ya?"
msgstr ""
"なんとかやってるよ。妙な野生動物が襲い掛かって来るなんて、そんな地獄のような狩りがあってたまるかよ...ああ、酷い世界の話なんか止めだ。人生について語ろうぜ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"I've got other things to deal with.  Do you really need these trophies?"
msgstr "他にも色々やる仕事があるんだ。その戦利品はそんなに必要なものなのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I've seen too many things out there.  Why do you ask?"
msgstr "怪物なら数えきれないほど見かけたよ。どうしてそんな質問をするんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "I've seen too much out there.  Why do you ask?"
msgstr "怪物なら数えきれないほど見かけたよ。どうしてそんな質問をするんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"It's not often that we see new folks around the remnants of the New England "
"Community Church.  So, got any tales to share from the outside world?"
msgstr "ニューイングランド教会コミュニティの近くで、知らない人に会えることは滅多にない。何か外の話を聞かせてくれよ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Let's make a deal."
msgstr "よし、取り引きしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Let's talk about getting you those trophies."
msgstr "戦利品について話そう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"Look, I'm just a regular God-fearing fella like you.  You gotta have "
"something to keep your mind off stuff.  You'd get mad otherwise.  My passion"
" happens to be collecting trophies."
msgstr ""
"聞けよ、俺はあんたと同じで、信心深いんだ。気持ちを落ち着けるために、何か持っておきたい。そうしないと、とても心が休まらない。そこで、戦利品の収集に情熱を燃やしてるんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"Oh it's nothing new to me.  Livin' off the land, far from everyone - it's "
"just what I'm adjusted to.  I've kept in touch with the church folks, and "
"that was enough.  I had a loyal companion back home, Betsey, my rottweiler."
"  Things have been very different since she passed away, though."
msgstr ""
"別にいつも通りさ。人里離れた土地で暮らすのには慣れてるからな。教会の皆とは以前から連絡を取り合っていたから、問題ない。故郷には忠実な相棒、ロットワイラーのベッツィーがいた。でも、あいつが死んじまって、状況が大きく変わったんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Russell, hey?  Nice to meet you."
msgstr "やあ、ラッセル。会えて嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Since I helped you out with your trophies, can I get a discount?"
msgstr "戦利品の件で協力したんだから、値引きして貰えないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Thank you.  I'll see you around, Russell."
msgstr "ありがとう。また会おう、ラッセル。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Thank you.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "ありがとう。そういえば、前に言ってた話は何だっけ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"We're all desperately holding on to our stockpiles, but I can find something"
" for you.  I have some spare hides and pelts, if you're interested in "
"buying."
msgstr "ここの皆は必死で物資の備蓄をしているが、何かあったかな。ああ、皮や毛皮なら余っている。欲しいなら売ってやるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"Well, let's just say I'm interested in rare game.  I've heard stories, "
"rumors and some tall tales about otherworldly beings out there in the "
"wasteland.  That's where you come in.  I want to see the evidence, something"
" physical I can collect as a trophy collection.  You seem to have "
"experience, I was hoping you could help me."
msgstr ""
"そうだな、レアな獲物に興味があるとだけ言っておこう。荒野にいる異界生物の噂や伝説を耳にしたんだ。そこであんたの出番って訳だよ。俺は証拠が見たい。戦利品として収集できるような、物理的な証拠がな。あんたは腕利きのようだし、協力して貰えないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "What do you do now?"
msgstr "これからどうするんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid ""
"Who cares what's up with me?  You're the new one here.  Let me put it "
"another way: what have you seen out there?  I'm talking about the monsters "
"that lurk deep in the woods.  Have you witnessed them with your very own "
"eyes?"
msgstr "俺の話なんざ誰が喜ぶんだ？折角新入りが来たのに。分かりやすく言おうか。外で何を見た？森の奥に潜む怪物のことだよ。その目で見たのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Why didn't you hunt these trophies yourself?"
msgstr "どうして戦利品を自分で狩りに行かなかったんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Why don't you hunt these trophies yourself?"
msgstr "どうして戦利品を自分で狩りに行かないんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Russell_Connelly.json
msgid "Your life, your escape mechanism…"
msgstr "活力の源でもあり、逃避行動でもあるということか..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Alright, let's hear it."
msgstr "よし、さっそく聴こう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid ""
"Fairly?  There's no such thing as fairness in the world.  The NECC wouldn't "
"give a damn if I starved to death on this very bench.  At least I have "
"friends here, ones that appreciate what I do.  I make music and that's all I"
" have left, it means everything to me."
msgstr ""
"平等？世の中に平等なんてものは無いよ。私がこのベンチで餓死しても、教会の連中は何もしてくれないさ。でも、少なくとも、音楽を評価してくれる、友人と呼べる人たちはいる。私は音楽を作る。それが私に残された唯一にして全てなんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid ""
"Good to see people like you in the world.  I'm Sonia, Sonia Greene.  I "
"entertain the people."
msgstr "あなたみたいな人に会えて嬉しいよ。私はソニア、ソニア・グリーン。皆を楽しませて過ごしてる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Hey Sonia.  I can't stay to talk right now."
msgstr "やあ、ソニア。今は話している時間がないんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Hey Sonia.  What's up?"
msgstr "やあ、ソニア。調子はどう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid ""
"I was in an underground band - Taurists was our name - before all this.  "
"Performing gigs at local venues and jamming with my friends; that's all my "
"life was about.  Now, I'm a badass soloist with a war-torn guitar, a singer "
"of the old-world preserving the wonders of music and the Taurist legacy for "
"generations to come.  That's also a synonym for not having all that much "
"going on in my life."
msgstr ""
"こんなことになる前は、トーリスツっていうアングラなバンドのメンバーだったんだ。地元のライブハウスで演奏したり、友達とジャムセッションしたり、それが人生のすべてだった。それが今じゃ、傷付いたギターをもつイカしたソロギタリスト、またの名を旧世界のシンガーとして、音楽の素晴らしさとトーリスツの記憶を後世に残す活動をしてる。これってつまり、私の今までの人生での経験なんて、ほんのちっぽけな物だったってことだよなぁ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid ""
"Nothin' much, just sitting around and biding my time, getting any work I "
"can.  I might play something to cheer everyone up, if my guitar wasn't "
"busted."
msgstr ""
"ぼちぼちだね。ただ座って時間を潰すか、できる限りの仕事をするだけ。ギターが壊れていなかったら、何か音楽でも奏でて、皆を元気づけられるんだけどな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Now that your guitar is fixed, could you play something for me?"
msgstr "ギターは直ったし、何か一曲披露してもらえないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid ""
"Now that's a wild story.  I owe my life to this kid Chloe, really.  I'll let"
" her tell the tale."
msgstr "振り返ってみるとあれは滅茶苦茶だったね。私はこの子、クロエに命を救われたんだ。話を聞いてみるといいよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid ""
"Oh, just fine.  A bit malnourished and all, but I can't really complain if "
"that's the worst of it, right?  My guitar makes our twisted little world a "
"bit more tolerable, though.  Takes my mind off stuff and muffles the screams"
" of the boogeyman, you know?"
msgstr ""
"まあ、普通かな。ちょっと栄養失調気味だけど、こんな最悪の状況で文句を言えると思う？私のギターは、この歪んだ小さな世界でちょっとでも長く耐えようって気分にさせてくれる。気持ちを紛らわせてくれるし、化け物の叫び声すらかき消してくれる気がしないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "Sonia?  Nice to meet you, I'm <u_name>.  How are things here?"
msgstr "ソニアっていうのか？はじめまして、私は<u_name>。ここはどんな感じ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid ""
"Sure, I can play you a tune or two that I know.  It will cost you a little "
"something, just one icon.  The artist doesn't want to starve, if you know "
"what I mean."
msgstr ""
"オーケー、知ってる曲の中からいくつか演奏しようか。聖画カード1枚でいいから、投げ銭をよろしくね。分かってると思うけど、アーティストだって餓死したくはないんだから。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid "That's a nice guitar you have."
msgstr "いいギターを持ってるな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Sonia_Greene.json
msgid ""
"You're <swear> right.  I like its scars, makes it look like it has a "
"history, you know?  We've been through a lot.  Those pesky <zombies> forced "
"me to harm my sweet, sweet guitar, but I retaliated and bashed their heads "
"in!  I lost a part of me that day, but the guitar's alright.  Just a bit "
"rusted from all that blood and gore, that's all."
msgstr ""
"<swear>、お目が高い。ここの傷なんか、歴史を感じるだろ？このギターと私は色々なことを経験してきた。忌々しい<zombies>のせいで、大事な大事なギターに傷がついたんだ。でも、お返しに頭を叩き割ってやった！あれ以来、自分の中の何かを失った気分だよ。ああ、ギターは無事だよ。血とか肉片とかでちょっと錆びちゃったけど。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Ah, another survivor!  I hope you come in peace.  I'm Tom, nice to meet you."
msgstr "ああ、生存者か！君の心が安らかでありますように。僕はトム、よろしくね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgctxt "u:m"
msgid ""
"Ah, another survivor!  I hope you come in peace.  I'm Tom, nice to meet you."
msgstr "ああ、生存者か！君の心が安らかでありますように。僕はトム、よろしくね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid ""
"Ah, another survivor!  I hope you come in peace.  I'm Tom, nice to meet you."
msgstr "ああ、生存者か！君の心が安らかでありますように。僕はトム、よろしくね。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"All of us are here; me, Felicity, and Olwen.  We're so <swear> lucky, I feel"
" like crying tears of joy every time I see them."
msgstr "全員がここにいる。僕、フェリシティ、オルウェンだ。僕ら家族は本当に幸運だ。ただ会話するだけでも嬉し涙を流しそうになる。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Any progress?"
msgstr "何か進展はあった？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Could you tell me about Felicity?"
msgstr "フェリシティについて教えて？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Could you tell me about Olwen?"
msgstr "オルウェンについて教えて？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_staff/NPC_free_merchant_broker.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
msgid "Delivering <topic_item>."
msgstr "<topic_item>を渡す。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Good luck with that.  See you around, Tom."
msgstr "頑張って。また今度、トム。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Hey, Tom.  I can't stay to talk."
msgstr "やあ、トム。話は後にしよう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Hey, that's nice of you to ask.  The people here are barely holding on.  "
"Malnutrition, sleepless nights, odd sounds from the woods, everyone turns a "
"little mad in these circumstances.  It's not their fault, I know, but they "
"did get what they wanted."
msgstr ""
"ああ、よくぞ聞いてくれたね。ギリギリ持ちこたえている状態だ。食事も足りないし、夜は森から妙な音が聞こえてくる。こんな状況じゃ、頭がおかしくならない人はいない。そうだね、誰の責任でもないよ。それでも、ここの皆は、欲していたものを手に入れた。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Hi Tom, got a minute?"
msgstr "やあ、トム。ちょっといいかな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"I haven't got a story.  I'm an independent thinker.  Living out here, away "
"from the Man."
msgstr "僕の話なんてないよ。僕は自由な思想家だ。影の支配者の手を逃れ、この地で暮らしている。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "I mean, can I help with the research?"
msgstr "ええと、資料を読んで調査すればいいのか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"I want to find out the truth and preserve the past for the following "
"generation, so that they'll know some of what <swear> happened."
msgstr "僕は真実を探し、過去にどんな、<swear>、どんな酷いことが起きたのか記録し、次世代に少しでも知ってもらいたい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"I was nobody but an ordinary office drone.  Lived the average suburban life,"
" prepping for the inevitable.  Had the bright idea of purchasing a Last Man "
"On Earth shelter, but I decided to settle for less when I found out it cost "
"five times my annual salary.  That's how I ended up in a religious "
"campground with my family and a survival kit."
msgstr ""
"僕はただただ平凡な、会社の駒だった。でも郊外で普通の生活を送りながら、避けられない事態に備えていた。LMOEシェルターを購入しようと思ったが、値段が僕の年収の5倍もすると知って、もっと質素な避難所で我慢することにしたよ。こうして私は、サバイバルキットと家族を携え、教会の一団に加わることになったんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"I'm currently in the middle of solving a pointless mystery for my own "
"entertainment.  Of course I have time!"
msgstr "ああ、ちょうど無意味な推理を楽しんでいる最中だ。もちろん、お喋りする時間もある。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "I'm just a curious traveler.  What about you, how are you doing?"
msgstr "私はただの好奇心旺盛な放浪者だよ。あなたの調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "I'm seeking asylum here.  What about you, how are you doing?"
msgstr "ここに滞在しようと思っているんだ。あなたの調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Let's talk about your goals."
msgstr "あなたの目標について話そう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"New England Church Community is what they're called.  My wife was the first "
"in the family to come in contact with 'em.  She joined because of their "
"charity work and as for myself, well… you know why I was there.  Let me tell"
" you, being surrounded by like-minded folks was like a breath of fresh air."
"  Even if the only belief we shared was paranoia, but you get what I'm "
"saying.  I tried everything to prep my family for the inevitable, I really "
"did, but in the end it wasn't me who saved us all."
msgstr ""
"ニューイングランド教会コミュニティという団体だ。家族の中で一番最初に入信したのは、僕の妻だ。慈善活動に魅力を感じたのが理由だそうだが、僕の方は...別の理由がある。同じ志をもつ仲間に囲まれて、新鮮な空気を吸えたような気分になったものさ。たとえ、僕と彼らが共有している信念が妄想と呼ばれるものだったとしても、僕の言わんとしていることは伝わる筈だ。僕は家族を守るため、あらゆる手を尽くした。でも、結局家族を救ったのは、僕の力じゃなかったんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Nice to meet you, Tom."
msgstr "はじめまして、トム。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"No no no no no!  Thinking is one of the only thing I have left and you can't"
" take that away from me.  But, If you *really* want to make yourself useful,"
" relevant newspapers would help me piece out the puzzle."
msgstr ""
"あー、違う違う！思考は僕に残された唯一の娯楽だ。それを奪うなんて許せない。もし、僕の役に立ちたいと思っているなら、新聞記事を持ってきてくれ。僕の真相解明に役立つだろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "No rest for the weary.  See you around, Tom."
msgstr "疲れた者に休息はない、とはこの事か。また今度話そう、トム。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Of course!  Just put all your literary findings on that chair over there.  "
"Remember, you're not only doing a favor for me, but for all of humanity as "
"well.  World heritage is what we're talking about!  I managed to get my "
"hands on a book called 'Zombie Survival Guide' while, uh… dumpster diving.  "
"Imagine how much this book alone reveals about our pre-Cataclysm culture!  "
"Oh boy, how wrong we were about everything."
msgstr ""
"ぜひ頼むよ！文書情報を探し当てたら、そこの椅子に置いといてくれ。忘れないでくれ、これは僕のためじゃない、全人類のための偉業なんだ。世界遺産ってのは、こういう物なんだよ！僕が苦労して、その...ゴミ箱を漁って、手に入れたのが「ゾンビサバイバルガイド」と呼ばれる書物だ。これだけでも、大変動以前の文化がどれだけ鮮明に記録されているか、想像してみてごらん！いやはや、僕らの行動は間違いだらけだったようだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Olwen's a bright girl; she's fiddled with electronics and computers since "
"she was in high school.  She got a master's in it from the University of "
"Rhode Island.  Felicity's been a good mother for her, always been there for "
"us.  Olwen might be able to teach you a few things, she should be around "
"here somewhere."
msgstr ""
"オルウェンは聡明な娘だ。高校生の頃から電子工作やコンピューターにのめり込み、ロードアイランド大学で修士号を取ったんだ。フェリシティも母親として上手くやってくれている。オルウェンの知識は君の役にも立つかもしれないな。この近辺にいる筈だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Perhaps it's not worth finding out."
msgstr "真実の探求なんて無意味なのかもしれない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Perhaps.  You don't wanna think about the stuff I'm thinking about, it would"
" spiral a newbie independent thinker into madness.  I don't blame you for "
"saying that."
msgstr ""
"かもね。僕の真似をして考え込むのは止した方がいい。自由な思考を手に入れたばかりの者を狂気の渦に巻き込みたくはないんだ。君がそう思うのも無理はないさ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Please continue."
msgstr "続けて。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"She's my wife, we've been married for a while now.  We used to live in Rhode"
" Island, worked at a publishing firm, Stillwater.  She's always wanted to be"
" a writer, that's why we moved away.  We've been a bit distant as of late, I"
" don't think she's taking the \"whole end-of-the-world\" thing too well."
msgstr ""
"オルウェンは僕の妻だ。結構してもうかなり経つ。昔は僕らはロードアイランドに住んでいて、スティルウォーターという出版社に勤めていた。妻は以前から作家になりたいと言っていて、それがこっちに引っ越してきた理由なんだ。最近は、少し心の距離を感じているよ。彼女は、「世界の終焉」というものをあまりよく思っていないようだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"So far?  Not so great.  Now that the Internet is down, I don't know.  Such "
"abundant hidden information - all gone!"
msgstr ""
"現時点での進展？あまりよくないね。今はインターネットが使えないから、知れる事もない。隠された情報があんなにたくさんあったのに...全部消えてしまった！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Sorry Tom, I can't stay to chat."
msgstr "悪いねトム、話している暇はないんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Sounds like an ambitious project.  Is there anything I can do to help you "
"out?"
msgstr "野心的な目標だ。私に手伝えることはあるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Rhyzaea_Johnny.json
msgid "Tell me about yourself."
msgstr "あなたについて聞きたい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"The sky has broken!  They received a rather passive-aggressive sign from "
"God!  The wait is finally over.  Well, not for me.  So much is left "
"unanswered, and I know for a fact the answer's out there."
msgstr ""
"天が裂けたんだ！攻撃的な暗示をもつ兆しを神から受け取ったということだね！待ちに待った時が遂に来た。まあ、僕にとってはそうじゃないが。未解決の問題が多すぎるし、答えは必ず見つかると信じているからね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Try not to get stuck in the past.  See you around, Tom."
msgstr "あまり過去に囚われ過ぎない方がいい。また今度、トム。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid "Try not to glorify the past.  See you around, Tom."
msgstr "あまり過去を美化しない方がいい。また今度、トム。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Tom_Powell.json
msgid ""
"Was it difficult to find us?  We haven't seen a single soul out there for so"
" long, I'm starting to lose my hope.  So, tell me about yourself."
msgstr "ここまで来るのは大変だったかい？長い間、人っ子一人来ないから、希望を失いかけていたよ。さっそく、君の話が聞きたいな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Ain't you heard it?  It's been screeching out in the forest during the night"
" for a while now, keeps me up sometimes.  I'm too scared to go out and see "
"what that thing is.  If you'd kill it, I'd be in your debt forever."
msgstr ""
"聞いたことはないか？夜中に時々、森から金切り声が聞こえてくるんだ。恐ろしくてとても様子を見に行く気にはなれない。もし退治してくれたら、一生恩に着るよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
