msgstr "私はここにいる権利があるんだ、そうだろ。ここに居座る権利だ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/beggars/BEGGAR_3_Luo_Meizhen.json
msgid "I'll see what I can do."
msgstr "できる限りのことをやってみるよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "I'll see you around then."
msgstr "また今度。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to hear that <name_g>, but I don't feel like facing it either."
msgstr "<name_g>、申し訳ないが、私もそんなものを確認しに行こうとは思わない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid ""
"It ain't so bad.  I got shelter, heat, and people to defend me if any "
"<zombie> shuffles its way in here.  If I want to eat then I'll be doin' "
"construction work all day."
msgstr "それほど悪くない。屋根も、暖房もあるし、<zombie>から守ってくれる奴もいる。飯を食うには、一日中働く必要があるがな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid ""
"No chance!  Its not you, its the world out there I'm worried about.  All "
"those <swear> monsters really give me the creeps, and as far as I know this "
"church is the last bastion of humanity in the <the_cataclysm>."
msgstr ""
"無理だ！私が怖いのはあんたじゃない、外の世界だ。<swear>、化け物だらけで、動けやしない。<the_cataclysm>以来、この教会が人間の最後の砦なんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgid "Now that's an archaic belief.  I'll see you around."
msgstr "古臭いルールだな。それじゃあ、また。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/necc/members/NPC_Zachary_Montes.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"That ain't the point here, chum.  Don'tcha get it?  This was MY territory, "
"but they took it away from me.  Now they think of us as nothin' but a "
"<swear> nuisance."
msgstr ""
"お前、そんなことはどうでもいいだろ。分からないのか？ここは私の縄張りだったのに、奴らに奪われたんだ。今や厄介者としか思われてない、<swear>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
