msgstr "ええと、そろそろ行くよ。さようなら。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_APARTMENT_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_CAMPER.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_MOONSHINER.json
