#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "I'll have a cat."
msgstr "ネコを引き取ろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "I'll have a dog."
msgstr "イヌを引き取ろう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "I've changed my mind, let's talk about something else."
msgstr "気が変わった。何か他の話をしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
msgid "Interesting."
msgstr "面白いな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid ""
"That's quite noble of you, but how do you take care of so many animals?"
msgstr "とても立派な行いだな。でも、これだけの数の動物を、どうやって世話するんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid ""
"To be honest with you, it's been pretty difficult.  I sneak out at night or "
"whenever there's an opening to grab whatever I need and come back before "
"something notices me.  I've been held up for quite a while whenever a horde "
"decides to pass by.  Good thing we had some spare bookcases lying around, or"
" I'd be a goner by now."
msgstr ""
"正直なところ、かなり苦労してるよ。夜中や安全そうな頃合いにこっそり移動して、必要な物資を手に入れ、気付かれる前に帰ってくるんだ。通りかかった大群に阻まれて、かなりの時間足止めを食らったこともある。使ってない本棚がいくつかあって助かったよ。あれがなかったら今頃死んでただろうな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid "Wanna buy something, maybe sell off what you don't need?"
msgstr "何か買いたい物資や、売りたい不用品はないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_ANIMAL_SHELTER_SURVIVOR.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, today's your lucky day.  Hand over your stuff, or you'll be one "
"yourself."
msgstr "ああ、本当にラッキーだったな。こっちに荷物を寄越せ。さもなくばゾンビの仲間入りだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_NPC_PREPPER_SURVIVOR.json
