msgid "I'm sorry to hear that.  Maybe we should change the subject."
msgstr "そうだったとは。話題を変えた方がいいかな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/other/TALK_GUN_STORE_SURVIVOR.json
msgid ""
"Well, they weren't really around to lock it up.  Whoever got here first blew"
" their head off with a 12-gauge, but they were up and movin', tried to kill "
"me too.  They're out in the dumpster now."
msgstr ""
"いや、鍵を掛ける脳がなかったと言うべきか。元の家主が誰か知らないが、ショットガンで頭を吹き飛ばして、その後動き出したんだろう。私も殺されかけた。今はそいつはゴミ箱の中さ。"

