msgstr "気象学者のために墜落したドローンを探す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"Good.  I just need a little stuff: 50 scrap, 6 lithium batteries, 5 small "
"high-quality lenses and a radio remote control.  Bring the scrap for now, "
"but don't forget about the rest."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find batteries for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Great, I'm continue to work on it…"
msgstr "いいね、早速続きに取り掛かろう..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find high-quality lenses for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Great, I'm continuing to work on it…"
msgstr "いいね、早速続きに取り掛かろう..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find scrap for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid "Great, I'm starting to work on it…"
msgstr "よし、早速取り掛かるよ..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find a radio controller for the meteorologist"
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgid ""
"Great, very little work left.  I need a few days to finish all this, and to "
"try it in work.  I hope everything will work fine!  While I'm working on the"
" drone, you can read this book.  Maybe you can learn something new from it."
msgstr ""
"素晴らしい、もう完成したも同然だ。作業を完了して実際に試してみるには数日かかるかな。きっと上手くいくことを願っているよ！私がドローンを調整している間に、この本を読んでみてはどうだろう。きっと何か新しい知識を学べるはずだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/other/meteorologist.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"Help?  Help with what?  Oh, yes, yes.  If you know a place with many "
"survivors, can you take me there?  I doubt I can survive alone…"
msgstr ""
"手伝い？手伝いって？ああ、そうそう。生存者が集まっている場所があるなら、私を連れて行ってもらえないか？一人で生き残れるとは思えないんだ..."

