msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I didn't think anyone was around here.  Pleased to meet you, I'm <npc_name>."
msgstr "まさか他の人に会えるとは思わなかった。初めまして、<npc_name>だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
