msgid ""
"I used to travel a lot before <the_cataclysm>, and I've had this camper with"
" me for a while now.  I was at home when the riots started, so I grabbed "
"everything I could from my house and hopped in the camper.  I nearly wrecked"
" on my way out of town when some crazy people tried to smash my van, but I "
"made it out.  I've been on the move ever since."
msgstr ""
"<the_cataclysm>以前はよく旅行していて、このキャンピングカーもしばらく前から乗っていたんだ。暴動が激しくなってきた頃、家にあるものを全部車に詰め込んで、逃げ出した。街からでる途中で、危うく頭のおかしい奴らに車を壊されそうになったけど、何とか無事に走ってこられた。それ以来、ずっと旅を続けている。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
