msgid ""
"Thank you for trying, my friend.  With you and me that will be five, I will "
"do my best to be strong and assist in the cleanup."
msgstr "協力者を集めてくれてありがとう、友よ。私と君が加われば5人で作業できる。頑張って片付けを終わらせよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"That sounds a bit heavy for me right now, let's talk about something else"
msgstr "ちょっと話が深刻過ぎる気がするな。何か他のことについて話そう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"There isn't much to do with a hammer and a saw here indoors, and working "
"outside is too dangerous.  If we had enough space for me to do some "
"shuffling around, I could build some privacy walls in here.  I tried to set "
"up a bit of a shop in the garage space, but I had to keep taking everything "
"down for caravan loading and unloading and couldn't get anything done.  The "
"caravans bring food, so they get priority, I can't argue with that."
msgstr ""
"屋内ではハンマーやのこぎりを使った作業はあまりない。屋外での作業は危険だ。家具を動かせるほど広いスペースを確保できれば、目隠し用の壁を設置できそうだな。貯蔵庫にちょっとした店を開こうとしたんだが、荷物の積み下ろしをする場所が欲しいと隊商が言うものだから、そちらを優先したんだ。食料を運んでくる隊商を重視するのは間違っていない。口出しはできないよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find someone to clean up the back bay."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"This has great promise.  Perhaps something to keep me busy will help.  Here,"
" I found some small money to thank you."
msgstr "順調な滑り出しだな。忙しくしていた方が、私も気が楽なんだ。ほら、少額だけど謝礼をどうぞ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find someone to clean up the back bay."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"Those of us here in the back have too many bad memories, but perhaps someone"
" who didn't come with the original refugee groups would be less burdened."
msgstr "建物の裏手の部屋ではあまりにも色々なことが起きたから、最初の避難者グループ以外の人に頼む方が、精神的な負担が少なくて済むだろうな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Want to talk about it a little?"
msgstr "そのことについて、少し話さないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"We could put together a little clean up group, but everyone here has "
"terrible memories of that place.  I could not ask anyone here to go back and"
" see the leftovers of people we knew.  Still, it's a big job.  Who here "
"might be able to do it?"
msgstr ""
"ちょっと人を集めればいいと思うが、ここにいる皆はあの場所にいい思い出がないんだ。あの場所へ行って、知り合いの残骸を目にするような仕事は頼めなかった。それでも、これは重要な仕事だ。ここにいる誰だったらやってくれるだろうか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Bring Boris a circular saw."
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"We now have a space to work in, and I have wood and nails to spare.  All I "
"need is a saw.  I would love a table saw and mitre saw, but I can work with "
"a hand held circular saw for now.  I have looked, and what we have is "
"garbage.  Can you bring me a good one?"
msgstr ""
"これで作業スペースが確保できたし、木や釘も集まった。あと必要なのは、ノコギリだ。テーブルソーやマイターソーがあれば最高だが、今のところは手持ち式の電動丸ノコギリで十分かな。私も見つけはしたんだが、とんだ不良品でね。ちゃんと使える物を譲ってもらえないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"We've all lost a lot of people.  You can either let yourself die, or learn "
"to survive."
msgstr "私たちは皆、多くの人を失った。その先の道は、自ら死を選ぶか、生き残る方法を学ぶかのどちらかだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid "Well, well.  I'm glad you are back."
msgstr "やぁやぁ。戻ってきてくれて嬉しいよ。"

