msgid "Well, well.  You are back."
msgstr "やぁ、やぁ。戻ってきてくれたね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "What do you need to get things cleaned up?  Can I help?"
msgstr "片付けに必要なものは何だ？手伝おうか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "What have you lost, if it's okay for me to ask?"
msgstr "もし差し支えないなら、失ったものについて聞かせてくれないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid ""
"What is 'up'?  Less than I would like, it seems.  I am better when I am "
"busy, and I am not at all busy."
msgstr "調子はどう、だって？思ってた以上に最悪って感じだな。忙しければ気も紛れるだろうが、ここ最近は暇で仕方がない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgid "Yeah, fine.  Just wallow in it.  I'm out."
msgstr "そうか。悩むのも大事だ。私はもう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Boris_Borichenko.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"Yes, my friend.  You have done so much for me, I would be glad to teach you "
"what I can.  I must ask a small amount in trade, for materials.  I hope you "
"understand."
msgstr ""
"もちろんだ、友よ。君は色々と手伝ってくれたからね。私にできることなら喜んで教えるよ。資材は物々交換で少量しか手に入らなかった。分かってもらえると助かるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
