msgid ""
"*tips his cowboy hat and sets his feet far apart as he faces you.  \"Howdy, "
"pardner.\""
msgstr "*はカウボーイハットを被り、足を大股に開き、こちらに向き直りました。「ハウディ、友よ。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
msgctxt "u:f"
msgid ""
"*turns to look at you, lifting an enormous cowboy hat off his eyes.  He "
"appears to be in the process of growing out a set of bushy muttonchops and a"
" handlebar moustache.  Bright blue eyes peer out from his wrinkled face.  "
"\"Howdy, pardner.  They call me Clemens.  John Clemens.  I'm an ol' "
"cowhand.\""
msgstr ""
"*は巨大なカウボーイハット越しにこちらを見ました。生い茂ったもみあげとカイゼルひげを整えている最中だったようです。顔は皺だらけで、目の色は青です。「ハウディ、ようこそ。俺ぁクレメンス、ジョン・クレメンスだ。くたびれた牛追いさ。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_John_Clemens.json
