msgctxt "u:m"
msgid "*peers at you for a while before speaking.  \"Oh, you're back.\""
msgstr "*はしばらくこちらを覗き込み、やがて話し始めました。「なに、戻ってきたの。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "*peers at you for a while before speaking.  \"Oh, you're back.\""
msgstr "*はしばらくこちらを覗き込み、やがて話し始めました。「なに、戻ってきたの。」"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ", and there's not enough food to go around"
msgstr "。食料は足りない"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ".  Why don't you fuckin' figure it out?\""
msgstr "。クソみたいな状況を理解できたかしら？」"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Actually, you owe me a free haircut, remember?"
msgstr "そういえば、無料で散髪してくれるって言ったことは、覚えているか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make a makeshift haircut kit for Vanessa Toby
#. in the refugee center"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Cool, thanks.  It'll be good to have something useful to do, and to not be "
"staring at so many shaggy slobs."
msgstr "助かるわ、ありがとう。私も人の役に立ちたいし、これでむさ苦しい髪型を眺めずに済むのね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Could you fix it to where I can grow my hair out, please?"
msgstr "時間経過と共に髪が伸びるようにしてもらえるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Could you give me a haircut?"
msgstr "散髪してもらえるかな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Ha ha ha ha!  No."
msgstr "アッハハハ！絶対イヤ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Hi, Vanessa.  What's up?"
msgstr "やあ、ヴァネッサ。調子はどう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Hmm, can we change this haircut a little please?"
msgstr "うーん、ちょっと髪型をかえてもらえるかな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Hmm, can we change this shave a little please?"
msgstr "うーん、ちょっと顔剃りをしてもらえるかな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"I can see you need one, but last time I used these shears it was to stab a "
"zombie in the face.  I don't think you'd want them in your hair.  Maybe you "
"could help me get set up properly?"
msgstr ""
"散髪が必要なのは見ればわかるけれど、ハサミを最後に使ったのは、ゾンビの顔に突き刺した時なのよね。そんな道具で髪は切りたくないわ。きちんと散髪の準備をするのを手伝っていただけない？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make a makeshift haircut kit for Vanessa Toby
#. in the refugee center"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"I didn't think to pack my hairdressing equipment when I was evacuated.  If "
"you could put together a basic hair cutting kit for me, I could do a bit of "
"styling for people around here.  I'll even give you a free haircut for your "
"troubles."
msgstr ""
"避難する時は、散髪用の道具を持っていこうなんて思ってもみなかったわ。散髪キットがあれば、ここにいる人達の髪を切ってあげられるのに。もし持ってきてくれたら、無料で散髪してあげるわよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "I don't know what I expected."
msgstr "こうなると思った。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make a makeshift haircut kit for Vanessa Toby
#. in the refugee center"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"I don't need too much.  Scissors, a small mirror, a bit of cloth, and some "
"way to keep it all stored clean when I'm not using it, like a leather pouch "
"or something.  I can get the rest of what I need from shelter supplies."
msgstr ""
"最低限のものでいいわ。ハサミ、小さな鏡、布切れと、清潔に保管できる革製のポーチがセットになっているものよ。他に必要なものは私が自分で用意するわ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"I don't really want to talk about my life before this shit-show, if that's "
"what you mean.\"  She shrugs.  \"I don't need a shoulder to cry on.  I'm a "
"hairdresser, is that enough personal information for you?"
msgstr ""
"このふざけた状態になる以前の話をしろって言うなら、冗談じゃないわ。」彼女は肩をすくめました。「カウンセリングは結構よ。私は美容師、それだけで十分な個人情報じゃない？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"I'd like it if my hair didn't grow out anymore.  Can you help me with that?"
msgstr "ずっと今の髪型でいたい。時間が経過しても髪が伸びないようにしてもらえるか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "I'd like to hire out those scissors of yours."
msgstr "散髪をお願いします。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "I'm not a new mouth to feed, but nice to meet you too."
msgstr "食料が目的ではないが、会えて嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make a makeshift haircut kit for Vanessa Toby
#. in the refugee center"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "If I had some equipment, I could do some hairdresser work here."
msgstr "道具が揃っていれば、美容師の仕事ができるのに。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Make a makeshift haircut kit for Vanessa Toby in the refugee center"
msgstr "避難センターのヴァネッサ・トビーのために簡易散髪キットを作る"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Nevermind.  I'm going."
msgstr "気にしないで。もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Not much is up.  Not enough, in fact.  Here we are stuck in this slum pit "
"with a bunch of strangers, and all we can do is sit around staring at our "
"hands."
msgstr "特に何もないわ。実際、厳しいけどね。こんな貧民街みたいな場所で大勢の赤の他人と過ごして、できることは、ただ座って手を見つめるだけ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make a makeshift haircut kit for Vanessa Toby
#. in the refugee center"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Seriously?  You failed to find *scissors*?  How do you tie your shoes in the"
" morning?"
msgstr "本当に？*ハサミ*すら見つけられないの？あなた、出かける時に靴ひもを結ぶことすらできないんじゃないの？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Sure, I can give you a haircut.  It'll be six merch for a haircut, or three "
"for a shave, okay?"
msgstr "もちろん、まかせて。散髪は6マーチ、顔剃りは3マーチだけど、大丈夫かしら？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "That's a bit rich for my blood.  I better head out."
msgstr "ちょっと高すぎるな。そろそろ行かないと。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "That's a bit rich for my blood.  What were you saying before?"
msgstr "ちょっと高すぎるな。ところで、さっきの話は何だったかな？"

#. ~ Unique name of a female NPC
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Vanessa Toby"
msgstr "ｳﾞｧﾈｯｻ ﾄﾋﾞｰ"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Well that's good.\"  She purses her lips and gives you another judgmental "
"stare.  \"If you're going to pull your own weight I guess that's an "
"improvement.\""
msgstr "そっ、なら良いけど。」彼女は唇を歪め、こちらを責めるように睨んでいます。「あなたが自分のお世話をできる人間なら、もっと良いんだけどね。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make a makeshift haircut kit for Vanessa Toby
#. in the refugee center"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"Well, this is pretty serviceable.  Heck, these scissors are nice enough that"
" I could probably inexplicably make your hair longer or a different color "
"with them."
msgstr "まあ、これはきっと役に立つわ。このハサミなら、髪の毛を長くしたり染色したりできちゃいそう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "What can I do to help you out?"
msgstr "何を手伝えばいいんだ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Make a makeshift haircut kit for Vanessa Toby
#. in the refugee center"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Whatever, I'll keep twiddling my thumbs then."
msgstr "だったら、手持ち無沙汰でじっとしてるしかないわね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "Yeah, no.  I'm going."
msgstr "いや、何でもない。もう行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid ""
"You want the sarcastic version, or the really sarcastic version?  I'm stuck "
"in a dank shitty brick building with two dozen strangers, the world's dead"
msgstr ""
"皮肉を込めた言い方と、皮肉をたっぷり込めた言い方、どっちがいい？私は2ダースもの見知らぬ人が住むレンガ造りの劣悪な建物で立ち往生していて、世界は滅びてる"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "[3 merch] Please give me a shave."
msgstr "[3 ﾏｰﾁ] 顔剃りをしてほしい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/NPC_Vanessa_Toby.json
msgid "[6 merch] Please give me a haircut."
msgstr "[6 ﾏｰﾁ] 散髪をしてほしい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid "I can try.  It's worth trying for Boris."
msgstr "やってみよう。ボリスのためにも、試す価値はある。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid "I can't.  Too many memories back there.  Sorry."
msgstr "できない。辛い記憶が多すぎる。申し訳ない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid "I wish I could, but no.  I can't face the memories."
msgstr "手伝えたら良かったんだけど。辛い記憶に向き合いたくないんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgid ""
"It won't be pretty, but I'll see what I can do.  We'll all benefit from it "
"after all."
msgstr "簡単にはいかないだろうが、できる限りのことをするよ。最終的に、あの場所が綺麗になれば皆も恩恵を受けるだろうし。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"No way, sorry.  I was in there when things went bad.  It'll be hard enough "
"to go back after it's cleaned up, I can't bear to look at it right now."
msgstr "申し訳ないけど、ありえない。あの事件があった時、現場にいたんだ。たとえ片付いていても、行きたくないね。今の状態は見たくもない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_refugees/shared_dialogue.json
