msgctxt "u:n"
msgid "Screw You!"
msgstr "くたばりやがれ！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Sorry to ask."
msgstr "悪いことを尋ねてしまったな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"Ssh.  Some people in here hate mutants.  They just showed up one day, OK?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Supply the arsonist"
msgstr "放火屋に物資を供給する"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Supply the arsonist"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "Think it over."
msgstr "よく考えてくれよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Supply the arsonist"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"This is great!  I'll get to work making something of this.  You can have "
"some of my Molotovs, I won't need quite so many now."
msgstr "こりゃいいや！さっそく何か作ってみるよ。火炎瓶をいくつか持って行ってくれ。もうそんなに必要ないからな。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "What's with your ears?"
msgstr "その耳はどうした？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid ""
"You should talk to the trader guy at the entrance.  He's usually dressed "
"like a firefighter, has a shop in one of the booths."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_arsonist.json
msgid "You're disgusting."
msgstr "気持ち悪いな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid ""
"A steady diet of cooked meat and clean water will keep you alive forever, "
"but your taste buds and your colon may start to get angry at you.  Eat a "
"piece of fruit every once in a while."
msgstr "調理された肉と飲料水があれば永遠に生きられるかもしれない。だが味覚と腸がいずれ反乱を起こすだろう。かけらでいいから果物も取ることだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid ""
"Feed a man a fish, he's full for a day.  Feed a man a bullet, he's full for "
"the rest of his life."
msgstr "魚を腹いっぱい食わせてやれば、一日は腹が減らない。だが銃弾を食わせてやれば、永遠に腹が減らない。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Got any survival advice?"
msgstr "何かサバイバルの助言はあるかな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Got anything for sale?"
msgstr "何か売り物はあるかな？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgid "Great, now my mouth is watering…"
msgstr "いいねえ、よだれが出てきた。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_hunter.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid "Huh, thought I smelled someone new.  Can I help you?"
msgstr "はん、新入り臭いのがいるな。何か助けが必要か？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
