" to you straight.  They're the best hope we got right now.  They are "
"stretched impossibly thin but are willing to do what is needed to maintain "
"order.  They don't care much about looters since they understand most "
"everyone is dead, but if you have something they need… you WILL give it to "
"them.  Since most survivors here have nothing they want, they are welcomed "
"as champions."
msgstr ""
"まあ... "
"正直に言えば、招集命令を受けるまでは私も一般市民と大して変わらなかったよ。政府は、現在考えられる一番の希望と言ってもいい。ほとんどパンク寸前ではあるが、秩序を維持するためにできる限りのことをする意志はまだ残っている。市民のほとんどが死に絶えたという情報が入ってからは、火事場泥棒などはまるで相手にしてもらえないが、君ならば..."
" 何か政府の役に立つ仕事ができるかもしれないと思ってね。普通の生存者よりも優秀な人材ならばきっと歓迎されるはずだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"Why sell the info instead of retrieving the cargo yourself, and how can you "
"be sure it wasn't looted already?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"Yes actually.  The scout told me that he saw something weird down at the "
"lake, shapes swimming close to the surface from time to time.  He wasn't "
"keen on diving in to get a better look."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Install radio repeater mod"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"You can find the Radio Stations in towns or urban centers.  I still have no "
"repeater mod available Marshal.  However you can craft one yourself, if you "
"find the manual.  Try libraries or bookstores if you still don't have one."
msgstr ""
"ラジオ局は市街地や都市の中心部にある。それと、執行官、今回もこちらでモジュールを準備できていない。図面があれば君なら自作できるだろう。図面が無いなら、図書館や書店を探してみるといい。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"You can't actually join unless you go through a recruiter.  We can usually "
"use help though, ask me from time to time if there is any work available.  "
"Completing missions as a contractor is a great way to make a name for "
"yourself among the most powerful men left in the world."
msgstr ""
"仲間に加わりたいなら募集人を通せ。まずは、ここに時々顔を出して出来る仕事が無いか私に聞いてくれ。任務を請け負って達成していけば、募集人に実力を知らしめることができるだろう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Deal with Informant"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "You deal with the rat?"
msgstr "裏切り者を始末できたか？"

#. ~ Failure explanation for NPC dialogue response
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "You don't have enough."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Find the sunken helicopter"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid ""
"You got the location of a sunken helicopter, all that's left to do is find a"
" way to get there."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_old_guard_representative.json
msgid "[50 merch] Fine."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "A pilot?"
msgstr "操縦士"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "About that helicopter…"
msgstr "その仕事について..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Alright, let's get moving."
msgstr "よし、それじゃあ行こうか。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Are you part of Yusuke's group?"
msgstr "私が目指す未来を恐れているのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Do you need anything?"
msgstr "何がお望み？"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Get to the Chopper"
msgstr "ロープで結ぶアイテムを選択"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Great, I'm with you."
msgstr "分かった、一緒に行くよ！"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"Great.  I guess I'll hang back until we're ready, just let me know when you "
"want me to come with."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Hello there.  Glad to see an unfamiliar face around here."
msgstr "やあ、見知らぬ人。生きてる人間に会えて嬉しいよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Hey, that's fine.  Thanks for taking me up here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "How did you wind up here?"
msgstr "どうやってここにたどり着いたんだ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"I don't blame you.  The offer stands though, in case you decide to stop "
"being so sensible."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "I have to get going."
msgstr "早く本題を話してくれ。"

#. ~ Job description of "Rescue Pilot" NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "I just want to fly."
msgstr "話がしたいだけなんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "I should have figured…"
msgstr "大丈夫だ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"I wound up getting chased out of town myself, had to leave my ride behind "
"and just run.  Yusuke, the mut--uh, the furry guy who hangs out with the "
"folks in the lobby, he found me, brought me back here."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "I'll have to think about it."
msgstr "考えておくよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "I'll try to get us there, just tell me where to go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"I'm coming with you, but it might be easier to clear a path up there on your"
" own first.  Just give the word and I'll hang back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"It's like I said: take me to it, and I'll fly you anywhere you want to go "
"from now on.  It's not like I got anywhere else to be."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Just let me know what you need."
msgstr "もし気が変わったら教えてよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Let's talk about that helicopter."
msgstr "拠点について話そう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"Nah.  I owe Yusuke for getting me someplace safe, but I'm not trying to set "
"up camp here and most of these people don't want outsiders sticking around "
"anyway.  I just need to get my helicopter back."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Nevermind that for now."
msgstr "やっぱり止めておこう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Not really.  What happened with the army?"
msgstr "バリーに何があったんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"Oh, you don't remember?  I wouldn't worry too much, seems a lot of people "
"lost a week or two around the time the bombs fell.  Long story short, the "
"army--well, not just them, it was the guard and the police, whoever really."
"  Order kind of fell apart and some of the guys cracked, started shooting at"
" each other or the evacuees.  That was right around the time the dead "
"started walking…a lot of people really couldn't handle that.  Anyway most "
"the refugee camps…the FEMA camps, the evac shelters…most of 'em turned into "
"death traps pretty quick.  I'm surprised these folk here are getting on as "
"well as they are."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Name of an NPC class
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Rescue Pilot"
msgstr "ヘリコプター操縦士"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Right."
msgstr "そうか。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "That chopper's still up there."
msgstr "製粉機があります。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"The rescue pilot at the refugee center says there's probably still a working"
" helicopter on the roof of a hospital.  If you bring them there, they'll be "
"happy to fly you anywhere you want to go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"Uh, advice?  I say we get the hell out of here as fast as we possibly can."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"Unless the army got to it, and let's just say I don't think there's much "
"chance of that, it'll be parked up on the roof of the hospital I was working"
" with.  Hopefully I don't have to explain to you how dangerous that place "
"probably is by now."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Wait here for now."
msgstr "今はその情報で十分だ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "We made it!  Just let me check out the bird real quick."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"Well at first they had me flying people out the mountains to a hospital, but"
" then things started to get too bad in the city and, well, you know what "
"happened with the army and all of that."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"Well here's the thing: I'm a pilot, and I want to get airborne again.  I "
"dunno if there's anyone left to find or help or whatever out there, but I "
"don't like being grounded like this.  If you can help get me back to my "
"bird, I'll fly you anywhere you want to go.  Problem is, it's up on a roof "
"and I can't reach it by myself.  I'm not really equipped for that kind of "
"thing."
msgstr ""

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"Well up until recently I was a search and rescue pilot.  Now I guess I'm "
"more of a pedestrian."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "What about your helicopter?"
msgstr "シェルターは今どうなっているんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Where did you leave your ride?"
msgstr "どうして隠れ家から出てきたんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, I was flying medevac, for all the good it did.  There wound up being "
"nowhere to take anyone."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Get to the Chopper"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid "Yeah?"
msgstr "あん？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"You held up your end, so I guess I'm with you now.  Like I said, I can fly "
"this or any other helicopter, I'll take you anywhere you want to go."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of mission "Talk to the Rescue Pilot"
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_rescue_pilot.json
msgid ""
"You've made it to the helipad, you probably ought to talk to the pilot."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Any tips for surviving?"
msgstr "サバイバルの知恵を教えてくれる？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "I see.  Let's try this again from the start."
msgstr "そうか。他の話をしよう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "I suppose I should hire a party then?"
msgstr "それはつまり、雇ってくれってこと？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid ""
"I'm currently waiting for a customer to return… I'll make you a deal though,"
" 750 merch will cover my expenses if I get a small cut of the loot."
msgstr "客を待っている...私を雇ってみないか。750マーチ支払ってもらえれば、戦利品の取り分は必要ない。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid ""
"I'm just a hired hand.  Someone pays me and I do what needs to be done."
msgstr "私は傭兵だ。相応の金を払うなら働いてやろう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid ""
"If you have to fight your way out of an ambush, the only thing that is going"
" to save you is having a party that can return fire.  People who work alone "
"are easy pickings for monsters and bandits."
msgstr ""
"待ち伏せが出来ない状況で困難な戦いに直面したとき、必要なものは敵に応射を浴びせてくれる仲間の存在だ。一匹狼はモンスターや盗賊にとって格好の獲物なんだ。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Appears in the refugee center as a partner for hire.
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Merc"
msgstr "傭兵"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid ""
"Merch is what they call dollar bills around here.  Free Merchant Credit "
"Notes or something.  If you want to buy stuff around here and you don't want"
" to barter away your guns, you need merch."
msgstr ""
"ここで流通しているドル紙幣のようなものだ。正式には、自由商人信用手形、だったか。ここで取り引きをしたいけど銃を売り払いたくないなら、マーチを用意することだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Okay, how much merch do I need?"
msgstr "分かったよ、何マーチ必要なんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "Well, thanks for the info.  Bye!"
msgstr "ふぅん、教えてくれてありがとう。また今度！"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "What the heck is a merch?"
msgstr "マーチとは一体何だ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "What would it cost to hire you?"
msgstr "雇いたい。報酬はいくら要る？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_scavenger_mercenary.json
msgid "[750 merch] You have a deal."
msgstr "[750 ﾏｰﾁ] 取り引き成立だ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Actually, I have to go.  Maybe later."
msgstr "もう行かないと。また後で。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Ah, yeah, I've heard of that too.  It's a weird world out there, hey?"
msgstr "ああ、なんだ、それなら私も知っている。この世界は本当に妙なことばかり起きるな？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Hey there.  Do you work here, or what?"
msgstr "やあ。ここで働いてる奴か？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgctxt "npc:f"
msgid ""
"I found a map to this place in an evac center and thought I'd see if it was "
"just full of <zombies> or if there was something up.  Didn't expect to find "
"so many survivors still alive though."
msgstr ""
"避難所でここへの経路を知ったから、<zombies>だらけなのか、それとも他に何があるのか見てやろうと思ってね。まさか、生きた人間がこんなに大勢いるとは思いもしなかった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgctxt "npc:m"
msgid ""
"I found a map to this place in an evac center and thought I'd see if it was "
"just full of <zombies> or if there was something up.  Didn't expect to find "
"so many survivors still alive though."
msgstr ""
"避難所でここへの経路を知ったから、<zombies>だらけなのか、それとも他に何があるのか見てやろうと思ってね。まさか、生きた人間がこんなに大勢いるとは思いもしなかった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#. ~ You don't need to translate genders that aren't in your language
#. ~ Check: https://github.com/Cataclysm-TLG/Cataclysm-
#. TLG/blob/master/doc/TRANSLATING.md#grammatical-gender
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgctxt "npc:n"
msgid ""
"I found a map to this place in an evac center and thought I'd see if it was "
"just full of <zombies> or if there was something up.  Didn't expect to find "
"so many survivors still alive though."
msgstr ""
"避難所でここへの経路を知ったから、<zombies>だらけなのか、それとも他に何があるのか見てやろうと思ってね。まさか、生きた人間がこんなに大勢いるとは思いもしなかった。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"It doesn't really work that way.  They're back in safety, and I've got to go"
" check in with them with some supplies.  You know how it is, not everyone is"
" suited to risk travel these days."
msgstr "そうもいかない。せっかく安全な拠点が確保できたんだし、物資を持ち帰ってやらないと。危険な旅ができない奴だっているんだから。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Look, I don't know a better way to put this.  I don't know you, I can't "
"bring some random back with me.  For all I know you're a cannibal psycho or "
"something.  We all saw too much of that during <the_cataclysm>.  Me and "
"mine, we're not looking to expand our tribe just now, OK?"
msgstr ""
"おい、こんなことは言いたかないがな。あんたのことは何も知らないし、危険かもしれない奴は入れたくない。あんたが人食いの狂人って可能性もある。<the_cataclysm>でそんな奴は山ほど見てきた。俺らは仲間を増やす気なんてない、分かったか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Me?  No, I'm just passing through, how about you?"
msgstr "私？いや、単なる通りすがりだ。あなたは？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Not much, just passing through.  Have a good day."
msgstr "ぼちぼちだね。通りがかったから声をかけたんだ。いい一日を。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Oh well, I'd better get going."
msgstr "そうだったか。私はそろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"Sorry, I have people of my own to look out for.  I can't leave them in the "
"lurch."
msgstr "悪いね、こっちも世話してる奴らがいて、放って出て行く気にはなれないんだ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Sure, here, I'll draw you up a little map."
msgstr "よしよし、簡単なマップを書いておこう。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Thanks!  I'd better get going."
msgstr "ありがとう！そろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Thanks!  What's your story?"
msgstr "ありがとう！あなたはどうしてこんな暮らしをするようになったんだ？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "They could come along too."
msgstr "その人たちも一緒に来ればいい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Well, I'd better get going."
msgstr "さて、そろそろ行くよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Why don't I come back to your hideout?"
msgstr "あなたの拠点へ行ってもいい？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "Work here?  No, of course not.  I'll be on my way."
msgstr "ここで？いいや、違う。もう行かないと。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid ""
"You looking for a travelling companion?  I could use someone to watch my "
"back."
msgstr "同行者を探しているのか？私も背中を預けられる人を探しているんだ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/refugee_center/surface_visitors/NPC_visiting_scavenger.json
msgid "You seen anything interesting out there?"
msgstr "何か気になる話はあるか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Anything else you need?"
msgstr "他に必要なものは？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Can I have another look?"
msgstr "もう一度見せてもらえないか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Do you need something?"
msgstr "何がお望み？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Find anything good?"
msgstr "何かいい品物は入った？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<hands_up>"
#. ~ Mostly hostile NPCs say these things in preparation for mugging an
#. unarmed avatar.
#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid "Hands up, <name_b>!"
msgstr "手を挙げろ、<name_b>！"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid ""
"Haven't seen another face in quite a while.  Not a living one, at least.  "
"State your business.  Maybe you got some use for some of this scrap metal?"
msgstr "人間の顔を見るのは久々だよ。ああ、生きてる人間って意味でな。要件は何だ？この金属屑を引き取りに来たのか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Let's take a look at your stock."
msgstr "商品を見せてもらおう。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid ""
"Like I said, I came out here when the dead got pissed off.  This place had "
"some barbed wire, metalworking tools, and plenty of stuff to make weapons "
"out of.  Even the walls are my own making."
msgstr ""
"前にも言ったかもしれないが、死者が暴れ出した頃、私はここにやってきたんだ。この場所には有刺鉄線や金属加工の道具もあるし、武器の材料も豊富だ。この壁も自作だよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Nah, see ya."
msgstr "いや、さよなら。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid ""
"Nope, although I have a really good claim by the river.  Gonna go fetch them"
" soon, be right back in <interval>."
msgstr "いいや、川辺でちゃんと宣伝してるんだけどな。<interval>後には品物が揃うと思うから、また来るといい。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Pleasure to see you again, <name_g>."
msgstr "また会えて嬉しいね、<name_g>。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Sure thing.  I've got a few things on hand.  What'll ya have?"
msgstr "もちろん。手元にいくらかあるけど、何にする？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid ""
"Sure, I'm fine with it.  There's a spare bed in the shed next door for "
"anyone who needs it.  Just don't hog it.  Someone else might come along."
msgstr "ああ、構わない。隣の小屋に予備のベッドがある。眠りたければ使ってくれ。他にも来客があるかもしれないから、独占はしないでくれよ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Think I could stay here?"
msgstr "私もここに滞在していいか？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid ""
"Well, I held a modest job here as a scrap yard worker.  Business was fair "
"most days, but when <the_cataclysm> hit, I decided to head out here.  With "
"all the craziness going on in the cities and whatnot, I decided to just stay"
" here for while.  I figure someone might find a use for the leftover metal "
"lying around, so I started selling it to anyone who passed by."
msgstr ""
"ああ、私はここで、くず鉄置き場の作業員として日々仕事をしていただけなんだ。<the_cataclysm>が始まったとき、ここへ避難しに来ようと決めた。街中が騒がしくなってきたから、しばらく留まることにしたんだ。それで、辺りに転がってる金属屑を誰かが買ってくれるかもしれないと思って、道行く人相手に商売を始めたってわけさ。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Well, good luck."
msgstr "そうか、頑張って。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "Why stay here of all places?"
msgstr "何故こんなところに居座っているんだ？"

#. ~ Name suffix of a male NPC
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader.json
msgid "scrapper"
msgstr "スクラップ業者"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "An electronics store might have some."
msgstr "電器店に行けば、あるかもしれない。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the charcoal?"
msgstr "炭はあったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the magnetrons?"
msgstr "磁電管はあったか？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Do you have the solder?"
msgstr "はんだはあったか？"

#. ~ Description of mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"Establish trade relations between the scrapper and a refugee center, and "
"bring back a writ of the agreement."
msgstr "避難センターと取り引きの契約を締結し、契約書をスクラップ業者に渡しましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Find 25 Magnetrons"
msgstr "25個の磁電管を探す"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "How does this help us?"
msgstr "それで、どうすればいいんだ？"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "I need help…"
msgstr "助けが必要だ..."

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"I was out scavenging recently, and I found one of those old evac shelters.  "
"Turns out the computer was still on and had an address for a refugee center."
"  I figure they might want some spare metal, so I need you to go over there "
"and strike a deal with them."
msgstr ""
"少し前に物資を拾いに行った時、古い避難シェルターを見つけたんだ。中にまだ使えるコンピュータが置いてあって、避難センターという施設の住所を閲覧できた。きっと金属素材の備蓄が必要だろうから、うちと取り引きするよう交渉を持ちかけてほしいんだ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"Its fairly simple to make some.  I don't know where you could find any, "
"though."
msgstr "作るのは簡単だろう。どこで売ってるのかは、よく知らないけどな。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"Magnetrons can be found in microwaves.  An apartment block should have tons "
"of them."
msgstr "磁電管は電子レンジの中にある。アパートには大抵置いてる筈だ。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 Solder"
msgstr "100個のはんだを集める"

#. ~ Description of mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 100 solder in exchange for credit with the scrap merchant."
msgstr "スクラップ業者のために、はんだを100個入手しましょう。"

#. ~ Description of mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 25 magnetrons in exchange for credit with the scrap merchant."
msgstr "スクラップ業者のために、磁電管を25個入手しましょう。"

#. ~ Mission name
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
msgstr "300個の炭を集める"

#. ~ Description of mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"Obtain 300 lumps of charcoal in exchange for credit with the scrap merchant."
msgstr "スクラップ業者のために、300個の炭を集めましょう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"Since business is increasing around here, I've decided to start selling more"
" specialized metal.  Problem is, I can't separate the metal out.  "
"Fortunately, I found some old schematics on a machine for this sort of "
"thing.  If you could get me 25 magnetrons, I can melt down the sorted stuff "
"into bars.  I can quickly pay you in raw materials."
msgstr ""
"商売も軌道に乗り出したから、もっと特殊な金属を売ることにしたんだ。ただ、金属を選り分ける方法がないんだよ。ありがたいことに、選別機の古い回路図はあったんだ。磁電管が25個あれば、特殊な金属を選別して棒状に成型できる。手伝ってくれたら、謝礼は金属素材で支払おう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Someone's got to do it."
msgstr "他の誰かに頼むことにするよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"That machine I put together is working wonderfully, but the generator is "
"nearly out of juice.  If you could get me 300 lumps of charcoal, I'll pay "
"you however I can."
msgstr "組み立てた選別機はとても役立ってるが、発電機の電力がほとんど底をついてしまったんだ。もし炭を300個持ってきてくれたら、報酬は弾もう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"That machine I put together needs some repairs on it, but I'm out of solder."
"  If you could get me about 100 spools, I'll pay you for it."
msgstr "自作の機械を修理しなきゃならないんだけど、はんだを切らしてしまった。100巻き融通してくれたら、謝礼を出そう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "That's unfortunate.  I guess I'll do it myself."
msgstr "それは残念だ。自力で探すことにしよう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Establish A Trade Route"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid ""
"That's unfortunate.  I guess we'll have to find someone else to trade with."
msgstr "それは残念だ。他の取り引き相手を探すことにしよう。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Where are they?  I don't believe you."
msgstr "どこにあるんだ？実物を見なければ信じないよ。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Find 25 Magnetrons"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Wonderful!  I'll start the smelting as soon as possible."
msgstr "でかした！これで選別を始められる。"

#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 300 Charcoal"
#. ~ Dialogue line in mission "Obtain 100 Solder"
#: data/json/npcs/scrap_trader/scrap_trader_missions.json
msgid "Wonderful!  This should do for a while."
msgstr "でかした！これでしばらくは持ちそうだ。"

#. ~ Name suffix of an NPC
#. ~ Provides hair cuts
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Barber"
msgstr "理髪師"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid ""
"Can I interest you in a trim?  It'll cost you 6 merch for a haircut or 3 for"
" a beard trim.  I can do color and styling too."
msgstr "髪の手入れに興味がある？6マーチで散髪、3マーチで顔剃りだよ。カラーリングや整髪もやってるよ。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "I can't imagine what I'd need your assistance with."
msgstr "私が君の手伝いを必要とする状況ってのがちょっと想像できないな。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Stand still while I get my clippers…"
msgstr "バリカンを使うからじっとしててくれ..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid "Thanks…"
msgstr "ありがとう..."

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_carpenter2.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_crop_overseer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_farmer2.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_foreman.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter1.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid ""
"The doctor needs some help building an anesthetic machine.  Do you have "
"anything that could help?"
msgstr "医者に麻酔器作りの手伝いを頼まれたんだ。何か役に立ちそうな物資はないか？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_bartender.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_nurse.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scavenger.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_scrapper.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_sickly_laborer.json
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_woodcutter2.json
msgid "What is your job here?"
msgstr "ここで何の仕事をしているんだ？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/tacoma_ranch/NPC_ranch_barber.json
msgid ""
"What?  I'm a barber… I cut hair.  There's demand for cheap cuts and a shave "
"out here."
msgstr "うん？ 私は床屋だよ... 髪を切るんだ。安価な散髪や髭剃りの需要があるみたいなんでね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
