#: data/json/npcs/talk_tags.json
msgid ""
"I can do a lot more for you if you pass me a couple batteries to recharge."
msgstr "充電用の電池をいくつか分けてくれたら、もっと役に立てるよ。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<cramped_vehicle>"
