#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid ""
"Seriously?  You figure you're the boss of me now?  Fine, whatever, what do "
"you want me to do."
msgstr "本気？私の上司にでもなったつもりかい？ええ、構わないさ、何をしてほしいんだい？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "So, here we are.  What's up?"
msgstr "さてと。調子はどう？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "Sure.  Here we are, talking."
msgstr "いいね。早速話そうか。"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid ""
"Well, before <the_cataclysm> I was working at a university bookstore, "
"remember?  But that was just an in-between after finishing my PhD, while I "
"looked for a post-doc placement I was interested in.  Which, I suppose, I've"
" got now?  You didn't recruit my for my fragile body, intractable obesity, "
"or sunny disposition."
msgstr ""
"そうだね、<the_cataclysm>以前に大学の書店で働いてたって話は、もうしたんだった？でもその仕事も、博士課程を修了して、ポスドク向けの面白そうな就職先を探していた頃の、ほんの短い間のことだ。さて、結局どこに行き着いたんだかね？ひ弱な身体、病気由来の肥満、陽気な性格、どれも採用理由にはちょっと弱いね。"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "What's your story, anyway?"
msgstr "それでは、あなたの話を聞かせて？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid ""
"What?  You're not content with me being a personal tutor, now you want to "
"start a post-apocalyptic university?"
msgstr "何だって？私を家庭教師にするのに飽き足らず、終末世界で大学でも設立しようってのかい？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid ""
"Yeah, sure, why not.  I love hearing myself talk.  What did you want to know"
" about?"
msgstr "ああ、いいとも、断る理由もない。勝手に喋りまくるの大好き。知りたいことは何？"

#. ~ NPC dialogue line
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid ""
"You kind of already know, don't you?  I used to be a post-doc researcher in "
"mycology, then I wound up stuck in the lobby at that stupid refugee center, "
"then you came and yeeted us all out of there.  What more is there?"
msgstr ""
"もう知ってるじゃないか？菌類の博士として研究をしてたのに、あのみじめな避難センターのロビーに閉じ込められて、そこにあんたが来て、困ってた全員を連れ出してくれたんだ。他に言うことなんてないだろう？"

#. ~ Response to NPC dialogue
#: data/json/npcs/your_followers/luo_follower.json
msgid "You mean you'll talk about more than just mushrooms?  What've you got?"
msgstr "キノコ以外の話題もあるんだな？何の話をしてくれる？"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_salt_water_pipe_swamp"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsolete_recipe_modular_workshop_salt_water_pipe.json
msgid ""
"Construct a pipe to bring salt water from a nearby swamp to the Workshop, "
"which will become available once a pump is built to connect to it.  This job"
" just adds the first bit (in a swamp)."
msgstr ""
"隣接する湿地から作業場まで塩水を運ぶパイプを建設します。揚水ポンプを設置すれば、塩水を利用できるようになります。まずは湿地にパイプを建設しましょう。"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "fbmw_2_salt_water_pump"
#: data/json/obsoletion_and_migration/obsolete_recipe_modular_workshop_salt_water_pipe.json
msgid ""
"Construct a pump and connect it to the salt water pipe.  You have to add the"
" pump to a storage zone to access the salt water for camp crafting!"
msgstr ""
"揚水ポンプを作り、塩水を送るパイプに接続しましょう。拠点での製作作業で塩水を使う場合は、ポンプを設置した地点を「拠点: "
"資材」区画に追加しておく必要があります！"

