#. ~ Description of profession "Pastor" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Armageddon has come!  You did everything you could to protect your "
"community, but it appears that prayers were not enough.  Now that they are "
"all dead, you should probably find something more tangible to protect you."
msgstr ""
"ハルマゲドンが来ました！コミュニティを守るためにできる限りのことをしましたが、祈りだけでは十分ではなかったようです。 "
"みんな死んでしまったので、自分を守ってくれるもっと具体的なものを見つけるべきでしょう。"

