#. ~ Description of profession "Fast Food Cook" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"The diners at the fancy burger joint where you worked were even more "
"irritable and unreasonable than usual today.  You showed them the meaning of"
" fast food… by running for your life!"
msgstr ""
"しゃれたバーガーショップに勤めていましたが、今日ほど客が怒りっぽく理不尽だったことはありません。ファーストフードの意味を教える時が来たのです...全速力で逃げましょう！"

