#. ~ Description of profession "Taekwandoin" for female
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You've spent years practicing the Korean art of hand-to-hand combat, and now"
" it looks like your training will be put to the ultimate test."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of profession "Taekwandoin" for male
#: data/json/professions.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You've spent years practicing the Korean art of hand-to-hand combat, and now"
