msgid "Shiv Mastery"
msgstr "簡易ナイフ戦闘達人"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Shiv Proficiency"
msgstr "簡易ナイフ戦闘熟達"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Short Sword Familiarity"
msgstr "短剣戦闘基礎"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Short Sword Mastery"
msgstr "短剣戦闘達人"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Short Sword Proficiency"
msgstr "短剣戦闘熟達"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Spear Familiarity"
msgstr "槍戦闘基礎"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Spear Mastery"
msgstr "槍戦闘達人"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Spear Proficiency"
msgstr "槍戦闘熟達"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Medium Sword Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"The weight of your weapon feels as natural to you as if it were your own "
"limb."
msgstr "武器をまるで自分の手のように自然に扱えます。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Unarmed Technique Familiarity"
msgstr "素手格闘基礎"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Unarmed Technique Mastery"
msgstr "素手格闘達人"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Unarmed Technique Proficiency"
msgstr "素手格闘熟達"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Spear Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"Whether you're hunting boar or hunting zombies, you know how to stab with "
"your spear."
msgstr "イノシシだろうがゾンビだろうが、槍で上手く指す方法を心得ています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Bionic Sword Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You and your bionic sword are the epitome of combat efficiency."
msgstr "肉体に埋め込んだ剣によって、戦闘効率を極限まで高めています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Sword Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You are a blade master of unparalleled skill.  And they said anime wasn't "
"real."
msgstr "比類ない技術をもつブレードマスターです。アニメのような戦いを繰り広げられます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Bionic Sword Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You are able to operate your bionic sword without incident."
msgstr "肉体に埋め込んだ剣を問題なく扱えます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Sword Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You are not afraid to swing big with a heavy sword."
msgstr "重い剣を恐れず大きく振り回せます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hammer Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You are quite used to using hammers and maces in close combat."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Hammer Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You can handle a big ol' hammer without dropping it on your toes."
msgstr "大きく重い鎚をつま先に落とすことなく扱えます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Polearm Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You can handle the awkward balance of a polearm well, like it's an extension"
" of your body."
msgstr "重心が独特な長柄武器もまるで肉体の一部のように自在に扱うことができます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Flail Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You can make your flail dance like a ballerina, and hit like a truck."
msgstr "穀竿をバレリーナのように華麗に振るい、トラックのように力強く殴打します。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Axe Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You chop through bodies as easily as you chop through trees."
msgstr "樹木を切り倒すのと同じくらい簡単に敵の肉体を切り裂きます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hooking Weapon Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You could probably unhorse someone with your weapon with your skills."
msgstr "この技術があれば、武器を使って敵をウマから振り落とすことすらできそうです。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Bludgeon Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You crack skulls with deadly efficiency."
msgstr "メイスでゾンビを効率よく殴る方法を学びました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Claw Weapon Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You feel as dangerous as a tiger with your claws."
msgstr "危険なトラのように爪を戦闘に生かします。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Knife Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You handle your knife like a butcher, and are ready to prove it."
msgstr "まるで食肉解体のようにナイフを上手に扱う方法を心得ています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Medium Sword Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You have enough practice not to cut yourself with your own blade."
msgstr "自分の武器でケガをしないように十分な練習を積みました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Polearm Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You know how to keep your enemies at a distance with a polearm, and are able"
" to defend yourself with one."
msgstr "長柄武器を使って敵を退け身を守る術を身につけました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Unarmed Technique Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You know how to punch someone and make it hurt."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Shiv Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You know how to stab someone with something not typically intended to stab "
"them with."
msgstr "通常は武器として使わないものを敵に突き立てる方法を知っています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Baton Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You know how to strike with your baton so you get the most out of every "
"blow."
msgstr "短棒を使った打撃を最大限に活用する方法を知っています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Sword Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You know how to swing a longsword without chopping off your own foot."
msgstr "自分の足を切り落とさずにロングソードを振り回せます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hand Axe Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You know how to use a hatchet safely and effectively."
msgstr "ハチェットなどの安全かつ効果的な活用法を心得ています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hand Axe Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You know the proper technique to use with a hand axe."
msgstr "手斧の適切な扱い方を心得ています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hammer Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You know which end of a hammer to use."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Fencing Weapon Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You strike forth with ease after many hours of training."
msgstr "何時間も訓練を重ね、敵を自然に突けるようになりました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Short Sword Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You understand how to swing a short blade around.  In theory, at least."
msgstr "短い刃を振るう方法が分かりました。少なくとも、理論的には。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Sword Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You wield your blade like it was a modern day Caliburn."
msgstr "その手で振るわれた剣はまるで現代のカリバーンのように活躍します。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Hammer Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're a hammering juggernaut, ready to smash it all."
msgstr "全てを粉砕する戦鎚の巨人です。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Axe Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're a post-apocalyptic Paul Bunyan, but it's not just wood you're "
"chopping."
msgstr "終末世界のポール・バニヤンです。切り倒すのは樹木ではありませんが。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Thrusting Sword Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're a virtuoso with your sword, ready to deliver a swift and deadly "
"thrust."
msgstr "素早く致命的な突きを繰り出す剣の名手です"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Short Sword Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're able to cut through zombies with the same ease you cut through "
"foliage."
msgstr "ゾンビ程度であれば木の葉のように簡単に切り裂けます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Thrusting Sword Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're able to gore someone on your sword like a pro."
msgstr "剣士のように敵に剣を突き刺せます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Unarmed Technique Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're able to pace yourself when you've got nothing else to fight with."
msgstr "武器が見当たらなくても、心を落ち着けて戦えます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Handgun CQC Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're able to precisely strike your opponent with your handgun where it "
"hurts the most."
msgstr "ハンドガンを使った近接戦闘で、正確に敵の急所を狙って攻撃できます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Flail Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're able to swing your flail with deadly precision, crushing through ribs"
" and skulls alike."
msgstr "凄まじい精度で穀竿を振るい、肋骨や頭蓋骨を打ち砕きます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Handgun CQC Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're able to use your handgun effectively as a melee weapon without "
"shooting yourself."
msgstr "ハンドガンを暴発させることなく近接武器として効果的に扱えます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Gun CQC Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're familiar with how to grip a long gun correctly while striking someone"
" with it."
msgstr "銃身の長い銃を適切に握って敵に近接攻撃を仕掛ける方法に精通しています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Quarterstaff Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're familiar with how to handle your staff and can use it without "
"knocking yourself out."
msgstr "クォータースタッフの扱いに慣れ、自分自身を打ち据えるミスはなくなりました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hooking Weapon Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're getting a hang of hooking your opponents with your weapon."
msgstr "武器で敵を引っ掛けて倒すコツをつかみました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Spear Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're in touch with your inner hunter-gatherer, able to keep up the hunt "
"for longer."
msgstr "原始的な狩猟者の精神を呼び起こし、より長く狩りを続けられるようになりました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hand Axe Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're more than capable of using a hand axe to protect yourself."
msgstr "手斧を使って問題なく身を守ることができます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Thrusting Sword Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're no stranger to thrusting your sword through zombies."
msgstr "ゾンビに剣を突き刺すのは初めてではありません。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Sword Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're not afraid to lift a heavy sword nor bring it down on someone's head."
msgstr "重い剣を恐れず構え、敵の頭に振り下ろせます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Hammer Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're not afraid to put some muscle into it when you're swinging a hammer."
msgstr "恐れることなく筋肉を最大限に生かしてハンマーを振るいます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Great Axe Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're not quite a professional lumberjack, but you can handle an axe."
msgstr "プロの木こりではありませんが、斧を扱うことはできます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Shiv Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're pretty good at shanking your enemy, if you do say so yourself."
msgstr "こんなことを自慢するのも何ですが、敵を刺すのが得意です。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Handgun CQC Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're proficient in striking with your handgun and can do so precisely."
msgstr "ハンドガンを使った近接戦闘に熟達しており、正確に攻撃を仕掛けられます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Gun CQC Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're proficient in striking with your rifle, both with and without a "
"bayonet."
msgstr "銃剣の有無にかかわらず、ライフルを使った近接攻撃に熟達しています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Sword Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You're proficient with the use of long swords, and are deadly with one in "
"your hands."
msgstr "ロングソードの扱いに熟達しており、致命的な剣捌きを繰り出します。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Claw Weapon Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're quite experienced with your claws by now."
msgstr "爪の戦闘での扱いにかなり慣れました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Unarmed Technique Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're used to fighting with nothing and can fight unarmed for longer."
msgstr "何も持たずに戦うことに慣れており、素手でより長く戦い続けられます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Quarterstaff Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You're used to the balance of a staff and know how to handle it."
msgstr "クォータースタッフの重心に慣れており、上手く使いこなせます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Bionic Weapon Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You've become accustomed to the motions of your bionic weapons in combat."
msgstr "肉体に埋め込んだ武器を戦闘で上手く活用できるようになりました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Knife Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You've got a handling on gripping knives so they don't slip out of your "
"hand."
msgstr "ナイフが手から滑り落ちないように柄をしっかり握れています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Fencing Weapon Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You've got the basics of lunging and parrying your opponent."
msgstr "実戦でのランジとパリの基礎を習得しました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Flail Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You've learned how to hit your opponent instead of yourself with your flail."
msgstr "穀竿を自分ではなく敵に命中させる方法を学びました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Claw Weapon Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You've learned how to use claw weapons in combat."
msgstr "爪を武器として戦闘で生かす方法を学びました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Baton Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You've learned to swing a baton without spraining your wrists."
msgstr "手首をねんざせずに短棒を振り回す方法を学びました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Shiv Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You've mastered the ancient and ignoble art of sticking someone with "
"something small and pointy."
msgstr "尖った小さなもので敵を突き刺すという、古来より伝わる卑劣な戦術を会得しています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hooking Weapon Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You've mastered the art of knocking someone to the ground with your weapon."
msgstr "武器で敵を引っ掛けて地面にたたきつける技術を会得しました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Long Gun CQC Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You've mastered the art of the bayonet charge and know how to handle the gun"
" itself as a weapon."
msgstr "銃剣突撃の技術を会得し、銃を近接武器として自在に扱う方法を心得ています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Baton Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You've mastered the use of all kinds of batons."
msgstr "あらゆる種類の短棒の扱い方と、短棒で敵を殴打する技術を習得しました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Quarterstaff Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "You've mastered the use of quarterstaves.  Donatello would be proud."
msgstr "クォータースタッフの扱いをマスターしました。ドナテロも喜んでいることでしょう。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Short Sword Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"You've trained your body against the strain of fighting with a short sword."
msgstr "短剣での戦いの負荷に耐え、肉体を鍛えました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Bionic Sword Proficiency"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"Your bionic sword proficiency is satisfactory.  You are able to use it "
"without discomfort."
msgstr "肉体に埋め込んだ剣を何の違和感もなく満足に振るえます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Bionic Weapon Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Your bionic weapon feels as natural to you as your heartbeat."
msgstr "肉体に埋め込んだ武器を、心臓の鼓動と同じくらい身近なものに感じます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Medium Sword Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"Your body has grown accustomed to the rigors of sword fighting, and can "
"handle it for longer."
msgstr "厳しい剣術に肉体が慣れており、より長く戦い続けられます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Bionic Weapon Familiarity"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid "Your body is getting used to the stress your bionic weapons put on it."
msgstr "肉体に埋め込んだ特異な武器の扱い方に慣れてきました。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Knife Mastery"
#: data/json/proficiencies/melee_weapons.json
msgid ""
"Your knife is like an extension of yourself, you wield it effortlessly."
msgstr "ナイフを自分の肉体の一部のように自由自在に操れます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Welding"
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid ""
"A basic understanding of the different types of welding, welding tools and "
"fuels, how to weld different materials, and more."
msgstr "様々な溶接技法や道具、燃料、素材の溶接方法など基本的なことを理解しています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Principles of Metalworking"
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid ""
"A basic understanding of the properties of metal as a material, and the "
"concepts behind smithing, die casting, and other metalworking techniques."
msgstr "素材としての金属の基本的な特性を理解し、鍛冶、ダイカストなどの金属加工技術の根本となる概念を学びました。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "Armorsmithing"
msgstr "鎧鍛冶"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "Blacksmithing"
msgstr "鍛冶"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "Bladesmithing"
msgstr "刃鍛冶"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "Case Hardening"
msgstr "鋼材焼き入れ"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "Fine Metalsmithing"
msgstr "金属精密加工"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Case Hardening"
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid ""
"Heating steel packed in charcoal at high temperatures to cause a hard case "
"of higher carbon steel around the lower carbon core."
msgstr "炭火の上に鋼材を置いて高温で熱し、低炭素鋼の芯の周囲に高炭素鋼の硬い殻を作る技法です。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Bladesmithing"
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "How to fabricate sharp and reliable blades from scratch."
msgstr "鋭く信頼性の高い刃物を一から製作する技術です。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Armorsmithing"
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "How to make articulated armor from pieces of metal."
msgstr "金属片から連結式の鎧を作り出す技術です。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Manual Tooling"
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid ""
"How to make high-quality tools and parts by hand.  Includes techniques like "
"threading, durable articulation points, and using appropriate metals for "
"appropriate tasks.  Also applies to making blunt instruments that can "
"withstand a severe beating without distortion."
msgstr ""
"品質の高い工具や部品を手作業で作る技術です。ねじ切りの技法や耐久性の高い可動部の加工法、特定の用途に適した金属の選択なども心得ています。激しい衝撃を受けても歪まない頑丈な鈍器の製造技術にも関わります。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Fine Metalsmithing"
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "How to make jewelry from precious metals like gold and silver."
msgstr "金や銀などの貴金属から装飾品を作り出す技術です。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Wire Making"
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid ""
"How to turn raw ingots and metals into usable wire.  Includes both drawing "
"and extruding."
msgstr "未加工の金属鋳塊をワイヤーに変えるための、押し出しと引き抜きという二通りの手法を身に着けています。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "Manual Tooling"
msgstr "工具自作"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "Principles of Metalworking"
msgstr "金属加工基礎"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "Principles of Welding"
msgstr "溶接基礎"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid "Quenching & Tempering"
msgstr "焼き入れ&焼き戻し"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Quenching & Tempering"
#: data/json/proficiencies/metalwork.json
msgid ""
"Quenching involves heating the steel, quenching it in water, then tempering "
"it to create extremely tough metal."
msgstr "鋼材の加熱と急冷を繰り返すことで非常に強靭な状態にする技法です。"

