#: data/json/proficiencies/vehicles.json
msgid "Helicopter Piloting"
msgstr "ヘリコプター操縦"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/vehicles.json
msgid "Offroad Driving"
msgstr "飛び込み禁止！"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Helicopter Piloting"
#: data/json/proficiencies/vehicles.json
msgid "You are able to operate helicopters of all shapes and sizes."
msgstr "変異したあらゆる種、あらゆるサイズのクモの体構造に精通しています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Boat Piloting"
#: data/json/proficiencies/vehicles.json
msgid ""
"You're familiar with the control and operation of boats and other marine "
"vehicles."
msgstr "ボートなどの船舶の操縦と制御を熟知しています。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Amphibian Biology"
msgstr "両生類生態"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Anatomy of Amalgamations"
msgstr "融合体構造"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Arachnid Anatomy"
msgstr "クモ綱体構造"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Bird Biology"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Basic familiarity with various types of birds."
msgstr "様々な種類の鳥類について、ごく基本的な知識をもっています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Amphibian Biology"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Basic familiarity with various types of frogs and salamanders."
msgstr "様々な種類のカエルやサンショウウオについて、ごく基本的な知識をもっています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Invertebrate Biology"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Basic familiarity with various types of insects, arachnids, and worms."
msgstr "様々な種類の昆虫やクモ、ミミズについて、ごく基本的な知識をもっています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Debug Weakpoint"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"Basic improvement on the chance of hitting the Weakpoint Monster's weak "
"points."
msgstr "モンスターの弱点に攻撃が命中する基礎的な確率が上昇します。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Creatures of Flight"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"Basic understanding of what's needed for certain creatures to fly, as well "
"as ways of preventing it."
msgstr "生物が空を飛ぶ原理やそれを妨害する方法について、基本的な知識を持っています。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Beetle Anatomy"
msgstr "甲虫体構造"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Bird Biology"
msgstr "鳥類生態"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Centipede Anatomy"
msgstr "節足動物体構造"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Creatures of Flight"
msgstr "飛行生物"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Cyborg Anatomy"
msgstr "サイボーグ体構造"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Debug Weakpoint"
msgstr "弱点攻撃(デバッグ専用)"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Expert Debug Weakpoint"
msgstr "弱点攻撃熟練(デバッグ専用)"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Expert Debug Weakpoint"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"Expert improvement on the chance of hitting the Weakpoint Monster's weak "
"points."
msgstr "熟練によってモンスターの弱点に攻撃が命中する確率が上昇します。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Triffid detailed anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"Extensive study of triffids has provided you with a good understanding of "
"their strengths and weaknesses when it comes to combat.  A scientific study "
"of them might yield further biological insights, but you don't have the time"
" to spend years cooped up in a lab."
msgstr ""
"トリフィドを徹底的に研究することで戦闘時の長所と短所を十分に把握します。トリフィドを化学的に研究すれば更なる生物学的発見をものにできるかもしれませんが、研究室に閉じこもって何年も過ごす暇はありません。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hymenopteran Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"Familiarity with the comparative anatomy of mutant Hymenopterans - ants, "
"bees, and wasps of all kinds.  You find it easier to exploit their weak "
"points, and possibly disable their natural weaponry."
msgstr ""
"アリ、ミツバチ、スズメバチなど、変異したハチ目の体構造についてある程度の理解があります。弱点を狙って攻撃でき、強力な武器となる部位を無力化する方法も知っています。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Fungaloid basic anatomy"
msgstr "真菌生物体構造基礎"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Fungaloid detailed anatomy"
msgstr "真菌生物体構造熟知"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Giant Humanoids"
msgstr "超大型人型生物"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Hymenopteran Anatomy"
msgstr "ハチ目体構造"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Invertebrate Biology"
msgstr "無脊椎動物生態"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Mi-go basic anatomy"
msgstr "ミ＝ゴ体構造基礎"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Mi-go detailed anatomy"
msgstr "ミ＝ゴ体構造熟知"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Natural Armors"
msgstr "天然装甲"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Netherium Abominations"
msgstr "異界生物"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Ossified Exoskeletons"
msgstr "骨化外骨格"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Small Humanoids"
msgstr "小型人型生物"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Triffid basic anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"Study of triffids has given you insights into their anatomy that allows you "
"to aim for some weak spots."
msgstr "トリフィドを研究することでトリフィドの体構造を明らかにし、弱点を狙って攻撃できるようになります。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Synthetic Armors"
msgstr "人造装甲"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Undead Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"The so-called walking dead are in fact alive.  They do not breathe and most "
"do not eat, but their hearts still pump putrid blood to their rotting "
"muscles, and if they bleed, they can be killed."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Anatomy of Amalgamations"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"These twisted chimeras are each unique, yet follow a reliable set of "
"underlying biological principles which can still be exploited."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Triffid basic anatomy"
msgstr "トリフィド体構造基礎"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Triffid detailed anatomy"
msgstr "トリフィド体構造熟知"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid "Undead Anatomy"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Synthetic Armors"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"Understanding of man-made armors and ways to exploit them.  You're able to "
"find openings in certain kinds of body armor."
msgstr "人工的な装甲の仕組みや弱点を理解しており、ボディアーマーなどの隙間を狙うことができます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Beetle Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You are familiar with the anatomy of mutated beetles - bypassing their thick"
" armor should be easier."
msgstr "変異した甲虫の体構造に精通しており、厚い装甲を避けて攻撃することができます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Centipede Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You are familiar with the anatomy of mutated centipedes, letting you target "
"their less-deadly parts with ease."
msgstr "変異した節足動物の体構造に精通しており、致命的な武器となる部位を狙って無力化する方法も知っています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Arachnid Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You are familiar with the anatomy of mutated spiders of all shapes and "
"sizes."
msgstr "変異したあらゆる種、あらゆるサイズのクモの体構造に精通しています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Fungaloid detailed anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You have advanced your understanding of the fungaloid body sufficiently to "
"have a pretty good idea of where you can harm it and where it's better "
"protected.  You don't really understand it's biological functions, although "
"it seems it would be possible for someone with much more time than you have "
"to glean some insight into it, but you've gotten an understanding of how to "
"hurt it, and that's what's important here."
msgstr ""
"真菌生物についての理解を十分に深め、どこを狙えば効果的か、どこが特に頑丈かなど、かなり分かるようになってきました。生物学的な機能については理解できていませんが、もっと時間を持て余している人なら、更に詳細に考察できるかもしれません。何よりも、真菌生物にダメージを与える方法を理解したという点が重要です。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Netherium Abominations"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You have extensive experience with netherium abominations which provides you"
" with a vague sense of where more vulnerable spots might be."
msgstr "異界の生物との戦いを何度も経験し、どこがより脆弱な部位なのか、漠然とした感覚で理解しています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Giant Humanoids"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You have some practice in fighting large, hulking humanoids.  You're better "
"at reaching certain weak points."
msgstr "巨大な人型生物と戦う経験を積んでおり、弱点を正確に狙えます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Small Humanoids"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You have some practice in fighting small humanoids like children.  You don't"
" necessarily feel good about it."
msgstr "必ずしもいい経験とは言えませんが、子供のような小さな人型生物と戦う経験を積んでいます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Fungaloid basic anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You have studied fungaloids sufficiently to get an idea of which parts are "
"the more sensitive ones.  While seeming to be a weird mixture of fungus and "
"animal, it at least has a structure with commonalities between different "
"types of fungaloids."
msgstr ""
"真菌生物について十分に研究し、どの部位がより脆弱なのか分かるようになってきました。菌類と動物が混ざり合った奇妙な生物ではありますが、少なくとも個体ごとに共通の構造はあるようです。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Mi-go basic anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You have studied mi-go sufficiently to get a sense for where some sensitive "
"points might be.  However, its biology remains too different from life "
"originating on Earth to be understood to any extent."
msgstr ""
"ミ＝ゴについて研究を重ね、弱点の位置を把握できるようになりました。しかしその生態は地球起源の生命とあまりに異なっており、依然として完全に理解することはできません。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Ossified Exoskeletons"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You're familiar with creatures presenting unsettling bones on their outer "
"structure."
msgstr "表面が硬い骨に変化した生物の体構造に精通しています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Cyborg Anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You're somewhat familiar with cybernetic creatures.  You're able to find "
"openings and gaps that aren't as hardened."
msgstr "サイボーグの体構造についてある程度の理解があり、硬い外殻などの隙間や開口部を狙うことができます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Natural Armors"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"You're somewhat familiar with naturally armored creatures.  You're able to "
"find openings in certain kinds of hardened shells and thick hides."
msgstr "生物が生まれつき身につけている装甲についてある程度の理解があり、硬い外殻や厚い皮などの隙間を狙うことができます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Mi-go detailed anatomy"
#: data/json/proficiencies/weakpoints.json
msgid ""
"Your understanding of the mi-go body is advanced enough to have a decent "
"idea of where it is more sensitive to harm.  This does not mean you have any"
" significant understanding of how it works internally; if anything, your "
"dissections have just left you more confused."
msgstr ""
"ミ＝ゴの体構造について十分に理解し、よりダメージを与えられる部位を適切に判断できるようになりました。しかし、これらの部位がどのように作用してこの怪物を動かしているのか理解した、という訳ではありません。むしろ、解剖すればするほど混乱が深まります。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Archer's Form (Expert)"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid ""
"After significant practice, you have become experienced in the movements "
"used in drawing and firing a bow, and have strengthened those muscles "
"considerably."
msgstr "相当量の練習を積むことで弓を引いて射る動作に慣れ、弓術で使う筋肉が特に発達しています。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Archer's Form"
msgstr "弓術のフォーム"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Archer's Form (Expert)"
msgstr "弓術のフォーム(熟練)"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Archer's Form (Master)"
msgstr "弓術のフォーム(達人)"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Basic Tanning"
msgstr "革鞣し基礎"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Fiber Twisting"
msgstr "紡績"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Ropemaking"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Making twisted fibers into durable and useful rope."
msgstr "繊維を捩って耐久性の高いロープに加工する方法です。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Ropemaking"
msgstr "縄作り"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "Skilled Tanning"
msgstr "革鞣し職人"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Skilled Tanning"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid ""
"You have a lot of practice and experience with processing hides to leather, "
"as well as related techniques like making boiled leather."
msgstr "生皮を革に加工する、革を硬化させるなどの様々な技術について、多くの訓練と経験を積んでいます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Archer's Form (Master)"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid ""
"You have drawn and fired a bow so many times, you probably have a bit of a "
"twist in your spine from it.  You've developed at least a professional-level"
" understanding of the pose and motion of effective archery."
msgstr ""
"何度も弓を引き、射っているため、背筋が少し曲がっているでしょう。 効果的な弓術の姿勢と動作について、少なくともプロレベルまで理解を深めています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Archer's Form"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid ""
"You have grasped some basic understanding on archery, and find handling bows"
" easier."
msgstr "弓術の基本的な知識が身に付いており、弓を容易に扱えます。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Basic Tanning"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid "You're familiar with the theory behind turning raw hides into leather."
msgstr "生皮を革に加工する理論に精通しています。"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Fiber Twisting"
#: data/json/proficiencies/wilderness.json
msgid ""
"You've got a basic grasp of the theory of how to twist and arrange fibers "
"into a more durable cord."
msgstr "繊維を捩じって耐久性の高い紐に加工する基本的な方法論を理解しました。"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/woodworking.json
msgid "Basic Carpentry"
msgstr "大工基礎"

#. ~ Proficiency name
#: data/json/proficiencies/woodworking.json
msgid "Hobbyist Luthier"
msgstr "趣味人"

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Hobbyist Luthier"
#: data/json/proficiencies/woodworking.json
msgid "Simple projects involving creating musical instruments out of wood."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of proficiency "Basic Carpentry"
#: data/json/proficiencies/woodworking.json
msgid ""
"Simple projects involving holding planks and panels of wood together with "
"nails or similar fasteners."
msgstr "釘などの留め具を使って板を固定することをはじめとする、基礎的な大工の技術です。"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "faction_base_fire_lookout_tower_beds_0"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_fire_lookout_tower/recipe_modular_fire_lookout_tower_beds.json
msgid ""
"We should build a pair of beds in the northern shack for our survivors."
msgstr "北の小屋に、生存者のためのベッドを2台作る必要があります。"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting "faction_base_fire_lookout_tower_beds_1"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_fire_lookout_tower/recipe_modular_fire_lookout_tower_beds.json
msgid ""
"We should build a pair of beds in the southern shack for our survivors."
msgstr "南の小屋に、生存者のためのベッドを2台作る必要があります。"

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_fire_lookout_tower_beds_0"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_fire_lookout_tower/recipe_modular_fire_lookout_tower_beds.json
msgid "pair of beds in the northern shack"
msgstr "ベッド2台(北)"

#. ~ Blueprint name of recipe crafting
#. "faction_base_fire_lookout_tower_beds_1"
#: data/json/recipes/basecamps/base/fbmc_fire_lookout_tower/recipe_modular_fire_lookout_tower_beds.json
msgid "pair of beds in the southern shack"
msgstr "ベッド2台(南)"

