"Let's set up a radio tower to improve our recruitment efforts, we'll "
"repurpose that terminal for it."
msgstr "もっと人を効率的に集められるように、電波塔を建てましょう。制御端末は再利用できそうです。"

#. ~ Description of recipe crafting
