#. ~ Description of scenario "Unliving History" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"New England is dotted with old forts from the Revolutionary War, and many of"
" them are still standing.  When things started getting really bad, it seemed"
" like a natural place to hole up for a while, and it turns out that many, "
"many other people had the same idea.  The peace didn't last long.  Now "
"everyone else is undead, and you're trapped inside the walls with them.  The"
" single entrance being a tight choke point is looking a lot less useful now…"
msgstr ""
"ニューイングランド地方には、今でも独立戦争時代の古い砦が点在しています。情勢が悪化し始めた頃、砦へ避難しようと考えるのはごく自然なことであり、多くの人が同じような行動をとりました。しかし、その平和も長くは続きません。ゾンビとなった避難民と共に、防壁の中に閉じ込められてしまいました。防備のための一つしかない入り口も、今や窮屈なだけで何の効果もありません..."

#. ~ Description of scenario "Unliving History" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"New England is dotted with old forts from the Revolutionary War, and many of"
" them are still standing.  When things started getting really bad, it seemed"
" like a natural place to hole up for a while, and it turns out that many, "
"many other people had the same idea.  The peace didn't last long.  Now "
"everyone else is undead, and you're trapped inside the walls with them.  The"
" single entrance being a tight choke point is looking a lot less useful now…"
msgstr ""
"ニューイングランド地方には、今でも独立戦争時代の古い砦が点在しています。情勢が悪化し始めた頃、砦へ避難しようと考えるのはごく自然なことであり、多くの人が同じような行動をとりました。しかし、その平和も長くは続きません。ゾンビとなった避難民と共に、防壁の中に閉じ込められてしまいました。防備のための一つしかない入り口も、今や窮屈なだけで何の効果もありません..."

