#. ~ Description of scenario "Lone Survivor" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You are the only one that made it.  Everyone else died nearby.  You have to "
"get out of here!"
msgstr "助かったのは自分だけです。傍にいた皆は死んでしまいました。ともかくここから脱出しましょう！"

