msgstr "必要不可欠なスタッフと見なされ、非常事態の最中も研究所に残るよう指示されました。脱出方法を見つけなければ、餓死するしかありません。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Mansion Escape" for female
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_female"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life when the world ended, surrounded by riches and"
" eating well every day.  Now you've woken up, alone and drugged, in a room "
"of your mansion that you don't recognize.  As you fight to remain conscious,"
" you hear heavy footsteps nearby.  Time to get the hell out of here."
msgstr ""
"世界が崩壊するまでは、毎日富と贅沢な食事に囲まれて上流階級の生活を送っていました。ある日薬を盛られ、ふと目覚めると、見覚えのない大邸宅の一室に一人置き去りにされていました。何とか意識を保とうと必死になっていると、周囲からは重い足音が響いてきました。早く脱出した方がよさそうです。"

#. ~ Description of scenario "Mansion Escape" for male
#: data/json/scenarios.json
msgctxt "scen_desc_male"
msgid ""
"You were living the high life when the world ended, surrounded by riches and"
" eating well every day.  Now you've woken up, alone and drugged, in a room "
"of your mansion that you don't recognize.  As you fight to remain conscious,"
