#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Dad said he was going to get groceries two days ago.  he didnt come home "
"yet.  he told me to stay inside the shelter but im getting scared.  i think "
"i remember where the grocery store is.\""
msgstr ""
"「パパが2日前に食べ物を買いに行くと言って、まだ帰らない。シェルターの中にいろって言われたけど、こわくなってきた。スーパーの場所なら覚えてると思う。」"

