#. ~ The grammar and punctuation mistakes are there on purpose 9/10 times.
#. Keep in mind that those notes are supposed to be written by primary-school-
#. level children.
#: data/json/snippets/children_notes.json
msgid ""
"\"Daddy and Mommy, some really scary storm is happening outside.  I hear "
"some people telling me everything will be okay and everything will be over "
"if I get out, so I'm going with them to help find you, and if not i left a "
"message to you so you know where I'm gone!  I'm just too hungry to keep "
"waiting anymore… I'm sorry.\""
msgstr ""
"「父さんと母さんへ、外はものすごい嵐です。外に出ればきっと大丈夫だと言ってくれる人たちがいるので、一緒に父さんと母さんを探しに行きます！おなかが空いて、これ以上は待てません...ごめんなさい。」"

