#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "<mi-go_harvest>  <mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
msgstr "<mi-go_harvest><mi-go_harvest_deeper>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
msgstr "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A network of sacs and vessels carry different fluids through the mi-go's "
"body, any of which you might call \"blood\".  One is thin and clear with a "
"grayish cast, while another is thick, foamy, and bubblegum pink, almost like"
" Pepto-Bismol."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Large pores all over the body connect short sections of tubing to small "
"balloon-like organs throughout the body, possibly serving as its respiratory"
" system."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Many short tentacles with rasping tips hang from beneath the subject's head."
"  They're too small to serve as weapons, and it would be tempting to assume "
"these are how it eats if it had any apparent digestive tract."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"On close examination, the mi-go's rigid carapace is more of a pellicle, as "
"though its spongy insides have merely dried into a hard crust where exposed "
"to the air."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Owing to its many limbs and hard carapace, it is at first tempting to "
"compare the mi-go to an insect.  Up close, there's little resemblance to be "
"had.  Its multijointed legs are more akin to tentacles, a comparison that's "
"easy to make because it also has a few of those."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The \"skeleton\" of this creature is almost a single solid piece, merely "
"softening at the joints to allow the limbs to bend."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The creature contains a lot of irregular clumps of tissue that must serve as"
" its organs, but it's difficult to guess at their purpose."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The front of the creature's head, riddled with eyestalks and antennae, folds"
" open under gentle pressure to reveal a rippling interior like ruched "
"mortadella.  Perhaps this structure is how the creatures vocalize."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The mi-go's body is seemingly composed of a single material that merely "
"varies in density.  It's as hard as bone at its core, spongy and almost "
"gelatinous through the middle, and hard and crusty at the exterior.  Is this"
" all the same tissue?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The smell emanating from the specimen is a noxious combination of chlorine "
"and acetone.  There's none of the rot-stink or typical smells you'd expect "
"from an animal carcass."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"There's nothing that resembles an animal brain anywhere in the creature.  "
"Whatever it used to interpret the world and make decisions is simply beyond "
"your understanding."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<mi-go_harvest_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/mi-go_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Tiny clumps of white crystal are buried throughout the creature's tissue "
"like so many kidney stones.  They don't look functional, but then again, how"
" would you know?"
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"!! HELP ME !!\n"
"My name is Pippa and I am lost!\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a long-haired cat with a round face and short muzzle sitting on a floral carpet.]\n"
"\n"
"I'm getting on with age, so I don't remember how to get home.  I am a (traditional) Persian longhair with silky white fur and brownish eyes.  I was wearing a red collar with my name tag on it.\n"
"\n"
"PLEASE CALL (413)555-1688 IF YOU SEE ME\n"
"(AND TAKE A PICTURE IF YOU CAN)"
msgstr ""
"！！助けて！！\n"
"私はピッパです。家に帰りたい！\n"
"\n"
"[花柄の絨毯の上に座る、丸顔の長毛猫の写真]\n"
"\n"
"私は歳を取っており、帰り道が分かりません。私は(トラディショナルタイプの)ペルシャ猫で、絹のような白く長い毛並みをしており、目の色は茶色です。名札がついた赤い首輪を付けています。\n"
"\n"
"私を見かけたら、(413)555-1688に電話してください\n"
"(できれば写真を撮っておいてください)"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_dog"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"!MISSING DOG!\n"
"Male, 5 years old, fine and dense blue mottled fur, stands 19 inches, sharp ears.\n"
"Answers to the name \"Caesar\".\n"
"He is an Australian Cattle Dog.\n"
"He's NOT FRIENDLY and is irate at times.  But he's a good boy.  We miss him dearly.\n"
"\n"
"Last seen on Liberty Street, Canton.  Missing since May 13.\n"
"If found please contact 978-555-6865.\n"
"\n"
"$100 REWARD IF FOUND!"
msgstr ""
"！迷子犬！\n"
"オス、5歳、細かいブチがたくさんある青みが買った黒色の体毛、体高48cm、尖った耳の犬です。\n"
"名前は「シーザー」です。\n"
"犬種はオーストラリアン・キャトル・ドッグです。\n"
"人見知りする性格で、よく吠えます。\n"
"飼い主には懐いており、言うことをよく聞きます。\n"
"\n"
"最後に目撃されたのは、カントンのリバティ通りです。5月13日から行方不明です。\n"
"もし見つけたら、978-555-6865に連絡してください。\n"
"\n"
"発見者には$100の報酬を差し上げます！"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_child"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"AMBER ALERT\n"
"\n"
"Child Find Case #01943\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a child with curly ginger hair celebrating her sixth birthday.]\n"
"\n"
"Olivia Clymer\n"
"\n"
"Age At Missing: 6\n"
"Hair: Ginger, Curly, Neck-Length\n"
"Eyes: Green\n"
"\n"
"Olivia was last seen playing in her backyard on 176 Farland Street under parental supervision.  When her mother was momentarily distracted, Olivia disappeared.  A police search is currently being conducted to find Olivia.  She was wearing a dark blue sweater, an ankle-length floral skirt, red cotton gloves and a knitted wool cap on the day of her disappearance.  Olivia has burn marks on her left arm.\n"
"\n"
"Last Seen: 1:30 pm, October 22\n"
"Concord, MA\n"
"\n"
"If you have any information regarding Olivia, please call\n"
"Concord Police Department: 617-555-7622\n"
"\n"
"PLEASE HELP US"
msgstr ""
"誘拐事件速報\n"
"\n"
"児童失踪事件 #01943\n"
"\n"
"[6歳の誕生日を祝っている、赤い巻き毛の子供の写真]\n"
"\n"
"オリビア・クライマー\n"
"\n"
"行方不明時の年齢: 6歳\n"
"髪型: 赤毛、巻き毛、首までの長さ\n"
"目の色: グリーン\n"
"\n"
"オリビアちゃんが最後に目撃されたのはファーランド通り176番地にある自宅裏庭で、母親の近くで遊んでいました。母親が一瞬目を離した際に、オリビアちゃんは姿を消しました。現在、警察がオリビアちゃんを捜索しています。失踪当日の服装は、ダークブルーのセーター、花柄のロングスカート、赤色の綿製手袋、ニットのウール帽です。左腕に火傷の跡があります。\n"
"\n"
"最後の目撃情報: 10月22日 13時30分\n"
"マサチューセッツ州コンコード\n"
"\n"
"オリビアちゃんに関する情報をお持ちの方は、下記までご連絡ください\n"
"コンコード警察署: 617-555-7622\n"
"\n"
"ご協力よろしくお願いします"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_child"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"AMBER ALERT\n"
"\n"
"Jayden Perry Norton\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a child in a baby blue short sleeve onesie playing with a toy car.]\n"
"\n"
"HAVE YOU SEEN THIS BOY?\n"
"\n"
"Sex: Male ; Age: 6\n"
"Hair: Brown; Eyes: Brown\n"
"Height: 3'7\" ; Weight: 40 pounds\n"
"\n"
"IT IS BELIEVED HE WAS ABDUCTED BY A CAUCASIAN MALE FROM HIS SOUTH BOSTON HOME ON THE NIGHT OF 3 MAY.\n"
"\n"
"[Illustration: poorly drawn police sketch of a man in a black hoodie.]\n"
"UNIDENTIFIED SUSPECT\n"
"\n"
"The abductor drives a black sedan with a Canadian license plate.\n"
"Authorities say the abductor may have been headed to Canada or Maine.\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU HAVE ANY INFORMATION THAT CAN HELP THE INVESTIGATION, PLEASE CONTACT LOCAL LAW ENFORCEMENT IMMEDIATELY OR CALL TIPS TO 508-555-6311"
msgstr ""
"誘拐事件速報\n"
"\n"
"ジェイデン・ペリー・ノートン\n"
"\n"
"[車のおもちゃで遊んでいる、ベビーブルーの半袖つなぎを着た子供]\n"
"\n"
"この子を見かけませんでしたか？\n"
"\n"
"性別: 男、年齢:6歳\n"
"髪色: 茶色、目の色: 茶色\n"
"身長: 110cm、体重: 18kg\n"
"\n"
"5月3日の夜間、サウスボストンの自宅から白人男性に誘拐されました。\n"
"\n"
"[警察による、黒色のパーカーを着た男性のラフスケッチ]\n"
"身元不明の容疑者\n"
"\n"
"誘拐犯はカナダのナンバープレートを付けた黒色のセダンに乗っていました。当局によれば、誘拐犯はカナダかメイン州へ向かった可能性があります。\n"
"\n"
"捜査に役立つ情報をお持ちの方は、すぐに地元警察署か508-555-6311にご連絡ください。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_adult"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"AT RISK MISSING PERSON\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: an elderly woman with short curly hair wearing a pearl necklace and a floral dress.]\n"
"Betty Rue Webber, 74\n"
"\n"
"Mrs. Webber is a female Caucasian 74-year-old, 5'1\" tall, 160 pounds, short gray curly hair, wears reading glasses, last seen wearing a purple waistcoat, blue jeans and black crocs.\n"
"\n"
"The family reports Mrs. Webber has dementia.  The missing person left her residence on 2354 Kennedy Court, Mansfield, MA, at approximately 11 to 13 am.  Her loved ones are very worried and asking for your help locating her.\n"
"\n"
"ANY INFORMATION PLEASE CONTACT LOCAL LAW ENFORCEMENT OR CALL 774-555-3710"
msgstr ""
"行方不明者 注意事項あり\n"
"\n"
"[真珠のネックレスをつけ、花柄のワンピースを着た、短い巻き毛の老女の写真]\n"
"ベティ・ルー・ウェバー(74歳)\n"
"\n"
"ウェバー氏は74歳の白人女性で、身長は155cm、体重は73kgです。髪は灰色で短い巻き毛、老眼鏡をかけており、当時は紫色のベスト、青色のジーンズ、黒色のクロックスを着用していました。\n"
"\n"
"ウェバー氏は認知症を患っています。マサチューセッツ州マンスフィールド町ケネディ通り2354番地にある自宅を11時頃から13時頃までに出た可能性があります。家族が安否を非常に心配しています。ご協力よろしくお願いします。\n"
"\n"
"情報提供は、地元警察または774-555-3710にご連絡ください。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_adult"
#. ~ Please replace the fictitious phone number with one of your local
#. equivalent when translating
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"AT-RISK MISSING PERSON\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a wise-looking old man with receding gray hair and a long white beard.]\n"
"\n"
"DAVIS, JOHN CHRISTOPHER\n"
"\n"
"Male, White, 67 years old\n"
"5'11\", 155 lbs, blue eyes, bald, full white beard\n"
"\n"
"MISSING PERSON SUFFERS FROM DIABETES AND HIGH BLOOD PRESSURE\n"
"\n"
"Missing person, John Christopher Davis, a resident of Charlestown, MA, was last seen on February 27, at 3:30 p.m. leaving a grocery store on 3678 Rockford Road.  He was wearing a black winter coat, brown jeans, sunglasses and holding two plastic bags.  Mr. Davis' family is concerned for his well-being.\n"
"\n"
"IF YOU HAVE ANY INFORMATION OR HAVE SEEN MR. DAVIS\n"
"PLEASE CONTACT 978-555-5874 IMMEDIATELY\n"
"\n"
"HELP US PLEASE"
msgstr ""
"行方不明者 緊急\n"
"\n"
"[禿げ上がった白髪、長い白髭を生やした聡明そうな老人の写真]\n"
"ジョン・クリストファー・デービス\n"
"\n"
"男性、白人、67歳\n"
"身長180cm、体重70kg、瞳の色は青、禿頭、伸びた白髭\n"
"\n"
"この行方不明者は糖尿病と高血圧症を患っています。\n"
"\n"
"マサチューセッツ州チャールズタウン在住のジョン・クリストファー・デービス氏は2月27日15時30分、ロックフォード通り3678番地の食料品店を出た姿を目撃されて以降、行方不明になっています。当時は黒色の防寒コート、茶色のジーンズ、サングラスを着用し、ビニール袋を2つ提げていました。デービス氏のご家族が安否を気にかけています。\n"
"\n"
"情報をお持ちの方、デービス氏を目撃した方は\n"
"今すぐ978-555-5874までご連絡ください\n"
"\n"
"ご協力よろしくお願いします"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_cat"
#: data/json/snippets/missing_posters.json
msgid ""
"ATTENTION\n"
"MISSING CAT\n"
"\n"
"[Photograph: a hairless, wrinkled cat with lemon-shaped eyes wearing a striped T-shirt.]\n"
"\n"
"RAMSES went missing from the car park at Companion Care Vets in Oakland on 30th March.\n"
"He is a Canadian Sphynx with a gray spot covering its stomach.\n"
"She is wearing a striped T-shirt and a pink collar.\n"
"\n"
"If found, please contact me at: ifoundramsesthecat@gmail.com"
msgstr ""
"お知らせ\n"
"迷子猫\n"
"\n"
"[縞模様の猫用Tシャツを着用した、毛のない皺だらけの皮膚と大きな目が特徴的な猫の写真]\n"
"\n"
"ラムセスは3月30日、オークランドのコンパニオン・ケア動物病院の駐車場で行方不明になりました。\n"
"お腹に灰色のブチがあるカナディアン・スフィンクスです。\n"
"縞模様のTシャツを着ており、ピンク色の首輪を付けています。\n"
"\n"
"見つけた方はifoundramsesthecat@gmail.comまでご連絡ください"

#. ~ Snippet in category "missing_child"
