"<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper> <zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
msgstr ""
"<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper> <zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_headless_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
msgstr "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headles_deeper>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_mushroom_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
msgstr "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_mushroom_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>  "
"<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgstr ""
"<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>  "
"<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_shadow_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
msgstr "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_shadow_harvest>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>  "
"<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
msgstr ""
"<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>  "
"<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A careless move dislodges some remaining air causing the throat of the "
"undead monster to emit one more choked scream."
msgstr "不用意に死体を動かしたことで体内に残っていた空気が排出され、死んだ筈の怪物は再び耳をつんざく叫び声を発しました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A clump of rotten entrails.  The sallow membranes that link these lobes of "
"flesh together are lined with veins and capillaries.  A caul of slime coats "
"them all in a greasy sheen.  You should not put this anywhere near your "
"mouth."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "leg_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A fat zombie haunch.  It doesn't look tasty but the shape is undeniably "
"close to a large fried chicken leg.  The skin is even the right texture, "
"though for the wrong reasons."
msgstr ""
"太ったゾンビの脚です。美味しそうには見えませんが、この形はどう見てもフライドチキンです。皮膚の状態もフライドチキンそっくりですが、もちろん調理された訳ではありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A roaming insect attracted by the carcass gets fried after landing on an "
"organ glowing a faint blue, making you decide to avoid it with the utmost "
"care."
msgstr "死骸に引き寄せられてやってきた虫が、薄青色に輝く器官に触れて、ジュッと焦げ付きました。細心の注意を払って解体を進めましょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A rotted and then shredded arm.  Not much use unless you want to scrape the "
"rancid meat from the bones."
msgstr "腐ってちぎれた腕です。こそぎ取ってまで腐った肉を採取したい状況でもない限り、役には立ちません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"A rotted skull from a human zombie.  It feels more flexible than it should, "
"like stiff leather, no longer natural bone."
msgstr "かつては人間のものだった、汚染された頭蓋骨です。少し弾力があり、骨というよりは硬い革のような手触りです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Along joints in the limbs and torso you find strange new muscly organs "
"filled with fluid, suggesting this behemoth moved with some form of organic "
"hydraulics."
msgstr ""
"四肢と胴の関節部には筋肉でできた袋状の器官が見られ、その内部は液体で満たされています。この巨大な怪物は何かの有機的な水力学を使って動いているのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"An accidental cut opens a gland that spurts clear fluid across the "
"creature's flesh, which bubbles and smokes as some of the acid undergoes a "
"neutralizing reaction."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"As you cut into its stomach, the insane fragmentary remains of some creature"
" it devoured, which appears to have melded with its own tissues, attempt to "
"claw at your hand before you bludgeon them until they cease moving."
msgstr ""
"胃に切り込みを入れると、内部で死骸と融合した何かの生物の部位がこちらの手を引っ掻こうと狂ったように暴れ始めたため、慌てて殴りつけ、動きを止めました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "As you cut through the muscle, it tenses up in reaction."
msgstr "筋肉を切断すると、腱が連動して死体がピクリと震えました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"As you finish up, you notice your earliest cuts seem to be the tiniest bit "
"smaller."
msgstr "作業を進めているうちに、最初にメスを入れた切り口はこんなに小さかっただろうかと疑問が浮かびました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"As you make your first cut into its skin, a pressurized jet of decaying "
"blood almost hits your face."
msgstr "皮膚に入れた切り込みから腐敗した血液が勢いよく噴き出し、危うく顔にかかるところでした。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Despite it not being very evident from the outside, it seems the entire "
"digestive tract of the abomination was bloated with its obscuring smoke."
msgstr "外側からは分かりませんでしたが、この忌まわしい怪物の消化管すべてが、もやのようなものを溜め込んで膨らんでいるようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Despite the carcass lying still, you still notice churning while "
"investigating its entrails, as if whatever was originally animating this "
"corpse is wrestling with the mycelium fibers to retake control."
msgstr ""
"死骸は動くことなく横たわっていますが、体内は未だに波打っています。まるで最初にこの死体を動かしていた何かが菌糸に襲い掛かり、制御を取り戻そうとしているかのようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Every cavity in this creature's anatomy is puddled with a foaming mixture of"
" acid and half-dissolved tissue.  It seems it wasn't entirely immune to its "
"own secretions."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Fibers of Kevlar-like material spread through the body like a cobweb, "
"originating from a tiny entry wound in the abdomen."
msgstr "腹部にできた小さな傷口を中心に、ケブラーのような繊維素材がクモの巣のように体内に広がっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Fungal stalks still sway gently despite the lack of movement of the formerly"
" shambling corpse."
msgstr "ふらふらと動いていた死体は動かなくなりましたが、菌糸は依然として穏やかに揺れています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Inside its muzzle you notice strange glands and fibrous growths, almost as "
"if the creature's sense of smell was in the process of being overhauled."
msgstr "鼻面の内側には、まるでこの怪物の嗅覚を徹底的に強化していたかのような、奇妙な腺と発達した繊維質が入っていました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Inside the chest is some unfamiliar organ, a hideous amalgam of disparate "
"tissues and veins."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Inside the chest is some unfamiliar organ, fatty and wrinkled like brain "
"tissue."
msgstr "胴体の内部には、脳組織のような、脂質に皺が寄った見慣れない臓器が存在しています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"It seems most of the creature was grown as some sort of suit looking as if "
"it was piloted by the still normal sized human corpse found in a fetal "
"position in its torso."
msgstr "怪物の下腹部には、通常サイズの人間の死体が操縦者のように収まっていました。この怪物はある種のスーツとして機能していたのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Its distended lungs seem to be partially lined with a black and sticky mucus"
" membrane."
msgstr "膨らんだ肺の一部は、粘着性のある黒い液体で覆われています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Its legs seem to have been reinforced with a strange lattice of skeletal "
"bracing and muscle fibers to support its immense bulk."
msgstr "巨大な胴を支えるその両脚の内部では、筋繊維が奇妙な格子模様を形作り、中心を通る骨の柱をしっかりと補助しています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Its massive diaphragm seems to have been the only correctly sustained muscle"
" of this starved corpse."
msgstr "巨大な横隔膜は、この痩せこけた死体が唯一維持できていた立派な筋肉だったようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Its tissue has significant trouble separating from the bone in some spots."
msgstr "一部の組織は骨に密着しており、とても切り離せそうにありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Little tainted meat remains on whatever limb bones these were.  It still "
"bends at the joint but doesn't look to be moving on its own anymore."
msgstr "汚染された肉がほとんど削げ落ち、四肢のどの部分かも分かりません。関節は残っていますが、もう勝手に動くことはありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Lodged into the neck area of the creature and grown over you find a corroded"
" tag reading the following \"Max my best friend forever\"."
msgstr "怪物の首筋に何かが突き刺さっています。取り出してみると、それは「ずっと親友だよ、マックス」と書かれた、腐食したネームタグでした。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Most cavities in its anatomy seem to have been filled with an acidic "
"solution mixed with putrefied fat and pieces of its slowly melting tissues."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Opening its jaw wide, you notice the presence of multiple additional tongues"
" deeper it in its throat."
msgstr "顎を大きく開いてみると、喉の奥に複数の舌が生えていることが分かります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Organs in the lower abdomen, mainly the kidneys and the reproductive organs,"
" are absent."
msgstr "下腹部の臓器、主に腎臓と生殖器が無くなっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Portions of the spine and surrounding bones have grown and fused into a "
"single piece, presumably to hold up the creature's bulk - but even then, it "
"still shows signs of strain."
msgstr ""
"脊椎の一部とその周囲の骨が肥大し、融合して単一構造となっています。この怪物の肉体を支える強度はあったようですが、かなり無理をしていたように思えます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Pressed against the liver is a swollen gland the size of a golfball, still "
"somewhat functioning, pumping out acrid fluids."
msgstr "肝臓にゴルフボールほどのサイズの膨らんだ腺が張り付いています。まだある程度機能が残っているのか、刺激臭を放つ液体が漏れ出ています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Putrefied blood bubbles like tar in the places where you managed to remove "
"its skeletal growths."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Random cavities in its body make you think it was at least partially feeding"
" on its own tissues to keep functioning."
msgstr "筋肉のあちこちに空洞ができています。肉体の機能を維持するために、自分自身の組織を栄養として消費していたのかもしれません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Removing its bone plates proves more arduous than you would have thought, "
"requiring you to almost put your entire weight on your tool to pry them off."
msgstr "骨の装甲を取り外すのは想像以上に困難です。道具に全体重を掛けなければ、とてもこじ開けられそうにありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Separating what is flesh and what is synthetic is difficult, as some parts "
"appear to be between the two."
msgstr "内部組織の一部が硬質の人工物と完全に混じり合っているため、どこからどこが肉なのか判別できません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "Some organs have atrophied or outright dissolved entirely."
msgstr "一部の臓器は萎縮しているか、完全に溶けてしまっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Some strands of the bulletproof material snake deep into the body like roots"
" of an invading organism."
msgstr "防弾素材の一部は、まるで植物のように体内の奥深くまで根を張っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Strong fibers run alongside the muscles in a way that you want to compare to"
" marbling."
msgstr "強靭な繊維が筋肉に沿って並んでおり、まるで霜降り肉のようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The black camouflage evaporates off the body where you put your tool "
"through, completely odorless."
msgstr "少し刃を入れただけで、肉体から黒いもやが発散され、あっという間に消えてしまいました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The body stirs as you open it up, suggesting it's still trying to attack, "
"and reminding you to be cautious."
msgstr "切り開いた肉体が、こちらを攻撃しようとするかのようにビクリと震えたため、気を引き締め直しました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The brain has ossified inside this tainted skull.  It doesn't feel "
"noticeably heavier and you surmise that the brain-turned-bone must be deeply"
" porous or hollow itself."
msgstr "汚染された頭蓋骨の中には、硬化した脳が入っています。特に重くはないので、恐らく脳はスポンジ状か中空になっているのでしょう。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The brain stem is swollen and packed with what looks like new growth bulging"
" along the cervical vertebrae."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The cavities of this creature are filled with lethargic winged creatures "
"hanging off tubes oozing a greyish milky substance."
msgstr ""
"この死骸の体内には空洞があり、内部には翼をもつ動かなくなった怪物で満たされています。空洞内に生えた管に張り付き、灰色がかった乳状の物質を吸っていたようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The corpse is inundated with smaller forms, increasing in complexity and "
"size as you near its central cavity where they wait for their release in "
"neat clusters."
msgstr ""
"死骸の空洞には小さな怪物が大量に埋まっています。それらは中央へ近付くにしたがって大きく複雑な構造になり、完璧な姿で外に放出される日を待っていたようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The corpse twitches as you begin.  It didn't feel like rigor mortis."
msgstr "作業を始めると死骸がピクピクと動きました。死後硬直しているようには思えません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The front part of the brain is completely missing, with spongy, half-formed "
"bone in its place."
msgstr "脳の前部は完全に失われており、その代わりにスポンジ状の未熟な骨が入っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The heart is overtaken by a mass of fistulas and other growths."
msgstr "心臓のあちこちに穴が開き、大量の腫瘍ができています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The heart is overtaken by a mass of fistulas and other growths.  Healthy-"
"looking arteries still spiderweb out of the tumorous mass."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The heart makes an odd, swallowing sound on occasion as you work around it."
msgstr "心臓の周りを切り開いていると、時折心臓から何かを飲み込むような奇妙な音が聞こえます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The inner contents of the walking dead.  It's hard to tell exactly what kind"
" of tissue this may have once been.  Several structures appear to have "
"molded together."
msgstr "動く死体の中身です。かつてどんな機能を果たしていたのかさっぱり分かりません。いくつかの臓器が癒着し一つにまとまったような形状です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The inner tissues are a mosaic of somewhat normal flesh and flesh interlaced"
" with fibers of the armor."
msgstr "内部組織は、正常に見える肉質と鎧のように硬い繊維質がモザイク状に絡み合っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The inside of the torso is stuffed with hair, fingers, and a distorted face,"
" as if the zombie was growing a twin inside of itself."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The inside of this carcass resembles more an industrial production line than"
" anything vaguely natural."
msgstr "この死骸の体内は、とても生物のものには見えません。敢えて何かに例えるなら、工場の生産ラインに似ています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The intestines have pushed their way up into the thoracic cavity.  Lined "
"with teeth, they stretch up toward the throat like a swarm of eels."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The layout and segmentation of its bony carapace disturbingly resembles what"
" you want to call plate mail, but it's closer to the armor of an arthropod."
msgstr "骨でできた装甲の形状や並びは、プレートメイルと呼ばれる防具に不気味なほど似ていますが、節足動物の外殻のようにも見えます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The lingering shadows surrounding it make your work quite a lot harder as "
"they seem to deliberately grow more opaque around your tool as if they "
"wished to hide the monster's secrets."
msgstr "周囲に残った暗い影が、まるでこの怪物の秘密を隠そうとするかのように道具の周りに集まってくるため、作業は困難を極めました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The lungs of this creature are cavernous, seemingly having been repurposed "
"from their respiratory function to house an impressive volume of air."
msgstr "この生物のスポンジ状の肺は、大量の空気を溜めておく用途に使われていたようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The majority of the digestive tract seems to have reshaped into a singular "
"stomach."
msgstr "消化管の大部分が繋がって、一つの胃に変化しています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The more delicate joints in the body such as the wrists and neck have fused "
"with surrounding tissue."
msgstr "手首や首などの繊細な動きをつかさどる関節部は、周囲の組織と融合してしまっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The overall anatomy of this enormous monstrosity leaves you only to wonder "
"how it possibly could achieve the range of motion you witnessed while it was"
" still standing."
msgstr "巨大な怪物の全体的な構造を調べていると、この肉体でどうやってあれだけの可動域を確保していたのか不思議に思えてきます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The overbearing sweet smell of decay emanating from the carcass forces you "
"to take short breaks during your work to not puke."
msgstr "死骸から放たれる強烈な腐敗臭に圧倒され、吐き気を抑えるために休憩を取りながら少しずつ作業を進めました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The putrefied blood that leaks from your incisions is visibly saturated with"
" spores."
msgstr "切り口から漏れ出る腐敗した血液には、胞子が混じっているようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The putrid veins of the creature seem strangely rigid, and you see faint "
"crackles of electricity course across them."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The rear of this greying zombified dog shows strange reinforcements, as if a"
" previous pathology was being remediated."
msgstr "ゾンビ化した灰色のイヌの背中は、まるで何かの疾患が治った痕跡のように、妙に分厚くなっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The ropey muscles are still unbelievably tense along the corpse's back, your"
" own back aches just looking at them."
msgstr "死体の背中の筋肉は未だに張り詰めて縄のように浮かび上がっており、見ているだけで自分の背中も痛くなってきます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The sheer pungent acrid odor of the carcass makes you temporarily recoil and"
" reconsider the safety of delving into its entrails."
msgstr "死骸が発する強烈な刺激臭を嗅いでいると、本当に安全に内臓を取り出せるのか疑問に思えてきました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The sheer pungent acrid odor of the corpse makes you temporarily recoil and "
"reconsider the safety of delving into its entrails."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The sheer remaining tension in each of the muscles of its arms and shoulders"
" makes them unwind with a sonorous thwang each time you cut one off the "
"supporting bones."
msgstr "腕と肩の筋肉は未だに張り詰めています。支えになっていた骨を切断する度に、ドスンと音を立てて筋肉が緩んでいきます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The sheer scale of the carcass leaves you only with a luxury of choice on "
"where to start your work."
msgstr "死体のサイズが尋常ではないため、どこから手を付けるかじっくり悩むことができます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The skin is loose on the muscle in some places and melded with it in others."
msgstr "皮膚の一部が筋肉を包むようにたるんでおり、筋肉と癒着している部分もあります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_screamer_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The slack jaws and starved body of this creature make you think that it "
"would have struggled to seriously harm anything on its own."
msgstr "伸びきった顎と痩せ衰えた肉体を見ると、この怪物単体では何かに襲い掛かって仕留めることすら難しかったのではないかと思えます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The sputters of acid on your gear you earned by digging into this corpse "
"could maybe warrant the use of some water to douse."
msgstr "この死骸から取り出した物体には例外なく酸が付着しています。後で洗った方がいいかもしれません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The stained skull of a former human.  Whatever turned their flesh to walking"
" in death, it left its mark on their bones."
msgstr "かつては人間のものだった、汚染された頭蓋骨です。何が原因で化け物になったのか分かりませんが、骨にはその痕跡が確かに残っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The stained skull of what was once a human being.  It is rotted and "
"noticeably warped from its living form."
msgstr "かつては人間のものだった、汚染された頭蓋骨です。生前の状態から形がかなり歪み、腐っています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The stench coming off of this corpse is immediately reminiscent of vomit."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The teeth of this lopsided human skull have melded together like hot wax and"
" joined with the maxilla.  The eye sockets are drooping and canted to the "
"side as if shaped while soft.  Most of the suture joints of the cranium are "
"fused over with thick lines of growth as if soldered together with bone."
msgstr ""
"形状が歪んだ人間の頭蓋骨です。歯が蝋のように溶けて上顎の骨と一体化しています。眼窩は柔らかい状態で押し潰したように垂れ下がって横に伸びています。頭部の接合部には、はんだ付けでもされたかのような太い筋が通り、ほとんど癒着しています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The thing has extra teeth leading all the way down into the stomach."
msgstr "この死骸には歯が余分に生えており、歯列は胃の奥まで続いています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The thing's feet are entirely calloused and the smaller toes are completely "
"vestigal, simply a bump with a dead nail on them."
msgstr "足の表面はカチカチに硬くなっています。小さな足の指はほとんど退化し、血色の悪い爪が付いた瘤のようにしか見えません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid "The thing's innards churn slightly even as you dig through them."
msgstr "かき出そうとした内臓がわずかに脈打ちました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The thing's innards resemble one giant tumor more than the body of a human "
"being."
msgstr "人間の体内というよりも、巨大な腫瘍を切り開いているように思えます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The thing's innards resemble one giant tumor more than the body of a living "
"being."
msgstr "生物の体内というよりも、巨大な腫瘍を切り開いているように思えます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The tissue is rotting before your eyes, muscle turning to jelly and fat to a"
" clear, reeking slime.  It's as if time is catching up with the cadaver now "
"that it's no longer animated."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The tissue is rotting before your eyes, muscle turning to jelly and fat to a"
" clear, reeking slime.  It's as if time is catching up with the carcass now "
"that it's no longer animated."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The tremendous growth of its upper body's muscle mass must have rendered the"
" creature almost incapable of efficiently surveying its surroundings."
msgstr "上半身の筋肉があまりにも大きく発達しすぎたせいで、この怪物は辺りを歩き回ることすら一苦労だったと思われます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"The vestibular organs seem to be nonfunctional, but your question of how the"
" creature balances itself is answered by an odd mass in the center of the "
"brain, that you liken to a gyroscope."
msgstr ""
"前庭器官は機能していないように見えますが、この生物はどのようにしてバランスを取っていたのでしょうか。その答えは、脳の中心部の奇妙な物体にありました。これはまさにジャイロスコープです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"There are bundles of nerves snaking all throughout the tissues, still "
"channeling small amounts of electricity."
msgstr "組織全体に太い神経網が張り巡らされており、依然として微弱な電気が流れています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"These plates are almost impossible to remove until you realize they are "
"linked to the internal skeleton with calcified pillars you must break before"
" removing its armor."
msgstr "装甲はびくともしませんでしたが、内部の骨格に繋がっている石灰化した支柱のような部位を壊すと、綺麗に剥がれました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This corpse seems completely ordinary now, and dissection brings you no "
"further to asserting what gave the creature its peculiar properties."
msgstr ""
"この死骸は今では他の死骸と何ら変わらないように見えます。解剖をしてみても、どうしてこの怪物が特異な性質を持っていたのか、説明できそうにありません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "arm_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This jaundiced zombie's arm still bears a full sleeve tattoo.  Quality work "
"from what you can tell through all the rot."
msgstr "黄色く変色した腕全体に、今でもタトゥーが残っています。素晴らしい出来栄えであることは、肉が腐っていても分かります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This looks like a stomach and length of intestine, if they were made of lung"
" tissue.  Every now and then you notice it expanding or contracting "
"slightly.  It looks dangerous to eat, maybe even to handle."
msgstr ""
"この臓器の形状は胃や腸のようですが、質感は肺に似ています。時々わずかに膨らんだり縮んだりしているようです。当然食べるのは危険でしょうし、触りたいとも思いません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_bone_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_bone_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This one's armor falls off surprisingly easily, almost as if whatever "
"puppets it wishes for it to lose the extra weight."
msgstr "この死骸の装甲は驚くほど簡単に脱落しました。重い鎧を早く脱ぎ捨てたいと願っていたのでしょうか。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This person had an artificial hip, but it's completely overgrown with bone "
"now."
msgstr "人工股関節を入れていたようですが、今では完全に本来の骨に覆われています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This person has undergone a horrific mutation.  Their stomach has ballooned "
"outward to fill almost their entire thoracic cavity, crushing the lungs "
"against the ribs.  Even now, the lining oozes a thin, greasy film of acid."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "skull_human_tainted_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"This pitted human skull is filled with teeth, few of them where they should "
"be.  You can see them growing in the hollows that have developed, their "
"roots grown long and winding, more like those of a tree."
msgstr ""
"表面に凹凸の多い人間の頭蓋骨です。歯が残っていますが、どれもでたらめな位置から生えています。どの歯も広い空間内で野放図に伸び、歯根もまるで木の根のように曲がりくねっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"To your \"delight,\" you find a tapeworm in its gut, turgid but seemingly "
"dead."
msgstr "「大当たり」です。腹の中にサナダムシが入っていました。丸々と太っていますが、死んでいるようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_electric_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Uncomfortable static forces you to ground yourself multiple times during "
"your work."
msgstr "作業中に不快な静電気が何度も発生し、その度にアースを取る羽目になりました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Under the skin, crushing against the ribcage, you find a thick growth of "
"flesh and Kevlar formed from a mutated diaphragm."
msgstr "胴体の皮膚の下には、変異した横隔膜とケブラー素材が分厚い装甲を形作っており、胸郭を押し潰すように広がっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_mushroom_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Under the stomach you notice a wrinkled fruit that you can't help but think "
"somewhat appetizing despite where you found it."
msgstr "胃の中に皺だらけの果実が入っていました。こんなところに入っていたにもかかわらず、どこか美味しそうに見えます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Upon closer examination, some of the Kevlar isn't Kevlar - its off color and"
" composition suggest it's the creature's flesh reformed to imitate it."
msgstr ""
"よく調べてみると、ケブラー素材の一部はただのケブラーではありません。くすんだ色と質感を見るに、この怪物の肉体がケブラーを模倣して作り出した素材のようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_headless_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"While its individual fingers appear to be losing their dexterity, the "
"zombie's flexor muscles are tense and swollen."
msgstr "指の一本一本は器用に動きそうに思えませんが、折り曲げるための筋肉だけは大きく発達しています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"While some parts of the brain have turned to mush, others appear healthy and"
" pink."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"While some parts of the brain have turned to mush, others appear pink and "
"almost healthy."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"While you are cutting into it, the creature suddenly moves and grabs one of "
"your limbs.  Despite considerable effort, you are unable to pry open the "
"creature's iron grip and resign yourself to chop off the hand instead."
msgstr ""
"切り刻んでいた怪物の手が突然動き、がっちりと掴まれてしまいました。必死に引き剥がそうとしましたが、万力のように締め付けられて外れそうにありません。仕方なく、怪物の腕の付け根から切り落としました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You are almost certain that its flesh should not be able to contain such a "
"virulently aggressive liquid, yet, it does."
msgstr "肉の中にこれほど毒性の強い危険な液体が染み込んでいるなんてまず有り得ませんが、実際に目の前に存在しています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You are almost certain this zombie was pregnant before its undeath, the "
"fetus within the womb having been twisted into the abomination it was "
"carrying."
msgstr "このゾンビが生前に妊娠していたことは明らかです。子宮内の胎児が、忌まわしい怪物に取り込まれ一体となっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You begin your dissection - though, vivisection would be more appropriate, "
"as you find the corpse not as still as you once thought."
msgstr "解剖を始めましたが、死体とは思えないほどあちこちが動いています。これでは生きたまま解体しているのと同じです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You cut into its abdomen, and discover its utter lack of internal organs, "
"the expected cavity replaced by nothing but more flesh and muscle."
msgstr "腹部を切り裂くと、内臓は完全に消え去っていました。そこにあったのは空洞ではなく、筋肉の塊です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You cut into the arms of the creature and realize that instead of what you "
"would expect from what you know of normal human anatomy, its muscles wind "
"around the bones in what looks like a tight spring."
msgstr "怪物の腕を切り開いてみると、通常の人体構造からかけ離れた状態になっていました。骨の周りに、張り詰めたバネのような筋肉が巻き付いています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_kevlar_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You cut off some scraps of the uniform that were still adhered to the body, "
"finding tendrils of flesh anchored into them."
msgstr "肉に張り付いていた衣服の切れ端を剥ぎ取ると、まるで蔦のように肉が繊維に固着していました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_pupating_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You find several unfinished creatures inside the main cavity, you have a "
"vague feeling something greater discarded them, founding them wanting."
msgstr "体内の大きな空洞には、未発達の怪物が何体か入っていました。より大きな怪物に栄養を奪われ、飢えていたように感じます。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You find that shoulder and upper arm bones are supported by smaller, similar"
" bone growths."
msgstr "肩と上腕部の骨は、同じ形状の一回り小さい骨の構造で支えられているようです。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_acid_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You have to step back as a gland you inadvertently cut into seems to perform"
" a neutralization reaction between its contents and the rest of its fluids."
msgstr "うっかり何かの腺に傷をつけてしまい、内部に残った液体と肉が中和反応を起こしている間、少し下がって待つことになりました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You make one incision and the resulting cloud of black smoke forces you to "
"take a short break as it becomes impossible to see anything."
msgstr "少し切り込みを入れただけで黒いもやが立ち込めて何も見えなくなるため、作業は少しずつしか進みません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_dog_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You notice cysts in its fur, you cut into them and alternatively find acrid "
"fluids, flakes of bone or twitching strands of muscle."
msgstr "毛皮の中に瘤があることに気付き、切り開いてみると、刺激臭を放つ液体、骨の欠片、痙攣する腱などが入っていました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_grabber_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You realize the muscles of the zombie's arms are hollow, their marrow "
"replaced by a thick reddish liquid.  You wonder if the ridiculous muscle "
"mass surrounding them is the other half of a strange hydraulic system."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You spot a few flies and maggots in the corpse, their chosen carcass not "
"seeming to be very good for them, as most seem moribund."
msgstr "死骸の内部には何匹かのハエや蛆虫がいました。あまり居心地のいい棲家ではなかったようで、どの個体も死にかけています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You spot a few flies and maggots in the corpse.  Most are dead, but a few "
"seem to be able to handle eating zombie flesh."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_shadow_general>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_shadow_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You spot a few pores still weakly sputtering thin puffs of black smoke, "
"investigating them further reveals glands full of fuming black liquid linked"
" to the pores with long tubes."
msgstr ""
"まだ皮膚の一部には、黒いもやをわずかに吐き出し続ける部分が残っています。詳しく調べてみると、皮膚の毛穴には長い管が通っており、黒い液体で満たされた腺に繋がっていました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "leg_zed_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You think this decaying severed limb ends in a foot.  It's actually hard to "
"tell after the hell it's been through."
msgstr "ちぎれて朽ち果てた脚のように見えますが、この地獄のような状況でははっきりと断定もできません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_humanoid_harvest_general_deeper>"
#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_animal_harvest_general_deeper>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"You try pulling out some teeth to better analyze them, only to find they've "
"fused with the jawbone."
msgstr "より詳しく分析するために歯を抜こうとしましたが、顎の骨と融合してしまっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<zombie_harvest_hulk_general>"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Your search for the source of the creature's size has you discover a cluster"
" of glandular organs deep in the body, most of which you are unable to "
"identify."
msgstr ""
"巨大な怪物の肉体を徹底的に調べ上げ、体内の奥深くに何かの腺のような器官の集合体を見つけましたが。どんな機能をもっていたのかさっぱり分かりません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "tainted_innards_desc"
#: data/json/snippets/zombie_anatomy.json
msgid ""
"Zombie guts.  Your appetite may have been spoiled by one look at the "
"twisted, compacted tubes and sacs that form this clump of foul entrails.  "
"Why then does it make you think of frozen spaghetti and meatballs?"
msgstr ""
"ゾンビの臓物です。捻じれて縮んだ管や嚢からなる悪臭を放つ塊を一目見ただけで、食欲が減退しそうです。でも、どうして冷凍スパゲティやミートボールを連想してしまうのでしょうか？"

