#. ~ Description of vehicle part "swappable very large storage battery"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/battery.json
msgid ""
"A battery for storing electrical power, and discharging it to power "
"electrical devices built into the vehicle.  This one is mounted on a quick "
"release framework to allow it to be easily swapped, though it still weighs "
"so much that a lifting tool of some kind is necessary for most people."
