#. ~ Description of vehicle part "cloth board"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/boards.json
msgid ""
"A cloth wall.  Keeps zombies outside the vehicle and prevents people from "
"seeing through it."
msgstr "布製の壁です。ゾンビが車内に入るのを防ぎ、視界を遮ります。"

