#. ~ Description of vehicle part ""
#: data/json/vehicleparts/rotor.json
msgid ""
"A set of aerofoil helicopter rotors, when spun at high speed, they generate "
"thrust via lift."
msgstr "回転翼が付いたヘリコプター用のローターです。高速で回転することで揚力が生じて離陸します。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty military rotors"
#. ~ Description of vehicle part "small helicopter rotors"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/rotor.json
msgid ""
"A set of four military-grade helicopter rotor blades, used to provide lift "
"by rotation."
msgstr "4つセットになった、軍用ヘリコプターのローターと回転翼です。回転することで揚力が生じます。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "heavy-duty military Osprey rotors"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/rotor.json
msgid ""
"A set of three military-grade helicopter rotor blades, used to provide lift "
"by rotation."
msgstr "3つセットになった、軍用ヘリコプターのローターと回転翼です。回転することで揚力が生じます。"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/rotor.json
msgid "heavy-duty military Blackhawk rotors"
msgstr "軍用強化ローター(ブラックホーク)"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/rotor.json
msgid "heavy-duty military Osprey rotors"
msgstr "軍用強化ローター(オスプレイ)"

#. ~ Vehicle part name
#: data/json/vehicleparts/rotor.json
msgid "small helicopter rotors"
msgstr "ヘリ用小型ローター"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "leather bucket seat"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/seats.json
msgid "A leather car seat for one."
msgstr "革張りが施された一人分の座席です。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "saddle"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/seats.json
msgid "A padded wedge that you straddle, like a bicycle or motorcycle."
msgstr "自転車やバイクについているような、跨いで座る三角形のパッドです。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "cloth seat"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/seats.json
msgid "A simple fabric seat, suspended from the frame itself."
msgstr "フレーム自体に吊って固定した、シンプルな布製の座席です。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "reclining bucket seat"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/seats.json
msgid ""
"A soft seat with an adjustable backrest, making it a reasonably comfortable "
"place to sleep."
msgstr "背もたれにリクライニング機構を備えた柔らかいシートです。それなりに快適な寝床になります。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "bucket seat"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/seats.json
msgid "A soft upholstered car seat, contoured to hold one person."
msgstr "一人の人間が座れる形状になっている、柔らかい布張りの座席です。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "bench seat"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/seats.json
msgid ""
"A soft, wide seat with a high back, the kind often used in back seats or "
"older cars.  It might be a decent place to sleep."
msgstr "車両の後部座席や古い車によく見られる、幅の広い背もたれを備えた柔らかいシートです。丁度いい寝床になりそうです。"

#. ~ Description of vehicle part "steel bench"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/seats.json
msgid ""
"A steel bench with ankle and wrist restraints built in.  It looks very "
"uncomfortable."
msgstr "足首と手首に嵌める拘束具が内蔵された、鋼鉄製のベンチシートです。座り心地は非常に悪そうです。"

#. ~ Label of vehicle part variant "motor"
#: data/json/vehicleparts/seats.json
msgctxt "vpart_variants"
msgid "Motorcycle"
msgstr "オートバイ"

