#. ~ Description of "revolver speedloader"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/magazines/pistol.json
msgid ""
"A 'speedloader', a metal block capable of holding and releasing ammunition "
"to aid in loading revolvers.  Accepts 6 standard or magnum pistol "
"cartridges."
msgstr ""
"「スピードローダー」は、リボルバーの装填を補助するための、弾薬を着け外しできる金属製の部品です。一般的な拳銃弾またはマグナム弾を6発装填できます。"

#. ~ Description of magazine "pistol magazine"
#. ~ Description of "pistol magazine"
#: data/mods/Generic_Guns/magazines/pistol.json
