#. "EOC_PRE_EYES_INSECT"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_eocs/limb_changing_eocs.json
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "<insect_eye_success>"
msgstr "<insect_eye_success>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "<insect_dream>"
msgstr "<insect_dream>"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_blind>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "A sudden sharp pain in your eyes, then you are lost in the darkness."
msgstr "突然目に鋭い痛みが走り、暗闇に囚われました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_success>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"After another day of dazed mundanity you make your way back home to your dingy cellar apartment, but miss a step and fall down the stairs, landing on your face with a wet thud.  Consciousness fades, but the pain stays.  The pain, and the feeling of myriad cockroach legs running on your skin, coating your wounds in a skittering, biting cloak.\n"
"\n"
"You wake, shedding the weird apey memories, and you are stunned by a dizzying cavalcade of colors you could never have imagined before.  This is a step in the right direction, you decide, regarding your newly-expanded perspective with appreciation before the vertigo takes you."
msgstr ""
"夢の中でぼんやりとした一日を過ごし、薄汚いアパートの地下室に帰ろうとしたその時、足を踏み外して階段から落ち、べちゃりと顔面から着地しました。意識は薄れていきますが、痛みは残っています。苦痛、皮膚の上を走り回る無数のゴキブリの肢、傷口にたかられ、かじられるこそばゆい感覚。\n"
"\n"
"起床して奇妙な記憶を頭から振り払うと、そこで目に飛び込んできたのは、今まで見たこともない頭がくらくらするような極彩色の風景でした。眩暈を引き起こすより先に、新たに広がった視点に感謝し、正しい方向に進めたことを確認しました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Getting the bodybag was harder than you would have thought, and ordinary garbage bags would just not do.  You eat your fill for the last time with this mouth, undress (you won't need clothes after the change), and climb in the bag.  Closing the zipper from the inside is a challenge, but you need complete darkness for what comes now.  You wait.\n"
"And wait.\n"
"And wait.\n"
"\n"
"Could you have been wrong?  You were so sure the time was right.\n"
"You need to get out of here, but you can't move your…anything.  Do you even have anything to move?"
msgstr ""
"夢の中で、遺体袋を苦労して手に入れました。普通のゴミ袋では小さすぎたのです。この口で摂る最後の食事を味わい、服を全て脱ぎ(変化が訪れたら服は不要になります)、袋の中に入りました。内側からジッパーを閉めるのは大変でしたが、何とかして完全な暗闇を作り出しました。そして待ちます。\n"
"更に待ちます。\n"
"更に待ちます。\n"
"\n"
"何かを間違えたのでしょうか？確かにその時が来たと確信したのですが。\n"
"袋の外に出るべきですが...身体が動きません。身体はどうやって動かすものでしたっけ？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "More of the <color_yellow> good nectar</color>.  That's what you need."
msgstr "あの<color_yellow>蜜</color>がもっと必要です。更に摂取する必要があります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_blind>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "Something snaps behind your eyes, and the world turns black."
msgstr "視覚が急に失われ、世界が真っ暗になりました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_glare>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "The lights grow uncomfortably bright."
msgstr "不快なほど眩しい光に照らされています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_stun>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "The world starts turning wildly, and you stumble."
msgstr "世界が激しく回転し始め、ふらつきました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You and your sisters have worked diligently, made your home safe and "
"prosperous.  You felt so proud.  But lately Mother has been growing slower, "
"and more cells are empty than with brood.  You see hesitation on your "
"sisters as well…does the hive need you to step up?  Would they follow?  "
"Could you defeat Her?"
msgstr ""
"夢の中で姉妹と共に熱心に働き、安全で豊かな家を作り上げていました。とても誇らしい気分です。しかし、近頃母の体は衰え、子供たちの寝床も空室が増え始めています。姉妹たちも戸惑っていますが...家を守るため、一歩踏み出すべきなのでしょうか？皆はついてきてくれるでしょうか？母を倒せるでしょうか？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "You can't be expected to metamorphose with so little.  You need more."
msgstr "変化は進みそうにありません。変化を促すものがもっと必要です。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You could build a hive, if only you were better.  What are you missing?"
msgstr "もっと上手くいけば巣作りを始められたかもしれません。何が足りないのでしょうか？"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a dark, damp place permeated by the smell of sawdust.  You feel"
" like this is all you've ever known, each bend in the walls and scratch on "
"the floor your handiwork.  It feels like home, but deep down you know that "
"you'll have to change and emerge into the dangerous, light-battered outside."
msgstr ""
"夢の中で、木屑の匂いが充満する暗く湿った場所に籠っていました。壁がたわみ、床にヒビが入る度に、自分が知っていた世界の狭さを実感します。ここは確かに心地よい家のようなものですが、変化し、光が降り注ぐ危険な外の世界へ出なければならないことも分かっています。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_2_success>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You dream of a throbbing headache, and the feeling of an imminent molt.  You find a suitable recess, freeze in place and **push**, trying to rip your old exoskeleton up with you pressure of your new armor but nothing happens.  All the pressure seems to well up into your head, and finally you feel a wet snap and a shower of too-warm mammal ichor on your feelers.\n"
"\n"
"You wake up in a puddle of your own blood under your head, a puddle you can see despite looking straight up.  It will be some time before your eyes' crystals harden properly, but already the colors are even richer than they were before, and the world seems somehow sluggish."
msgstr ""
"夢の中で頭痛にうなされ、脱皮が間近に迫っているような感覚に襲われました。適当な凹みを見つけ、そこに嵌って固まり肉を**押しつけ**、新しい外皮の圧力で古い皮を引き裂こうとしました。しかし、中々変化は訪れません。あらゆる圧が頭に集結し、やっとのことで、湿った音、触角に当たる哺乳類の熱い体液を、痛みと共に感じられました。\n"
"\n"
"目覚めると、頭が血溜まりに濡れています。仰向けになって上を見ているにもかかわらず、血溜まりが見えるのです。水晶体がしっかり固まるまでにはもう少し時間が掛かるでしょうが、周囲の色彩は既に以前より豊かに感じられ、世界がどこか緩慢としている気がします。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You have stuffed yourself to bursting for the fourth time today, but your "
"hunger doesn't abate.  You would need to escape your too-small skin to be "
"able to eat enough, you're sure of it.  Take the knife to one of the stretch"
" marks on your back, and part the skin - it springs to the side readily and "
"with no pain.  You work your way down your sides, changing the knife between"
" hands as needed and free your <color_light_green>new skin</color> from its "
"fleshy prison."
msgstr ""
"夢の中で、腹がはち切れそうなほど食べ物を食べました。食事は今日で4度目ですが、空腹感は治まりません。もっとたくさん食べるには、窮屈すぎる皮膚を何とかする必要があります。背中の筋の一つにナイフを当て、肌を裂きました。痛みもなく、皮膚が裂けていきます。必要に応じてナイフを持つ手を替えながら、脇腹を下にずらし、新しい皮膚を肉の牢獄から解放しました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "You long for a safe, dark place to complete your change."
msgstr "完全に変化するには、安全で暗い場所を確保する必要があります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You need enough insect primer and catalyst in your system while you are "
"sleeping to complete your change."
msgstr "完全に変化するには、変異原触媒と虫の変異原プライマーを十分に摂取して眠る必要があります。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "You need the right nectar, otherwise you will never be queen."
msgstr "適切な蜜がなければ頂点には立てません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_failure>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"You won't be able to change without enough catalyst, the right primer and "
"being asleep."
msgstr "十分な変異原触媒、適切な変異原プライマー、そして睡眠がなければ、変化することはできません。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<eyes_blind>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid "Your eyes fail you, and everything turns dark."
msgstr "視界が機能しなくなり、何もかもが真っ暗になりました。"

#. ~ Snippet in category "<insect_eye_dream>"
#: data/mods/Limb_WIP/mutation_snippets.json
msgid ""
"Your try going about your day as usual, but your vision seems to dim every "
"few seconds for no reason.  You reach to your eyes in annoyance and feel a "
"disgusting fleshy membrane periodically covering them with a squeaky, wet "
"motion.  You grasp them tightly and pull hard despite the pain until they "
"tear off with a shower of red ichor coating your eyes.  You lick it away, "
"and finally you can see clearly."
msgstr ""
"夢の中でいつも通りの一日を送ろうとしていたのに、何故か視界に数秒ごとに暗闇が入り込みます。イライラして目元を触ってみると、不快な肉の膜が定期的に目玉を覆い隠しているようです。二つの肉の膜をしっかり掴み、痛みも気にせず強く引っ張ると、赤い体液のシャワーと共に膜はちぎれました。目玉の表面を舐めると、ようやく視界が晴れました。"

