#. ~ Description of MOD "No Monsters"
#: data/mods/Only_Wildlife/modinfo.json
msgid ""
"Removes all monsters from the game, save for those in the WILDLIFE category."
msgstr "野生動物以外の全モンスターを削除します。"

#. ~ EOC selection title in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_2"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Adjust Return Obelisk Behavior"
msgstr "帰還のオベリスクの機能調整"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_warpspell_adjuster_4"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"All additional returning options removed.  You can use the Difficulty "
"Adjuster if you wish to change your setting at any time."
msgstr "追加の帰還手段は全て削除されました。難易度調整装置を使用すれば、いつでも難易度を変更できます。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_difficulty_DEFAULTS"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"All difficulty settings set to default.  You can speak to the Heart of the "
"Island to change these at any time."
msgstr "難易度は初期設定になっています。空島の核を調べることで、難易度をいつでも変更できます。"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Casual"
msgstr "簡単"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_difficulty0"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Difficulty set to Casual.  You can speak to the Heart of the Island to "
"change this at any time."
msgstr "難易度はCasualに設定されています。空島の核を調べることで、難易度をいつでも変更できます。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_difficulty2"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Difficulty set to Hard.  You can speak to the Heart of the Island to change "
"this at any time."
msgstr "難易度はHardに設定されています。空島の核を調べることで、難易度をいつでも変更できます。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_difficulty3"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Difficulty set to Impossible.  You can speak to the Heart of the Island to "
"change this at any time."
msgstr "難易度はImpossibleに設定されています。空島の核を調べることで、難易度をいつでも変更できます。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_difficulty1"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Difficulty set to Normal.  You can speak to the Heart of the Island to "
"change this at any time."
msgstr "難易度はNormalに設定されています。空島の核を調べることで、難易度をいつでも変更できます。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_claritystone"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Displays statistics on how your expeditions have gone so far and how your "
"warp sickness works."
msgstr "これまでの遠征の進捗状況と転移酔いの動作に関する統計を表示します。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_claritystone"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Displays your current progress on constructions."
msgstr "空島での建設の進行状況を表示します。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_claritystone"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Displays your current progress on permanent upgrades."
msgstr "空島を恒久的に強化するアップグレードの進行状況を表示します。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_buildcheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Entrance: <global_val:skyisland_build_base> of 1\n"
"Main Room: <global_val:skyisland_build_bigroom> of 4"
msgstr ""
"エントランス: <global_val:skyisland_build_base> / 1\n"
"メインルーム: <global_val:skyisland_build_bigroom> / 4"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in else statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_skyisland_versioncheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Error.  Update not applied.\n"
"\n"
"Reason: Cannot update while on expedition.  Return home, save and close your game, and try loading this save again."
msgstr ""
"エラーが発生しました。更新が適用されませんでした。\n"
"\n"
"原因: 地表遠征中はデータを更新できません。空島に帰還し、ゲームを保存して一度終了し、再度ロードしてください。"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Get nothing"
msgstr "何も習得しない"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Get the Warp Home spell"
msgstr "ワープ・ホームの呪文を習得"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Get the Warped Return spell"
msgstr "ワープド・リターンの呪文を習得"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Get the Warped Skyward Beacon recipe"
msgstr "空島帰還ビーコンの製作レシピを習得"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Hard"
msgstr "困難"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Impossible"
msgstr "不可能"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"In Casual difficulty, time limits are more relaxed.\n"
"Warp pulses occur every 30 minutes.  This means warp sickness sets in after 4 hours of being earthside, and disintegration at 6 hours.  You will have more time for activities and reaching the extract should generally not be a problem."
msgstr ""
"難易度「簡単」では、時間制限が通常より緩和されます。\n"
"転移パルスは30分ごとに発生します。つまり、地表に降り立ってから4時間後に転移酔いが発生し、6時間後に肉体が崩壊する、ということです。行動できる時間が増えるため、余裕をもって物資を集められます。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"In Hard difficulty, time limits are strict.\n"
"Warp pulses occur every 10 minutes.  This means warp sickness sets in after only 1 hour 20 minutes of being earthside, and disintegration at 2 hours.  You will have much less time to spare and must make getting to the exit your immediate priority."
msgstr ""
"難易度「困難」では、時間制限が通常より厳しくなります。\n"
"転移パルスは10分ごとに発生します。つまり、地表に降り立ってから1時間20分後に転移酔いが発生し、2時間後に肉体が崩壊する、ということです。時間の余裕はほとんどなくなるため、帰還地点に到達することを最優先に考える必要があります。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"In Impossible difficulty, time limits are extremely tight.\n"
"Warp pulses occur every 5 minutes.  This means warp sickness sets in after only 40 minutes of being earthside, and disintegration at 1 hour.  Reaching the extract alive will take all the time you can spare, and warp sickness will be common.  You will not be given mercy!"
msgstr ""
"難易度「不可能」では、時間制限が通常より遥かに厳しくなります。\n"
"転移パルスは5分ごとに発生します。これは、地表に降り立ってからわずか40分後には転移酔いが発生し、1時間後には肉体が崩壊する、ということです。物資を集めて生き残るだけの余裕すらほとんどなく、転移酔いの症状も頻繁に起こります。情け容赦ない難易度です！"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"In Normal Difficulty, pulses occur every 15 minutes.  This means on every expedition, you will have 2 hours to explore, fight, loot, and find the exit before warp sickness sets in, and 3 hours total before disintegration begins.\n"
"This is the intended way to play.  Getting to the exit is not a cakewalk, but you should have time to explore while earthside."
msgstr ""
"難易度「普通」では、転移パルスが15分ごとに発生します。つまり、地表に降り立ってから2時間後に転移酔いが発生し、3時間後に肉体が崩壊するので、その間に探索や戦闘、物資集めをすることになります。\n"
"これが本来想定している難易度です。帰還地点に到達するのは簡単ではなく、探索に費やす時間を考えて行動する必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_progresscheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Island Rank: <global_val:islandrank_readable> of 2\n"
"Expedition Lengths: <global_val:longerraids> of 2\n"
"Expedition Starts: <global_val:totalstarts> of 5\n"
"Bonus Pulses: <global_val:bonuspulses> of 4\n"
"Target reveal distance: <global_val:scoutingdistancetargets> of 10\n"
"Landing reveal distance: <global_val:scoutingdistancelanding> of 24\n"
"Warpcloak duration in seconds: <global_val:invistime> of 120\n"
"Slaughter missions unlocked: <global_val:slaughterunlocked> of 1\n"
"Exits per expedition: <global_val:totalexits> of 3\n"
"Missions per expedition: <global_val:bonusmissions> of 3\n"
"Mission tiers unlocked: <global_val:hardmissions_readable> of 3"
msgstr ""
"島のランク: <global_val:islandrank_readable> / 2\n"
"遠征期間: <global_val:longerraids> / 2\n"
"遠征開始地点: <global_val:totalstarts> / 5\n"
"追加転移パルス: <global_val:bonuspulses> / 4\n"
"ミッション目標表示範囲: <global_val:scoutingdistancetargets> / 10\n"
"開始地点表示範囲: <global_val:scoutingdistancelanding> / 24\n"
"非実体化持続時間(秒): <global_val:invistime> / 120\n"
"殺戮ミッション解禁: <global_val:slaughterunlocked> / 1\n"
"各遠征の帰還地点: <global_val:totalexits> / 3\n"
"各遠征のミッション: <global_val:bonusmissions> / 3\n"
"解禁済ミッションレベル: <global_val:hardmissions_readable> / 3"

#. ~ Fail message in teleportation in effect in EoC "EOC_initiate_randomport"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "It seems the portal couldn't find a valid location."
msgstr "ポータルが有効な位置を見つけられなかったようです。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_skyisland_versionupdate"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Milestone 1 applied.  You have been given a Heartseed.  Activate it while on"
" your island to create the new Heart of the Island.  Interact with the Heart"
" to access new upgrade options."
msgstr ""
"Milestone "
"1が適用されました。ハートシードを入手しました。空島でハートシードを使用し、新たに空島の核を設置しましょう。空島の核を調べることで、アップグレード設定にアクセスできます。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_youdied"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Moments before your last breath leaves your body, the mote of warp essence "
"on you jolts with a brilliant energy.  Its thin filament immediately snaps "
"tight, reeling you home faster than you can process what it was that just "
"saved your life.  The mote is spent, but you arrive home alive and well."
msgstr ""
"人生最後の息を吐く直前に、転移のエッセンスが輝きを放ち震えました。光の粒子はひときわ強く輝き、肉体を拠点へと転移し、やがて力尽きたように消えました。小片は失いましたが、無事に帰還することができました。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_return_OM_teleport_item"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Now teleporting back home.  Please wait…"
msgstr "転移中です。しばらくお待ちください..."

#. ~ EOC selection title in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Select Emergency Return Options"
msgstr "緊急帰還手段を選択"

#. ~ EOC selection title in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Select a Difficulty"
msgstr "難易度を選択"

#. ~ EOC option name in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_2"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "Self Only"
msgstr "所持アイテムのみ"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_2"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Set the behavior of the return obelisk.\n"
"With this option, everything in the room with you will return to your sky island.  Getting resources will generally not be a problem as long as you make it to the extraction point."
msgstr ""
"帰還のオベリスクの機能を設定します。\n"
"オベリスクの部屋にある全てのアイテムを空島に持ち帰ります。帰還地点にさえ辿り着けば、物資集めに困ることはありません。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_2"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Set the behavior of the return obelisk.\n"
"With this option, if you have a warp vortex token with you, everything in the room with you will return to your sky island.  Otherwise, only what you are carrying on your person will return with you.  You may have to make difficult choices about what to bring back."
msgstr ""
"帰還のオベリスクの機能を設定します。\n"
"所持している渦流トークンと引き換えに、オベリスクの部屋にある全てのアイテムを空島に持ち帰ることができます。過流トークンがない場合は、所持アイテムだけ持ち帰ります。アイテムを取捨選択しなければいけないこともあるでしょう。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_2"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Set the behavior of the return obelisk.\n"
"With this option, only what you are carrying on your person will return with you.  You will always have to make difficult choices about what to bring back."
msgstr ""
"帰還のオベリスクの機能を設定します。\n"
"所持しているアイテムのみ空島に持ち帰ります。常にアイテムの取捨選択を強いられます。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Set the possibility of returning home without the extraction point.\n"
"With this option, you will receive a recipe to craft a Warped Skyward Beacon.  This costs 5 warp shards and when used, casts the Warped Return spell."
msgstr ""
"帰還地点に到達せずに帰還する手段を設定します。\n"
"空島帰還ビーコンを製作するレシピを習得します。製作材料として転移の欠片が5個必要で、製作したアイテムを使用するとワープド・リターンの呪文が発動します。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Set the possibility of returning home without the extraction point.\n"
"With this option, you will receive a spell that will return you home at any time by paying 1 warp shard.  It takes one minute to cast.  You may not be near any enemies when the spell is successfully cast or it will have no effect."
msgstr ""
"帰還地点に到達せずに帰還する手段を設定します。\n"
"いつでも転移の欠片を1個消費して帰還できる呪文を習得します。呪文の詠唱には1分掛かります。呪文の発動に失敗することもあり、成功しても周囲に敵がいると帰還できません。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Set the possibility of returning home without the extraction point.\n"
"With this option, you will receive a spell that will return you home at any time for no cost.  It takes one minute to cast.  Using this will remove most of the challenge of the mod."
msgstr ""
"帰還地点に到達せずに帰還する手段を設定します。\n"
"いつでもコストなしで帰還できる呪文を習得します。呪文の詠唱には1分掛かります。この呪文を習得すると、このMODの難易度が著しく簡単になります。"

#. ~ EOC option description in effect in EoC "EOC_difficultycheck_3"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Set the possibility of returning home without the extraction point.\n"
"With this option, your only choice is to find the extraction point.  Good luck!"
msgstr ""
"帰還地点に到達せずに帰還する手段を設定します。\n"
"他の手段などありません。帰還地点への到達だけが唯一の帰還手段です。頑張って！"

#. ~ Description of spell "Warp Home"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Take a full minute of concentration and return to the safety of your home "
"base."
msgstr "1分間精神を集中させ、安全な拠点へ帰還します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Warped Return"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"Take a full minute of concentration, pay one warp shard, and return to the "
"safety of your home base."
msgstr "転移の欠片を1個消費して1分間精神を集中させ、安全な拠点へ帰還します。"

#. ~ Description of spell "Warp Home Real"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid "The actual warp home spell.  It's a bug if you have it."
msgstr "ワープ・ホームの副次呪文です。通常は表示されません。"

#. ~ Player message in false effect in EoC "EOC_healall"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"The effect is wasted and you don't feel any better.  You have to be in your "
"sanctuary to be healed by this!"
msgstr "肉体は回復せず、何の効果もないようです。癒しの効果を得るには、空島で使用する必要があります。"

#. ~ Player message in effect in EoC "EOC_HEAL_NEWBIE"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"The island's grace heals you at no charge.\n"
"This effect will only be free until you have survived 10 expeditions."
msgstr ""
"島の恵みが無償で肉体を癒します。\n"
"10回の遠征を生き延びると、以降は対価が必要になります。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in effect in EoC
#. "EOC_skyisland_versionupdate"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"The stat stone, healing salve, difficulty adjuster, and similar items are removed.  These options are instead accessed by speaking to the Heart of the Island.\n"
"\n"
"Warped bags and quickheals are obsolete.  If you already have any, they can still be used, or salvaged for a refund of warp shards.\n"
"\n"
"Any further changes are documented in the patch notes."
msgstr ""
"遠征記録、温情の軟膏、難易度調整装置、および同様のアイテムは削除されます。これらの機能には、空島の核を調べることでアクセスできるようになりました。\n"
"\n"
"不思議なバッグと急速回復薬は今後は生成されません。既に持っているものに限り引き続き使用できますが、転移の欠片と交換することも可能です。\n"
"\n"
"その他の変更内容はパッチノートをご確認ください。"

#. ~ Player message in nested effect in then statement in false effect in EoC
#. "EOC_HEAL_NEWBIE"
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"The warp shards you were holding dissipate into a mist and swirl in tiny "
"vortices around your body.  The price is paid, and you are healed."
msgstr "転移の欠片が肉体の周囲を飛び回り、やがて霧散しました。対価を支払い、体力が回復しました。"

#. ~ Query message shown in a popup
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
msgid ""
"This will teleport you back to your sky island.  Any items inside the room "
"will be teleported home alongside you.  Are you ready to leave?"
msgstr "空島に転移します。室内のアイテムも全て一緒に転移されます。出発する準備はできましたか？"

#. ~ Query message shown in a popup
#: data/mods/Sky_Island/EOCs.json
