#. ~ Description of furniture "wild beans"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"A mess of vines strangling a dead bush.  There are pods and tiny white "
"flowers growing along them."
msgstr "枯れ草に蔓が絡みついており、あちこちに莢と白く小さな花をつけています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wild cannabis"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "A riotous snarl of cannabis, all stalks and five-pointed leaves."
msgstr "茎の先端に5枚の小葉がまとまって生えている、青々と茂った大麻草です。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wild pumpkins"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"A tangled mess of hairy vines and pale yellow trumpet flowers.  Is that a "
"pumpkin hidden in this mess?"
msgstr "黄色いラッパ型の花と産毛が生えた蔓が絡み合っています。どこかにカボチャが実をつけているでしょうか？"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wild sugar beet"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "Sugar beet plant, growing wild without human touch."
msgstr "野生化したサトウダイコンが生い茂っています。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "wild corn"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid ""
"Tall green stalks with what looks like hair growing out of nodes along its "
"length.  You're pretty sure this is corn."
msgstr "背が高い緑色の植物の節々に、長い毛を生やした実がなっています。これは間違いなくトウモロコシですね。"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "wild beans"
msgstr "野生豆"

