msgid "wild corn"
msgstr "トウモロコシ"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "wild cotton"
msgstr "ワタ"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "wild pumpkins"
msgstr "カボチャ"

#. ~ Furniture name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-flora.json
msgid "wild sugar beet"
msgstr "サトウダイコン"

#. ~ Description of furniture "bulletin board"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid ""
"A crude approximation of a 'real' bulletin board.  Good for pinning various "
"notices for other survivors to read."
msgstr "「本物の」掲示板に似せて作った、簡素な板です。他の生存者に読んでもらう様々な連絡事項を張り出せそうです。"

#. ~ Description of furniture "fermenting vat"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "A sealable vat for fermenting vinegar and various alcoholic brews."
msgstr "酢や酒を発酵させるための密封可能な大桶です。"

#. ~ Construction group name
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/furniture-tools.json
msgid "Build Innawood Bulletin Board"
msgstr "掲示板を設置する(Innawood)"

#. ~ Description of terrain "pavement"
#: data/mods/innawood/furniture_and_terrain/terrain-floors-outdoors.json
msgid ""
"A segment of asphalt, slowly degrading from cracks, frost heaves and lack of"
" maintenance."
msgstr "アスファルトの一部は氷結や整備不足からゆっくりとひび割れ、劣化し始めています。"

#. ~ Profession name for female
#: data/mods/innawood/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_female"
msgid "Book Hating"
msgstr "読書嫌い"

#. ~ Profession name for male
#: data/mods/innawood/hobbies.json
msgctxt "profession_male"
msgid "Book Hating"
msgstr "読書嫌い"

#. ~ Description of profession "Book Hating" for female
#: data/mods/innawood/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_female"
msgid ""
"Reading is for nerds!  You've managed to make hatred of the written word a "
"central part of your identity.  Or, perhaps, you have a barrier that makes "
"books additionally challenging and frustrating for you.  Whatever the "
"reason, boring books are more boring, and you can't have fun by reading "
"books."
msgstr ""
"読書なんてオタクのすることです！文章を憎むことがアイデンティティの柱になっています。あるいは、読書が困難だったり、途中で挫折してしまうような障害を抱えているのかもしれません。理由はともかく、本を読んでも楽しく感じず、つまらない本は更につまらなく感じます。"

#. ~ Description of profession "Book Hating" for male
#: data/mods/innawood/hobbies.json
msgctxt "prof_desc_male"
msgid ""
"Reading is for nerds!  You've managed to make hatred of the written word a "
"central part of your identity.  Or, perhaps, you have a barrier that makes "
"books additionally challenging and frustrating for you.  Whatever the "
"reason, boring books are more boring, and you can't have fun by reading "
"books."
msgstr ""
"読書なんてオタクのすることです！文章を憎むことがアイデンティティの柱になっています。あるいは、読書が困難だったり、途中で挫折してしまうような障害を抱えているのかもしれません。理由はともかく、本を読んでも楽しく感じず、つまらない本は更につまらなく感じます。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift transformer"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A bundle of cables around an iron core.  Useful for controlling voltage."
msgstr "ケーブルを巻いた鉄芯です。電圧を制御するのに役立ちます。"

#. ~ Description of "makeshift hand-crank charger"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/electronics.json
msgid "A makeshift hand-powered battery charger based on homopolar generator."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "electrolysis kit"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/electronics.json
msgid ""
"A set of wiring and electrodes for applying a direct current, usually to a "
"liquid.  Useful for crafting.  Load with a storage battery or 12V vehicle "
"battery to use."
msgstr ""
"一般的には液体に直流電圧を印加するために使う、配線と電極のセットです。アイテム製作材料として使います。使用するには、蓄電池か12Vの自動車用バッテリーを装填する必要があります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/electronics.json
msgid "makeshift hand-crank charger"
msgid_plural "makeshift hand-crank chargers"
msgstr[0] "手回し充電器"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/electronics.json
msgid "makeshift transformer"
msgid_plural "makeshift transformers"
msgstr[0] "簡易変圧器"

#. ~ Description of "fresh honeydew"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/food_other.json
msgid "Turgid, but still liquid honeydew, fresh from the… bug."
msgstr "虫から採取したばかりの、とろみのある液体です。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/food_other.json
msgid "fresh honeydew"
msgid_plural "fresh honeydew"
msgstr[0] "甘露液"

#. ~ Description of "torch"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a large stick, wrapped in rags that are soaked with a flammable "
"material.  It is burning, producing plenty of light."
msgstr "可燃性の液体を染みこませてある布を巻きつけた棒です。燃え盛る炎が辺りを照らします。"

#. ~ Description of "clay oil lamp"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is a specialized small clay container with a wick, an ancient form of "
"oil lamp.  Unlike newer designs, it isn't windproof, so the flame is likely "
"to be extinguished if exposed to wind; better use it indoors.  It does not "
"provide much light, but lasts a long time.  It is lit, consuming oil and "
"providing light.  Use it to extinguish the flame."
msgstr ""
"オイルランプの燃焼に特化した、芯が入っている小さく古風な土器です。現代のランプと違って風が吹くと火が消えてしまうため、室内で使った方がよさそうです。光量は多くありませんが、火が長持ちします。現在火がついており、オイルを消費しています。使用すると火を消します。"

#. ~ Description of "oil lamp"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/lighting.json
msgid ""
"This is an oil fueled lamp.  It does not provide much light, but it lasts a "
"long time.  It is turned on.  Use it to turn it off."
msgstr "オイルランプです。光は弱いですが、長持ちします。ランプは点いています。使用すると明かりを消します。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/lighting.json
msgid "oil lamp"
msgid_plural "oil lamps"
msgstr[0] "オイルランプ"

#. ~ Description of "birchbark bandage"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/medical_primitive.json
msgid ""
"A small roll of birchbark with cord, to tie around wounds to help stop "
"bleeding and protect from dirt.  It's better than nothing."
msgstr ""
"シラカバの樹皮を小さく丸めたものに紐を付けただけの包帯です。傷口を覆って止血や保護に使いますが、何もしないよりはマシ程度の効果しかありません。"

#. ~ Description of "salved birchbark bandage"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/medical_primitive.json
msgid ""
"Birchbark bandages with added garlic salve.  They're better for wounds but "
"not as good as real bandages."
msgstr "ニンニクの軟膏を塗ったシラカバ包帯です。傷口の保護に役立ちますが、本物の包帯には劣ります。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/medical_primitive.json
msgid "birchbark bandage"
msgid_plural "birchbark bandages"
msgstr[0] "シラカバ包帯"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/medical_primitive.json
msgid "salved birchbark bandage"
msgid_plural "salved birchbark bandages"
msgstr[0] "軟膏付きシラカバ包帯"

#. ~ Description of "glue"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/misc.json
msgid "A thick, goopy glue that cures fast."
msgstr ""

#. ~ Description of "slow-sand water filter"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/misc.json
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"An improvised water filter made from a clay hydria filled with a layer of "
"sand and a layer of gravel.  It can be used to remove particulates and some "
"pathogens from water, but it is not 100% effective."
msgstr ""

