#. ~ Description of "blacksmith repair kit"
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_workshop.json
msgid ""
"This is a set of tools to repair damaged metal tools and armor.  It uses "
"charcoal, contained in a small clay vessel, to heat the part and make it "
"easier to work."
msgstr "傷ついた金属製の道具や鎧を修復するための道具一式です。小さな陶器に入った炭で修復部分を加熱し、作業効率を高めます。"

#. ~ Item name
#: data/mods/innawood/items/tool_workshop.json
