#. ~ Description of "chunk of cassiterite"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of cassiterite, an ore of tin.  It only needs to be smelted "
"into a usable form."
msgstr "未加工の大きな錫の塊です。精錬すれば使えるようになります。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of cinnabar "
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of cinnabar, an ore of mercury.  It is also the historic "
"source for vermilion pigment."
msgstr "水銀の鉱石である、大きな辰砂の塊です。古くから朱色の顔料として使われてきました。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of native copper"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of copper, in its native state.  It only needs to be worked "
"into a more usable shape."
msgstr "未加工の大きな銅の塊です。使いやすい形状に加工しましょう。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of galena"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of galena, a lead ore with small amounts of silver.  It only "
"needs to be smelted into a usable form."
msgstr "未加工の大きな方鉛鉱の塊です。鉛の鉱石ですが、わずかに銀が含まれています。精錬すれば使えるようになります。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of hematite"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of hematite, an ore of iron.  It only needs to be smelted into"
" a usable form."
msgstr "未加工の大きな酸化鉄の塊です。精錬すれば使えるようになります。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of magnetite"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of magnetite, a ferrimagnetic oxide of iron.  It can be "
"magnetized to become a permanent magnet itself."
msgstr "未加工の大きな酸化鉄の塊です。精錬すれば使えるようになります。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of native aluminum"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of native aluminum, which would have been priceless before "
"other ways to obtain aluminum were invented.  It needs to be cast into an "
"ingot."
msgstr "未加工の大きなアルミニウムの塊です。アルミニウムの製造法が発明されるまでは、貴重な鉱石でした。アルミ鋳塊に加工する必要があります。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of native gold"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of native gold, a rare find.  It only needs to be molded into "
"a more usable shape."
msgstr "珍しい未加工の大きな金の塊です。使いやすい形状に加工しましょう。"

#. ~ Description of "chunk of native silver"
#: data/mods/innawood/mining/items/ore.json
msgid ""
"A large chunk of silver, in its native state.  It only needs to be molded "
"into a more usable shape."
msgstr "未加工の大きな銀の塊です。使いやすい形状に加工しましょう。"

