#, c-format
msgid "Press [<color_yellow>%s</color>] to view and edit keybindings."
msgstr "[<color_yellow>%s</color>] キー割当の表示と編集。"

#: src/construction.cpp:1072 src/iexamine.cpp:4532
msgid "It is too dark to construct right now."
msgstr "暗すぎて建設できません。"

#: src/construction.cpp:1085
msgid "You can't build that!"
msgstr "それは建設できません！"

#: src/construction.cpp:1338
msgid "Construct where?"
msgstr "建設する方向を選択してください"

#: src/construction.cpp:1375
msgid ""
"There is already an unfinished construction there, examine it to continue "
"working on it."
msgstr "その地点には未完成の建設があります。調べると建設を再開します。"

#: src/construction.cpp:1445
#, c-format
msgid "%s assists you with the work…"
msgstr "%sが作業を手伝ってくれました..."

#: src/construction.cpp:1448
#, c-format
msgid "%s watches you work…"
msgstr "%sは作業を眺めています..."

#: src/construction.cpp:1497
#, c-format
msgid "%s finished construction: %s."
msgstr "建設完了(%s): %s"

#: src/construction.cpp:1742
msgid ""
"You feel relieved after providing last rites for this human being, whose "
"name is lost in the Cataclysm."
msgstr "大変動で亡くなった人物の、人生の最後を飾る儀式を終えられたことに安堵しました。"

#: src/construction.cpp:1744
msgid "You bury remains of a human, whose name is lost in the Cataclysm."
msgstr "大変動で亡くなった人物の遺体を埋葬しました。"

#: src/construction.cpp:1751
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You feel sadness, but also relief after providing last rites for %s, whose "
"name you will keep in your memory."
msgstr "悲しみもありますが、%sのための最後の儀式を無事に終えられたことに安堵しています。"

#: src/construction.cpp:1755
#, c-format
msgid ""
"You bury remains of %s, who joined uncounted masses perished in the "
"Cataclysm."
msgstr "大変動で失われた数多の命の一つとなった%sを埋葬しました。"

#: src/construction.cpp:1764
msgid "Inscribe something on the grave?"
msgstr "墓に文字を刻みますか？"

#: src/construction.cpp:1768
msgid ""
"Unfortunately you don't have anything sharp to place an inscription on the "
"grave."
msgstr "残念ながら、墓に文字を刻める鋭い道具を所持していません。"

#: src/construction.cpp:1796 src/veh_interact.cpp:2074
msgid "Enter new vehicle name:"
msgstr "車両の新しい名前を入力して下さい:"

#: src/construction.cpp:1800
msgid "Car"
msgstr "自動車"

#: src/construction.cpp:1842
msgid "Also reveal all nearby wirings?"
msgstr ""

#: src/construction.cpp:1898 src/construction.cpp:1935
#, c-format
msgid "That %s can not be disassembled!"
msgstr "%sを分解できません！"

#: src/construction.cpp:1906 src/construction.cpp:1947
#, c-format
msgid "The %s is disassembled."
msgstr "%sは分解されています。"

#: src/construction.cpp:1941
#, c-format
msgid "That %s can not be disassembled, since there is furniture above it."
msgstr "%sの上に設置物があるため分解できません。"

#: src/construction.cpp:1982
msgid "The rock feels much warmer than normal.  Proceed?"
msgstr "岩が熱をもっています。続けますか？"

#: src/construction.cpp:1986
msgid "You just tunneled into lava!"
msgstr "溶岩に掘り進みました！"

#: src/construction.cpp:1996
msgid "You dig into a preexisting space, and improvise a ladder."
msgstr "既にある空間に掘り進み、即席の梯子を掛けました。"

#: src/construction.cpp:1998
msgid "You dig a stairway, adding sturdy timbers and a rope for safety."
msgstr "階段を作り、木材とロープで安全に登り降りできるようにしました。"

#: src/construction.cpp:2000
msgid "You drill out a passage, heading deeper underground."
msgstr "地中へ続く道を掘り当てました。"

#: src/construction.cpp:2017
msgid "Something crawls out of the coffin!"
msgstr "棺の中から何かが這い出しました！"

#: src/construction.cpp:2059
msgid "The rock overhead feels hot.  You decide *not* to mine magma."
msgstr "頭上の岩が異常に熱くなっています。マグマに掘り進むのはやめておきました。"

#: src/construction.cpp:2067
msgid "The rock above is rather damp.  You decide *not* to mine water."
msgstr "頭上の岩が濡れています。水中に掘り進むのはやめておきました。"

#: src/construction.cpp:2080
msgid "You drill out a passage, heading for the surface."
msgstr "地上へ続く道を掘り当てました。"

#: src/construction.cpp:2100
msgid "After boarding up the window the curtains and curtain rod are left."
msgstr "窓を板張りし、カーテンやカーテンロッドを取り外しました。"

#: src/construction.cpp:2112
msgid "You gather some clay."
msgstr "粘土を集めました。"

#: src/construction.cpp:2114
msgid "You gather some sand."
msgstr "砂を集めました。"

#: src/construction.cpp:2117
msgid "You gather some materials."
msgstr "素材を集めました。"

#: src/construction.cpp:2208
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Deconstructing the %s will yield:\n"
"%s\n"
"You feel you might also learn something about %s.\n"
"Really deconstruct?"
msgstr ""

#: src/construction.cpp:2212
#, c-format
msgid ""
"Deconstructing the %s will yield:\n"
"%s\n"
"Really deconstruct?"
msgstr ""
"%sの分解結果：\n"
"%s\n"
"本当に分解しますか？"

#. ~ Sound of a shovel digging a pit at work!
#: src/construction.cpp:2245
msgid "hsh!"
msgstr "ザクッ！"

#: src/construction.cpp:2258
msgid "Would you really touch the sacred resting place of the dead?"
msgstr "本当に神聖なる死者の寝床を暴きますか？"

#: src/construction.cpp:2259
msgid "Exhuming a grave is really against your beliefs."
msgstr "墓暴きは信条に反する行為です。"

#: src/construction.cpp:2269
msgid "Exhuming a grave is fun now, when there is no one to object."
msgstr "墓暴きを楽しんでも、もはや誰にも非難されません。"

#: src/construction.cpp:2272
msgid "You wonder if you dig up anything useful."
msgstr "役に立つものを掘り当てられるとは思えません。"

#: src/construction.cpp:2275
msgid "Exhuming this grave is utterly disgusting!"
msgstr "墓暴きなんて、まったくもって嫌な作業です！"

#: src/construction.cpp:2286
msgid "You cannot build there!"
msgstr "その場所には建設できません！"

#: src/construction.cpp:2291
msgid "You cannot deconstruct this!"
msgstr "これは分解できません！"

#: src/construction.cpp:2589 src/iuse.cpp:4514
msgid "Time to complete: "
msgstr "完了時間: "

#: src/consumption.cpp:808 src/consumption.cpp:827
msgid "That doesn't look edible."
msgstr "食べられそうにありません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:823
msgid "That doesn't look edible to you."
msgstr "食べられそうにありません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:832
msgid "That doesn't look edible in its current form."
msgstr "この状態では食べられません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:837
msgid "This is full of dirt after being on the ground."
msgstr "地面に置いたアイテムが汚れています。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:849 src/creature.cpp:471 src/iuse_actor.cpp:1592
#: src/iuse_actor.cpp:2255 src/iuse_actor.cpp:2382 src/iuse_actor.cpp:2561
msgid "You can't do that while underwater."
msgstr "水中でその行動はできません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:856
msgid "We can't eat that.  It's not right for us."
msgstr "我々はこれを食さない。我々はこの行為に正当性を認めない。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:863
msgid "It's frozen solid.  You must defrost it before you can eat it."
msgstr "凍結しています。食べる前に解凍する必要があります。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:866
msgid "You can't drink it while it's frozen."
msgstr "凍っている飲み物は飲めません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:880 src/consumption.cpp:900 src/consumption.cpp:1878
#: src/game_inventory.cpp:1133 src/game_inventory.cpp:1145
#, c-format
msgid "You need a %s to consume that!"
msgstr "これを摂取するには%sが必要です！"

#: src/consumption.cpp:908
msgid "Ugh, you can't drink that!"
msgstr "うっ...それは飲めません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:914
msgid "Eww.  Inedible plant stuff!"
msgstr "オエッ。この植物は食べられません！"

#: src/consumption.cpp:921
msgid "The thought of eating that makes you feel sick."
msgstr "それを食べると考えただけで気分が悪くなります。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:934
msgid "You cannot bring yourself to consume human flesh."
msgstr "騎乗中は体重を計測できません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:942
msgid "No way, that's disgusting!"
msgstr "痛っ、刺されました！"

#: src/consumption.cpp:953
msgid "You're still not going to eat animal products."
msgstr "動物性食品を食べるつもりはありません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:958
msgid "You can't eat this."
msgstr "これは食べられません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:966
msgid "You deserve better food than this."
msgstr "もっと美味しいものを食べたい。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:972
msgid "You are not going to drink this."
msgstr "これは飲みたくない。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1005
msgid "This is rotten and smells awful!"
msgstr "腐っており酷い悪臭がします！"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1014
msgid "The thought of eating human flesh makes you feel sick."
msgstr "人肉を食べると考えただけで気分が悪くなります。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1021
#, c-format
msgid "Consuming this %s probably isn't very healthy."
msgstr "%sを摂取するのは健康的ではない気がします。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1029
msgid "You still feel nauseated and will probably puke it all up again."
msgstr "吐き気が続いており、何か食べても吐いてしまうでしょう。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1035
msgid "Your stomach won't be happy (allergy)."
msgstr "体質のせいで胃が拒否反応を起こしています。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1040
msgid "Your stomach won't be happy (not rotten enough)."
msgstr "腐敗していないため胃が拒否反応を起こしています。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1049
msgid "You're full already and will be forcing yourself to eat."
msgstr "満腹のため無理やり食べようとしています。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1051
msgid "You're full already and will be forcing yourself to drink."
msgstr "満腹の状態ですが、無理やり飲もうとしています。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1068
#, c-format
msgid "Eat your %s anyway?"
msgstr "それでも%sを食べますか？"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1070
#, c-format
msgid "Drink your %s anyway?"
msgstr "それでも%sを飲みますか？"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1072
#, c-format
msgid "Consume your %s anyway?"
msgstr "それでも%sを消費しますか？"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1130
msgid ""
"You've begun stockpiling calories and liquid for hibernation.  You get the "
"feeling that you should prepare for bed, just in case, but… you're hungry "
"again, and you could eat a whole week's worth of food RIGHT NOW."
msgstr ""
"カロリーと水分の備蓄を始めました。念のため、寝床の準備もした方が良さそうですが...またお腹が減ってきました。早速、一週間分の食料をむさぼりましょう。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1139
#, c-format
msgid "Ick, this %s doesn't taste so good…"
msgstr "むぅ、この%sはあまり美味しくありません..."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1144
#, c-format
msgid "Mmm, this %s tastes delicious…"
msgstr "うーん、この%sは非常に美味しいです..."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1180
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> assimilates a %s."
msgstr "<npcname>は%sを消化しました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1180
#, c-format
msgid "You assimilate your %s."
msgstr "%sを消化しました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1190 src/consumption.cpp:1204
#, c-format
msgid "Ick, this %s (rotten) doesn't taste so good…"
msgstr "むぅ、この%s(腐)はあまり美味しくありません..."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1191
#, c-format
msgid "You drink your %s (rotten)."
msgstr "%s(腐)を飲みました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1193
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> drinks a %s."
msgstr "<npcname>は%sを飲みました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1193
#, c-format
msgid "You drink your %s."
msgstr "%sを飲みました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1205
#, c-format
msgid "You eat your %s (rotten)."
msgstr "%s(腐)を食べました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1208
#, c-format
msgid "<npcname> eats a %s."
msgstr "<npcname>は%sを食べました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1208
#, c-format
msgid "You eat your %s."
msgstr "%sを食べました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1232
msgid ""
"You try to ignore its mushy texture, but it leaves you with an awful "
"aftertaste."
msgstr "どろどろした食感を気にしないよう努めましたが、酷い後味が口内に残っています。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1236
msgid "You can't taste much of anything with this cold."
msgstr "風邪を引いているので食事を味わえません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1239
msgid "You can't taste much of anything with this flu."
msgstr "インフルエンザに罹っているので食事を味わえません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1378
msgid "The human blood tastes as good as any other."
msgstr "人間の血も、他の動物の血と同様に美味しいです。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1380
msgid "It's meat, that's all that matters."
msgstr "ああ、それは残念だ。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1382
msgid "You feel a cold twinge of guilt.  It will pass."
msgstr "体内にかすかな痒みを感じましたが、すぐに治まりました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1385
msgid "This is wrong, but you can't stop yourself."
msgstr "こんなハズじゃなかったと感じています。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1389
msgid ""
"Despite your cravings, you can't help feeling weird about drinking "
"somebody's blood."
msgstr "飲みたくてたまらないのは本当ですが、それでも他人の血を飲むことに奇妙さを感じずにはいられません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1393
msgid "This goes against everything you believe in."
msgstr "そういうことか、ありがとう。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1397
msgid "You find this meal distasteful, but you'll get over it."
msgstr "不味くて嫌になりますが、しかたありません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1403
msgid "You feel horrible for eating a person."
msgstr "食人に対する恐怖を感じました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1425
msgid "As you tear into the raw flesh, you feel satisfied with your meal."
msgstr "生肉を引き裂き、美味しく平らげました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1430
msgid "Raw flesh doesn't taste all that bad, actually."
msgstr "生肉も意外と不味くはありません。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1435
msgid "This doesn't taste very good, but meat is meat."
msgstr "あまり美味しくはありませんが、肉は肉です。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1445 src/consumption.cpp:1465 src/consumption.cpp:1474
msgid "Your stomach begins gurgling and you feel bloated and ill."
msgstr "胃が膨張し、唸り始め、吐き気を催しました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1450
msgid "Mmm, junk food."
msgstr "うーん、ジャンクフード。"

#. ~ Translators: This is a quote from the 1973 animated film Charlotte's Web,
#. where a rat is singing about eating trash off the ground. Do what you will
#. with that information.
#: src/consumption.cpp:1456
msgid "A veritable smorgasbord!"
msgstr ""

#: src/consumption.cpp:1458
msgid "Snack attack!"
msgstr "不意打ち"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1482
msgid "You find the sweet taste of honey surprisingly palatable."
msgstr "知らなかった、自分ってこんなに蜂蜜が好きだったのか、と驚きを感じました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1484
msgid "You feast upon the sweet honey."
msgstr "蜂蜜を大いに楽しんで食べました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1502
msgid "You're not sure you're going to be able to keep that down."
msgstr "探し回る必要がありそうだ。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1503
msgid "<npcname> looks about ready to puke."
msgstr "<npcname>は大きな欠伸をしました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1642
msgid "You gorge yourself, preparing to hibernate."
msgstr "腹が一杯になるまで食べ物を詰め込み、冬眠の準備をしました。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1650
msgid ""
"You feel stocked for a day or two.  Got your bed all ready and secured?"
msgstr "数日分の栄養を体内に蓄えました。寝床と安全は確保しましたか？"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1659
msgid ""
"Mmm.  You can still fit some more in… but maybe you should get comfortable "
"and sleep."
msgstr "うーん。まだ物足りませんが...とりあえずは快適に冬眠できそうです。"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1666
msgid "That filled a hole!  Time for bed…"
msgstr "これで十分でしょう！冬眠の時間です..."

#: src/consumption.cpp:1677
msgid "You feel as though you're going to split open!  In a good way?"
msgstr "体がバラバラになりそうです！大丈夫かな？"

#. ~ slimespawns have *small voices* which may be the Nice equivalent
#. ~ of the Rat King's ALL CAPS invective.  Probably shared-brain telepathy.
#: src/consumption.cpp:1689
msgid "hey, you look like me!  let's work together!"
msgstr "おや、私にそっくりだな！一緒に行こう！"

#: src/consumption.cpp:1933
#, c-format
msgid "You can't eat your %s."
msgstr "%sを食べられません。"

