msgid "Load mill with what kind of product?"
msgstr "製粉機に入れるアイテムを選択"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6570
msgid "You don't have any products that can be milled."
msgstr "製粉できるアイテムがありません。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6593
#, c-format
msgid "Insert how many %s into the mill?"
msgstr "製粉機に入れる%sの数を選択"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6598
msgid "You don't have that many."
msgstr "そんなにたくさん持っていません。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6601
msgid "You can't place that many."
msgstr "多すぎて入りません。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6622
#, c-format
msgid "You carefully place %1$d %2$s in the mill."
msgstr "製粉機の中に%2$s(%1$d)を注意深く置きました。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6643
msgid "The water mill needs to be over shallow flowing water to work."
msgstr "粉挽き水車を稼働するには浅い流水上に設置する必要があります。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6649
msgid "The wind mill needs to be outside in the wind to work."
msgstr "粉挽き風車を稼働するには風が吹いている屋外に設置する必要があります。"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6698
msgid "What to do with the mill?"
msgstr "製粉機操作"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6701
msgid "Inspect mill"
msgstr "製粉機の中を調べる"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6705
msgid "Remove brake and start milling… insert some products for milling first"
msgstr "稼働して製粉を始める...製粉するアイテムが入っていない"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6706
msgid "Remove brake and start milling"
msgstr "稼働して製粉を始める"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6707
#, c-format
msgid "Remove brake and start milling, milling will take about %s."
msgstr "石臼を稼働して製粉を開始します。完成まで約%sかかります。"

