msgid "What to do with the smoking rack:"
msgstr "燻製ラック操作:"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6885
msgid "Inspect smoking rack"
msgstr "燻製ラックの中を調べる"

#: src/iexamine.cpp:6889
msgid "Light up and smoke food… insert some food for smoking first"
msgstr "点火して燻製を始める...燻製する食料が入っていない"

