msgstr "%1sが%2sから噴き出しました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:380
msgid "You lose some blood."
msgstr "若干の血液を失いました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:384
msgid "<npcname> loses some blood."
msgstr "<npcname>は若干の血液を失いました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:390
msgid ""
"You could reduce the bleeding by emptying your hands and pausing to apply "
"pressure."
msgstr "何も装備していない状態でその場に立ち止まると、傷口を押さえて出血を軽減します。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:393
msgid "You could reduce the bleeding by pausing to apply pressure."
msgstr "その場に立ち止まると、傷口を押さえて出血を軽減します。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:414
msgid "You feel a little strange."
msgstr "少し奇妙な感覚に襲われました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:418
msgid "The world takes on a dreamlike quality."
msgstr "世界が素晴らしく幻想的に見えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:420
msgid "You have a sudden nostalgic feeling."
msgstr "郷愁の念に駆られました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:422
msgid "Everything around you is starting to breathe."
msgstr "周辺の全ての物が呼吸し始めました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:424
msgid "Something feels very, very wrong."
msgstr "何かが異常に間違っているように感じます。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:428
msgid "You feel sick to your stomach."
msgstr "胃がむかついています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:436
msgid "\"I think it's starting to kick in.\""
msgstr "「始まったようだ」"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:437
msgid "\"Oh God, what's happening?\""
msgstr "「おお、何が起こってる？」"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:438
msgid "\"Of course… it's all fractals!\""
msgstr "「もちろん...全てがフラクタルになる！」"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:439
msgid "\"Huh?  What was that?\""
msgstr "「はあ？なんだあれは？」"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:455
msgid "Fractal patterns dance across your vision."
msgstr "フラクタルパターンが視界を覆い尽くし、揺れ動いています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:462
msgid "Dancing fractals distract you."
msgstr "フラクタル模様に視界を遮られました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:469
msgid "Everything looks SO boring now."
msgstr "何もかもが死ぬほど退屈です。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:471
msgid "Things are returning to normal."
msgstr "事態は正常に戻ってきています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:515
msgid "Your thoughts are unclear."
msgstr "思考が朦朧としています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:517
msgid "Your face is stiff from the cold."
msgstr "顔が寒さで硬直しています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:519
msgid "You quiver from the cold."
msgstr "寒さで小刻みに震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:519
msgid "Your torso is freezing cold.  You should put on a few more layers."
msgstr "胴体が凍えるような寒さで震えています。更に重ね着する必要があります。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:520
msgid "Your shivering makes you unsteady."
msgstr "寒さで不規則にぶるぶると震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:521 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:522
msgid "Your left arm is shivering."
msgstr "左腕がぶるぶると震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:521 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:522
msgid "Your left arm trembles from the cold."
msgstr "左腕が寒さで震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:523 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:524
msgid "Your right arm is shivering."
msgstr "右腕がぶるぶると震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:523 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:524
msgid "Your right arm trembles from the cold."
msgstr "右腕が寒さで震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:525 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:526
msgid "Your left hand feels like ice."
msgstr "左手が凍り付いたように感じます。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:525 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:526
msgid "Your left hand quivers in the cold."
msgstr "左手が寒さで小刻みに震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:527 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:528
msgid "Your right hand feels like ice."
msgstr "右手が凍り付いたように感じます。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:527 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:528
msgid "Your right hand quivers in the cold."
msgstr "右手が寒さで小刻みに震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:529 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:530
msgid "Your left leg trembles against the relentless cold."
msgstr "左脚が厳しい寒さで意思に反して震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:529 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:530
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:531 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:532
msgid "Your legs uncontrollably shake from the cold."
msgstr "寒さで脚が震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:531 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:532
msgid "Your right leg trembles against the relentless cold."
msgstr "右脚が厳しい寒さで意思に反して震えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:533 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:534
msgid "Your left foot feels frigid."
msgstr "左足が凍えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:533
msgid "Your left foot is as nimble as a block of ice."
msgstr "左足が氷塊になったかのように固まっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:534
msgid "Your freezing left foot messes up your balance."
msgstr "左足が凍り付く程の寒さで上手くバランスを保てなくなっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:535 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:536
msgid "Your right foot feels frigid."
msgstr "右足が凍えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:535
msgid "Your right foot is as nimble as a block of ice."
msgstr "右足が氷塊になったかのように固まっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:536
msgid "Your freezing right foot messes up your balance."
msgstr "右足が凍り付く程の寒さで上手くバランスを保てなくなっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:549
msgid "Your head is pounding from the heat."
msgstr "熱で頭がガンガンします。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:551
msgid "You are sweating profusely."
msgstr "大量の汗をかいています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:553 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:554
msgid "Your left hand's too sweaty to grip well."
msgstr "左手が汗をかき過ぎており、物を掴むのが困難になっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:555 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:556
msgid "Your right hand's too sweaty to grip well."
msgstr "右手が汗をかき過ぎており、物を掴むのが困難になっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:557
msgid "Your left leg is cramping up."
msgstr "左脚が痙攣を起こしています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:559
msgid "Your right leg is cramping up."
msgstr "右脚が痙攣を起こしています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:561
msgid "Your left foot is swelling in the heat."
msgstr "左足が暑さで腫れあがっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:563
msgid "Your right foot is swelling in the heat."
msgstr "右足が暑さで腫れあがっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:582
msgid "The heat is making you see things."
msgstr "熱で幻覚が見えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:591 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:592
msgid "You have trouble grasping with your numb fingers."
msgstr "指が凍えており、物を掴むのが困難になっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:593 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:594
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:595 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:596
msgid "Your foot has gone numb."
msgstr "足が凍えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:597 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:598
msgid "Your face feels numb."
msgstr "顔が凍えています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:626
msgid "Glowing lights surround you, and you teleport."
msgstr "眩い光に包まれ、瞬間移動しました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:655 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:716
#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1333
msgid "A monster appears nearby!"
msgstr "近くに怪物が現れました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:656
msgid "Space folds impossibly around itself!"
msgstr ""

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:666 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:726
msgid "You shudder suddenly."
msgstr "急に身震いしました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:682
msgid "You pass out."
msgstr "気絶しました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:717 src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:1334
msgid "A portal opens nearby, and a monster crawls through!"
msgstr "近くに開いたポータルからモンスターが這い出てきました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:741
msgid "Your vision is filled with bright lights…"
msgstr "視界が眩しい光で満たされました..."

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:757
msgid "You're suddenly covered in ectoplasm."
msgstr "急にエクトプラズムに包まれました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:792
msgid ""
"You're experiencing loss of basic motor skills and blurred vision.  Your "
"mind recoils in horror, unable to communicate with your spinal column."
msgstr "基本的な運動能力が失われ、視界もぼやけています。精神は恐怖にすくみ上がり、脊椎神経との通信が途絶しています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:793
msgid "You stagger and fall!"
msgstr "よろめいて倒れました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:808
msgid "There's some kind of big machine in the sky."
msgstr "空を見上げると、用途不明の大きな機械があります。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:811
msgid "It's some kind of electric snake, coming right at you!"
msgstr "機械の蛇か何かです。向かってきます！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:818
msgid ""
"Order us some golf shoes, otherwise we'll never get out of this place alive."
msgstr "ゴルフシューズを集めよとの勅命が下りました。さもなくばここから生きて出ることは叶わないでしょう。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:822
msgid "The possibility of physical and mental collapse is now very real."
msgstr "肉体と精神が破綻している可能性が非常に現実的なものになってきました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:824
msgid "No one should be asked to handle this trip."
msgstr "誰かなんとかしてくれないもんかなあ。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:834
msgid ""
"Your heart spasms painfully and stops, dragging you back to reality as you "
"die."
msgstr "心臓が激痛を伴いながら痙攣し、トリップ中の夢から死という現実に引き戻されました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:837
msgid ""
"You dissolve into beautiful paroxysms of energy.  Life fades from your "
"nebulae and you are no more."
msgstr "美しいエネルギーの爆発に溶けていきました。濁った角膜から魂が抜け、二度と戻ってくることはありませんでした。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:859
msgid "You bleed to death!"
msgstr "出血多量で死にました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:860
msgid "<npcname> bleeds to death!"
msgstr "<npcname>は出血多量で死にました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:865
msgid "Your heart can't keep up the pace and fails!"
msgstr "不整脈を起こしました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:866
msgid "<npcname> has a sudden heart attack!"
msgstr "<npcname>は急に心臓発作を起こしました！"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:892
msgid "Your skin looks pale and you feel anxious and thirsty.  Blood loss?"
msgstr "皮膚が青白くなり、不安や喉の渇きを感じます。失血が原因でしょうか？"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:894
msgid ""
"Your pale skin is sweating, your heart is beating fast, and you feel "
"restless.  Maybe you lost too much blood?"
msgstr "皮膚は青白く汗をかいており、鼓動が速まり、気持ちが落ち着きません。大量の失血が原因でしょうか？"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:896
msgid ""
"You're unsettlingly white, but your fingertips are bluish.  You are agitated"
" and your heart is racing.  Your blood loss must be serious."
msgstr "皮膚は異常なほど青白く、指先は真っ白です。興奮し、心臓は早鐘を打っています。あまりにも血を失いすぎたようです。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:898
msgid ""
"You are pale as a ghost, dripping wet from the sweat, and sluggish - despite"
" your heart racing like a train.  You are on the brink of collapse from the "
"effects of blood loss."
msgstr "皮膚は幽霊のように青ざめ、全身から汗が滴り落ちています。異常な心拍数の高さにもかかわらず、気だるさを感じます。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:906
msgid "You feel dizzy and lightheaded."
msgstr "目眩がし、ふらつきました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:910
msgid "You feel tired and you breathe heavily."
msgstr "疲れを感じ、呼吸が荒くなっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:915
msgid "You are anxious and cannot collect your thoughts."
msgstr "不安感が強すぎて、考えが上手くまとまりません。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:919
msgid "You are sweating profusely, but you feel cold."
msgstr "大量の汗をかいているにもかかわらず、寒さを感じます。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:928
msgid "You huff and puff.  Your breath is rapid and shallow."
msgstr "息を切らしています。呼吸が浅く、速くなっています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:933
msgid "You drop to the ground, fighting to keep yourself conscious."
msgstr "その場に倒れ伏し、なんとか意識を保とうとしています。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:937
msgid "Your mind slips away."
msgstr "意識が途切れました。"

#: src/player_hardcoded_effects.cpp:968
msgid "You cannot breathe and your body gives out!"
